西省西安市莲湖区自强西路38号东院办公楼1楼118室 联系人：招标二部杨工 联系电话：029-86452114 电子邮箱：928544011@qq.com</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26B2SXQY0342',NULL,NULL,'1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目立体库仓储建设采购设计及安装时间','陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司','2026-07-18 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097226324504670210,'','2026-09-10 09:34:53','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕煤电力合川2×1000MW清洁煤电扩建项目第三批辅机设备采购-20包：10kV高压开关柜变更公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/3ywgg/20260717/1262828330621599744.html','4b0575d436b5565673bbeb4e5d4914b43897b805a0015c4ebe51b9edac0ce820',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"16\" style=\"text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 15pt;\">陕西煤业物资有限责任公司西安分公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤电力合川</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2&times;1000MW清洁煤电扩建项目第三批辅机设备采购-20包：10kV高压开关柜</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 15pt;\">(招标编号：</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 15pt;\">0866-26C2SXQY0465</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 15pt;\">)</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 15pt;\">变更</span></strong><strong><span styl