r-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"110\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">具体详见招标文件第五章</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">供货要求</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -33.1500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">交货期</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：合同签订后，收到订购单</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">20个日历天内到货，周期内可分批到货。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -33.1500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">交货地点</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：袁大滩煤矿厂区。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -33.1500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: center blank 221.5000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">质保期：六个月，自验收合格之日计起。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -33.1500pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Toc491883079\"></a><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2业绩要求：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人必须具有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">至投标截止日，类似产品销售业绩不少于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3份。（证明文件以合同为准，合同复印件应清晰明了，有合同签署双方的盖章页，每份合同均应包括合同总金额、合同主要内容，并提供与合同对应的任意一张增值税发票及国家税务总局全国增值税发票查验平台查询截图，有效业绩以合同签订时间为准）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.3财务要求：有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（投标截止前三个月内）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-heigh