amily: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">来</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">自企业自筹，出资比例</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.1500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">该</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.1500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">已</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">具</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.1500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">备</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">招</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.1500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">标</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">条</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司榆林分公司的委托，现对</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">曹家滩煤矿料仓可视化设备采购项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">进行</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">二次</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（国内）公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 140%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_bookmark3\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; li