font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">处理器</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ge;i9，内存&ge;32GB，SSD&ge;500GB，需满足至少18座料仓数据展示，便于后期扩容</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 38.3000pt; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; border-left: 1.0000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border-right: 1.0000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border-bottom: 1.0000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"51\">\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 94.6500pt; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; border-left: 1.0000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border-right: 1.0000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border-bottom: 1.0000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"126\">\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #0f1115; font-size: 10.5pt;\">其它辅材安装及调试</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 38.3000pt; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; border-left: 1.0000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border-right: 1.0000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border-bottom: 1.0000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"51\">\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 40.6000pt; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; border-left: 1.0000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border-right: 1.0000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border-bottom: 1.0000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"54\">\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 241.9500pt; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; border-left: 1.0000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border-right: 1.0000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border-bottom: 1.0000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"322\">\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #0f1115; font-size: 10.5pt;\">配套辅材</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.3招标范围：投标人负责煤矿料仓可视化设备采购的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">系统设计</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">设备制造</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">设备供货、软件开发、系统集成、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">运输（装卸）、必要的附件、技术资料、现场设备的指导</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">安装调试、验收、培训及售后服务等全过程</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">为实施本项目所需的全部工作内容，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">具体内容及要求详见招标文件第五章供货要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.4交货期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2个月内完成供货，并确保系统可正常上线运行。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.5交货地点：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">曹家滩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">煤矿</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.6质保期：投运1年或到货验收18个月，先到为准。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.7质量：满足</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #0f1115; font-size: 10.5pt;\">最新版《煤矿安全规程》、国家相关质量标准规范及招标文件的质量要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-left: 5.1000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_bookmark4\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.3000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK1\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资质要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（1）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人必须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（2）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本项目接受拟投标</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #0f1115; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采集设备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">制造商或代理商投标；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（3）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">代理商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标时，须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采集设备制造商针对本招标项目出具的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">唯一授权</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">委托</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">书</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span><u></u></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（4）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">一个</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #0f1115; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采集设备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #0f1115; font-size: 10.5pt;\">制造商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">对同一品牌同一型号的设备，仅能委托一个</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">代理商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">参加投标，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #0f1115; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采集设备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">同一品牌同一型号的设备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #0f1115; font-size: 10.5pt;\">制造商与</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">代理商不能同时参加该招标项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #0f1115; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">否则相关投标均无效；</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（5）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">必</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">拟投标</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采集设备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">有效的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">防爆合格证</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">开户许可证或基本存款账户信息证明材料。</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（6）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">必须提供采集设备的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3C认证证书，并提供全国认证认可信息公共服务平台可查询认证证明。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（7）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">若为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">代理商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">参与</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，业绩、相关证书及资质等可提供生产厂家资质。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.3000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2业绩要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人如为</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #0f1115; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采集设备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">制造商：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">应具有近年（自</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2022年1月1日至投标截止日期）至少三项料仓仓位显示类销售业绩，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">有效</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">业绩以合同及合同对应的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">任意一张</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">增值税发票为准，对应的增值税发票在国家税务总局全国增值税发票查验平台核验必须真实、有效，合同必须有双方盖章页、首页、供货清单，合同</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">内容清晰</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合同</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">双方盖章完整，有效业绩时间以合同签订时间为准</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）投标人若为</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">代理商：代理商需提供</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">近年（自</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2022年1月1日至投标截止日期）至少三项料仓仓位显示类销售业绩（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">可为制造商或者代理商自身销售业绩</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">），</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">有效</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">业绩以合同及合同对应的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">任意一张</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">增值税发票为准，对应的增值税发票在国家税务总局全国增值税发票查验平台核验必须真实、有效，合同必须有双方盖章页、首页、供货清单，合同</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">内容清晰</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合同</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">双方盖章完整，有效业绩时间以合同签订时间为准</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.3000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3财务要求：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">必须提供（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">-202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">年）连续三年经第三方审计的财务报告，若公司成立时间不足三年，可提供成立之后年份经第三方审计的财务报告。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.3000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">信誉要求（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）未被国家企业信用信息公示系统（http://www.gsxt.gov.cn/index.html）列入严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）未被列入&ldquo;信用中国&rdquo;（http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.3000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5其他要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（1）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">法定代表人为同一个人的两个及两个以上法人，母公司、全资子公司及其控股公司，都不得同时投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">4.1获取时间</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">从</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时00分至2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">10</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">4.2获取方式:凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台(https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html)&rdquo;下载招标文件，具体操作步骤如下</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">(1)登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行投标人注册</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">(2)注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书及&ldquo;三、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">投标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资格要求</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件，点击【提交】按系统提示下载招标文件，招标文件售价</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">500元/套，售后不退，项目结束后在秦源招标电子平台下载增值税电子普通发票</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">(3)本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字CA证书才能完成投标工作，数字CA证书办理及咨询电话</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">4008206660转6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">(4)有关注册、下载招标文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">400-685-1179，邮箱:qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">法定工作日，咨询时间</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">08:30-12:00，13:30-17:30。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">下载网址</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">1)秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的供应商/供应商操作手册及开标注意事</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">项</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">2)秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址:</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888594722560.html</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-left: 5.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">五、投标文件的</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.1递交截止时间：202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">29</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">09时00分（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.2递交方式：电子招标平台文件递交：电子招标平台下载《投标人/供应商操作手册》，按说明操作。电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.3未在投标截止时间前成功上传的投标文件，招标人不予受理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">六、开标时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.1开标时间：202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">29</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">09时</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">00分（北京时间）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.2开标地点：开标通过&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">七</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.发布公告的媒介</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标公告在《中国招投标公共服务平台》</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.cebpubservice.com/及《陕西采购与招标网》http://www.sntba.com/及《秦源招标电子招标平台》http://qyzb.shccmg.com/上同时发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">八、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">监督部门及异议渠道和方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.1本项目监督部门：陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司榆林分公司物资管理部。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系人：杨先生；监督电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">13891246218；监督邮箱：wgb@smwzyt.com。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.2异议渠道及方式:投标人或其他利害关系人对本投标邀请书及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前10日内以书面形式(邮件发送)向招标人提出，邮箱:wgb@smwzyt.com。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.4000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1)异议提出人名称、地址、电话等；</span></p>\n<p class