; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购文件；审核未通过的，采购单位联系人以邮件形式回复审核情况，供应商可在</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">询比</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购文件获取时间内重新提交材料。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购文件售价</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">元。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">五、响应文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span 