ont-family: 宋体;\">项目所在地区：陕西省</span> </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">咸阳市</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1．招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本招标项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">西彬长矿业集团有限公司陕西彬长小庄矿业有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">40208工作面地面水平井分段压裂防治冲击地压项目资金为企业自筹，招标人为陕西彬长</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">矿业集团有限公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，项目已具备招标条件。陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">的委托，现对该项目进行公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.项目概况与招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.1项目名称：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西彬长小庄矿业有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">40208工作面地面水平井分段压裂防治冲击地压项目</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.2招标编号：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0866-26C3SXQY0557</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">项目概况：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目为陕西彬长小庄矿业有限公司</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">40208 工作面地面水平井分段压裂防治冲击地压项目，实施地点位于小庄矿井二盘区东翼北部 40208 工作面对应的地面区域。项目采用地面 L 型水平井分段水力压裂工艺，对工作面顶板厚硬岩层进行预裂卸压，弱化顶板岩体完整性，释放岩层弹性应变能，从而降低工作面回采过程中的冲击地压灾害风险，保障后续回采作业安全有序开展。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">40208 工作面北部为 40302 工作面采空区，西侧紧邻中央 2# 回风大巷，南部及东部均为实体煤区域；工作面走向可采长度 1544m，倾向长度 280m，可采面积约 432320㎡。工作面主采 4 号煤层，煤层厚度 12～23m，整体呈中间厚、两侧薄的变化趋势，煤层结构简单稳定，内生裂隙发育。依据周边钻孔柱状资料，4 号煤层上方 100m 范围内分布多层厚硬复合砂岩、含砾砂岩层，岩层厚度大、整体性强、硬度高，是本次冲击地压防治的核心目标层位。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">结合井场地形条件、顶板硬厚岩层的展布形态，以及水力压裂裂缝扩展影响范围，本项目共设计部署</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2 口 &ldquo;L&rdquo; 型地面水平井，编号分别为 XZ40208-01L、XZ40208-02L，两口井设计总井深 3357m，计划实施分段压裂共计 29 段。项目施工包含钻井、录井、测井、下套管固井、射孔压裂、微地震实时监测、压后排液、井筒封堵及井场地貌恢复等全部工作内容，施工全过程须严格遵守国家及行业矿山安全、环保、民用爆炸物品管理等相关规定；</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">具体内容</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">详见招标文件第五章发包人要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.5服务期限：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">150日历天</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.6项目地点：彬长</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">小庄煤矿二盘区东翼北部，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">40208综放工作面对应的地面区域。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">质量要</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">求或服务</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">标准：本项目须严格执行国家及煤炭行业现行规范与本技术规格书全部要求，确保钻井固井、分段压裂、监测评价、安全环保、资料交付及回采跟踪服务全流程质量达标，工程一次性验收合格，实现</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">40208工作面顶板硬岩层预裂卸压、有效防治冲击地压的治理目标，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">并符合招标文件要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1资格要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3.1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人单位。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">须</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具有有效的地质灾害治理工程施工</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">甲级资质或矿山工程施工总承包一级</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">及以上</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资质，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">且具备有效的安全生产许可证，所有证书均应在有效期内。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">业绩</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3.2.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">须提供自</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1日至投标截止日(以合同签订时间为准)，至少具有</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2份</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">已完成的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">矿井</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">地面水平井防治冲击地压项目业绩（业绩以合同文件为准，合同内容要体现：合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页及双方盖章签字页）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3财务要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年至2025年经审计的财务审计报告，投标人新成立不足三年的需提供自成立以来的财务审计报告，财务审计报告至少包含：审计报告正文及正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表；投标人新成立不足一年的需提供自成立以来的财务报表，财务报表至少包含：资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4人员</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc18101\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.4.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目负责人：</span><a name=\"_Toc21896\"></a></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">须持有地质、钻探或采矿相关专业高级</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">工程师及以上</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">职称</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（须提供职称证书扫描件），并提供在本单位连续缴纳</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6个月及以上的社保证明；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc14751\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.4.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">技术负责人：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">须持有地质、钻探或采矿相关专业高级</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">工程师及以上</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">职称</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（须提供职称证书扫描件），并提供在本单位连续缴纳</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6个月及以上的社保证明</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc26036\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.4.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">安全负责人：投标人拟派安全负责人须具有并提供有效的注册安全工程师证书（须提供注册安全工程师证书扫描件）；并提供在本单位</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">连续缴纳</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6个月及以上的社保证明。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc1039\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.5信誉要求:</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc2182\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.5.1投标人未列入信用中国(</span><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">https://www.creditchina.go</span></a><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">v.cn/</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">)严重失信主体名单；（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc22588\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.5.2投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统(</span><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">https://ww</span></a><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">w.gsxt.gov.cn/</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">)严重违法失信名单(黑名单)信息（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc24651\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-f