标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 7.9500pt; margin-right: 7.9000pt; margin-left: 0.0500pt; text-indent: 20.9500pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.8pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -2.75pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.8pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西有色榆林新材料集团有限责任公司</span>2026年阳极脱硫石灰石粉采购项</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -3.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&rdquo;，招标人为陕西有色榆林新材料集团有限责任公司，招标项目资金来自企业自筹</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">。该项目已具备招标条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">司受陕西有色榆林新材料集团有限责任公司的委托，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.55pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">现对</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -3.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.55pt; font-size: 10pt;\">陕西有色榆林新材料集团有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">2026年阳极脱硫石灰石粉采购项目&rdquo;进行（国</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">内）公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 3.0000pt; margin-left: 5.1500pt; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc22987\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.25pt; font-size: 10pt;\">2.项目概况</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.6500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">项目名称：陕西有色榆林新材料集团有限责任公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.7000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.9500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">年阳极脱硫石灰石粉采购项目</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt;\">2.2项目简介：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">本项目为榆林新材料集团阳极分公司煅烧车间石灰石粉采购项目，物料为煅烧车间</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">余热脱硫烟气净化核心</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">消耗物资，主要保障车间生产工艺平稳运行，配套</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">煅烧车间脱硫烟气净化系统</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">使用。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">业主配套三台脱硫塔及一套制浆系统。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.3项目规模：</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 21.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">系统配置：三台脱硫塔（浆液区</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&phi;6.5m*5.5m）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 21.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">制浆装置：一台搅拌器、两台供浆泵</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(一用一备)、浆液池6m*6m*3m。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 21.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">输送方式：密闭罐车运输、罐车气力输送入仓。</span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 21.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">储存装置：车间专用密闭圆柱形石灰石粉仓</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&phi;6m*12m。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 21.6000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">料需求量：月系统需求</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">800t左右，年需求9600t左右。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt;\">2.4项目背景：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">鉴于石灰石粉是煅烧车间生产运行的重要原料，物料品质直接影响生产工况、产品质量及现场环境。为避免因物料水分超标、粒度不合格、杂质过多、重金属超标等问题造成生产波动、设备堵塞、现场污染，规范物料质量、运输、储存及使用标准，现采购符合技术要求的散装石灰石粉。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.9500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标编号：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun