ight: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.3500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">吨脱硫石灰石粉</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.3500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.3500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">选取符合要求的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1家单位作为本次招标项目的中标单位。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">服务期：合同签订后</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.2000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.8500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">年。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">交货期：合同有效期内，根据生产需求分批次</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">到货。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 22pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">交货地点：陕西省榆林市榆阳区金鸡滩镇陕西有色榆林</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">循环经济产业园陕西有色榆林新材料</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">集团有限责任公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc27897\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.25pt; font-size: 10pt;\">3.投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.6pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">3.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.9pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">投标人须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; font-size: 10pt;\">效的营业执照，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.6pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">3.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.9pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">投标人提供投标截止时间前近三个月内银行</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; font-size: 10pt;\">出具的资信证明或</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.7pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; font-size: 10pt;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -2.1pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span>-2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.85pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; font-size: 10pt;\">年经第三方</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">审计的财务审计报告（公司成立不足三年的需提供已出年份的审计</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">报告，公司成立不足一年的需提供公司成立以来的财务报表</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10pt;\">）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 22pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">3.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.25pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人提供无行贿犯罪行为承诺书及在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;中国裁判文书网&rdquo;网站（</span></span><a href=\"http://wenshu.cour/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">http</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.5000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">://</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">wenshu</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.5000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">cour</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">t.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10pt;\">gov</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10pt;\">cn</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\">/）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中无行贿犯罪记录查询截图、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;中国执行信息公开网</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&rdquo;网站（</span><a href=\"http://zxgk.court.g/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">http</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">://</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">zxgk</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">court</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.g</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;ov</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10pt;\">cn</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10pt;\">shixin</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.6pt; font-size: 10pt;\">/）中未被列入失信被执行人查询截图、&ldquo;信用中国&rdquo;网站（</span><a href=\"http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">http</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.6000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">://</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">www</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.6000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">creditch</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.7pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">ina</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">gov</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4500pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">cn</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">）中未被列入重大税收违法失信主体查询截图；</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -2.65pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">以上截图无法提供的，提供承诺书。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.8pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">3.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.9pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目投</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10pt;\">标；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.4pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; font-size: 10pt;\">3.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -2pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; font-size: 10pt;\">本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.3pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc27327\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.3pt; font-size: 10pt;\">4.招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.6pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">4.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.8pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招投标平台&rdquo;（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 2.05pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://qyzb.shccmg.com/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">http</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">://</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">qyzb</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">shccmg</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">com</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.4000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">/</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">）上免费注册；注册时预留联系人手机号应为常用手机。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.8pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">4.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注册完成后，投标人登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招投标平台&rdquo;（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 2.05pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://qyzb.shccmg.com/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.00