%; letter-spacing: 0.35pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件（加盖单位公章）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.8pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">4.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -2pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标文件费用：</span>800元，通过秦源招标电子招投标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;\">支付，售后不退。（支付时请按</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">平台要求提供企业信息及购买招标文件的项目信息，注明项目名称和招标编号）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.8pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">4.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -1.65pt; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10pt;\">购买招标文件的发票，投标人可在平台自行申请并打印（招标文件购买发票仅提供电子</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 20pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;\">4.5 招标文件购买</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时间：</span>2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 1