font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">渭河洁能公司水处理升级改造项目</span>EPC<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工程总承包，招标人为渭南高新区渭河洁能有限公司</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标项目资金来自企业自筹</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，出资比例为</span>100%<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">该项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已具备招标条件，招标方式为公开招标。诚邀符合条件的潜在投标人前来参加。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2.1 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称：渭河洁能公司水处理升级改造项目</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">EPC</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工程总承包</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2.2 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目为陕西渭河煤化工集团有限责任公司（以下简称</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;渭化集团&rdquo;）年产30万吨合成氨、52万吨尿素及60万吨甲醇装置的配套附属装置，旨在保障陕西神渭煤炭管道运输有限责任公司富余煤浆的顺利接收与废水达标处理。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目为渭河洁能公司水处理升级改造项目，处理废水来自渭化集团现有厂区，其中气化污水</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">239m&sup3;/h，变换污水 37m&sup3;/h，火炬废水 8m&sup3;/h，动力中和废水 41m&sup3;/h，甲醇精馏、C1605、C7606 塔废水 28m&sup3;/h，推浆废水 120m&sup3;/h，项目年操作时间 8000h。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">本项目主要工程如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">新建污水预处理系统（包含处理能力</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">28m&sup3;/h 的甲醇精馏、C1605、C7606 塔废水预处理系统、处理能力 120m&sup3;/h 的推浆废水的污水预处理系统以及处理能力 300m&sup3;/h 的气化污水预处理系统）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">新建处理能力</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">200m&sup3;/h 的污水处理系统；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">新建处理能力</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">45m&sup3;/h 的氨回收系统；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">升级更换清净废水回用厂房（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">222C）超滤和反渗透膜元件；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">升级改造中水回用厂房（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">461C），建成处理规模 350m&sup3;/h 中水回用设施；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">项目内辅助单元以及公用工程设计：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">渭化集团现有厂区的部分工程，主要包括污水输送管道的设计、现有厂区管廊至本项目之间的管廊设计、所有新建、改建装置控制信号引入现有控制室，提升智能化控制水平的设计以及相关的桥架、电缆设计。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"> <a name=\"OLE_LINK4\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标为渭河洁能公司水处理升级改造项目</span>EPC<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工程总承包。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">总承包工作范围包括但不限于</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">详细设计、设备材料采购、旧管廊加固</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">及改造</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK5\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">土建</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（不含基坑开挖、桩基以及桩间土开挖、破除桩头、水泥土垫层</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">垫层换填、桩基及垫层部分检测工作）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及设备管道安装、机械竣工</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、满足招标人有关项目现场</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6S</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">可视化要求</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、系统吹扫、系统清洗（含化学清洗）、单机试车、系统调试、交工验收、中间交接；提供中间交接起至产出合格产品全过程的联动试车、投料试车技术支持与现场协助，以及项目性能考核配套技术服务及协助；同步完成竣工图绘制、全套项目文件整理归档、竣工验收组织配合、固定资产清册编制，同时承担缺陷责任期内全部工程保修工作。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目涉及各政府监管部门、第三方机构开展的各类核查、验收工作，以及验收过程中要求完成的全部整改工作，均纳入总承包工作范畴。总承包单位须在自身承包工作范围内，严格遵照本项目约定的工艺技术标准、工程质量、职业健康、安全生产、生态环境保护、消防管理等相关规范及要求组织项目实施。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标工程量清单或基础设计设备表中的数量均非限制性清单。凡属于系统正常运行、检修、计量、取样、排放、冲洗、吹扫、保温、防腐、防冻、防渗、防雷接地、消防、照明、通信、控制、监测、联锁、安全防护和环保达标所需的内容，即使未逐项列出，均应视为已包含在</span>EPC<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">总价和工期内。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">为本装置提供工期全过程的技术服务，提供设备运行相关资料。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">为工程提供缺陷修复、质量保证和保修管理服务。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">总承包方负责为满足装置开工、试车、开车等所需的临时管道等的设计、采购、施工。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">本项目执行过程中若涉及国外采购的设备，设备随机相关资料的外文翻译均由总承包方负责，提供中外文对照版。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">不计入总承包工作范围内容：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">土建</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工程中除基坑开挖、桩基以及桩间土开挖、破除桩头、水泥土垫层</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">垫层换填部分、桩基及垫层部分检测工作以外，其余工程内容由投标人负责，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以下内容</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">由招标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">实施，不计入投标人工作范围</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">460D<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，核晶造粒厂房</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi