ight: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕煤集团铜川矿务局有限公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">的委托，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 9.9000pt; mso-pagination: lines-together; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc381707602\"></a><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc19171\"></a><a name=\"_Toc422234099\"></a><a name=\"_Toc14298\"></a><a name=\"_Toc23327\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2．项目概况、招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">项目名称：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">王石凹工业遗址项目室外及消防工程</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.2招标编号：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0866-26C1SXQY0589</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.3招标范围：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目为改造项目，包含消防及道路、给排水、电气三个专业。消防及道路专业本次改造主要内容为室外消防道路及消防管网。新建及改造道路做法采用沥青混凝土面层道路，拆除恢复道路采用除面层外保持和现状一致混凝土构造层，面层再做沥青混凝土路面。消防车道道路宽度大于等于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4米，坡度大于等于0.3%，小于等于10%。多层消防车道转弯半径9米，高层消防车道转弯半径12米。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">给排水专业主要包含：生活给水系统、消防给水系统及室外雨水、污水系统。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">生活给水系统：本项目以市政自来水为水源，引入一根</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">DN100的给水管为生活水池、消防水池补水。在迎宾楼室外设置生活水池及生活水泵房，园区内生活用水由生活水池及生活水泵房供给。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">消防给水系统：本次设计在室外设置有效容积</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">230立方的室外消防水池，供小游客服务中心室外消火栓用水，其他单体消防水池及小游客服务中心室内消火栓系统、自动喷淋系统由已建消防系统供给。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">室外雨、污水系统：本项目在室外雨水、污水管网未覆盖区域、原排水系统损坏区域设置雨水及污水管，其中污水管管径</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">DN300，污水通过管网排放至原污水箱涵或收集至园区污水处理厂进行处理。雨水管管径DN300~DN1200，通过设置雨水管及雨水口收集场地雨水。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">电气专业包含室外强电及弱电工程。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">强电工程包括原实业楼</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">315kVA变压器6kV架空线更换为电缆，园区内现有未改造建筑用电，迎宾楼、小游客服务中心、煤炭科技馆的消防备用电源敷设，园区内路灯安装及路灯线路敷设。线路采用穿管埋地方式敷设，园区内沿绿化带敷设，必要时敷设于道路下方或者穿道路敷设。敷设于绿化带内时穿PE管，敷设于道路下方或穿道路敷设时穿热镀锌钢管。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">弱电工程包括，迎宾楼、小游客服务中心、煤炭科技馆报警线路改造，园区内现有未改造建筑网络线路敷设，监控及广播系统。线路采用穿管埋地方式敷设，园区内沿绿化带敷设，必要时敷设于道路下方或者穿道路敷设。敷设于绿化带内时穿</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">7*32梅花PE管，敷设于道路下方或穿道路敷设时穿热镀锌钢管。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">具体内容详见工程量清单及施工图。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.4工程地点：</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">陕西省铜川市印台区王石凹街道王石凹煤矿工业遗址</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">计划工期：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">180日历天</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.6质量目标：符合现行国家有关工程施工质量验收规范和标准的要求，达到建设工程质量验收统一标准合格等级。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 9.9000pt; mso-pagination: lines-together; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc381707603\"></a><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc8082\"></a><a name=\"_Toc32365\"></a><a name=\"_Toc422234100\"></a><a name=\"_Toc25597\"></a><a name=\"_Toc246996912\"></a><a name=\"_Toc385254841\"></a><a name=\"_Toc179632539\"></a><a name=\"_Toc152045522\"></a><a name=\"_Toc247085683\"></a><a name=\"_Toc342318888\"></a><a name=\"_Toc144974490\"></a><a name=\"_Toc296602413\"></a><a name=\"_Toc246996169\"></a><a name=\"_Toc152042298\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3．投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 10.5500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1 资质要求：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人必须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">企业</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 10.5500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2 证书要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">须</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具有</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">建筑工程施工总承包贰级及以上资质，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">并具备有效的安全生产许可证。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 10.55pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3 人员要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人拟派项目经理应具有</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">建筑工程专业二级及以上</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注册建造师资格证书，并具有有效的安全生产考核合格证书（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">B类），且在本项目投标截止时未担任其他在建项目的项目经理（提供无在建承诺书）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 10.5500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.4 财务要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人须提供</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表及财务报表附注）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人新成立无</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2025年财务审计报告的须提供</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">自成立以来</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">的财务报表</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 10.5500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.5业绩要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日至投标截止时间至少</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">份</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">房屋建筑工程或工业建筑工程施工业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（以合同为准</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合同应至少包含合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 10.5500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.6信誉要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 10.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人不得在信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）中被列入失信企业目录（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">提供网页截图或承诺书</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 10.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人不得</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><a href=\"https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">www.gsxt.gov.cn</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">提供网页截图或承诺书</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.7其他要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc27394\"></a><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc7902\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4．招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.1 获取时间：202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0分至202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日下午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">时</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0分。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.2 获取办法：凡有意参加投标者，登录秦源招标电子招标平台（qyzb.shccmg.com），点击&ldquo;投标人登录&rdquo;请将法人授权委托书（附法定代表人、委托代理人身份证复印件）上传。投标人即可办理缴费下载招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.3</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">常用文件</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&mdash;</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">手册及开标注意事项</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">投标人在秦源招标电子招标平台购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件每套售价：</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">00元，招标文件售后不退。购买招标文件发票可在平台开具后自行打印（仅提供电子增值税普通发票）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.5潜在投标人支付招标文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.6已注册的潜在投标人若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.3500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.9400; mso-pagination: lines-together; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_bookmark7\"></a><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_bookmark6\"></a><a name=\"_Toc2663\"></a><a name=\"_Toc25862\"></a><a name=\"_Toc3620\"></a><a name=\"_Toc3809\"></a><a name=\"_Toc26117\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4.7</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">有关交易平台的业务咨询及技术支持请联系：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.3500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.9400; mso-pagination: lines-together; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc8606\"></a><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc22543\"></a><a name=\"_Toc31564\"></a><a name=\"_Toc17240\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">客服电话</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">: 400-685-1179；邮箱:qyebidding@163.com；咨询日期:法定工作日；咨询时间:08:30~12:00 13:30~17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.3500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.9400; mso-pagination: lines-together; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc26517\"></a><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt