font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0866-26C1SXQY0590</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.3招标范围：本工程包含主车间及室外工程。空压制氮机间、热泵机房为门式刚架轻型房屋钢结构，配电室为钢框架结构，整体钢结构涂刷防火漆，建筑面积1532平方米，桩基采用钢筋混凝土灌注桩，车间主体为地上一层，檐高10.8m，局部檐高5m，设计工作年限50年，本结构安全等级为一级;基础形式为桩承台基础，&plusmn;0至﹢1.5m外围护结构及内隔墙采用 240 厚A3.5型蒸压加气混凝土砌块，﹢1.5m以上采用双层压型钢板复合保温墙体，地下墙体采用 240 厚非粘土实心砖;屋面采用双层压型钢板复合保温屋面,配电室采用细石混凝土屋面;在高度7m处设钢结构吊车梁设备平台。给排水工程主要包括消防给水系统、雨排水系统;通风工程主要包括10台通风机，空调器等;采暖工程主要包括钢管柱式散热器及采暖管道;电气工程主要包括智能模块集中控制照明系统，防雷接地工程。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">室外工程包含制氮站检修棚、室外地面、检修棚未简易钢框架结构，屋面采用压型钢板，基础为钢筋混凝土独立基础，局部采用砖砌</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">370墙围护，内设集泥坑、高压水枪等，檐高8m，室外地面为25cm厚混凝土场地硬化，路灯安装，铁艺围墙安装及室外坡道混凝土排水沟浇筑等。具体内容详见工程量清单及施工图。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.4工程地点：</span><a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E9%93%9C%E5%B7%9D%E5%B8%82/8024779?fromModule=lemma_inlink\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">铜川市</span></a><a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%8D%B0%E5%8F%B0%E5%8C%BA/4637645?fromModule=lemma_inlink\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">印台区</span></a><a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E9%87%91%E9%94%81%E5%85%B3%E9%95%87/5859496?fromModule=lemma_inlink\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">金锁关镇</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">玉华煤矿玉华井后沟风井</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">计划工期：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">150</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-siz