 line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本招标项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">煤矿隐蔽致灾因素普查项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，资金为企业自筹，项目已具备招标条件，招标人为陕西陕煤铜川矿业有限公司。陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕西陕煤铜川矿业有限公司的委托，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc428196410\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc438\"></a><a name=\"_Toc399427364\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.项目概况及招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.1项目名称：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">煤矿隐蔽致灾因素普查项目</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc20281\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.2招标概况：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">根据国家矿山安全监察局颁布的《矿山隐蔽致灾因素普查规范》和国家矿山安全监察局陕西局《陕西省煤矿隐蔽致灾因素普查治理工作指导意见》（矿安陕〔</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2025〕59号）文件要求，按照陕西煤业《关于开展矿井隐蔽致灾因素普查方案和报告审查及结果报告的通知》（陕西煤业发〔2025〕153号）文件安排，为切实做好铜川矿业下辖4处煤矿隐蔽致灾因素普查、治理工作，结合矿井未来3～5年生产规划进行隐蔽致灾因素普查、治理，现需开展下辖玉华煤矿玉华井、玉华煤矿柴家沟井、下石节煤矿和陈家山煤矿等4处煤矿隐蔽致灾因素普查工作，编制《煤矿隐蔽致灾因素普查工作方案》《隐蔽致灾因素普查报告》，并依据隐蔽致灾因素普查结果，针对性地编制各煤矿《隐蔽致灾因素治理方案》。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"21\" style=\"margin-top: 0.2000pt; margin-left: 0.5500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.3 招标范围：本标段主要针对铜川矿业的玉华煤矿玉华井、玉华煤矿柴家沟井、下石节煤矿、陈家山煤矿隐蔽致灾因素，拟采用资料收集、航测遥感、现场调查、地面物探、井上下钻探与试验等综合普查方法开展工作，共计划实施四部分工作量，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">详</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">见</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">第五章发包人要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.4服务期：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">180</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日历天。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.5服务地点：陕西陕煤铜川矿业有限公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">玉华煤矿玉华井、玉华煤矿柴家沟井、下石节煤矿、陈家山煤矿</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">矿区内</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc428196411\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc11852\"></a><a name=\"_Toc399427365\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc428196412\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1资质要求</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（1）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人须是中华人民共和国境内注册的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">独立法人或其</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（2）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人须提供有效的地质灾害评估和治理工程勘查设计甲级资质证书</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">地质灾害治理工程施工甲级资质证书</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，并提供有效的安全生产许可证。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-