lign=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标编号：</span></strong><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">0866-26B2SXQY0488</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目所在地区：陕西省，</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">渭南市</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一、招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">聚烯烃弹性体（</span>POR<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）工业化示范项目，招标人为陕西陕煤协创达新材料有限公司，招标项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资金已落实</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。项目已具备招标条件</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，现对该项目的</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">气动调节阀（</span>V<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">型球阀、蝶阀、偏心旋转阀）及自力式调节阀采购</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">进行国内公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目概况和招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、项目名称：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">聚烯烃弹性体（</span>POR<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）工业化示范项目气动调节阀（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">V</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">型球阀、蝶阀、偏心旋转阀）及自力式调节阀采购</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、项目概况：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">聚烯烃弹性体（</span>POR<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）工业化示范项目生产装置，从原料乙烯开始到合成橡胶产品包装为止；辅助生产装置包括循环水站、污水处理站、综合泵站、焚烧及热回收、消防事故水池、雨水监控池、生产办公室、化验室、控制室、备品备件库、综合机修、化学品库、液体罐区、火炬等公辅设施。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">根据聚烯烃弹性体（</span>POR<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）工业化示范项目的工艺需求，计划采购气动调节阀（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">V</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">型球阀、蝶阀、偏心旋转阀）及自力式调节阀</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">49</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">台。该批调节阀主要用于对工艺管线内的流量、压力、液位等参数实现连续精确调节，要求具备高可调比与优良的流量特性（等百分比</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">线性），可适配烃类介质的高压差工况，并带有防气蚀或低噪音设计；自力式调节阀应能依靠介质自身能量实现压力或差压的自动稳定调节，无需外部气源或电源。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、招标范围：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作范围包括但不限于拟采购设备的设计、材料部件采购、制造、检验、试验、运输交付（含卸货）、现场安装调试指导、技术培训、质保期服务、资料交付</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">含数字化交付</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及提供与其配套的安装及维修所需的备品备件、专用工具等为实施本项目所需的全部工作内容。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">详细工作内容及相关技术要求详见：招标文件及第五章供货要求。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、交货地点：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西省渭南市蒲城县渭北煤化工业园区。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、交货期：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月内。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.6<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、质保期：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本设备的质保期为待设备调试完毕性能验收合格后</span>12<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月或到货验收完毕</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">18</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月，以先到时间为准（由于投标人原因未通过性能验收除外）。在质保期间，如需更换某一零部件，此零部件的质保期从更换之日起重新计算。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、资质要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人须是</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人所投产品的制造商须具备有效的《中华人民共和国特种设备生产许可证》压力管道元件制造【许可子项目：压力管道阀门（金属阀门）</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">B</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">级及以上资质】。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目接受代理商投标，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">代理商投标时须提供拟投标设备制造商针对本项目的唯一有效授权；同一品牌同一型号的设备不接受两家投标人同时投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、财务要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（投标截止前三个月内）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年连续三年）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、业绩要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）当投标人为制造商时，须提供近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日期）至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">份</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">气动调节阀（须包含</span>V<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">型球阀）及自力式调节阀</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的制造供货业绩；若同一份业绩无法同时覆盖两类阀门，可分别提供。有效业绩以签署完毕的合同文件为准，合同文件须至少包含合同首页、供货范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章页</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">等</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（可提供相关技术协议作为补充材料）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）当投标人为代理商时，须提供近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日期）至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">份本次投标拟代理品牌</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">气动调节阀（须包含</span>V<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">型球阀）及自力式调节阀</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的供货业绩（该业绩可以是代理商自身作为卖方签订的合同，也可以是所代理品牌的制造商作为卖方签订的合同，也可以是所代理品牌的其他代理商（销售商）作为卖方签订的合同）；若同一份业绩无法同时覆盖两类阀门，可分别提供。有效业绩以签署完毕的合同文件为准，合同文件须至少包含合同首页、供货范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章页</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">等</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（可提供相关技术协议作为补充材料）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、信誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未被列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未被列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、其他要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本次招标项目的投标；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目不接受联合体投标，本项目资格审查方式为资格后审。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span>00<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分至</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span>18<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下载招标文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">登录</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】</span>-<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书、法定代表人及委托代理人身份证等资料，点击【提交】后按系统提示下载招标文件。招标文件售价：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">500</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">元</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">套，售后不退，项目结束后在秦源招标电子平台下载增值税电子普通发票；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书才能完成投标工作，数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书办理及咨询电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4008206660</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">转</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">客服，客服电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">400-685-1179</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">qyebidding@163.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08:30-12:00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">13</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">:</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">30-17:30<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下载网址：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人操作手册及开标注意事项</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、递交截止时间：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2026<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">18</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">午</span>9<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、递交方式：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子文件上传递交到</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">六、开标时间</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2026<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">18</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 