 New Roman;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标人负责提供包装袋、</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">设备检修维护及大检修</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，投标人负责提供本项目所使用的叉车、辅助工具、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">劳动防护用品</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">等，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">承担误操作导致的事故责任</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 5.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 5.0000pt;\">.费用按月根据劳务项目及结算清单据实结算。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">具体详见招标文件第五章发包人要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -33.1500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font