er-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。建设资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，资金已落实。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">西卓煤矿二盘区补充地质勘探工程</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（招标编号：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26B3SXQY0487</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">西卓煤矿目前正常回采一盘区，</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">号煤层各一个回采工作面，产能低于已批复的</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">500</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万吨生产规模要求，需开拓新盘区布设工作面，满足达产要求，因此计划接续开拓二盘区，但二盘区存在勘探控制程度相对较低、资源量大部分为推断资源量，水文地质等开采技术条件探查程度较低等问题，因此矿井从生产需求出发、针对上述问题开展二盘区补充地质勘探，目的是进一步查明补勘区水文、瓦斯等地质条件，掌握相关地质参数，提高补勘区勘探控制程度及主采煤层资源量级别，满足接续开拓要求，提升矿井产能。本次共设计钻孔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个，其中探煤孔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个，探煤孔兼做瓦斯参数井</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个，水文兼探煤孔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个，先期施工探煤孔兼做瓦斯参数井、水文兼探煤孔，再根据地面区域治理主孔位置施工探煤孔。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二盘区补充地质勘探工程，本次共设计钻孔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个，总设计进尺</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8225m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，其中探煤孔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个，设计进尺</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4030m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，探煤孔兼做瓦斯参数井</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个，设计进尺</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2750m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，水文兼探煤孔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个，设计进尺</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1445m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">具体内容详见招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目地点：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕西陕煤澄合西卓煤矿有限公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">服务期限</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日历天</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质量要求</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">严格执行《煤矿安全规程》</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">版</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、《煤炭地质钻探规程》</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(MT/T1076-2008)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">《煤层气井钻井工程安全技术规范》</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(SY6818-2011)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">等现行国家及行业规范，工程整体质量达到合格标准，施工资料完整规范，满足矿井地质设计及工程归档使用要求。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人须是</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。投标人须具有有效的安全生产许可证。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求（以下两个条件二选一）：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年经审计的财务审计报告（须包括审计报告正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表，并附审计机构营业执照、会计师事务所执业证书、注册会计师执业证书）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人提供基本账户银行出具的资信证明（自</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">05</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">01</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后出具）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日期）至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项煤田地质勘探类业绩。业绩证明材料以合同协议书为准，有效时间以签订时间为准。合同协议书应至少包含合同首页、关键信息页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.4</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">人员要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">项目负责人须具有高级工程师及以上专业</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">技术职称，职称专业类别应为地质类相关专业。项目负责人须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后由社保部门出具的连续</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月有效社保证明。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">其他要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）单位负责人为</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目不接受联合体投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目资格审查方式为资格后审。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.1</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">25</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\">0<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分至</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">31</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span>18<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.2</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）&rdquo;下载招标文件</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标文件每套</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">500</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">元</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">售后不退</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标后仅提供电子普票。具体操作步骤如下：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，点击【资料审核】，进入资料审核页面，上传授权委托书、法定代</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">表人及委托代理人身份证等资料，点击【提交】后按系统提示下载招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书才能完成投标工作，数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书办理及咨询电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4008206660</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">转</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。咨询日期：工作日及周末：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8:00-20:00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">400-685-1179</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">qyebidding@163.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08:30-12:00 13:30-17:30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-heigh