.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">电子邮箱：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">sxqygjb@126.com</span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26D2SXQY0349',NULL,NULL,'陕西省煤层气开发利用有限公司钻井分公司电驱压裂橇成套设备购置项目（第一批）','陕西省煤层气开发利用有限公司钻井分公司','2026-08-20 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097235088280551425,'','2026-09-10 09:34:58','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕西澄合山阳煤矿有限公司山阳煤矿四采区北部补充煤层气参数井施工项目招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260820/1275101796909449216.html','b257a854452d165006788ed64b63b59bda0235227717e6d2d8caa57d3380d04d',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">陕西澄合山阳煤矿有限公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">山阳煤矿四采区北部补充煤层气参数井施工项目</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（招标编号：</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26B3SXQY0474</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">项目所在地区：陕西省渭南市</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一、招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目山阳煤矿四采区北部补充煤层气参数井施工项目，招标人为陕西澄合山阳煤矿有限公司，招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。建设资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，资金已落实。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">山阳煤矿四采区北部</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">补充</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">煤层气参数井施工项目（招标编号：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26B3SXQY0474</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">为进一步提高四采区勘探精度，控制煤层走势，测定各煤层瓦斯参数等，为下一步巷道局部提供详细地质依据，拟在四采区北部补充三</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">口煤层气参数井，其中一口煤层气参数井兼奥灰文长观孔。设计钻孔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个，设计孔深</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">817.96m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">SY-02C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">参数井位于北护难村东南侧，设计孔深</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">561m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">SY-03C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">参数井位于北护难村东北侧，设计孔深</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">637m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人主</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">要工作如下：在四采区对应地面施工煤层气参数井钻孔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个，其中：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">SY-01C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为参数井兼水文长观孔，孔深</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">817.96m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">SY-02C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">SY-03C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为参数井，孔深分别为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">561m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">637m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，钻孔进尺共计</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2015.96m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；通过对参数井测井、</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采样化验，获取</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3#</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">煤、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4#</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">煤、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5#</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">煤、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6#</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">煤、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7#</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">煤、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8#</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">煤、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9#</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">煤、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">10#</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">煤储层含气量及相关参数；通过对</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">SY-01C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">SY-02C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">SY-03C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">井煤层进行注入压降试井、原地应力测试，查明</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5#</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">煤储层压力及相关参数；拟将</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">SY-01C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">井测定相关数据后建成水文长观孔，长观层位为奥陶系灰岩含水层，监测动态要素包括水位、水质和水温；其查明含水层水文地质特征，求取含水层的水文地质参数，评价其富水性；同时完成地下水自动化监测仪的安装与调试。具体内容详见招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目地点：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕西澄合山阳煤矿有限公司。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">服务期限</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">90</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日历天</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质量要求</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">严格执行《煤矿安全规程》</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">版</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、《煤炭地质钻探规程》</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(MT/T1076-2008)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">《煤层气井钻井工程安全技术规范》</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(SY6818-2011)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">等现行国家及行业规范，工程整体质量达到合格标准，施工资料完整规范，满足矿井地质设计及工程归档使用要求。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人须是在中华人民共和国</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">境内注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。投标人须具有有效的安全生产许可证。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求（以下两个条件二选一）：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年经审计的财务审计报告（须包括审计报告正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表，并附审计机构营业执照、会计师事务所执业证书、注册会计师执业证书）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人提供基本账户银行出具的资信证明（自</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">05</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">01</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后出具）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日期）至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项煤田地质勘探类业绩。业绩证明材料以合同协议书为准，有效时间以签订时间为准。合同协议书应至少包含合同首页、关键信息页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.4</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">人员要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">项目负责人须具有高级工程师及以上专业</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">技术职称，职称专业类别应为地质类相关专业。项目负责人须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后由社保部门出具的连续</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月有效社保证明。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">其他要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目不接受联合体投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目资格审查方式为资格后审</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.1</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">21</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 