宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">项目所在地区：</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">陕西省 延安市 黄陵县</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"31\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong>一、招标条件</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">建新煤化公司防爆柴油机履带式支架搬运车购置项目已由项目审批<span lang=\"EN-US\">/</span>核准<span lang=\"EN-US\">/</span>备案机关批准，项目资金来源为企业自筹，出资比例<span lang=\"EN-US\">100%</span>，招标人为陕西陕煤蒲白矿业有限公司。该项目已具备招标条件，现招标方式为公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"31\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong>二、项目概况和招标范围</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">、项目概况：建新煤化公司拟购置<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>台防爆柴油机履带式支架搬运车，用于采煤工作面单元支架搬运。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">、招标范围：防爆柴油机履带式支架搬运车<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>台，装机功率&ge;<span lang=\"EN-US\">105</span></span> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">kW</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">，外形尺寸（长&times;宽&times;高）：长：&le;<span lang=\"EN-US\">7200</span></span> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">mm</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">，宽：&le;<span lang=\"EN-US\">1400</span></span> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">mm</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">，高：&le;<span lang=\"EN-US\">2200</span></span> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">mm</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">；额定载重<span lang=\"EN-US\">/</span>举升能力&ge;<span lang=\"EN-US\">10000</span></span> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">kg</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">；最大牵引力&ge;<span lang=\"EN-US\">80</span></span> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">kN</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">；最大摆动转矩&ge;<span lang=\"EN-US\">5000</span></span> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">N.m</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">，保持转矩&ge;<span lang=\"EN-US\">15000</span></span> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">N.m</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">、交货期：</span>合同签订生效后<span lang=\"EN-US\">45</span>天<span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">4</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">、交货地点：陕西建新煤化有限责任公司（陕西省黄陵县店头镇闫庄村）。 </span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">5</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">、质保期：</span>设备井下使用一年后或到货<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>个月（先到为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"31\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong>三、投标人资格要求</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">、资质要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）投标人须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织的制造商。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）投标人所投设备需具有有效的矿用产品安全标志证书。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">、业绩要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">投标人须具备近年（合同签订时间<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日至投标截止时间）至少<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>份额定载重大于等于<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>吨的支架搬运车供货业绩（须提供供货业绩对应的合同，合同须至少包含：合同首页、买卖双方签字盖章页、签订时间页、供货范围等关键信息页）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">、信誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）投标人未列入信用中国（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span>）严重失信主体名单；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span>）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">本项目不允许联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"31\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong>四、招标文件的获取</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">获取时间：从<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">19</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>分到<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">26</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">获取方式：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">、投标人须在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）上免费注册。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">、注册完成后，投标人登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及&ldquo;三、投标人资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">、经招标机构确认后，即可获取招标文件，招标文件费用：<span lang=\"EN-US\">500</span>元，售后不退（购买招标文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票，在平台自行打印）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"31\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong>五、投标文件的递交</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">递交截止时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">递交方式：电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p>\n<p class=\"31\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong>六、开标时间及地点</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">开标时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">开标地点：开标通过&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></p>\n<p class=\"31\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong>七、其他</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">、本项目招标公告仅在陕西采购与招标网（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://www.sntba.com</span>）、秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）、中国招标投标公共服务平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://www.cebpubservice.com/</span>）发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">、秦源招标电子招标平台使用方法及技术支持咨询电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">400-685-1179</span>，邮箱：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"mailto:qyebidding@163.com\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: windowtext; text-decoration: none;\">qyebidding@163.com</span></a></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">，咨询时间：法定工作日<span lang=\"EN-US\">08:30~12:00</span>，<span lang=\"EN-US\">13:30~17:30</span>。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">、秦源招标二期电子招投标系统操作手册（供应商）下载网址：<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html</span>。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">4</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">、投标人须办理数字<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>证书并下载投标客户端。数字<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>证书办理及咨询电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">4008206660</span>转<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>。数字<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>驱动及办理指南下载网址：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/43.htm%E3%80%82\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: windowtext; text-decoration: none;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/43.htm</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; color: windowtext; text-decoration: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">。</span></span></a></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">秦源招标二期投标客户端下载网址： </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"../cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html%E3%80%82\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: windowtext; text-decoration: none;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; color: windowtext; text-decoration: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">。</span></span></a></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">5</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">、受理异议的联系人和联系方式<span lang=\"EN-US\">:</span>联系人<span lang=\"EN-US\">:</span>陕西陕煤蒲白矿业有限公司审计部冯丽萍，联系电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">0913-7560129</span>；联系邮箱：<span lang=\"EN-US\">376640784@qq.com</span>；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"31\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong>八、监督部门</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">本招标项目的监督部门为陕西陕煤蒲白矿业有限公司审计部。</span></p>\n<p class=\"31\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong>九、联系方式</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">招标人：陕西陕煤蒲白矿业有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">地址：陕西省渭南市蒲城县</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">联系人：吴战军</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">13571542066</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-hei