eight: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt;\">二次</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt;\">（招标编号：</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt;\">0866-26D1SXQY0302</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt;\">）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目所在地区：陕西省</span> </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">延安</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">市</span> </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">黄陵</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">县</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">一、招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">建新煤化采煤工作面深孔爆破卸压工程</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已由项目审批</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/核准/备案机关批准，项目资金来源为其他资金（企业自筹，比例100%），招标人为陕西陕煤蒲白矿业有限公司。本项目已具备招标条件，现招标方式为公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">二、项目概况和招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.1项目概况：建新煤矿为弱冲击地压矿井，现采用大直径钻孔、水力压裂实施卸压，保障了安全生产。随着开采深度增加、地质条件复杂化，特别是工作面上覆岩层存在着多层厚砂岩，在生产过程中存在采空区顶板悬顶、两巷超前应力集中、周期来压显现强烈等问题突出，单靠大直径钻孔、水力压裂等卸压方式对重点区域的矿压显现明显管控不足。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.2招标范围：本项目通过深孔爆破弱化采煤工作面上覆岩层顶板，改变上覆岩层的结构特征，降低高位岩梁断裂对采煤工作面及大巷的影响，实现精准断顶、切断压力传导路径，弱化冲击危险，调整采煤工作面的应力分布特征，达到减小两巷超前及大巷变形的目的，从而实现安全生产目标。该工程包含4301、4211工作面停采线及后续4216、4306采煤工作面初次来压、一次见方、二次见方、停采线及邻空侧卸压工程，共计总进尺29839m，总装药量55.563t。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.3计划工期：自合同签订生效之日起</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">730</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">日历天。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.4建设地点：陕西省黄陵县店头镇新村。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.5质量要求：合格。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1 资质条件：</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人须具备</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">公安机关</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">颁发的有效的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">爆破作业单位许可证</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(营业性)二级及以上资质</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3.2 业绩要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人近年（合同签订时间为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年1月1日起至投标截止日）具有1份</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">爆破卸压</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">业绩（以合同为准，包含合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3.3 信誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书为准）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.4 其他要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）爆破员具有</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">公安机关</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">颁布的爆破作业人员许可证（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">作业类别：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">爆破</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">员</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）和</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">应急管理部门</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">颁布的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">特种作业操作证（操作项目：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">煤矿井下爆破作业</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）安全员具有</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">公安机关</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">颁布的爆破作业人员许可证（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">作业类别：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">安全员）和</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">应急管理部门</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">颁布的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">特种作业操作证（操作项目：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">煤矿安全检查作业</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）爆破</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">技术负责人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">公安机关</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">颁布的爆破作业人员许可证（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">作业类别：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">爆破工程技术人员</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">高级</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">和</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">应急管理部门</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">颁布的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">特种作业操作证（操作项目：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">煤矿井下爆破作业</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本项目不允许联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：从</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年0</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">19</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时30分到2026年0</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">26</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">获取方式：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.1 投标人须在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）上免费注册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.2 注册完成后，投标人登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及&ldquo;三、投标人资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.3 经招标机构确认后，通知投标人办理购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件费用：500元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.4 购买招标文件的发票，待招标机构开出后投标人可在平台下载（购买招标文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2026年09月09日09时00分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：电子文件上传递交到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">六、开标时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">开标时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2026年09月09日09时00分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标地点：开标通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">7.1 本项目招标公告仅在中国招标投标公共服务平台（www.cebpubservice.com）、陕西采购与招标网（http://www.sntba.com）和秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">7.2 秦源招标电子招标平台使用方法及技术支持咨询电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询时间：法定工作日08:30~12:00，13:30~17:30。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">7.3 秦源招标二期电子招投标系统操作手册（投标人&