nt-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">300MW</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572390;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572449;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">燃煤发电机组，于</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572390;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572449;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">2005</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572390;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572449;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">年</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572390;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572449;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">8</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572390;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572449;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">月投产发电，其汽轮机系哈尔滨汽轮机厂有限责任公司引进西屋技术优化设计的</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572390;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572449;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">N300-16.7/537/537-2</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572390;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572449;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">型汽轮机组，单轴、高中压合缸、低压缸双分流、亚临界、一次中间再热、双缸双排汽、凝汽式汽轮机，额定功率</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572390;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572449;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">300MW</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572390;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572449;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">。循环水采用直流供水方式，水源为澧水。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><a name=\"_Toc234572391\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572450\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572391;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">2.3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572450;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572391;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">招标范围：长安石门发电有限公司</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572450;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572391;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">#3</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572450;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572391;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">汽轮机提效改造，包括汽轮机高、中、低压通流部分全面改造的设计、设备制造、供货、运输和检查、原有通流部件及辅机部件的拆改、金属监督、安装、部分设备的检修、试验、服务、培训、启动调试配合、</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572450;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572391;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">168h</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572450;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572391;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">试运行技术指导以及第三方性能考核试验配合等全部工作；同时也包括所有必要的材料、备品备件、专用工具、消耗品以及相关技术资料的提供等。</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572450;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572391;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: black; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">具体内容详见招标文件技术要求。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><a name=\"_Toc234572392\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572451\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572392;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; color: black; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">2.4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572451;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572392;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: black; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">计划工期：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><a name=\"_Toc234572452\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572393\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572452;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">总工期：合同签订生效后<span lang=\"EN-US\">500</span>天。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><a name=\"_Toc234572394\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572453\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572394;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: black; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">制造工期：<span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span>个月内，<span lang=\"EN-US\">2027</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日前完成所有设备供货到现场；</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><a name=\"_Toc234572454\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572395\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572454;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: black; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">施工工期：<span lang=\"EN-US\">60</span>天。<span lang=\"EN-US\">#3</span>汽轮机组<span lang=\"EN-US\">A</span>级检修计划于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2027</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>日开工，具体开工日期以招标人通知为准。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><a name=\"_Toc234572396\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572455\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572396;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; color: black; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">2.5</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572455;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234572396;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: black; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">建设地点：湖南省常德市石门县宝峰街道长安石门发电有限公司厂区。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span styl