695;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">的成功业绩，需提供：合同封面、合同买卖双方盖章页、合同签订时间和业绩要求中的关键信息页</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">（包括组容量、改造范围、热耗指标、供货范围、用户完工（投运）证明，），并附改造后性能考核试验报告封面及能反映热耗试验值的内容等</span></span></span> <span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">。若投标人为联合体，需提供联合体各方相对应专业至少</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">台及以上</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">300MW</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">容量及以上机组汽轮机通流部分改造业绩。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><a name=\"_Hlk226544837\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">3.3</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544837;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: black;\">财务要求：</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544837;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">投标人须提供</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544837;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2023</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544837;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">年至</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544837;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2025</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544837;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">年连续三年的财务审计报告，投标人成立不足三年的，提供自成立以来的财务审计报告，（至少包含：审计报告正文及正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表），<a name=\"OLE_LINK2\"></a>投标人成立不足一年的提供自成立以来的财务报表。</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">联合体投标，联合体各方均需提供。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">3.4</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: black;\">项目经理要求：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><a name=\"_Hlk226544546\"></a><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">投标人项目经理需具有机电工程专业一级注册建造师证书及有效的《安全生产考核合格证书》（</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544546;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">B</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544546;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">类），且未担任其他在建项目的项目经理（提供承诺书），至少从事过</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544546;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544546;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">次及以上</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544546;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">300MW</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544546;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">容量及以上汽轮机通流改造项目的项目经理从业经历（提供证明材料）。须提供在本单位</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544546;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2025</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544546;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">年</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544546;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">6</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544546;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">月</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544546;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544546;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">日至投标截止日连续</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544546;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">6</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544546;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">个月由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"line-heig