 150%;\">严重失信主体名单（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书或网站截图为准为准）。联合体投标，联合体各方均需提供。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544863;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">（</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544863;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544863;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544863;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">(https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544863;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">严重违法失信名单</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544863;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">(</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544863;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">黑名单</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544863;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544863;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">信息（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书或网站截图为准）。联合体投标，联合体各方均需提供。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544863;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\">3.6</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544863;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: black;\">其他要求：</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">（</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">）投标人负责人为同一人或存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得参加同一项目投标，否则相关投标均无效。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">（</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">）本项目接受联合体投标，联合体投标的，应满足下列要求：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">①联合体成员数量不超过</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">个（含牵头人），联合体各方须签订联合体协议书，明确联合体牵头人和各方的权利义务；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">②联合体各方均具备在中国境内注册法人或其他组织，并依法取得企业营业执照；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">③联合体各方不得再以自己名义单独或参加其他联合体在同一项目中投标；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">④联合体成员应当具备承担招标项目所需相应资质条件和能力。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-pagination: lines-together; page-break-after: avoid; mso-outline-level: 3;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;\">4</span></strong></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%;\">、招标文件的获取</span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><a name=\"_Toc428196413\"></a><a name=\"_Toc399427367\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk226544953\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4.1</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">获取时间：</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226544953;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc399427367;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc428196413;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hans