y: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 15pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">项目所在地：陕西省，</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">渭南市</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">一、招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目陕西陕煤韩城矿业有限公司象山矿井西一采区地面三维地震及瞬变电磁物探补充勘探，招标人为陕西陕煤韩城矿业有限公司，招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。招标项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%。该项目已具备招标条件，现进行国内公开招标。诚邀符合条件的潜在投标人前来参加。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2.1项目概况：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">象山矿井计划进行西一采区开拓掘进，采区开拓前需进行地面三维地震及瞬变电磁物探补充勘探。西一采区设计面积</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8.4平方公里，物探补充勘探范围东部至南一、南二下山采区边界，西部和南部超出采区设计边界200m，北部至矿井边界，面积9.8平方公里。具体详见本项目技术要求。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2.2招标范围：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人负责探查区内</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3号、5号、11号煤层落差大于等于5m的断层，煤层底板标高、埋藏深度及起伏形态（波幅大于等于5m的褶曲），预测区内3号、5号、11号煤层厚度变化趋势，探查区内直径大于20m的陷落柱，探查区内奥灰顶界面起伏情况及赋水性，探查区内3号煤层顶板上60m至奥灰顶界面以下100m范围内主要含水层的富水平面分布范围及垂向导通关系等所有工作内容。具体要求详见招标文件第五章发包人要求。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2.3服务地点：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">陕西省韩城市象山矿井</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2.4服务期限：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">合同签订生效</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">150天。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2.5质量：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">符合《矿山隐蔽致灾因素普查规范》《煤矿采区三维地震勘探规范》《地面磁性源瞬变电磁法技术规程》《煤炭煤层气地震勘探规范》《煤炭电法勘探规范》《煤矿地质工作细则》《煤矿防治水细则》等相关技术要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.1、资质要求：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">投标人必须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.2、业绩要求：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年1月1日至投标截止日期）至少</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">份</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">三维地震或瞬变电磁勘探业绩。业绩证明材料以合同文件为准，有效时间以签订时间为准。合同文件应至少包含合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.3、财务要求：（以下两个条件二选一）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人提供2025年经审计的财务审计报告（须包括审计报告正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表、并附审计机构营业执照、会计师事务所执业证书、注册会计师执业证书）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人提供基本账户银行出具的资信证明（自2026年6月1日以后出具）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.4、人员要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">项目负责人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">须具有物探相关专业高级职称</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。并提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年1月1日以后由社保部门出具的连续3个月有效社保证明材料。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">信誉要求：（下列要求仅提供加盖公章的承诺书）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.6、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">其他要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）本项目不接受联合体投标；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）资格审查方式为资格后审。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">18</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时00分至2026年8月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">24</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">00分；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html）&rdquo;下载招标文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书、法定代表人及委托代理人身份证等资料，点击【提交】，通过后按系统提示下载招标文件，招标文件售价：500元/套，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字CA证书才能完成投标工作，数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6。（4）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00，13:30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的投标人/投标人操作手册及开标注意事项https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">5.1</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">026年9月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">5.2</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;上传电子投标文件的方式递交。未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">六、开标时间、开标方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">6.1</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">开标时</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年9月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:0</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">0时整。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">6.2</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">开标方式：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;在线开标。所有投标人可准时进入&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;开标大厅参加在线开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标公告在中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.cebpubservice.com</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、陕西采购与招标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.sntba.com</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">上发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">八、监督部门</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">本招标项目的监督部门：陕西陕煤韩城矿业有限公司招标办</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">监督电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0913-5262402</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">监督邮箱：</span><a href=\"mailto:190678063@qq.com\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">190678063@qq.com</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">九、异议渠道及方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">10日内以书面形式（邮件发送）向招标人提出。提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">1）异议提出人名称、地址、电话等；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2）具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3）异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">4）提出异议的日期。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">十、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">招标人：陕西陕煤韩城矿业有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">地址：陕西省</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">渭南市</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">韩城市</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-