"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; vertical-align: super;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2</span></span></sup><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，一盘区南翼采空区面积</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6.55km</span></span><sup><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; vertical-align: super;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2</span></span></sup><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">12201工作面采空区面积0.53km</span></span><sup><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; vertical-align: super;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2，</span></span></sup><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合计物探工程</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">量约为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">15.6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6km</span><sup><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; vertical-align: super;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2</span></span></sup><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">物探结束后，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提交提交《袁大滩煤矿采空区积水地面物探成果报告》文字报告（含相关附图附表）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6套及双层PDF蓝光光盘（电子版）2套。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">具体</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-