 style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">38号东院办公楼1楼121室</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">联系人：招标二部蒋工</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">029-81611533 &nbsp;&nbsp;18192595257</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">786951107@qq.com</span></span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26B2SXQY0421',NULL,NULL,'聚烯烃弹性体（POR）工业化示范项目气动切断阀（球阀）采购','陕西陕煤协创达新材料有限公司','2026-08-14 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097235287501602817,'','2026-09-10 09:34:59','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕西陕煤协创达新材料有限公司聚烯烃弹性体（POR）工业化示范项目暖通施工工程招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260814/1272981699868753920.html','395512bd8bd03a328257779ff4a1924d9f24f9bae5fa1a15b7ccacd6ea8699d3',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西陕煤协创达新材料有限公司</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">聚烯烃弹性体（</span>POR<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）工业化示范项目</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">暖通</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">施工工程</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标公告</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标编号：</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26B1SXQY0461</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">项目所在地区：陕西省</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">，</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">渭南市</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-left: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">一</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西陕煤协创达新材料有限公司聚烯烃弹性体（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">POR）工业化示范项目</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，招标人为陕西陕煤协创达新材料有限公司，招标项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%，资金已落实。招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">暖通施工工程</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">进行国内公开招标</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-left: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">二</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、项目概况与招标范围</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2.1项目名称：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">聚烯烃弹性体（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">POR）工业化示范项目暖通施工工程</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2.2项目概况：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">聚烯烃弹性体（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">POR）工业化示范项目占地约175.52亩，主要建设聚烯烃弹性体（POR</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">工业化示</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">范项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">装置，聚合部分设置年产</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">35000吨POR（干基）的生产线，可根据市场需求生产不同牌号产品，年操作时间按8000小时考虑，操作弹性</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">50%～110%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">建设内容主要包括聚烯烃弹性体（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">POR）工艺装置，以及配套建设的公用工程、辅助生产设施等。建设的主要公辅设施有：循环水站、脱盐水系统、污水处理站、焚烧及热回收、消防系统、生产办公室、化验室、控制室、备品备件库、综合机修、化学品库、火炬等。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2.3招标范围：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK6\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">聚烯烃弹性体（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">POR）工业化示范项目暖通施工工程。包括但不限于：泵房、后处理包装工序、成品仓库、含镍废水处理设施、主催化剂配制、控制室、变电所、生产办公室、化验室、化学品库B、危废暂存库、备品备件库、换热站、综合泵站、循环水站、综合机修间、人流大门及门卫、 门卫2及地磅房等单元的所有采暖、通风空调和防排烟工程的设备、材料的采购和管道、设备、防腐保温安装以及为实施本项目所需的相关调试工作</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、数字化交付服务</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">并负责化验室通风柜万向罩等排风系统、新风系统、变频离心风机、排气吸附装置等的联动调试。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">本项目主要材料</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、设备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">均为乙供。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">具体施工内容详见</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">施工</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">图纸。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2.4项目地点：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">陕西省渭南市蒲城县</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">渭北煤化工业园区</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2.5工期：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">180日历天，以发包人下达的开工指令确定的实际开工日期起算，至工程竣工移交之日止。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2.6质量：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">符合国家《建筑工程质量统一验收标准》</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">GB50300-2013要求，同时须达到发包人的接管验收标准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK5\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">3.1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">资质要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">：</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人须</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">提供行政主管部门颁发的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">建筑机电安装工程专业承包二级及以上资质和消</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">防设施工程</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">专业承包二级及以上资质，并具有有效的安全生产许可证</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">且在有效期内</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoFooter\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: center blank 207.6500pt right blank 415.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）投标人须提供拟投标产品（多联机及单元式机组）制造商针对本项目出具的唯一授</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">权书</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（同一品牌同一型号仅接受一家授权）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">同一品牌同</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">一型号的设备不接受两家投标人同时投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">3.2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">财务要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">投标人财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人须提供有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（投标截止前三个月内）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人须提供（2023年-2025年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">连续三年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">3.3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">业绩要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK1\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">投标人须提供近五年（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">自</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2021年1月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">1日至投标截止日）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">至少三</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">份</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">暖通施工工程</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">或</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">建设</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">工程</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">施工总承包（含</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">暖通施工</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">工</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">程业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。有效</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">业绩以合同文件为准，合同内容须体现：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、证明业绩有效的其他关键信息等</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">3.4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">人员要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">项目负责人（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">项目经理</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">资格要求：具备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">机电</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">工程专业</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">二</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">级</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">及以上</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注册建造师资格，且持有安全生产考核合格证书（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">B证）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">须在本单位注册。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">且未担任其他在建设工程项目的项目经理或技术负责人（提供承诺书）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）技术负责人资格要求：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">须具有机电</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">工程专业</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">二</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">级</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">及以上</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">注册建造师资格</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">或机电工程</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">相关</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">专业</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">的助理工程师及以上职称，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">且未担任其他在建设工程项目的项目经理或技术负责人（提供承诺书）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）安全负责人资格要求：必须具有安全生产考核合格证书（C类）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以上人员须为本单位在册职工，提供由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日以后连续</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">个月）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">3.5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">信誉要求</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人基本信息在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;陕西省建筑市场监管与诚信一体化管理系统&rdquo;可查询（提供截图）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信名单。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">3.6</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">其他要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）本次招标不接受联合体投标。本项目资格审查方式为资格后审。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.3000pt; margin-bottom: 3.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">4.1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">获取时间：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">从</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">00分至</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">00分</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">4.2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">获取方式：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">下载招标文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）登录</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，点击【资料审核】，进入资料审核页面，上传授权委托书、法定代表人及委托代理人身份证等资料，点击【提交】按系统提示下载招标文件，招标文件售价：500元/套，售后不退，项目结束后在秦源招标电子平台下载增值税电子普通发票</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字CA证书才能完成投标工作，数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span> &nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">客服，客服电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00 </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">13:30-17:30。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">投标人操作手册及开标注意事项</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2）秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.3000pt; margin-bottom: 3.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">5.1递交截止时间</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">5.2递交方式：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">电子文件上传递交到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent2\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">六、开标时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">6.1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">开标时间：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">09</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">09</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">9:00时整</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">6.2开标方式：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">开标通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">网上进行。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">本项目招标公告在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">中国招标投标公共服务平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&rdquo;&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">陕西采购与招标网</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">和</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">八、监督部门</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">本招标项目的监督部门：</span><a href=\"mailto:\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕西</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">陕煤</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">协创达新材料有限公司综合管理部。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">监督联系人：宋孝敏</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">监督电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18191709378</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">监督邮箱：</span><a href=\"mailto:songxm@pcccti.com\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">songxm@pcccti.com</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">通讯地址：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">陕西省渭南市蒲城县渭北煤化工业园区陕西陕煤协创达新材料有限公司综合办公室</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.3000pt; margin-bottom: 3.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">九、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">异议渠道及方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前</span><span