ng><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">招标公告</span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（招标编号：<span lang=\"EN-US\">0866-26C2SXQY0410</span>）</span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">项目所在地区：河南省、信阳市、平桥区</span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">一、招标条件</span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><a name=\"_Hlk226402687\"></a><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">本招标项目<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>号炉低温过热器管屏泄漏隐患治理已由项目审批<span lang=\"EN-US\">/</span>核准<span lang=\"EN-US\">/</span>备案机关批准，项目业主为陕煤电力信阳有限公司，建设资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为<span lang=\"EN-US\">100%</span>，招标人为陕煤电力信阳有限公司。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目进行公开招标。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></strong></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK1\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK16\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">2.1</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">项目概况：陕煤电力信阳有限公司<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>号炉为东方锅炉生产的<span lang=\"EN-US\">DG2000</span>／<span lang=\"EN-US\">26.15-II2</span>型超超临界直流锅炉，<span lang=\"EN-US\">2009</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>月投产，采用单炉膛、前后墙对冲燃烧等结构。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">其低温过热器布置于后竖井后烟道，分水平段（<span lang=\"EN-US\">192</span>屏，<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>管绕制，节距<span lang=\"EN-US\">114.3mm</span>）和垂直段（<span lang=\"EN-US\">96</span>屏，节距<span lang=\"EN-US\">228.6mm</span>），材质均为<span lang=\"EN-US\">12Cr1MoVG</span>，分别通过吊挂管和集箱吊架悬吊。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">该低温过热器水平段管道曾两次发生泄漏，经中南院检测存在直道缺陷，且部分直道缺陷已发展为内壁裂纹，风险极高且缺陷难以预控，拟更换水平管段消除隐患；具体情况以招标文件的记载为准。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">2.2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">项目名称：<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>号炉低温过热器管屏泄漏隐患治理</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><a name=\"_Hlk227274136\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">2.3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><a name=\"OLE_LINK6\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">建设地点：河南省信阳市平桥区平桥镇陕煤电力信阳有限公司厂区内</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">2.4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">招标范围</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">：<a name=\"OLE_LINK36\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK54\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK53\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK54;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK36;\">投标人负责全部备件供应、施工及附属工作，具体范围如下：负责低温过热器水平管段及全部附件的供应、运输，备件含水平段、固定装置、防蚀装置、保温材料各<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>套；备件需符合相关标准，供货时提供完整资质及检测资料，承担运输责任。</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK36;\">具体内容详见招标文件相关章节。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">2.<a name=\"OLE_LINK35\"></a>5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK35;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">计划工期：</span></span><a name=\"_Hlk227327075\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk227273424\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK61\"></a></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK61;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227273424;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227327075;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">备件供应期为<span lang=\"EN-US\">60</span>天</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227273424;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227327075;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">，中标人须确保全部备件在现场施工前足额送达至招标人指定地点；现场施工工期为<span lang=\"EN-US\">35</span>天，自机组停机正式开工之日起计算，全部施工内容须在工期内完成并验收合格。本项目具体开工时间以招标人根据机组检修计划统筹安排后通知为准</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227327075;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK37\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">2.6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><a name=\"OLE_LINK14\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK37;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">质保期：项目竣工验收之日起<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>年。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK14;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK37;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">2.7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK14;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK37;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">质量</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK37;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK16;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">标准：<a name=\"OLE_LINK42\"></a>符合国家现行相关规范、行业标准及本次招标有关规定，所有工作及备件均达到合格验收标准。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK59\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK15\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk156767794\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">3.1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">资质要求：<a name=\"OLE_LINK27\"></a>（<a name=\"OLE_LINK33\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK27;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）</span>本次招标要求投标人<a name=\"OLE_LINK45\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\">（若为联合体投标，指联合体各方）</span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\">为在中华人民共和国境内依法注册设立的独立法人企业或其他组织，若为企业法人，须提供有效的营业执照；若为事业法人，须提供有效的事业单位法人证书；若为其他组织，须提供合法有效的登记证明文件；<a name=\"OLE_LINK5\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK3\"></a></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）投标人（若为联合体投标，联合体各方按各自分工对应资质情况）必须同时具有承接本项目所需的以下（<span lang=\"EN-US\">①</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">②</span>）的资质：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">①</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><a name=\"OLE_LINK43\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">货物资质：具有有效《中华人民共和国特种设备生产许可证》，或有效期内原《特种设备制造许可证》，许可项目须涵盖锅炉制造（<span lang=\"EN-US\">A</span>级）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">②</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">施工资质：具有国家建设行政主管部门颁发的电力工程施工总承包一级或以上资质，并持有有效安全生产许可证</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK33;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">3.2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">财务要求：<a name=\"OLE_LINK62\"></a>投标人（若为联合体投标，指联合体各方）须提供<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span>年度至<span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span>年度财务审计报告。企业成立时间不足三年的，可提供自成立以来财务审计报告；企业成立时间不足一年，可提供自成立以来财务报表。所提供审计报告至少包含：审计报告正文及正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表；财务报表至少包含：资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">3.3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><a name=\"OLE_LINK31\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">业绩要求：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><a name=\"OLE_LINK47\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK29\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK47;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK31;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日至投标截止日（以合同签订时间为准），投标人（若为联合体投标，指联合体牵头人）须具备<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>项<span lang=\"EN-US\">600MW</span>等级及以上燃煤锅炉过热器管屏整套供货业绩。须提供合同复印件，至少包含合同双方盖章页、签订时间页、供货范围、机组容量等关键信息页；若所提供合同无法体现机组容量，投标人须在投标文件中提供证明材料。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK29;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK47;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK31;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日至投标截止日（以合同签订时间为准），投标人（若为联合体投标，指联合体成员方）须具有<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>项<span lang=\"EN-US\">600MW</span>等级及以上燃煤锅炉受热面承压部件焊接施工业绩。须提供合同复印件，至少包含合同双方盖章页、签订时间页、施工范围、机组容量等关键信息页；若所提供合同无法体现机组容量，投标人须在投标文件中提供证明材料。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK29;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK47;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK31;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">注：独立投标人须同时满足本条第（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）项、第（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）项全部业绩要求。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">3.4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">信誉要求：<a name=\"_Hlk218412748\"></a>（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）投标人（若为联合体投标，指联合体各方）未列入&ldquo;信用中国（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.creditchina.gov.cn</span>）&rdquo;严重失信主体名单（以投标人加盖单位公章的承诺书为准）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk218412748;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）投标人（若为联合体投标，指联合体各方）未列入&ldquo;国家企业信用信息公示系统（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.gsxt.gov.cn</span>）&rdquo;严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息（以投标人加盖单位公章的承诺书为准）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK57\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK52\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK28\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK52;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK57;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">3.5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><a name=\"OLE_LINK50\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK57;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK52;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">项目经理</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK57;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK52;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">的资格要求：（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）拟任项目经理<a name=\"OLE_LINK67\"></a>须具备机电工程专业二级及以上注册建造师证书及有效的安全生产考核合格证书（<span lang=\"EN-US\">B</span>证）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK57;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK52;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）项目经理须提供社保主管部门出具的投标截止日前<span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span>个月内任意连续<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>个月在本单位缴纳社保的证明；若单位成立不足<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>个月，须提供自成立以来全部连续社保缴纳证明；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK57;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK52;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）项目经理不得同时担任其他在建工程项目的项目经理或技术负责人。投标人须提供《项目经理无在建项目承诺书》，承诺书须加盖投标人及联合体所有成员单位（如有）公章；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK57;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK52;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>）以上投标若为联合体投标，项目经理由承担施工任务的联合体成员单位委派。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK57;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">3.6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK57;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">技术负责人的资格要求：拟任技术负责人须具备电力工程相关专业中级及以上职称，并提供以下材料：（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）技术负责人职称证书复印件；（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK57;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">技术负责人须提供社保主管部门出具的投标截止日前<span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span>个月内任意连续<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>个月在本单位缴纳社保的证明；若单位成立不足<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>个月，须提供自成立以来全部连续社保缴纳证明；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK57;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）技术负责人不得同时担任其他在建工程项目的项目经理或技术负责人，投标人须提供《技术负责人无在建项目承诺书》，承诺书须加盖投标人及联合体所有成员单位（如有）公章；（<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>）以上投标若为联合体投标，技术负责人由承担施工任务的联合体成员单位委派。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK57;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">3.7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK57;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk156767794;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">其他要求：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK57;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk223431099;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk226402687;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk227274136;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）拟任安全负责人须持有有效安全生产考核合格证（<span lang=\"EN-US\">C</span>类）；（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）安全负责人须提供社保主管部门出具的投标截止日前<span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span>个月内任意连续<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>个月在本单位缴纳社保的证明；若单位成立不足<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>个月，须提供自成立以来全部连续社保缴纳证明；（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）以上投标若为联合体投标，安全负责人由承担施工任务的联合体成员单位委派。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK57;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">3.8</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK57;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">本次招标接受联合体投标。联合体投标的，应满足下列要求：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK57;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）联合体成员数量不超过<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>家（含牵头方）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK57;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）联合体各方须签订联合体协议，明确牵头方、成员分工及主要权利义务，并提供联合体协议书；联合体各方不得再以自身名义单独投标，也不得加入其他联合体参与本项目投标。否则其投标及相关联合体投标均将被拒绝；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK57;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK59;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）联合体各方应在联合体协议中明确承担施工任务的成员单位。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件获取</span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">获取时间：从<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">15</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分至<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">21</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">获取方式：<a name=\"OLE_LINK25\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\">4.1</span>凡有意参加投标者，登录秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）购买招标文件。未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;常用文件&mdash;投标人操作手册。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK25;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">4.2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK25;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">已注册的潜在投标人可登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;投标人登录&rdquo;请将法人授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码及上述&ldquo;<span lang=\"EN-US\">3.</span>投标人资格要求&rdquo;的所有资料扫描以<span lang=\"EN-US\">PDF</span>文件形式上传。潜在投标人应及时关注、查阅秦源招标电子招标平台。因未及时查看导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK25;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">4.3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK25;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">投标人通过秦源招标电子招标平台缴纳招标文件费，缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件每套售价：<span lang=\"EN-US\">800</span>元，招标文件售后不退。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK25;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">4.4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK25;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">潜在投标人支付招标文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票（招标文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK25;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">4.5</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK25;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">已注册的潜在投标人若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">五、投标文件递交</span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">递交截止时间：<a name=\"_Hlk186553190\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">递交方式：投标人应在截止时间前须登录秦源招标电子招标平台递交投标文件</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">六、开标时间及地点</span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">开标时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">开标地点：<a name=\"OLE_LINK12\"></a>本项目采用网上开标，须登录秦源招标电子招标平台网上进行，投标人应提前<span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>分钟登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，按时完成解密和确认步骤。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">七、其它</span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><a name=\"_Hlk170114402\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">7.1</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk170114402;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">本次招标公告同时在中国招标投标公共服务平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.cebpubservice.com</span>）、陕西采购与招标网（陕西采购与招标公共服务平台）（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.sntba.com</span>）、秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）上发布；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk170114402;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">7.2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk170114402;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">秦源招标电子招标平台的操作问题请咨询（业务咨询及技术支持客服电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">400-685-1179,</span>邮箱：<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyebidding@163.com ,</span>咨询时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">08:30-12:00 13:30-17:30</span>）；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk170114402;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">7.3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk170114402;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">秦源招标电子招标平台系统操作手册下载网址：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk170114402;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241016/1031244793008619520.html</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk170114402;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk170114402;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">7.4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK11;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK18;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk170114402;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; li