ght: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">/18192595196</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">电子邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">476351534@qq.com</span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26B1SXQY0454',NULL,NULL,'2.1、项目名称及招标编号：陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司1500万吨年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目中央控制楼精装修工程','陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司','2026-08-12 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097235417856376833,'','2026-09-10 09:34:59','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司放射性仪表维保服务 招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260812/1272113002505568256.html','d2cccf497f3daaa1263d89a6ae7f9d6205b0c04f7fd696fb911ba7c88d8adc42',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 28.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16pt;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 28.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16pt;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司放射性仪表维保服务</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 28.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标编号</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">:</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16pt;\">0866-26A3SXQY0802</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 28.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目所在地：陕西省，</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">榆林</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">市</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">一、招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Hlk17227348\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本招标项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">放射性仪表维保服务</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，招标人为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司，招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。招标项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%。该项目已具备招标条件，现进行国内公开招标。诚邀符合条件的潜在投标人前来参加。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1项目概况：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">180万吨/年乙二醇项目、120万吨/年粉煤热解示范项目及1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目建于陕西省榆林市榆神工业园区清水</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">工业园</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。为保障公司核仪表维保工作有效衔接，满足核仪表现场实际检维修，现对放射性仪表维保服务项目公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2招标范围：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">工作内容及要求包括但不限于：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">180万吨/年乙二醇项目、120万吨/年粉煤热解示范项目及二期项目一阶段现有（见附件清单）、新增的所有放射性仪表设备的巡检、校验、标定、调试、开关放射源、检修、更换等保运</span><a name=\"bookmark29\"></a></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">维护检修工作。其中放射性仪表的专业维修（经招标方认定确实无法维修，则由投标人负责送专业厂家进行维修，产生的维修费用由招标方承担）；控制系统界面以机柜间进</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">DCS或SIS系统端子为界，端子以内由招标方负责；放射性仪表使用的气源以气源入口阀为界，阀前由招标方负责，阀门及阀后至仪表本体的气路系统由投标人负责维护。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具体工作范围及要求详见招标文件</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">第五章发包人要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">及附件《放射性仪表维保技术规格书》</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目地点：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西省榆林市神木市大保当镇榆神工业区清水工业园。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4服务期限：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合同生效之日起</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5质量标准：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">符合国家石油化工及煤化工行业检修、施工的验收规范、质量评定标准、安全操作规程、检修规程、设备随机说明书以及招标人制定的维护检修规程等，质量合格</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">三、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.1资质要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人必须依法取得有效的《辐射安全许可证》（种类和范围须包含使用</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">Ⅳ类、Ⅴ类放射源）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">业绩要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2020年1月1日至投标截止日3份放射性仪表维保服务业绩【有效业绩以合同为准，日期以合同签订时间为准。合同文件需体现：合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间、双方盖章签字页（可提供技术协议补充合同内容）】。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">财务要求</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（投标截止时间前三个月内）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人须提供连续三年（2023年-2025年）（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2023年及以后年份审计报告需赋码可查）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表及财务报表附注）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告复印件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.45pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.4人员要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">投标人拟派人员须</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">具有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">《中华人民共和国特种作业操作证（高处作业）》</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">须</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">至少</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">一名</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">拟派</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">人员</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">满足</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">）</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">及核技术利用辐射安全与防护考核合格证书</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">且</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">为本单位在职职工，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">并</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">须提供在本单位</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2025年9月1日至投标截止日前连续6个月由社会保障管理部门出具的本企业有效社保证明材料</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供拟派人员的本年度辐射工作人员个人辐射剂量监测报告，且必须保证年有效剂量当量不得超过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">50mSv</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">信誉要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">严重失信主体名单；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">其他要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）本项目不接受联合体投标，资格审查方式为资格后审；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.1获取时间：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时00分至2026年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">北京时间，节假日接受文件购买）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.2获取方式：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">下载招</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">标文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">-【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书及&ldquo;三、投标人资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件，点击【提交】</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）按系统提示下载招标文件。招标文件售价：500元/套，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）有关注册、下载招标文件、加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00，13:30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1）秦源招标二期电子招标平台系统的供应商/投标人操作手册及开标注意事项https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2）秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：</span><a href=\"../cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html%E3%80%82\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CA证书才能完成投标工作，数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.1递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">00分</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（北京时间）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.2递交方式：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人应在投标截止时间前，登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标二期电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;，将加密的投标文件上传，上传成功后，系统自动反馈上传结果和时间，递交时间即为系统反馈结果时间。详见附件&ldquo;操作手册&rdquo;、&ldquo;数字证书办理指南&rdquo;、&ldquo;上海CA驱动-显卡助手&rdquo;。未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">六、开标时间及方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">开标时间</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">00分</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（北</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">京时间）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Toc21305\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.2开标地点：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标二期电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密和确认步骤，系统默认解密时间为30分钟。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">七、发布公告的媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本项目招标公告在</span><a href=\"https://bulletin.cebpubservice.com/\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #000000; font-size: 10.5pt;\">中国招标投标公共服务平台</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://bulletin.cebpubservice.com/）和陕西采购与招标公共服务平台（http://www.sntba.com/）及秦源招标电子招标平台（https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html）发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\" align=\"justify\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5pt;\">八、</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">监督部门及异议投诉渠道和方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 10.5500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.1本项目监督部门：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司商务部</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">联系人：周工</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">监督电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">0912-3732054</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">监督邮箱：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">swb@shccig.com</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 10.5500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.2异议渠道及方式：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 31.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 3.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">10日内以书面形式（邮件发送）向招标人提出，邮箱：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">swb@shccig.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">异议提出人名称、地址、电话等；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">单位负责人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">提出异议的日期。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">九、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> 标 人：陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">地</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\