0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司井下辅助运输路线安全改造工程四次招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260810/1271512358413402112.html','3306744c85cdd36e251e86e5613fa0a0755402de1c4a73d5da2eb82a2a8ea1fa',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; text-align: center; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 21px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px;\">陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司井下辅助运输路线安全改造工程</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; text-align: center; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 21px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px;\">招标编号：</span><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 21px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px;\">0866-26E1SXQY0342</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; text-align: center; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;\">四次招标公告</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Toc28046\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司井下辅助运输路线安全改造工程</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo;，招标人为陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司，资金来源于企业自筹，出资比例100%。项目已具备招标条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司的委托，现对该</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目进行</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">四次</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">公</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Toc27948\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.项目概况及招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 15.7500pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1项目名称</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司井下辅助运输路线安全改造工程</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（招标编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">0866-26E1SXQY0342</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 15.7500pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目概况：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">红柳林矿</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">井下辅助运输大巷作为矿井主要辅助运输路线，由于服务年限较长、道路表面光滑，同时由于搬家倒面重型车辆通行，路面破损严重，地坪修复施工频发，严重制约井下辅助运输效率，计划对路面进行安全改造。</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 15.8500pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标范围：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）5-2煤辅运大巷23联巷至33联巷（含沿线硐室、联巷及绕道口5米范围），（2）二号进风斜井、二号进风斜井与4-2煤绕道（含沿线硐室、绕道口5米范围），（3）5-2煤南北通道（含南北绕道及沿线硐室），（4）三盘区2-2煤辅斜巷至2-2煤辅运2联巷，（含绕道、联巷、皮带机头检修通道及沿线硐室），（5）北辅运斜联巷至交接班硐室（含沿线硐室、联巷口5米范围）。合计改造长度9700m，面积58480㎡。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">包括</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">混凝土路面铣刨、凿毛、渗水处理、过水路面排水管布设、粘层油洒布及</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">玻璃纤维栅施工、底层沥青混凝土摊铺、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">粘层油洒布、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">面层沥青混凝土摊铺、路面标线施工、清理</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">等</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具体以第五章工程量清单为准。</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 15.8500pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">工期：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">130</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">日历天</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">实际开工日期以甲方下达的开工令或签发的开工报告为准。</span><a name=\"_Toc3007\"></a></span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 15.8500pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">建设地点：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤集团神木红柳林煤矿</span><a name=\"_Toc5655\"></a><a name=\"_Toc7078\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 15.8500pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-hei