\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤黄陵店头电厂三期</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&times;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1000MW</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">机组项目</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">已由陕西省发展和改革委员会以陕发改能电力</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">〔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2024</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">〕</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2126</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">号</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">文件核准批复，项目资金来源为企业自筹，出资比例</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100%</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">建设单位为黄陵矿业河浦发电有限公司，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标人为陕西煤业物资有限责任公司黄陵分公司。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">该项目三大主机设备采购（锅炉设备）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">已具备招标条件，现招标方式为公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二、项目概况和招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、项目概况：陕煤黄陵店头电厂三期</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&times;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1000MW</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">机组项目位于陕西省黄陵县双龙镇。本项目是黄陵矿业公司为加快国家及陕西省新增规划内支撑性电源建设，保障陕西省经济发展电力增长需求的省级重点建设项目，建设规模</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&times;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1000MW</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">高效超超临界燃煤空冷发电机组，同步建设脱硫、脱硝装置。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、招标范围：本次招标</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为陕煤黄陵店头电厂三期</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&times;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1000MW</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">机组工程高效超超临界机组（同步建设</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">SCR</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">脱硝装置）的锅炉本体及辅助设备。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">锅炉为高效超超临界参数、变压直流炉、单炉膛、一次中间再热、平衡通风、半露天封闭布置（运转层以下封闭，以上露天）、固态排渣、全钢构架、全悬吊结构、炉顶设全覆盖式轻型防雨屋盖（含脱硝顶盖）、对冲或切圆燃烧方式的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&Pi;型炉或塔式炉。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">锅炉主蒸汽和再热蒸汽的压力、温度、流量等要求与汽轮机的参数相匹配，锅炉出口主蒸汽温度按</span> <span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">610 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">℃，主蒸汽压力按</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">31.5 MPa.a</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，再热蒸汽温度按</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">625</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">℃，给水温度暂按</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">315</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">℃（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">BMCR</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工况）。锅炉最大连续蒸发量暂按</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3092t/h</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标，最终与汽轮机的</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">VWO</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工况相匹配。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、交货期：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">#1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">锅炉交货期为合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">20</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月交货</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 12.0000pt;\">到电厂现场</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">#2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">锅炉交货期为合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">21</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月交货到电厂现场</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、交货地点：陕西省延安市黄陵县陕煤黄陵店头电厂三期</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&times;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1000MW</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">机组项目施工现场车板交货</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、质保期：合同设备通过</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">168</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">小时试运之日起一年（签最终验收证书）或卖方发运的最后一批交货的设备到货之日起</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">36</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月（签最终验收证书）。二者以先到日期为准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、资格条件：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）投标人须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织的制造商，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）投标人须具有</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">有效的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">《中华人民共和国特种设备生产许可证》锅炉制造〔许可子项目：锅炉</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(A)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">〕。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、业绩要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人须具备近年（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投运时间</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">20</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">21</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止时间）</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">份已投运的</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1000MW</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及以上高效超超临界燃煤电厂锅炉本体供货业绩（①须提供业绩对应的合同，合同须至少包含：合同首页、买卖双方签字盖章页、签订时间页、工作范围等关键信息页；②投运时间以机组通过</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">168</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">试运证明为准）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、信誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书为准）：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本项目不允许联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、获取时间：从</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分到</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、获取方式：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">凡有意参加投标者，登录陕西省公共资源交易平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）下载电子招标文件及附件，投标人必须在上述时间内下载招标文件，逾期无法下载。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标文件下载流程：投标人应登录陕西省公共资源交易平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">），选择&ldquo;电子交易平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西省工程建设交易系统</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">新点软件工程建设交易系统企业端&rdquo;进行登录，登录后选择&ldquo;交易乙方&rdquo;身份进入，进入后在左上角&ldquo;建设工程&rdquo;类别中找到并选择本项目点击文件下载，免费下载电子招标文件（后缀为</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">.</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">SXSZF</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的文件）及有关附件。投标人须在招标文件获取时限内，下载获取电子招标文件及有关附件，逾期下载通道将关闭，未及时下载获取电子招标文件及有关招标文件附件将会导致后期无法上传电子投标文件，无法参与本项目投标，投标人后果自负。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人初次使用交易平台需按陕西省公共资源交易平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）的要求办理</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">锁。办理须知详见：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/fwzn/004002/004002007/20250108/efdc53a2-c250-44b1-876c-c44ab6c5e66d.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。本项目采用</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;不见面开标&rdquo;方式，无须投标人现场递交纸质投标文件。投标人在投标截止时间前，在陕西省公共资源交易平台（陕西省）（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）在线递交上传电子投标文件并完成在线签到。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：在全国公共资源交易平台（陕西省）（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）网上递交</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">，未上传电子投标文件或未上传指定平台的电子投标文件，招标人不予受理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">六、开标时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">开标时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">开标地点：陕西省公共资源交易平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">《</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">陕西省不见面开标大厅</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">》</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">在线开标</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本次招标采用资格后审的方法对投标人资格进行审查，资格评审的条件、标准、方法详见招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、本次招标公告同时在陕西采购与招标网（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sntba.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）和全国公共资源交易平台（陕西省）（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.cebpubservice.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">上发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、投标人须在陕西省公共资源交易中心网站企业诚信管理系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）中登记企业信息，然后</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">登录</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">全国公共资源交易平台（陕西省）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">下载、查看电子招标文件及</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">有关附件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、关于平台操作及常见问题，请查看陕西省公共资源交易中心</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;服务指南&rdquo;，具体详见&ldquo;办事指南&rdquo;和&ldquo;常见问题解答&rdquo;。如有疑问请联系平台</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">相关技术问题，请提前咨询软件开发商：技术支持热线：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">029-88661287</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">029-88661298</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0512-58188039</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标的时候必须携带加密锁（公司</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">锁）。该项目将采取&ldquo;不见面&rdquo;开标</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">方式</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，投标人无须到达开标现场，即可在网上直接参与开标活动。具体方法详见招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; word-break: break-all; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">提出异议的方式：异议人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">提出异议</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">应当提交异议书，异议书应当以纸质盖章文件或有效的电子文件等书面形式提交。异议人是法人的，异议书必须由其法定代表人或者授权代表签字并盖章；由其他组织或者自然人提出的，异议书必须由其主要负责人或者异议人本人签字，并附有效身份证明复印件。异议书有关材料是外文的，应当同时提供其中文译本。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">受理机构：陕西煤业物资有限责任公司黄陵分公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">联系人：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times Ne