\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-outline-level: 1;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; text-indent: 28px; font-family: 宋体;\">张家峁选煤厂末煤提质技术改造项目勘察与设计服务</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-outline-level: 1;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; font-family: 宋体;\">招标编号：</span><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; font-family: 宋体;\">0866-26E3SXQY0473</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-outline-level: 1;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二次</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标公告</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Toc30192\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1．招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">张家峁选煤厂末煤提质技术改造项目勘察与设计服务</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo;，招标人为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕煤集团神木张家峁矿业有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，资金来源于企业自筹，出资比例</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%。项目已具备招标条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕煤集团神木张家峁矿业有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">的委托，现对该项目进行</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二次</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><a name=\"_Toc29314\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2．项目概况、招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.1项目名称:</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">张家峁选煤厂末煤提质技术改造项目勘察与设计服务</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（招标编号：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0866-26E3SXQY0473</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">），本项目划分为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1个标段</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2项目概况</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">张家峁</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">现有选煤厂建设工程分地面生产系统和洗选系统两部分设计，分期建设完成。地面生产系统由中煤西安设计工程有限责任公司于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2009年5月建成使用，设计生产能力为6.0Mt/a。主要生产设施包括：原煤仓、准备车间、地销煤仓、产品仓、快速装车站和相关转载点及带式输送机栈桥；辅助生产设施包括为整个选煤厂配套的电气楼和生产调度楼等。洗选系统由张家峁矿业有限公司组织设计招标，由泰戈特（北京）工程技术有限公司中标块煤车间（含浓缩车间及相关配套设施）工程的设计和建设，于2010年8月建成使用。设计生产能力为10.0Mt/a。洗选系统建设范围包括自准备车间至块煤车间带式输送机始至块煤车间各产品出车间带式输送机（或至矸石仓）止的全部生产系统。主要生产设施包括：块煤车间（含矸石转载站）、浓缩车间、矸石仓、准备车间至块煤车间带式输送机栈桥、块煤车间至准备车间洗大块、洗中块、煤泥带式输送机栈桥和块煤车间（矸石转载站）至矸石仓带式输送机栈桥；辅助生产设施有介质库、压风机房和相关变配电室等。通过2016年产能提升技术改造后，选煤厂目前可实现原煤筛分能力11.0Mt/a，块煤洗选6.0Mt/a。选煤厂设计工作制度为每年工作330d，每天工作16h。地面采用&ldquo;三八&rdquo;制作业，其中2班生产，1班检修。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoToc3\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本次末煤提质技术改造在现有地面工艺总布置基础上进行，除新增重介主厂房在现有主厂房西侧外扩外，不再新增生产车间，主要在现有车间内进行改造。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoToc3\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">主要改造工程包括：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1号转载点、准备车间、准备车间至块煤车间带式输送机栈桥、块煤车间（改造及向西侧外扩）、新增浓缩车间、地销煤仓、产品仓。根据工艺要求和设备布置对原有结构进行加固补强，结构加固采用直接加固的方法。具体方法采用外包型钢加固法、粘贴钢板加固法并配套相应的植筋技术和锚栓技术。加固补强按照现行规范《混凝土结构加固设计规范》（GB50367－2013）等进行。通过加固补强，以保证改造后建筑结构的安全可靠。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">因张家峁矿井地面场地太小，地面建筑非常集中，没有场地用于末煤提质改造，本次末煤提质技术改造只能通过降低现有浅槽分选下限来实现，对</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">13-8mm末煤也进行洗选。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.3招标</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">范围：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">设计服务：承担本项目相关设计、专篇编制工作，包括：初步设计（含设计说明书、附图、投资概算、设备清册）、施工图设计、安全设施设计、消防专篇（符合消防设计审查相关规范要求）的编制及完善；施工图设计需通过</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">审查</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，初步设计、消防专篇需配合</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">招标人取得</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">上级单位或政府部门的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">批复（备案）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，安全设施设计通过</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">招标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">审查或配合</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">招标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">取得上级单位（政府部门）批复</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）勘察服务：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">针对项目新增建构物开展专项岩土工程详细勘察，具体包括：查明场地工程地质条件；提出详细的岩土工程资料和设计、施工所需的岩土参数；出具岩土工程勘察报告及相关图表资料</span><span class=\"16\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">服务地点：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">张家峁煤矿</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">服务期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">工程勘察报告自合同签订</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">生效</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">之日起</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">15日历天内完成；初步设计及消防专篇自合同签订</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">生效</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">之日起</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">30日历天内完成</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">并配合</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">取得上级单位或政府部门的批复（备案）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">安全设施设计自合同签订生效之日起</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">30日历天内完成，通过</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">审查或配合</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">取得上级单位（政府部门）批复；</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">施工图设计自初步设计取得</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西煤业股份有限</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">公司批复后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">0日历天内完成</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">并通过</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">审查</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.6质量：符合</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">国家、行业</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">规定及招标文件要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><a name=\"_Toc16984\"></a><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3．投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.1资格要求：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.2资质要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 21.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人须具备建设行政主管部门颁发的工程设计综合甲级资质或工程设计煤炭行业甲级</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">资质或工程设计煤炭行业（选煤厂）专业甲级资质</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 21.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须具备建设行政主管部门颁发的工程勘察综合甲级资质或工程勘察专业类</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(岩土</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工程</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">)甲级资质或工程勘察专业类（岩土工程（勘察））甲级资质</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">项目负责人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">要求</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">:具有工程序列相关专业高级或以上技术职称。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.4业绩要求：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人必须具有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">202</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">至投标截止时间</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合同内容包含</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">岩土工程勘察及</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">选煤厂（含新建或改建或扩建）设计各</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">份</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">若同一合同同时包含</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">岩土工程勘察及</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">选煤厂设计内容，可只提供一份业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">），</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">证明材料以合同为准，至少包含合同首页、签订日期、合同内容及双方盖章页，有效业绩时间以合同签订日期为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.5 财务要求：提供2023年-2025年连续三年经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务报告（若公司成立时间不足三年，可提供成立之后年份经第三方审计的财务报告）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求：投标人未列入信用中国</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/)严重失信主体名单</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/)严重违法失信名单(黑名单)。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">其他要求：</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">同时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">参加</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标。</span> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21