er\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标编号：</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26B1SXQY0533</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; text-align: center; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标公告</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目所在地区：陕西省</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">渭南市</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西澄合山阳煤矿有限公司山阳煤矿四采区水泵房及抗灾排水泵房设备购置及安装工程</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已批准，招标人为</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西澄合山阳煤矿有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，招标项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span>100%<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，资金已落实。招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称及招标编号：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">山阳煤矿四采区水泵房及抗灾排水泵房设备购置及安装工程</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（招标编号：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26B1SXQY0533</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：山阳煤矿矿井水文地质类型综合评定为复杂类型。根据《煤炭矿井防治水设计规范》（</span>GB 51070-2014<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）中</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">11.1.6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">规定：水文地质条件复杂、极复杂或有突水危险的矿井，采用下山开采时，应在下山采区下部车场附近设置采区正常排水系统和采区抗灾排水系统或在采区正常排水系统基础上采取其他防治水措施。根据四采区设计，计划实施四采区水泵房及抗灾排水泵房设备购置及安装工程。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">山阳煤矿四采区水泵房及抗灾排水泵房设备购置及安装工程主要建设内容包括：购置并安装耐磨多级离心式水泵</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">含配套电机</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、矿用隔爆潜水泵</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">含配套电机；完成配电设备及系统、控制设备及系统，各项附属设备设施及材料的购置与安装；敷设</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">377</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">排水管路约</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3030</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米、支管约</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">130</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米、敷设动力电缆约</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万米、通讯和控制电缆约</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万米，施工中</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">273mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和中</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">159mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">钻孔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个。具体要求详见招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标文件范围内全部设备材料供应、工程施工、安装调试、竣工验收、验收交付及质量保修等全过程的所有内容。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工期：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">90</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日历天。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质量：</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合格。</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">严格按照专项施工方案及国家、煤矿行业现行规范组织作业，完成水泵、管路、电缆、配电自控系统供货、安装、单机及联动调试全流程管控；进场物资执行资质核验</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">抽样复检，设备基础、管路吊挂、电气接线精度满足规范限值；单机空载试运行</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ge;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4h</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、系统带载联动试运行&ge;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8h</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，液位自动轮换排水、故障告警等功能完整可靠；竣工验收执行《煤矿设备安装工程质量验收规范》（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">GB509462013</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">），配套全套竣工资料归档；系统</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">72h</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">连续稳定运行达标后完成竣工验收</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.6<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目地点：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西澄合山阳煤矿有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人须具有矿山工程施工总承包一级及以上资质，并具有有效的《安全生产许可证》。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人须提供拟投标设备有效的（符合现行煤矿安全法规要求）矿用产品安全标志证书（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">MA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">），防爆合格证书（对应电气设备具有）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">须</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提供</span>202</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年经审计的财务审计报告（须包括审计报告正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表，并附审计机构营业执照、会计师事务所执业证书、注册会计师执业证书）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人新成立不足</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年的需提供自成立以来的财务报表</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务报表应包含：资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">或</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">基本账户银行出具的资信证明（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">自</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">06</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">01</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后出具</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）及银行基本账户证明资料</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供近年（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">202</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日期）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项煤矿井下设备安装工程施工业绩。业绩证明材料</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以合同为准</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">有效时间以</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合同</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">签订时间为准</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同应至少包含合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人员要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）项目负责人（项目经理）：拟派项目负责人具有矿业工程专业一级注册建造师资格，具有有效的《安全生产考核合格证书》（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">B</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">类），且未担任其他在建项目的项目负责人或技术负责人（提供承诺书）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）技术负责人：须具有矿业工程专业一级注册建造师资格或矿业工程相关专业中级及以上工程师职称；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）安全负责人：具有有效的《安全生产考核合格证》（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">类）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）项目负责人（项目经理）、技术负责人、安全负责人为本单位在职员工，人员配备不能相互兼职，须为本单位在册职工，须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以后至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人基本信息在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;陕西省建筑市场监管与诚信一体化管理系统&rdquo;可查询（提供截图）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单（提供加盖公章的承诺书）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（提供加盖公章的承诺书）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.6<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">其他要求</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK75\"></a></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: