目名称：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西红柠铁路有限责任公司中秋、国庆节值班员工慰问品采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（采购编号</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">0866-26E2SXQY0868</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">），本项</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">目共划分</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">个包次。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.2采购人：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西红柠铁路有限责任公司</span><u></u></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.3采购机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.4采购项目资金落实情况：企业自筹，出资率100%</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.5采购项目概况：为中秋节、国庆节在岗职工慰问物资采购，物资包含苹果、石榴、提子、梨、坚果、老月饼、猕猴桃、原味茶饮料、猴头菇饼干共9个品类，最终结算以甲方实际验收合格的数量据实结算</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=