n style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2027</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">31</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日之后；生产资质齐全。</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.5500pt; padding: 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border: 1.0000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"94\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">盒</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 136.6500pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 51.9500pt; padding: 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border: 1.0000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"86\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 97.1500pt; padding: 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border: 1.0000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"161\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">菌菇礼盒</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 215.7500pt; padding: 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border: 1.0000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"359\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">干制食用菌组合礼盒，内含不少于</span>4种菌菇品类（黑木耳、香菇、茶树菇、竹荪、猴头菇等组合）；内袋独立分装</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">单种含量</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&ge;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">150</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">g；正规食品企业生产，具备 SC 食品生产许可；干货肉质厚实，无霉变、无虫蛀、无泥沙杂质、无异味；礼盒简约环保；总净含量&ge;800g；</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">保质期至少到</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2027</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">31</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日之后</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.5500pt; padding: 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border: 1.0000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"94\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">盒</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 113.3000pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 51.9500pt; padding: 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border: 1.0000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"86\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">10</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 97.1500pt; padding: 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border: 1.0000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"161\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">燕麦礼盒</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 215.7500pt; padding: 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border: 1.0000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"359\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">内含</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">原味即食燕麦片</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4袋</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，无结块、无霉变、无哈喇异味；执行</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">GB19640标准，无额外添加蔗糖；礼盒简约环保；</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">单袋</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">&ge;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">500g,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">总净重</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ge;2000g；正规食品企业生产，具备SC食品生产许可；保质期至少到2027年3月31日之后。</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.5500pt; padding: 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border: 1.0000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"94\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">箱</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 78.3000pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 51.9500pt; padding: 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border: 1.0000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"86\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; line-height: 18.0000pt; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">11</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 97.1500pt; padding: 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border: 1.0000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"161\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">水果礼盒</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 215.7500pt; padding: 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border: 1.0000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"359\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">当季鲜果，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">内含</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6种鲜果组合：徐香猕猴桃、籽满堂石榴、山东秋月梨、海南芒果、南非脐橙</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">、智利绿奇异果</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">等</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；果品完好无腐烂磕碰，成熟度适中，耐储运适合集中发放；礼盒分格独立摆放，简约环保；总净重</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ge;2.4kg，单果大小均匀&ge;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">230g</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">，新鲜无变质。</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 56.5500pt; padding: 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt 0.0000pt; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid windowtext; border: 1.0000pt solid windowtext;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"94\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">盒</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1采购范围：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本次</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">中秋节员工慰问品（大礼包）采购项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，供应商须按照谈判采购文件要求提供合格产品，并提供包装、运输、装卸以及售后等所有服务，承担验收签字前发生的损毁、丢失、变质风险，以及运输过程引发的人身伤害、第三方财产损失等全部责任</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具体内容详见谈判采购文件第五章采购需求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">交货期</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5天内。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3交货地点：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西红柠铁路有限责任公司采购人指定地点</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4质保期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目整体质保期为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3个月（各商品的实际保质期要求按照本项目谈判采购文件&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">中秋慰问品技术规格明细</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo;要求）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5质量：合格</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 24.1000pt; text-indent: -21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3、供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1供应商应依法设立且满足如下要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK30\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK31\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）依法设立：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">资质要求：须持有有效的食品经营许可证或食品备案；若为生产厂家，须提供有效的食品生产许可证。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：应具有近年（自</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年8月1日至谈判截止日期）至少一项节日慰问品或食品礼盒类似项目供货业绩（以合同为准，每份合同对应的增值税发票不少于1张，合同必须有签订时间页及双方盖章页，合同复印件应清晰明了，甲乙双方盖章完整，有效业绩时间以合同签订时间为准）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求：未被国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.gsxt.gov.cn/index.html）列入严重违法失信名单（黑名单）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未被列入</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;信用中国&rdquo;（http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单（以上条款提供承诺书或相关证明材料）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2供应商不得存在下列情形之一（提供承诺书或相关证明材料）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形。</span><u></u></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.3本次采购不接受联合体。</span><a name=\"_Toc10688\"></a></span></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc10856\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4、采购文件的获取</span></strong></h3>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc11513\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.1凡有意参加谈判者请在上述时间内登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;网址为：（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）下载谈判采购文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行供应商注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取参与资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书及&ldquo;三、供应商资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件，点击【提交】</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">按系统提示下载采购文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）有关注册、下载谈判采购文件、上传电子文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00，13：30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"20\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标二期电子招标系统的供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/供应商操作手册及开标注意事项：</span></span><a href=\"../cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html%E3%80%82\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html。</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.2谈判采购文件费用：500元，通过秦源招标电子招标平台支付，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.3购买谈判采购文件的发票，待采购机构开出后供应商可在平台打印（购买谈判采购文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc3775\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.4谈判采购文件获取时间：2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">上</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">午</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">12</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: