char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">沙梁煤矿</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 38.0000pt; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: none; border-right: 1.0000pt solid #000000; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000; border-bottom: 1.0000pt solid #000000; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000;\" valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"50\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1采购范围：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本次购置</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">40</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">套</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">主动隔爆装置</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，包括：矿用巷道抑爆器、矿用本安型巷道抑爆装置用压力开关、煤矿用聚乙烯绝缘编织屏蔽聚氯乙烯护套通信电缆、安装辅料，供货方负责该项目的设计、供货、指导安装工作，具体内容详见谈判采购文件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">第五章采购需求</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2交货期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">0天内完成</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3交货地点：货物运至</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">沙梁煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">甲方指定地点。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4质保期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">设备运行</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">12个月或到货后18个月，以先到为准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 24.1000pt; text-indent: -21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3、供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1供应商应依法设立且满足如下要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK31\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK30\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）依法设立：必须为具有独立的法人资格的生产厂家，并提供加载统一社会信用代码的营业执照或事业单位法人证书，提供开户许可证或基本存款账户信息证明材料</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">资质要求：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">必须提供本次采购产品的煤矿安全标志证书及配套电气产品的防爆合格证</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）业绩要求：应具有近年（自2022年1月1日至谈判截止日期）至少3项同类项目业绩（以合同及发票为准，发票需清晰明了完整，不得遮挡，每份合同对应的增值税发票不少于1张，对应的增值税发票在国家税务总局全国增值税发票查验平台核验必须真实、有效，合同必须有签订时间页及双方盖章页，合同复印件应清晰明了，可以看清合同内容，甲乙双方盖章完整，有效业绩时间以合同签订时间为准）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）财务要求：提供（2023年-2025年）连续三年经第三方审计的财务报告，若公司成立时间不足三年，可提供成立之后年份经第三方审计的财务报告。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求：未被国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.gsxt.gov.cn/index.html）列入严重违法失信名单（黑名单）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未被列入</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;信用中国&rdquo;（http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单（以上条款提供承诺书或相关证明材料）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2供应商不得存在下列情形之一（提供承诺书或相关证明材料）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形。</span><u></u></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.3本次采购不接受联合体。</span><a name=\"_Toc10688\"></a></span></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4、采购文件的获取</span></strong></h3>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc11513\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.1如贵单位有意参加参加</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">谈判</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购活动，请于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: