le=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: center blank 207.6500pt right blank 415.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目所在地区：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西省神木市店塔镇</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_bookmark3\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc201652949\"></a><a name=\"_Toc7676\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一、招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">神木固废资源综合利用项目智能化专项建设智慧工厂系列设备及系统采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo;已获批准采购，招标人为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">神木恒稳生态绿碳产业有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，资金来源为企业自筹。项目已具备招标条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">神木恒稳生态绿碳产业有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">的委托，现对该项目进行国内</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二次</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 3.2500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_bookmark4\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc2425\"></a><a name=\"_Toc201652950\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1项目概况：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">神木恒稳生态绿碳产业有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，位于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西省神木市店塔镇</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。本期建</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">设</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目围绕绿碳产业生产运营全流程，打造集基础设施、网络体系、智能管控、数据驱动于一体的现代化智慧工厂，全面覆盖生产、安防、运销、设备、能源、档案等核心业务环节，旨在通过技术赋能提升企业生产效率、安全管控能力、资源利用效率及综合运营效益，筑牢绿碳产业高质量发展的数字化根基。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.2招标范围：</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK3\"></a></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">基于原有生产系统设备、平台、数据、进行</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">企业生产效率、安全管控能力、资源利用效率及综合运营效益</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">提升建设，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">包括</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">数据</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采集、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">数据</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">治理</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、安全生产管控、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">AI智能体辅助决策</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">绿碳产业业务系统；</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">特种设备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">专家</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">操作</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">系统</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">生产设备智能化升级</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">等内容</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；同时涵盖智慧档案</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">系统、基础设施</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">等配套支撑系统</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">建设</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">具体内容见第五章技术规范书</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 10.5000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 1.0000gd; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3交货期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">全部设备和系统到达交货地点的时间为合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">90天内</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">质保期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">指合同设备通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">最终验收</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo;后免费保修的期限，自</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">最终验收</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo;日（以</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">最终验收</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo;证书上注明验收日期为准）起，期限为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">一</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">交货地点：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西省神木市店塔镇</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">神木恒稳生态绿碳产业有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 3.2500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_bookmark9\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_bookmark5\"></a><a name=\"_Toc12072\"></a><a name=\"_Toc201652951\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.4000pt; margin-right: 10.8500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc21655\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1资质要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1.1</span><span class=\"10\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;\">投</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">标人须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人单位。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><a name=\"_Toc201652952\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2财务要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.4pt; margin-right: 10.85pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc11500\"></a><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc201652953\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年至 2025年的财务审计报告，投标人新成立不足三年的企业需提供自成立以来的财务审计报告。财务审计报告至少包含：审计报告正文及正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表；投标人新成立不足一年的需提供自成立以来的财务报表，财务报表至少包含：资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc20732\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc3482\"></a><a name=\"_Toc26591\"></a><a name=\"_Toc29156\"></a><a name=\"_Toc20960\"></a><a name=\"_Toc28621\"></a><a name=\"_Toc3177\"></a><a name=\"_Toc2325\"></a><a name=\"_Toc5851\"></a><a name=\"_Toc14541\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1365381718\"></a><a name=\"_Toc10579\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK45\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-si