水系统。主要包含<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>套多级耐磨离心泵及配套附属设备安装、&Phi;<span lang=\"EN-US\">325</span>&times;<span lang=\"EN-US\">14mm 6.4Mpa</span>涂塑复合钢管敷设<span lang=\"EN-US\">8460</span>米、高低压配电及控制设备安装、系统联调联试及试运行等全部安装工程内容。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.2</span>招标范围：包含配电设备安装（<span lang=\"EN-US\">10kV</span>矿用隔爆内置本安型<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>智能<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>真空配电装置、矿用隔爆兼本安型高压真空交流软起动器、矿用隔爆型干式变压器、低压配电系统、微机综保装置<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>与原井下微机综保装置保持一致<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>、矿用隔爆兼本安型锂离子蓄电池电源、水泵自动控制系统、传输系统等）；排水设备安装（煤矿用耐磨多级离心泵、隔爆电动机、喷射泵、矿用离心泵用自动引水电控装置、压力表、真空表等）等，具体详见工程量清单。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.3</span>计划工期：合同签订生效后<span lang=\"EN-US\">210</span>日历天。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.4</span>建设地点：陕西省黄陵县店头镇黄陵建庄矿业有限公司井下四五盘区泄水巷及对应硐室。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.5</span>质量要求：合格。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>三、投标人资格要求</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">3.1 </span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">资质条件：</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）投标人须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）投标人须具备建设行政主管部门颁发的有效的矿山工程施工总承包一级及以上资质，并具有建设行政主管部门颁发的有效的安全生产许可证。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）投标人基本信息在&ldquo;陕西省住房和城乡建设厅（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://js.shaanxi.gov.cn/</span>）<span lang=\"EN-US\">-</span>陕西省建筑市场监管与诚信信息发布平台&rdquo;可查询（以投标人提供的加盖公章的网页查询截图为准）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">3.2 </span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">业绩要求：</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">投标人近年（合同签订时间为<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日起至投标截止日）具有<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>份矿山设备安装工程施工业绩（以合同为准，包含合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">3.3 </span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">信誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书为准）：</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）投标人未列入信用中国（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span>）严重失信主体名单；</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span>）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">3.4 </span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">其他要求：</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">拟派驻本项目的项目负责人须具有矿业工程专业二级及以上注册建造师资格和有效的安全生产考核合格证书（<span lang=\"EN-US\">B</span>类），且在本单位注册，并未担任其它在建工程项目负责人（提供相关证明材料或承诺书）。 </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">本项目不允许联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc117253880\"></a><a name=\"_Toc67468317\"></a><strong>四、招标文件的获取</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">获取时间：从<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">06</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>分到<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">13</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">获取方式：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">4.1 </span>投标人须在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）上免费注册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">4.2 </span>注册完成后，投标人登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及&ldquo;三、投标人资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">4.3 </span>经招标机构确认后，通知投标人办理购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件费用：<span lang=\"EN-US\">500</span>元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">4.4 </span>购买招标文件的发票，待招标机构开出后投标人可在平台下载（购买招标文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>五、投标文件的递交</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">递交截止时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">28</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">递交方式：电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: l