font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">渭南市</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目陕西陕煤澄合矿业有限公司董家河煤矿分公司</span>24501<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面底板水害超前区域治理工程已批准，招标人为</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西陕煤澄合矿业有限公司董家河煤矿分公司</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，招标项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span>100%<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，资金已落实。招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目进行国内公开招标，诚邀符合条件的潜在投标人前来参加。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 31.5000pt left blank 256.0000pt left blank 336.0000pt left blank 448.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称及招标编号：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">24501<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面底板水害超前区域治理工程</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（招标编号：</span>0866-26B1SXQY0427<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：针对四采区</span>24501<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面底板水害防治难题，开展工作面底板水害超前区域治理工程，通过地面定向钻探技术对底板水害进行区域注浆治理，封堵底板导水通道，加固底板隔水层薄弱带，改造底板含水层为相对隔水层，保障工作面安全回采和矿井正常接续。本次布置</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">DJ9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">DJ10</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">两个钻孔孔组采用梳状与扇骨状相结合的布孔方式进行底板水害超前区域治理</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">设计钻探进尺</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">11502m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，注浆量</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">13245t</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">24501<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面底板水害超前区域治理工程：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一开</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&Phi;311.15mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">从</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">钻进至</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">110m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，下入</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&phi;244.5&times;8.94mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">无缝钢管</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">110 m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，水泥固井；</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二开</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&Phi;215.9mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">从</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">钻进至</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">720m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三开</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&Phi;152.4mm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">从</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分别钻进至</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">935</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">m</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>DJ9<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">钻孔孔组）、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">797.2</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">m</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>DJ10<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">钻孔孔组），裸眼成井，注浆；</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">全孔段采用</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">无芯钻进岩屑录井、钻时录井、钻井液录井相结合</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的综合井控工艺；</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注浆：（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）注浆方式为地面制浆、地面注浆，采用孔口封闭止浆、静压分序分段下行式注浆法；（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）注浆材料采用水泥单液浆</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采用压水试验进行注浆质量检查。具体详见招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工期：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效之日起</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质量：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: -0.1000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">达到国家现行《煤矿防治水细则</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: -0.1000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">》《</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: -0.1500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.000