pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">、发布公告的媒介</span></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">本次招标公告同时在&ldquo;</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK13\"></a><a href=\"http://www.cebpubservice.com/\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: windowtext; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">中国招标投标公共服务平台</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; color: windowtext; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\"> (http://www.cebpubservice.com/)</span></span></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">、陕西采购与招标网（</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">http://www.sntba.com/announcement?id=35&amp;page=1&amp;tab=40</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">）和秦源招标电子招标平台（</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-fami