s SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.1 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目名称：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">2026</span>年西安分公司第一批次汽运承运服务项目韩城区域至陕西省榆林市运输<span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">01</span>包</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购编号</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span>0866-26B3SXQY0391</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.2 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购人：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西钢铁集团有限公司西安分公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购代理机构：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">4</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目资金落实情况：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已落实。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">5</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目概况：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">为规范西安分公司物流汽车配送服务采购工作，优化物流配送体系，保障物流全链条安全、高效、稳定开展，拟选择服务优质、履约可靠的物流运输服务商，全面提升物流配送效率与服务质量。按照&ldquo;保顺畅、降费用&rdquo;基本原则，结合当前物流运输实际情况，制定本采购需求，项目年运输量<span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">228</span>万吨，划分为<span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">25</span>个包次，覆盖<span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">328</span>条运输线路，预估年度运输费用约<span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">1.47</span>亿元。本包次情况如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">01</span>包：韩城区域始发，到达陕西省榆林市</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">12</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">个区县</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">计划运量预计约</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">375700</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">吨<span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">/</span>年，入围供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">4</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">家。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">6</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">成交供应商数量及成交份额：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">4</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">家，</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">成交份额：第一名：</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">40%</span></span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">第二名：</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">30%</span></span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">第三名：</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">20%</span></span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">第四名：</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">10%</span></span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、采购范围及相关要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px; margin: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购范围：</span></span></strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商须严格服从采购人统一调度与现场管理，按照采购人指令完成货物始发装车点至指定送达地点的全程运输工作。供应商自行配齐本项目所需运输车辆、配套装备及作业劳务人员，全面负责作业现场人员、设备及承运货物的安全管理工作，确保货物装载、捆扎、运输全过程稳固安全、合规环保。供应商投入的承运车辆、从业人员资质须全部符合国家、行业现行法律法规及标准规范。供应商全权负责承包运输范围内的日常运营、现场管控及内外协调工作，须严格满足采购人发货厂区、库房及货物目的地的安全、环保生产管理规定，全程保障运输路途路面整洁，车辆运行噪音、尾气排放、扬尘管控等全部符合途经属地生态环保及安全生产管控要求。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">详见第五章</span>&ldquo;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购需求</span>&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务期限：</span></span></strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合同签订生效后<span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">1</span>年</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">3</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> </span></strong><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">服务地点：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">韩城区域（包括但不限于龙钢厂区<span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">/</span>金波库<span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">/</span>上若厂区）始发，到达陕西省榆林市<span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">12</span>个区县。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、供应商资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px; margin: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商依法设立并满足如下要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px; margin: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px; margin: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">须具有有效的《道路运输经营许可证》。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px; margin: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商须提供近年（</span>202</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日期）至少</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">份</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">钢材或钢材制品的运输业绩。业绩证明材料以合同文件为准，有效时间以签订时间为准。合同文件应至少包含合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">3</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）信誉</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">①<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商未列入信用中国（</span>https://www.creditchina.gov.</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">cn/<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">②</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span>https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商不得存在下列情形之一：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）法律</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">法规规定的</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">以</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及采购文件约定的其他情形。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3 </span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次采购</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">不接受联合体。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购文件</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">从</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">2026</span>年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">8</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">6</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">8</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">00</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分至</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">2026</span>年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">8</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">11</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">18<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span>00<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取办法：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">1</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">如贵单位有意参加采购活动，请在</span>&ldquo;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span>&rdquo;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>http://qyzb.shccmg.com/<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）上免费注册，注册成功后申请成为供应商。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">2</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注册完成后，供应商</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">在上述获取时间内</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">登录</span>&ldquo;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span>&rdquo;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>http://qyzb.shccmg.com/<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）上传授权委托书</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">法定代表人及委托代理人身份证。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">经采购代理机构确认后，供应商可在</span>&ldquo;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span>&rdquo;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">选择</span>&ldquo;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">网上支付</span>&rdquo;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">扫码办理采购文件缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载采购文件。采购文件费用：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">500</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">元，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">4</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">购买采购文件的发票，待采购代理机构开出后供应商可在平台打印（购买采购文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">五、响应文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">5.1</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">2026</span>年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">8</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">18</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; f