; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">九、异议渠道及方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">或其他利害关系人对本</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购公告</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购文件</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">内容有异议的，应在响应文件递交截止时间前</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日内以书面形式</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">邮件发送</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">向</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-s