-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系人：井炫琳</span> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">029-86230838</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子邮件：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">605549067@qq.com/sxqygjb@126.com</span></span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26D3SXQY0317',NULL,NULL,'陕西煤业化工集团财务有限公司司库软件系统及集成对接项目','陕西煤业化工集团财务有限公司','2026-08-04 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097377261936316418,'','2026-09-10 09:35:00','','2026-09-10 09:37:21',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕西煤业物资有限责任公司西安分公司陕煤电力汨罗有限公司2×100万千瓦燃煤发电工程第七批辅机设备及材料采购-09包：电气试验室设备招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260804/1269311843214557184.html','8bedddfae5e66b18908cac6734241751e09dbb2174f3a4048c4b47b84711f6ec',NULL,'HTML','<p>陕西煤业物资有限责任公司西安分公司 陕煤电力汨罗有限公司2×100万千瓦燃煤发电工程第七批辅机设备及材料采购-09包：电气试验室设备 （招标编号：0866-26C2SXQY0509） 招标公告 项目所在地区：湖南省 岳阳市 汨罗市 一、招标条件 本招标项目陕煤电力汨罗有限公司2×100万千瓦燃煤发电工程第七批辅机设备及材料采购-09包：电气试验室设备，招标人为陕西煤业物资有限责任公司西安分公司，资金来源为企业自筹。项目已具备招标条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕西煤业物资有限责任公司西安分公司的委托，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。 二、项目概况与招标范围 2.1项目名称：陕煤电力汨罗有限公司2×100万千瓦燃煤发电工程第七批辅机设备及材料采购 -09包：电气试验室设备。 2.2招标编号：0866-26C2SXQY0509 2.3项目概况：陕煤电力汨罗有限公司2×100万千瓦燃煤发电工程，位于湖南省岳阳市汨罗市白水镇双桥村。本期建设2×1000MW超超临界二次再热燃煤发电机组，同步建设烟气脱硫、脱硝、除尘设施等。 2.4招标范围：继电保护试验室设备、测量仪器仪表试验室设备、试验室配套设施及服务。本次采购范围包含设备供货、备品备件配套供应、全程运输服务及相关指导安装、调试、检验、校验服务等，设备名称、型号、技术参数等详见招标文件第五章供货要求。 2.5交货期：合同签订后6个月开始发货（具体交货时间以招标人通知为准），设备及材料交货进度应满足工程进度的要求。 2.6质保期：自第二台机组168小时试运行结束之日起1年。 2.7交货地点：湖南省岳阳市汨罗市白水镇闵家巷村大屋组陕煤电力汨罗有限公司2×100万千瓦燃煤发电工程施工现场车板交货。 三、投标人资格要求 3.1资质要求： 投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件； 3.2财务要求： 投标人须提供2023年至2025年经审计的财务审计报告，投标人新成立不足三年的需提供自成立以来的财务审计报告，财务审计报告至少包含：审计报告正文及正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表；投标人新成立不足一年的需提供自成立以来的财务报表，财务报表至少包含：资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表。 3.3业绩要求： 供货业绩：投标人须提供自2016年1月1日至投标截止日（以合同签订时间为准），至少具有2份电气试验室设备供货合同业绩。证明文件须提供合同复印件（含首页、供货设备清单页、双方盖章签字页）。 3.4信誉要求： 3.4.1投标人未列入信用中国(https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/) 严重失信主体名单（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）。 3.4.2投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统(https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/) 严重违法失信名单(黑名单)信息（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）。 3.5其他要求： 3.5.1法定代表人为同一个人的两个及两个以上法人，母公司、全资子公司及其控股公司，都不得在同一货物招标中同时投标； 3.5.2本次招标不接受联合体投标。 四、招标文件的获取 4.1获取时间：2026年08月04日上午8时00分至2026年08月11日下午18时00分（北京时间，下同）。 4.2获取办法：凡有意参加投标者，登录秦源招标电子招标平台（qyzb.shccmg.com），点击“投标人登录”请将法人授权委托书（附法定代表人、委托代理人身份证复印件）及上述“3.投标人资格要求”的3.1-3.5条相关资料以PDF格式上传，投标人即可办理缴费下载招标文件。 4.3未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击“投标人注册”完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台—客服中心—常用文件—手册及开标注意事项。 4.4投标人在秦源招标电子招标平台购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件每套售价：800元，招标文件售后不退。购买招标文件发票可在平台开具后自行打印（仅提供电子增值税普通发票） 4.5潜在投标人支付招标文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。 4.6已注册的潜在投标人若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。 4.7有关交易平台的业务咨询及技术支持请联系： 客服电话: 400-685-1179；邮箱:qyebidding@163.com；咨询日期:法定工作日；咨询时间:08:30~12:00 13:30~17:30。 数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6，咨询时间：工作日及周末：8:00-20:00。 五、投标文件的递交 5.1递交截止时间：2026年08月27日上午9时00分。 5.2本次招标采取网上电子版提交的投标方式，以网上电子版为准。不接受纸质版和U盘投标文件。 5.3为避免受网速影响，以及网站技术支持的时间，建议于投标截止时间前24小时完成网上电子版的提交。 六、开标时间及地点 6.1开标时间：2026年08月27日上午9时00分。 6.2开标地点：开标通过“秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）”网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。 七、其他 7.1本项目招标公告同时在中国招标投标公共服务平台（www.cebpubservice.com）、陕西采购与招标网（陕西采购与招标公共服务平台）（www.sntba.com）、秦源招标电子招标平台（qyzb.shccmg.com）上发布。 7.2秦源招标电子招标平台投标人操作手册下载网址：http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/40.htm 。 八、监督部门及异议渠道和方式 8.1本项目监督部门：陕西煤业物资有限责任公司西安分公司物资管理部。 联系人：孙文健； 监督电话：029-65666250； 监督邮箱：smwzcgxaf@163.com。 8.2异议渠道及方式：投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前10日内以书面形式（邮件发送）向招标人提出，邮箱：smwzcgxaf@163.com。提出的异议书应包含的内容： （1）异议提出人名称、地址、联系人及有效联系方式； （2）提出异议项目的名称、编号、所涉及的具体事项及被异议人的有效联系方式； （3）提出异议事项的基本事实、具体理由及明确诉求； （4）有效线索和相关证明材料； （5）异议人为其他利害关系人的，应提交利害关系证明。 九、联系方式 招标人：陕西煤业物资有限责任公司西安分公司 地 址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路38号东院办公楼3楼303室 联系人：张佳斌先生 电 话：18291130512 邮 箱：912390597@qq.com 招标机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司 地 址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路38号梅苑温泉小区东院数智交易中心一楼105室 联系人：招标三部 凌洋 电 话：029-81615928 邮 箱：lingyang@sxxaqyzb.com.com</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26C2SXQY0509',NULL,NULL,'陕煤电力汨罗有限公司2×100万千瓦燃煤发电工程第七批辅机设备及材料采购','陕西煤业物资有限责任公司西安分公司','2026-08-04 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097377269041467393,'','2026-09-10 09:35:00','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司电仪运维中心气化开关阀球阀采购 招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260804/1269263043896803328.html','ba257eb32b2e1eeb1eb28e1e8d75f639720949613a628c97a984e01285b19591',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 140%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 140%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 140%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt;\">电仪运维中心气化开关阀球阀采购</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0866-26A2SXQY0792</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">项目所在地区：陕西省，</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">榆林市</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">一、招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.3000pt; margin-bottom: 3.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本招标项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">电仪运维中心气化开关阀球阀采购</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已由项目审批</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/核准/备案机关批准，项目资金来源为其他（企业自筹，出资比例100%），招标人为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司，本项目已具备招标条件，现进行国内公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">二、项目概况和招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1、项目名称：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">电仪运维中心气化开关阀球阀采购。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目概况：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司（简称</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;榆林化学&rdquo;）是陕煤集团的全资子公司，负责陕煤集团&ldquo;煤炭分质利用制化工新材料示范项目&rdquo;（简称&ldquo;示范项目&rdquo;）的规划、建设和运营，项目位</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">于榆林市榆神工业区清水工业园，项目总占地面积约</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">13平方公里。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">气化</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">装置</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采用干煤粉气流床加压气化技术，氧气、蒸汽和煤粉并流进入气化炉内，利用煤部分氧化</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(燃烧)释放热量，维持在该煤种的灰熔点温度以上进行气化反应。煤粉、氧气和蒸汽通过烧嘴喷入炉内，煤粉颗粒夹带在气流中，固体颗粒的体积浓度较气体低，可以认为各颗粒是被气体隔开的，颗粒难以互相碰撞，各颗粒独立进行燃烧和气化反应，煤颗粒在高温环境中快速发生热裂解，裂解产物在高浓度的氧中迅速燃烧，从而维持高温环境，生成以CO和H为有效组分的合成气。陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">气化炉高频阀门频繁出现故障，故障后仅能在线抢修，维修时间紧张、问题处理不彻底，导致检修质量无法保证，拟采购备用阀门，以提升检修质量。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本次招标拟采购电仪运维中心气化开关阀球阀总计</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">项，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">共计</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">16台。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标范围：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次采购阀门为电仪运维中心气化开关阀球阀，阀体材质</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">:WCB,阀芯、阀座材质：SS316+硬化,规格为DN300/DN200/DN150/DN100，压力等级:CL600，共计16台。投标人负责拟采购阀门的设计、制造、供货、包装运输、检验和试验、性能保证、现场指导安装调试、验收、人员培训、技术服务、质保期服务、售后服务及提供与其配套的安装及维修所需的备品备件、专用工具及技术资料等所有技术规格书要求的为实施本项目所需的全部工作内容。详细招标范围和要求以招标文件第五章供货要求及技术文件为准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4、交货地点：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕西省榆林市神木市大保当镇榆神工业区清水工业园项目现场指定地点交货。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5、交货期：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">合同签订后</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">90</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">天内分批次到货</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6、质保期：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同全部物资到货验收合格之日起</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">3.1资质要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人须是中国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须具有有效的特种设备生产许可证</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(压力管道阀门)A1级资质，许可类别、范围应完全涵盖本次拟采购货物。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">3.2业绩要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2016年1月1日至投标截止日期至少3份</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">粉煤</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">气化项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">耐磨球</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">阀供货业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">业绩以合同文件为准，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">日期以</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">签订时间为准</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">合同文件需体现：合同首页、签订时间、供货范围、双方签字盖章页等（可提供技术协议补充</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">财务要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">截止</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">时间</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">前三个月内）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人须提供连续三年（202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">-202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">年）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">年及以后年份审计报告需赋码可查）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表及财务报表附注）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告复印件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">3.4信誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">主体</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">名单</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">信息。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">3.5其他要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">1）法定代表人（单位负责人）为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">2）本项目不接受联合体投标</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">本项目资格审查方式为资格后审。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">3）本项目不接受非制造商投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.1获取时间：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时00分至2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">11</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分（北京时间，节假日接受文件购买）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.2获取方式：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">下载招</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">标文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">点击</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">【立即参与】</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">-【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书及&ldquo;三、投标人资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件，点击【提交】</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）按系统提示下载招标文件。招标文件售价：500元/套，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00，13:30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1）秦源招标二期电子招标平台系统的供应商/投标人操作手册及开标注意事项https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2）秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：</span><a href=\"../cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html%E3%80%82\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CA证书才能完成投标工作，数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.1、递交截止时间：202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">25</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9时00分（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.2、递交方式：投标人应在投标截止时间前，登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，将加密的投标文件上传，上传成功后，系统自动反馈上传结果和时间，递交时间即为系统反馈结果时间。未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">六、开标时间及方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.1、开标时间：202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">25</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9时00分（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.2、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标二期电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密和确认步骤，系统默认解密时间为30分钟。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">七、发布公告的媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目招标公告在中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://bulletin.cebpubservice.com/）和陕西采购与招标网（http://www.sntba.com/）及秦源招标电子招标平台（https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html）发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">八、监督部门及异议渠道和方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.1本项目监督部门：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司商务部</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">联系人：王工</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">监督电话：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">0912-3732054</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">监督邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">swb@shccig.com</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.2异议渠道及方式</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">10日内以书面形式（邮件发送）向招标人提出，邮箱：swb@shccig.com。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">异议提出人名称、地址、电话等；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">提出异议的日期。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">九、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">招</span> <span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">标</span> <span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">人：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-