 \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">)严重失信主体名单；（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统(</span></span><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">https://ww</span></a><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">w.gsxt.gov.cn/</span></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">) 严重违法失信名单(黑名单)信息。（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc24780\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.6 本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_bookmark6\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_bookmark5\"></a><a name=\"_Toc16347\"></a><a name=\"_Toc4945\"></a><a name=\"_Toc9588\"></a><a name=\"_Toc19738\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK4\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso