; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时00分至2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">10</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">8时00分。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.6其他</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）秦源招标电子招标平台使用方法、业务咨询及技术支持电话400-685-1179，邮箱： &nbsp;qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30~11:30，13:30~17:30；（2）秦源招标电子招标平台投标人（供应商）操作手册下载网址：http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/40.htm。（3）投标人须办理数字CA证书并下载投标客户端。数字CA证书办理及客服咨询电话：4008206660转6。咨询时间：工作日及周末：8:00-20:00。数字CA驱动及办理指南下载网址：http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/43.htm。投标客户端下载网址：http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/45.htm。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc25561\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc3674\"></a><a name=\"_Toc29364\"></a><a name=\"_Toc14970\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5.1投标文件递交的截止时间为</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">26</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">9时00分（北京时间）；地点为电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5.2逾期送达的或者未送达指定地点的投标文件，招标人不予受理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_bookmark7\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc15211\"></a><a name=\"_Toc9765\"></a><a name=\"_Toc28559\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">六、开标时间及地点</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 10.5000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 1.0000gd; text-indent: 10.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">开标时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">26</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">09时00分（北京时间）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 10.5000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 1.0000gd; text-indent: 10.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标地点：开标通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Toc16895\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc11801\"></a><a name=\"_Toc10397\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">七、发布公告的媒介</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标公告同时在陕西采购与招标网（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.sntba.com/）、中国招标投标公共服务平台(http://www.cebpubservice.com))及秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: -21.1000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Toc2469\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc2797\"></a><a name=\"_Toc27225\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">八、监督部门及异议渠道</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">8.1监督部门：陕西小保当矿业有限公司规划部；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">监督电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0912-8491854；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">监督邮箱：</span><a href=\"mailto:1015288644@qq.com%E3%80%82\"><u><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #0000ff;\">1015288644@qq.com。</span></u></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">8.2异议渠道及方式：投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前10日内以书面形式（邮件发送）向招标人提出，邮箱：1015288644@qq.com。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1)异议提出人名称、地址、电话等；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2)具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3)异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人（单位负责人）或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justi