-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">605549067@qq.com/sxqygjb@126.com</span></span></span></span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'陕煤金融中心（二期）DK57电力工程','西安尚和置业有限公司','2026-07-31 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097377384993001473,'','2026-09-10 09:35:01','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕煤电力合川2×1000MW清洁煤电扩建项目第三批辅机设备采购-07包：蒸发冷却装配式集成冷站【第3次招标】招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260731/1267883213510934528.html','ba41b5ffc8600a3ca28df9936132288bc464528b1984040b630b0648e7952095',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">陕西煤业物资有限责任公司西安分公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 119.8500pt; mso-para-margin-left: 8.5500gd; text-indent: -30.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 15.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤电力合川</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2&times;1000MW清洁煤电扩建项目</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'