 OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc169080538;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc180148160;\"><a name=\"_Toc235608241\"></a><span style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">投标人需提供<span lang=\"EN-US\">2021</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日起至投标截止时间内（以合同签订时间为准）<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>项及以上不同电厂<span lang=\"EN-US\">600MW</span>等级及以上燃煤机组精准喷氨合同业绩，提供业绩首页、供货内容页、能充分说明技术特点的内容页以及盖章页，所供资料必须真实完整，否则按无效业绩处理</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc235608241;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">。</span></span></span></span> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><a name=\"_Toc169080539\"></a><a name=\"_Toc180148161\"></a><a name=\"_Toc235608242\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc180148161;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc169080539;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; color: black; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">3.3</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc235608242;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc180148161;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc169080539;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: black; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">财务要求：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><a name=\"_Toc235608243\"></a><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">投标人须提供</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span sty