soNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK15;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc180148167;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc169080545;\"><a name=\"_Toc235608250\"></a><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: black; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）投标人负责人为同一人或存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得参加同一项目投标，否则相关投标均无效。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc180148167;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc169080545;\"><a name=\"_Toc235608251\"></a><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: black; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）本次招标不接受联合体投标</span></span></span><a name=\"_Toc169080550\"></a><a name=\"_Toc180148172\"></a></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc180148172;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc169080550;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc235608251;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: black; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-pagination: lines-together; page-break-after: avoid; mso-outline-level: 3;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;\">4</span></strong></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%;\">、招标文件的获取</span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin: 0cm; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4.1</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">获取时间：</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2026</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">年</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">7</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">月</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">31</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">日</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">08</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">时</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">00</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">分至</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2026</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">年</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">8</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">月</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">6</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">日</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">18</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">时</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">00</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">分。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin: 0cm; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4.2</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">获取方式：在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">）&rdquo;上免费注册。注册完成后，投标人登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;将授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及第</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">条&ldquo;投标人资格要求&rdquo;的所有资料的扫描件，所有资料汇总成一个加盖单位公章的</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">PDF</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">文件上传。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin: 0cm; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4.3</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">投标人办理购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件每套售价：</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">800</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">元，售后不退。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin: 0cm; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4.4</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">潜在投标人支付招标文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">(</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">招标文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">。若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin: 0cm; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4.5</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">已注册的潜在投标人若注册信息发生变更</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">(</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">如与初始注册信息不一致</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin: 0cm; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4.6</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">此次采购招标项目为全流程网上操作，需要登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">）&rdquo;主页&ldquo;常用文件&rdquo;下载投标人操作手册及</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">CA</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">驱动及</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">CA</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk55910695;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">办理指南完成投标工作。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"Mso