n><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">21</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.2、开标方式：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;网上进行。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目招标公告在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;中国招标投标公共服务平台&rdquo;、&ldquo;陕西采购与招标网&rdquo;和&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">八、监督部门</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\