pan style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">20</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span>9<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（北京时间）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">将投标文件上传递交到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">//qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）&rdquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一、项目基本情况</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">编号：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26D3SXQY0255</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">应急救援指挥平台建设项目初步设计编制</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购方式：公开招标</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">预算金额：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">283500.00</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">元</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购需求</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">根据工作需要，国家矿山安全监察局陕西局拟开展应急救援指挥平台建设项目。建设内容包括视频会议系统、会议扩声系统、集中控制系统、指挥调度台，指挥调度系统依托国家电子政务外网、应急指挥网、煤矿专网、陕西省电子政务外网、互联网建设，满足应急指挥调度和值班值守业务需求，具备</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">24</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">小时应急指挥调度及视频会商功能，支撑应急管理部、国家矿山安全监察局、陕西局、驻地执法处联动开展应急指挥调度、视频会商及陕西局远程监察执法等工作，现对以上内容进行初步设计编制。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">实施周期</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合同签订之日起</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">个工作日完成初步设计成品编制</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">并</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">国家局</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">评审</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">并批复</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">实施地点：国家矿山安全监察局陕西局。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span class=\"16\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目不接受联合体投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的资格要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">满足《中华人民共和国政府采购法》第二十二条规定</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）具有独立承担民事责任的能力：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">应为中华人民共和国境内合法注册，提供有效的法人或者其他组织的营业执照等证明文件，或自然人身份证明；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）具有良好的商业信誉和健全的财务会计制度：提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年经审计的财务报告（包括三表一注，即资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表及其附注，成立时间至提交</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">文件截止时间不足一年的可提供成立后任意时段的资产负债表）；事业法人提供部门决算报告；</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">或在</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">截止日期前六个月内其基本开户银行出具的资信证明（附《基本存款账户信息》或《银行开户许可证》复印件）；</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">或财政部门认可的政府采购专业担保机构出具的响应担保函；以上三种形式的资料提供任何一种即可；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）具有履行合同所必需的设备和专业技术能力：提供证明材料（声明函或承诺书或相关证明材料）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）有依法缴纳税收和社会保障资金的良好记录：提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年度至今任意一个月已缴纳税收和缴纳社会保障资金的证明材料；成立不满一年的提供成立后的任意一个月已缴纳税收和缴纳社会保障资金的证明材料；如依法免税或不需要缴纳社会保障资金的，提供相关证明材料或承诺书；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）参加政府采购活动前三年内，在经营活动中没有重大违法记录（重大违法记录是指</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">因违法经营受到刑事处罚或者责令停产停业、吊销许可证或者执照、较大数额罚款等行政处罚）：提供证明材料（声明函或承诺书或相关证明材料）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）法律、行政法规规定的其他条件：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人及其</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">法定代表人在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;信用中国&rdquo;网站（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）中未被列入失信被执行人名单，投标人在中国政府采购网（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">www.ccgp.gov.cn</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）中未被列入政府采购严重违法失信行为记录名单；（提供网站信息查询截图加盖企业公章</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;信用中国&rdquo;企业信用信息报告复印件加盖企业公章，截图及报告生成时间段为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">文件发出至递交响应文件截止时间内</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;信用中国&rdquo;网站中投标人失信被执行人截图以&ldquo;中国执行信息公开网&rdquo;网站（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://zxgk.court.gov.cn/shixin/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）中全国范围内查询为准（截图需显示网站名称）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">落实政府采购政策需满足的资格要求：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">无</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目的特定资格要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）法定代表人授权书（附法定代表人身份证复印件）及被授权人身份证（法定代表人直接参加只须提供法定代表人身份证）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #333333; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，不得参加同一合同项下的政府采购活动（提供承诺函，格式自拟）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、获取招标文件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时间：从</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分到</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">18</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">途径：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本招标公告在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">陕西采购与招标网（</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">http</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">//www.sntba.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">）、秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">http</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">//qyzb.shccmg.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">）、中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">http</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">//www.cebpubservice.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">发出，投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\