密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5.2递交方式：电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">6.开</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">标</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6.1开标时间：2026年8月21日09时00分；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6.2</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标地点：开标通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></sp