ht: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕西丝路金融信息发展有限公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 28.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">资金管理系统优化升级及信创改造项目招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 28.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">0866-26D3SXQY0305</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目所在地区：陕西省</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">西安市</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">一、招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">本资金管理系统优化升级及信创改造项目已由项目审批</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">/</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">核准</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">/</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">备案机关批准，项目资金主要来源为企业自筹，比例</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%，招标人为</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">陕西丝路金融信息发展有限公司。本项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">已具备招标条件，现招标方式为公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二、项目概况和招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.1项目概况：为推进关键信息基础设施</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">的创新与自主可控</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">，支撑资金业务发展，本项目计划对陕西农信资金管理系统实施功能升级及信创改造，以增强系统自主可控能力，全面提升资金运营效率与风险管控能力。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.2招标范围：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本次建设范围包括新增系统外联通道、完善量化风控与债券投资管理、数据治理及迁移、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">全面信创改造等，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">项目实施过程中</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人需负责项目的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">需求分析、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">设计、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">开发、测试、培训、上线、试运行等工作</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">确保</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">项目实施工作的顺利开展</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">实施</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">周期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">7个月。 &nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.1资质要求：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">财务要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2022年、2023年、2024年经过审计的财务报告（包括但不限于资产负债表、现金流量表、利润表、所有者权益变动表、附注及资质材料），投标人自成立至今不足三年的，提供自成立之日至今自然年的审计报告</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">业绩要求：投标人具有近三</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">合同签订时间为</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2023</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">至投标截止日）至</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">少有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1个资金系统建设或资金系统信创改造的实施案例（以合同签订时间及内容为准，合同名称应包含&ldquo;资金业务&rdquo;或&ldquo;资金系统&rdquo;或&ldquo;资金交易&rdquo;或&ldquo;资金维保&rdquo;关键字）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">信誉要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人未在国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn）中列入严重违法失信企业名单（提供网页截图并加盖公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">投标人未在中国执行信息公开网（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">http://zxgk.court.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">）中列入失信被执行人名单（提供网页截图并加盖公章）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3.5其他要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">投标</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目投标（提供承诺书）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">本项目不允许联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">获取时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">从</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">29</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">时</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">0分到202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">获取方式：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.1投标人须在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招投标平台（ http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;上免费注册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.2注册完成后，投标人登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招投标平台&rdquo;（ http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及&ldquo;三、投标人资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.3经招标代理机构确认后，投标人可在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招投标平台&rdquo;选择&ldquo;网上支付&rdquo;扫码办理招标文件缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件费用：500元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.4购买招标文件的发票，待招标代理机构开出后投标人可在平台打印（购买招标文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">递交截</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">止时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">19</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9时30分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">递交方式：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; 