me=\"_Toc2461\"></a><a name=\"_Toc15949\"></a><a name=\"_Toc151840972\"></a><a name=\"_Toc24152\"></a><a name=\"_Toc151918594\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二．</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目概况与招标范围</span></strong></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.1项目名称：陕煤集团神木张家峁矿业有限公司采、掘工作面物探项目（招标编号：0866-26E3SXQY0695）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2项目概况</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">为保障张家峁矿井采、掘工作面的安全掘进，拟采用井下钻孔瞬变电磁法等物探手段对工作面进行探查，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">为</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">采、掘工作面</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">防治水工作提供参考资料。</span> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">招标范围：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">①</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采用矿井瞬变电磁法超前探查掘进巷道迎头前方</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">120</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">m</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">范围内富水异常区的位置和范围；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">②</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">采用钻孔瞬变电磁探测技术在指定超前定向钻孔内进行</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">作业</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，探测定向钻孔径向</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">30m范围内富水性异常区的分布范围与相对强弱；为了保障回采工作面的安全高效生产，经分析拟采用瞬变电磁方法进行物探，探测工作面顶板上方120m范围内富水异常区的分布位置及范围，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">详见第五章发包人要求</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">服务期：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">总体服务期为合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">12个月，单次物探服务期要求见第五章发包人要求。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; fon