<strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc19768\"></a><a name=\"_Toc151840972\"></a><a name=\"_Toc14709\"></a><a name=\"_Toc22021\"></a><a name=\"_Toc24152\"></a><a name=\"_Toc15949\"></a><a name=\"_Toc2957\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二．</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目概况与招标范围</span></strong></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.1项目名称：陕煤集团神木张家峁矿业有限公司综采工作面槽波地震勘探项目（招标编号：0866-26E3SXQY0694）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2项目概况</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：为了保障</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年度煤矿综采工作面的安全高效生产，经研究拟采用槽波地震勘探方法对工作面的地质构造进行探测，查明工作面内部隐伏构造发育情况，结合矿井地质及临近工作面物探成果综合分析评价工作面内构造发育情况，为工作面回采提供地质依据。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">招标范围：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人须对</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">220</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Ca