 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">米，采用双巷透视及双巷反射观测系统</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">进行勘探。详见第五章发包人要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">服务期：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">总体服务期为合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">12个月，每个工作面具备现场作业（激发孔、地震数据采集）条件后，井下数据采集工作时间5~10天，数据采集完成20日内提交初步探测成果进行审查，根据审查意见进行修改并提交最终探查成果报告。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5质量标准</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">符合国家、行业现行规范标准及本项目的实际要求</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6服务地点</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕煤集团神木张家峁矿业有限公司</span