宋体;\">已获批准</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">项目资金来源为企业自筹，</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">招标人为陕煤电力汨罗有限公司，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">本项目已具备招标条件，</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">陕煤电力汨罗有限公司</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-language: AR;\">的委托，现对该项目进行国内公开招标</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"margin: 6pt 0cm 6pt 9.9pt; text-indent: -9.9pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2．项目概况与招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2.1</span> <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">项目名称：陕煤汨罗2&times;100万千瓦燃煤发电工程特殊消防及火灾报警系统工程。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2.2</span> <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">项目概况：陕煤汨罗2&times;100万千瓦燃煤发电工程（以下简称汨罗电厂），厂址位于湖南省汨罗市以南约11km白水镇越江村毛栗塝。南距长沙市城区约50km，北距岳阳市城区约72km。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">本期建设规模为2&times;1000MW级超超临界燃煤发电机组，同步建设烟气脱硫、脱硝装置，留有扩建余地。供水系统拟采用带自然通风高位冷却塔的二次循环供水系统，补给水源为汨罗江水。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2.3</span> <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">招标范围：包括但不限于对全厂特殊消防及火灾探测报警系统进行完整的设计、结构、性能、设备及材料供货、施工安装、性能试验、调试、系统检测、报审、设计审查、报建、报验、取证（包括试验、检测）、全流程消防咨询及消防验收。具体范围和内容详见技术规范书。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2.4</span> <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">计</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">划工期：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">号机组</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">施工</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">工期为<span lang=\"EN-US\">160</span>天</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">号机组施工工期为<span lang=\"EN-US\">200</span>天，</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">具体开工时间以招标人通知为准。本项目工期进度须与主体施工项目的工期进度相配套，不能影响整台套机组的调试运行进度。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2.5</span> <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">项目建设地点：湖南省岳阳市汨罗市白水镇闵家巷村大屋组。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2.6</span> <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">质量</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">标准：</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">工程质量标准必须符合现行国家、行业、地方有关工程施工质量验收规范和标准的要求。同时应达到合同协议书约定的质量标准和机组达标的标准。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"margin: 6pt 0cm 6pt 9.9pt; text-indent: -9.9pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">3．投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\">3.1<span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\"> 资质要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">（1）</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt;\">投标人须是中华人民共和国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织。</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">具有有效的营业执照</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2）投标人须具有消防设施工程设计专项甲级资质</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">或</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">工程设计综合资质甲级或建筑行业工程设计甲级资质或建筑行业建筑工程专业设计甲级</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">和</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">消防设施工程专业承包一级资质。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">）投标人须提供</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">有效的安全生产许可证。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">3.2</span> <span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">业绩要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">（1）合同业绩：投标人自2019年1月1日起至投标截止时间内应至少具有国内2份1000MW及以上火力发电机组的特殊消防系统(供货范围至少包含火灾报警系统、自动水消防系统、气体灭火系统的设计、施工/安装、调试、验收)的合同业绩(提供的业绩须以合同签订日期为准，应包含合同的主要内容，供货范围，合同首页、签字盖章页)。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">（2）运行业绩：投标人自2019年1月1日起至投标截止时间内（以建设工程消防验收意见书日期为准)应至少具有国内1份1000MW及以上火力发电机组的特殊消防系统(供货范围至少包含火灾报警系统、自动水消防系统、气体灭火系统的设计、施工/安装、调试、验收)投运业绩。(需提供合同的主要内容，供货范围、合同首页、签字盖章页及投运证明（以建设工程消防验收意见书为准)）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">3.3 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">财务要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma;\">投标人须提供</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma;\">2022</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma;\">年至</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma;\">2024</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma;\">年连续三年的财务审计报告，投标人成立不足三年的，提供自成立以来的财务审计报告（至少包含：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">审计报告正文及正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表、审计机构营业执照、会计师事务所执业证书、注册会计师执业证书</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">，投标人成立不足一年的提供自成立以来的财务报表。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">3.4</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">人员要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma;\">3.4.1</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">项目经理要求：</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -.3pt; mso-bidi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">投标人项目经理需具有机电工程专业一级注册建造师证书及有效的《安全生产考核合格证书》（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -.3pt; mso-bidi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">B</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -.3pt; mso-bidi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">类），且未担任其他在建项目的项目经理（提供承诺书）。须提供在本单位</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -.3pt; mso-bidi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">2025</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -.3pt; mso-bidi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -.3pt; mso-bidi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -.3pt; mso-bidi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -.3pt; mso-bidi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -.3pt; mso-bidi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">日至投标截止日连续</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -.3pt; mso-bidi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -.3pt; mso-bidi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">个月由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">若项目经理注册证书出现以下情况，提供的项目经理一级注册建造师证书无效：</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">（1）未在注册证书手写签名；</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">（2）手写签名与电子签名图像笔迹不一致；</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">（3）项目经理注册证书本人签署日期不是公告至投标的截止日期内的日期；</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">（4）项目经理注册证书右上角无有效时限的水印。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">3.4.2设计负责人要求：</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">投标人拟派设计负责人须具有有效的一级注册建筑师（注册电气工程师供配电专业或注册公用设备工程师给水排水专业）执业资格证书或高级工程类专业技术职称。须提供在本单位2025年6月1日至投标截止日连续6个月由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; vertical-align: baseline;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">3.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">4.3</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">其他主要人员：</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">拟派</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">安全生产管理人员，</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">必须是投标人在册职工</span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">须具有</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">有效的安全生产考核合格证书（<span lang=\"EN-US\">C</span>类）</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">；以上人员</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">须提供在本单位2025年6月1日至投标截止日连续6个月由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">3.5 信誉要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">（1）投标人未列入信用中国(https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/)严重失信主体名单（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书或网站截图为准为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">（2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统(https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/)严重违法失信名单(黑名单)信息（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书或网站截图为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">3.6 其他要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">（1）本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">（2）投标人负责人为同一人或存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得参加同一项目投标，否则相关投标均无效。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"margin: 6pt 0cm 6pt 9.9pt; text-indent: -9.9pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4．招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">4.1</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">获取时间：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">28</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">日</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">08</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">时</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">00</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">分至</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">日</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">18</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">时</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">00</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">分。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">4.2</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">获取方式：在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">）&rdquo;上免费注册。注册完成后，投标人登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;将授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及第</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">条&ldquo;投标人资格要求&rdquo;的所有资料的扫描件，所有资料汇总成一个加盖单位公章的</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">PDF</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">文件上传。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">4.3</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">投标人办理购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件每套售价：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">800</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">4.4</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">潜在投标人支付招标文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">招标文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">。若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">4.5</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">已注册的潜在投标人若注册信息发生变更</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">如与初始注册信息不一致</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">4.6</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">此次采购招标项目为全流程网上操作，需要登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">）&rdquo;主页&ldquo;常用文件&rdquo;下载投标人操作手册及</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">驱动及</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">办理指南完成投标工作。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">4.7</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">有关注册、购买招标文件等交易平台的操作问题请咨询（注册审批：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">029-81613218</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">；技术支持：客服电话：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">400-685-1179</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">，邮箱：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">qyebidding@163.com</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">；数字</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">证书办理及咨询电话：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">4008206660</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">转</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">，咨询时间：工作日及周末：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">8:30-12:00&nbsp;&nbsp; 13:30-17:30</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"margin: 6pt 0cm 6pt 9.9pt; text-indent: -9.9pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">5.投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">5.1</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">递交截止时</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">间：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">18</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">日</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">时</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">00</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">分；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">5.2</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">递交方式：本次招标采取网上电子版提交的投标方</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">式，以网上电子版为准。不接受纸质版和</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">U</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">盘投标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">5.3</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">为避免受网速影响，以及网站技术支持的时间，建议于投标截止时间前</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\"> 24 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">小时完成网上电子版的提交。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"margin: 6pt 0cm 6pt 9.9pt; text-indent: -9.9pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">6.开标时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">6.1</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">开标时间：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">18</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">日</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">09</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">时</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">00</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">分；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">6.2</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">开标地点：电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">）&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"margin: 6pt 0cm 6pt 9.9pt; text-indent: -9.9pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">7、发布公告的媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">本次招标公告同时在&ldquo;</span><a href=\"http://www.cebpubservice.com/\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: windowtext; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">中国招标投标公共服务平台</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: windowtext; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\"> (http://www.cebpubservice.com/)</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">、陕西采购与招标网（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">http://www.sntba.com/announcement?id=35&amp;page=1&amp;tab=40</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">）和秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -.3pt; mso-bidi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">&rdquo;发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"margin: 6pt 0cm 6pt 9.9pt; text-indent: -9.9pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">8</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">、监督部门及异议渠道</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">8.1</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">本招标项目的监督部门为：陕煤电力汨罗有限公司综合部，联系人：邱艺婕，监督电话：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">0730-5555908</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">，监督邮箱：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">837082250@qq.com</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">8.2</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">异议渠道及方式：投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">的，应在投标文件递交截止前</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">日内以书面形式（邮件发送）向招标人提出，</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">邮箱：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">837082250@qq.com</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">）异议人的名称、地址、联系人及有效联系方式。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">）提出异议项目的名称、编号、所涉及的具体事项及被异议人的有效联系方式。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">）提出异议事项的基本事实、具体理由及明确诉求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">）有效线索和相关证明材料。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">）异议人为其他利害关系人的，应提交利害关系证明。</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"margin: 6pt 0cm 6pt 9.9pt; text-indent: -9.9pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">9、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">招标人：陕煤电力汨罗有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">地</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">址：</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">湖南省岳阳市汨罗市白水镇闵家巷村大屋组</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">联系人：宋女士</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">电</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">话：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">0730-5606019</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">邮</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">箱：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">726434204@qq.com</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">招标机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">地</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">38</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">号东院办公楼</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">102</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">室</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">联系人：招标三部</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">景先生</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 24.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">联系电话：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">19911311939</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: HI;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;邮</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">箱：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">358698756@qq.com</span></span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26C1SXQY0411',NULL,NULL,'陕煤汨罗2×100万千瓦燃煤发电工程特殊消防及火灾报警系统工程','陕煤','2026-07-28 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097377665709379585,'','2026-09-10 09:35:01','','2026-09-10 09:37:22',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕西煤业物资有限责任公司西安分公司陕煤电力合川2×1000MW清洁煤电扩建项目第三批辅机设备采购-02包：锅炉给水泵汽轮机及碎煤机弹簧隔振系统招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260728/1266804929121484800.html','c5fac6ad39974b48e39a7c9fbabf734dd6ac6e889e7a609e829c76c72094f3c2',NULL,'HTML','<p>陕西煤业物资有限责任公司西安分公司 陕煤电力合川2×1000MW清洁煤电扩建项目 第三批辅机设备采购-02包：锅炉给水泵汽轮机及碎煤机弹簧隔振系统 （招标编号：0866-26C2SXQY0344） 招标公告 项目所在地区：重庆市,合川区，双槐镇。 一、招标条件 本招标项目陕煤电力合川2×1000MW清洁煤电扩建项目第三批辅机设备采购-02包：锅炉给水泵汽轮机及碎煤机弹簧隔振系统，招标人为陕西煤业物资有限责任公司西安分公司，资金来源为企业自筹。项目已具备招标条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕西煤业物资有限责任公司西安分公司的委托，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。 二、项目概况与招标范围 2.1项目名称：陕煤电力合川2×1000MW清洁煤电扩建项目第三批辅机设备采购-02包：锅炉给水泵汽轮机及碎煤机弹簧隔振系统。 2.2招标编号：0866-26C2SXQY0344 2.3项目概况：本期工程建设规模为2×1000MW超超临界一次再热燃煤发电机组，采用湿式冷却方式，同步建设高效烟气脱硫、脱硝装置、除尘设施等。 2.4招标范围：本次采购锅炉给水泵汽轮机及碎煤机弹簧隔振系统，由弹簧（阻尼）隔振器、基础台板等组成，主设备安装于基础台板之上。弹簧（阻尼）隔振器放置于框架梁或楼板梁和基础台板之间。基础台板采用现浇钢筋混凝土结构；其型号、备品备件、调试及性能保证等技术参数详见招标文件第五章供货要求。 2.5交货期：合同签订生效后7个月开始供货，设备交货进度应满足工程进度的要求。 2.6质保期：整套设备性能试验合格后12个月。 2.7交货地点：重庆市合川区双槐镇陕煤电力合川2×1000MW清洁煤电扩建项目施工现场（车板）。 三、投标人资格要求 3.1资质要求： 投标人须是中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人的生产厂家或其他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；本项目不接受代理商投标。 3.2财务要求： 投标人须提供2023年至 2025年的财务审计报告，投标人新成立不足三年的企业需提供自成立以来的财务审计报告。财务审计报告至少包含：审计报告正文及正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表；投标人新成立不足一年的需提供自成立以来的财务报表，财务报表至少包含：资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表。 3.3业绩要求： （1）合同业绩：投标人须提供自2019年1月1日至投标截止时间内至少具有国内2份600MW及以上等级新建或扩建火电机组锅炉给水泵汽轮机弹簧隔振系统的供货合同业绩（不包含改造业绩），投标人提供供货合同复印件首页、供货设备清单页、双方盖章签字页。 （2）运行业绩：投标人须提供自2019年1月1日至投标截止时间内（投运时间至投标截止时间超过一年即可）应至少具有国内1份600MW及以上等级新建或扩建火电机组锅炉给水泵汽轮机弹簧隔振系统安全运行1年及以上业绩（不包含改造业绩），需提供合同复印件首页、供货设备清单页、签字页，用户证明须由最终用户盖章，可以是验收证明、使用证明、回访记录或其他能证明合同标的物已成功投运材料。 3.4信誉要求： 3.4.1投标人未列入信用中国(https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/) 严重失信主体名单；（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）； 3.4.2投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统(https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/) 严重违法失信名单(黑名单)信息。（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）； 3.5其他要求： 本次招标不接受联合体投标。 四、招标文件的获取 4.1 获取时间：2026年07月28日上午8时00分至2026年08月03日下午18时00分（北京时间，下同）。 4.2 获取办法：凡有意参加投标者，登录秦源招标电子招标平台（qyzb.shccmg.com），点击“投标人登录”请将法人授权委托书（附法定代表人、委托代理人身份证复印件）及上述“三.投标人资格要求”的3.1-3.5条相关资料上传。投标人即可办理缴费下载招标文件。 4.3未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击“投标人注册”完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台—客服中心—常用文件—手册及开标注意事项。 4.4投标人在秦源招标电子招标平台购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件每套售价：800元，招标文件售后不退。购买招标文件发票可在平台开具后自行打印（仅提供电子增值税普通发票） 4.5潜在投标人支付招标文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。 4.6已注册的潜在投标人若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。 4.7有关交易平台的业务咨询及技术支持请联系： 客服电话: 400-685-1179；邮箱:qyebidding@163.com；咨询日期:法定工作日；咨询时间:08:30~12:00 13:30~17:30。 数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6，咨询时间：工作日及周末：8:00-20:00。 五、投标文件的递交 5.1 递交截止时间：2026年08月20日上午9时00分。 5.2本次招标采取网上电子版提交的投标人式，以网上电子版为准。不接受纸质版和U盘投标文件。 5.3为避免受网速影响，以及网站技术支持的时间，建议于投标截止时间前 24 小时完成网上电子版的提交。 六、开标时间及地点 6.1开标时间：2026年08月20日上午9时00分。 6.2开标地点：开标通过“秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）”网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。 七、其他 7.1本项目招标公告在陕西采购与招标网（http://www.sntba.com/）、秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）和中国招标投标公共服务平台（http://www.cebpubservice.com/）发布。 7.2秦源招标电子招标平台投标人操作手册下载网址：http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/40.htm 。 八、监督部门及异议渠道和方式 8.1本招标项目的监督部门为：陕西煤业物资有限责任公司西安分公司物资管理部。 监督电话：029-65666250，监督邮箱：smwzcgxaf@163.com，联系人:孙文健。 8.2异议渠道及方式：投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标变更公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前10日内以书面形式（邮件发送）向招标人提出，邮箱：smwzcgxaf@163.com。 提出的异议书应包含的内容： 1)异议提出人名称、地址、电话等； 2)具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料； 3)异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章； 4)提出异议的日期。 九、联系方式 招标人：陕西煤业物资有限责任公司西安分公司 地址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路38号东院办公楼3楼310室 联系人：屈睿 电话：15837633500 招标机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司 地 址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路38号东院办公楼1楼102室 联系人：招标三部 姜女士 电 话：18192595320 邮 箱：164691189@qq.com</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26C2SXQY0344',NULL,NULL,'陕煤电力合川2×1000MW清洁煤电扩建项目第三批辅机设备采购-02包：锅炉给水泵汽轮机及碎煤机弹簧隔振系统','陕西煤业物资有限责任公司西安分公司','2026-07-28 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097377674936848386,'','2026-09-10 09:35:01','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕西陕煤曹家滩矿业有限公司调度中心工业自动化集控软件平台替换升级项目招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260728/1266706958136639488.html','79c476b922f73a6fb5c178b07661fc3e1e6dd15777b888a8546ed81760e91d99',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">陕西陕煤曹家滩矿业有限公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">陕西陕煤曹家滩矿业有限公司调度中心工业自动化集控软件平台替换升级项目</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标编号：</span></strong><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">0866-26A3SXQY0647</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"15\" style=\"margin-right: 2.8500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc491883077\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc23939\"></a><a name=\"_Toc5657\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕西陕煤曹家滩矿业有限公司调度中心工业自动化集控软件平台替换升级项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标项目，招标人为陕西陕煤曹家滩矿业有限公司，招标项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%。该项目已具备招标条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕西陕煤曹家滩矿业有限公司的委托，现对陕西陕煤曹家滩矿业有限公司</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">调度中心工业自动化集控软件平台替换升级项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">进行（国内）公开招标。</span></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><a name=\"_Toc491883078\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc28203\"></a><a name=\"_Toc11742\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况、标段划分与招标范围</span></span></strong></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">:</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西陕煤曹家滩矿业有限公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">调度中心工业自动化集控软件平台替换升级项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0866-26A3SXQY0647</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">），本</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目划分为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1个标段。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2项目概况：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为满足公司日益增长的生产控制需求，解决现有调度中心工业自动化集控软件与系统在功能、性能和兼容性方面的不足，拟通过更换国产</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">SCADA平台软件、升级自动化集控操作系统，推动系统自主可控与智能化转型。升级后的系统将支持4K分辨率显示，完好适配一机五屏调度需求，显著提升操作人员的工作效率与交互体验。同时，系统将集成智能监测预警功能，提高日常操作、故障诊断与预警预测的准确性，有效降低设备故障停机与检修时间成本，进一步提升生产效率，为公司安全稳定运行和降本增效提供有力支撑。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标范围</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><a name=\"_Toc491883079\"></a></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西陕煤曹家滩矿业有限公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">调度中心工业自动化集控软件平台替换升级所需软硬件、配套各类物资材料、永久授权以及其他相关内容</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具体以招标文件</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">技术</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">要求为准。</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">服务期</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5个月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListNumber5\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 102.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">质保期：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">验收合格后</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2 年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">服务地点：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西陕煤曹家滩矿业有限公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -33.1500pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.1投标人须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.2</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人针对所投国产</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">SCADA监控组态软件，需提供软件原厂家针对本项目出具的正版授权（一个制造商对同一品牌同一型号的货物，仅能委托一个代理商参加投标）。授权证明应明确项目名称、招标编号等相关内容。所投国产 SCADA 监控组态软件授权范围应完整覆盖本项目供货清单中的开发版、运行版、OPCUA、客户端、WEB 发布等软件授权内容，并承诺为正版永久授权</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（提供承诺书并加盖单位公章）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.3</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">业绩要求</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：投标人必须具有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">20</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">22</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日至投标截止日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">类似煤矿综合管控平台建设或升级、自动化集成平台建设或升级等业绩</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">至少</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">份</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(证明文件以合同为准，合同有效日期以签订时间为准，合同至少包含合同首页、</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">供货清单，合同内容清晰</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">签订时间、合同内容及双方盖章页</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">以及合同对应的任意一张增值税发票</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">)。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.4</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">人员要求</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">拟派项目经理须具有计算机技术与软件专业技术资格（水平）考试高级资格证书或</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">由工业和信息化部教育与考试中心颁发的智能化系统集成项目经理</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(高级)证书</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">信誉要求：</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（以下提供加</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">盖单位公章的承诺书）：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本项目不接受联</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合体投标。</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -33.1500pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">四、招标文件获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-