5pt;\">陕西红柠铁路有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，资金来源于企业自筹，出资比例</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%。项目已具备招标条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西红柠铁路有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">的委托，现对该项目进行公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Toc7645\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc27948\"></a><a name=\"_Toc6871\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.项目概况及招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 15.7500pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1项目名称</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">轨道电路漏泄区段线路道床清筛工程</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（招标编号<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"color: #172b4d; font-size: 10pt; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; white-space: nowrap;\">0866-26E1SXQY0693</span>）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 15.7500pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目概况：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">红柠线管内线路清筛项目是为解决轨道电路区段道床漏泄及道床板结和翻浆冒泥等病害，工程采用人工清筛及机械配合方式进行。发包人提</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供道砟数量、石砟漏斗车、捣固车；</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">路道床清筛总长度</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3480m，其中：桥150.98m，隧1307m，路2022.02m；</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具体详见技术要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 15.8500pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Toc24878\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc8495\"></a><a name=\"_Toc11058\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.3</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标范围：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">包括</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3480m线路道床机械装卸道</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">砟、现场清筛、回填道砟及施工垃圾清运工作；</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">包含本项目范围内</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">全部工程</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">施工、竣工验收、验收交付及质量保修等全过程的所有工程。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 15.8500pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Toc15217\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc15807\"></a><a name=\"_Toc19888\"></a><span style=\"font-f