e5463559b5d94ce138d6dd4e01fb93e510d559aaf8e84804f79',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">陕西韩城矿业王峰煤矿有限责任公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 14.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">王峰煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">S1302</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面超高压水力割缝增透技术服务</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">标段编号：</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">E6100013501260297001001</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">项目所在地区：陕西省韩城市</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一、招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目王峰煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">S1302</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面超高压水力割缝增透技术服务已由陕西省发展和改革委员会以陕发改能煤炭〔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2021</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">〕</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">950</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">号文件核准批复，招标人为陕西韩城矿业王峰煤矿有限责任公司，招标代理机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。建设资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，资金已落实。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">及标段编号</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">王峰煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">S1302</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面超高压水力割缝增透技术服务（标段编号：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">E6100013501260297001001</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为加快王峰煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">S1302</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面瓦斯灾害治理进度，缩短钻孔施工周期的同时解决煤与瓦斯突出风险。根据前期试验及推广应用情况，王峰煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">S1302</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面计划采用超高压水力割缝增透技术，对煤体进行扰动卸压，增加煤体暴露面积，改善煤体透气性，提高抽采效果，从而预防煤与瓦斯突出风险。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">王峰煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">S1302</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面底抽巷共设计割缝钻孔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">11791</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">53.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。其中设计</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">S1302</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">运顺底抽巷割缝钻孔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4053</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个，钻孔工程量</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">18.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">S1302</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中部底抽巷割缝钻孔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3685</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个，钻孔工程量</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">16.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">S1302</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">回顺底抽巷割缝钻孔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4053</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个，钻孔工程量</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">18.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人负责本矿</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">S1302</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面底抽巷区域超高压水力割缝增透工艺实施及技术服务工作。具体内容详见招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目地点：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕西省渭南市韩城市王峰煤矿。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">服务期限</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">S1302</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面底抽巷（运顺、中部、回顺）灾害治理工程合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">450</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日历天。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质量要求</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">符合《煤矿安全规程》《防治煤与瓦斯突出细则》《煤矿瓦斯抽采达标暂行规定》等国家标准及相关行业规定要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人须持有</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">国家认证认可监督管理委员会</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">核发且有效的</span>CMA<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">检验检测机构资质认定证书，证书附表检验检测能力范围须</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">包含</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;煤与瓦斯突出鉴定&rdquo;类别</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，并附完整资质附表备查。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人提供近三年（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年至</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年其中任意连续三年）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人须提供基本账户银行出具的资信证明（在投标截止日期前</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月内出具）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供近年（自</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日起至投标截止日期）至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项煤矿水力割缝技术服务项目业绩。业绩证明材料以合同协议书为准，有效时间以签订时间为准。合同协议书应至少包含合同首页、主要服务范围、合同期限、合同签订时间及双方盖章签字页。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.4</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">人员要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）项目负责人须具备矿业工程或安全工程专业高级及以上职称，并提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后由社保部门出具的连续</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月有效社保证明材料。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）项目负责人须提供（自</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日起至投标截止日期）至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项煤矿水力割缝技术服务项目业绩。业绩证明材料以合同协议书为准，有效时间以签订时间为准。合同协议书应至少包含合同首页、主要服务范围、合同期限、合同签订时间及双方盖章签字页。合同协议书内须体现项目负责人姓名、项目负责人职务。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">其他要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目不接受联合体投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：</span></span></strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">28</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">0<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分至</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">05</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span>00<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）凡有意参加投标者，登录陕西省公共资源交易平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）下载电子招标文件及附件，投标人必须在上述时间内下载招标文件，逾期无法下载。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）招标文件下载流程：投标人应登录陕西省公共资源交易平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">），选择&ldquo;电子交易平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西省工程建设交易系统</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">新点软件工程建设交易系统企业端&rdquo;进行登录，登录后选择&ldquo;交易乙方&rdquo;身份进入，进入后在左上角&ldquo;建设工程&rdquo;类别中找到并选择本项目点击文件下载，免费下载电子招标文件（后缀为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">.SXSZF</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的文件）及有关附件。投标人须在招标文件获取时限内，下载获取电子招标文件及有关附件，逾期下载通道将关闭，未及时下载获取电子招标文件及有关招标文件附件将会导致后期无法上传电子投标文件，无法参与本项目投标，投标人后果自负。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人初次使用交易平台需按陕西省公共资源交易平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）的要求办理</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">锁。办理须知详见：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/fwzn/004002/004002007/20250108/efdc53a2-c250-44b1-876c-c44ab6c5e66d.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.1</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">18</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">上午</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目采用</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;不见面开标&rdquo;方式，无须投标人现场递交纸质投标文件。投标人在投标截止时间前，在陕西省公共资源交易平台（陕西省）（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）在线递交上传电子投标文件并完成在线签到。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.2</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在全国公共资源交易平台（陕西省）（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）网上递交，未上传电子投标文件或未上传指定平台的电子投标文件，招标人不予受理。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent2\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent2\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">六、</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.1</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">18</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.2</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">地点</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕西省公共资源交易平台《陕西省不见面开标大厅》在线开标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">七、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标采用资格后审的方法对投标人资格进行审查，资格评审的条件、标准、方法详见招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标公告同时在陕西采购与招标网（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sntba.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）和全国公共资源交易平台（陕西省）（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）、中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.cebpubservice.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）、秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）上发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须在陕西省公共资源交易中心网站企业诚信管理系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）中登记企业信息，然后登录全国公共资源交易平台（陕西省）</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下载、查看电子招标文件及有关附件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">关于平台操作及常见问题，请查看陕西省公共资源交易中心&ldquo;服务指南&rdquo;，具体详见&ldquo;办事指南&rdquo;和&ldquo;常见问题解答&rdquo;。如有疑问请联系平台，相关技术问题，请提前咨询软件开发商：技术支持热线：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">029-88661287</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">029-88661298</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0512-58188039</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标的时候必须携带加密锁（公司</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">锁）。该项目将采取&ldquo;不见面&rdquo;开标方式，投标人无须到达开标现场，即可在网上直接参与开标活动。具体方法详见招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">八、监督部门</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目的监督部门为陕西省能源局，联系电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">029-63913307</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">九、异议渠道及方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日内以书面形式</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">邮件发送</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">向招标人提出。提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）异议提出人名称、地址、电话等；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）提出异议的日期。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">十</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标人：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕西韩城矿业王峰煤矿有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">地址：陕西省韩城市桑树坪镇卓立村</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">联系人：企管部魏工</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0913-5261381</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">招标代理机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">38</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">号东院南一楼</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">118</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">室</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">联系人：李工（招标二部）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">029-89578069/18192595269</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子邮箱：</span>173461141@qq.com</span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'陕西韩城矿业王峰煤矿有限责任公司王峰煤矿 S1302 工作面超高压水力割缝增透技术服务','陕西韩城矿业王峰煤矿有限责任公司','2026-07-28 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097377723217481730,'','2026-09-10 09:35:01','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕煤电力略阳有限公司 2026至2028年保洁服务 （招标编号：0866-26C3SXQY0494） 招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260727/1266430233037242368.html','f7cd886e7112fa2c9a4da9e1fe06fdb58d7dfa715803f20ec6db8c1f2f43f547',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: center; line-height: 25.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">陕煤电力略阳有限公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: center; line-height: 25.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">2026至2028年保洁服务</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: center; line-height: 25.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（招标编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0866-26C3SXQY0494）</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: center; line-height: 25.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目所在地：陕西省</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">汉中市</span> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc16655\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc1695\"></a><a name=\"_Toc534198354\"></a><a name=\"_Toc24530\"></a><a name=\"_Toc60931021\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一、招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026至2028年保洁服务，招标人为陕煤电力略阳有限公司，资金来源为企业自筹，项目已具备招标条件。陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕煤电力略阳有限公司的委托，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc28001\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc534198355\"></a><a name=\"_Toc19082\"></a><a name=\"_Toc60931022\"></a><a name=\"_Toc32186\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目名称、招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1项目名称：2026至2028年保洁服务</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2招标编号：0866-26C3SXQY0494</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3项目概况：陕西省略阳县陕煤电力略阳有限公司2026至2028年保洁服务。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4招标范围：本次招标范围为陕煤电力略阳有限公司保洁服务，保洁服务范围包含6号7号机、炉主厂区域（生产门禁区域内）及燃运、化学外围、办公区域、道路的保洁服务及山上公租房、生产区域的病媒生物防治工作、汉中前进路家属区商铺等保洁服务，具体内容详见第五章&ldquo;发包人要求&rdquo;。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5项目地点：陕西省略阳县陕煤电力略阳有限公司厂区及招标人指定区域。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.6服务期限：二年（2026年10月1日&ndash;2028年9月30日）。报价方式：按</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">两年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">报价，首年与次年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">服务价格相同</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。合同续签：首年合同到期前，经甲方考核，乙方在质量保障、安全生产等方面满足要求，予以续签次年合同；否则甲方有权终止合作，且不承担违约责任。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">首年服务期为：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1日至2027年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">日。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.7服务标准：符合国家、省市及行业相关规范要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc26050\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc534198356\"></a><a name=\"_Toc60931023\"></a><a name=\"_Toc6751\"></a><a name=\"_Toc8050\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc27663\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc800\"></a><a name=\"_Toc21653\"></a><a name=\"_Toc534198357\"></a><a name=\"_Toc60931024\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.1</span><a name=\"_Toc12834\"></a><a name=\"_Toc23508\"></a><a name=\"_Toc1566\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1.1投标人须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人单位。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2财务要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2.1投标人须提供2023年至2025年经审计的财务审计报告，投标人新成立不足三年的需提供自成立以来的财务审计报告，财务审计报告至少包含：审计报告正文及正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表；投标人新成立不足一年的需提供自成立以来的财务报表，财务报表至少包含：资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3人员要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3.1项目负责人：具有3年及以上保洁或物业管理相关工作经验，并担任过类似项目的项目负责人或项目经理（须提供业主方出具的证明材料或合同关键页、履历表等可证明其任职经历的佐证材料）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.4业绩要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.4.1投标人须提供自2022年1月1日至投标截止日（提供的合同以签订时间为准）具有至少1份类似火力发电厂机组保洁或生产制造企业保洁服务业绩（有效业绩以合同文件为准，提供清晰的业绩证明文件扫描件，内容至少包含：合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.5信誉要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.5.1投标人未列入信用中国（https:／/www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单（以投标人加盖单位公章的承诺书为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.5.2投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息（以投标人加盖单位公章的承诺书为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.6其他要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.6.1本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.6.2投标人负责人为同一人或存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得参加同一项目投标，否则相关投标均无效。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc14903\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc30928\"></a><a name=\"_Toc22973\"></a><a name=\"_Toc534198358\"></a><a name=\"_Toc60931025\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.1获取时间：2026年07月2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8:00时至2026年0</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">03</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日下午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18:00时（北京时间，下同）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc18383\"></a><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerni