ne-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26B3SXQY0392</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标公告</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目所在地区：陕西省渭南市</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一、招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目山阳煤矿瓦斯治理技术服务项目，招标人为陕西澄合山阳煤矿有限公司，招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。建设资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span>100%<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，资金已落实。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">山阳煤矿瓦斯治理技术服务项目（招标编号：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26B3SXQY0392</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">根据目前山阳煤矿公司瓦斯赋存、瓦斯地质以及开采瓦斯情况，委托开展瓦斯治理技术工作，构建自有瓦斯抽采治理体系；协助山阳煤矿开展专项瓦斯治理、瓦斯与火灾协同治理技术研究；</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">协助山阳煤矿开展</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2026<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年矿井、采区、工作面瓦斯和二氧化碳涌出量测算，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">指导山阳煤矿进行</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">瓦斯治理设计，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">协助山阳煤矿制定</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">瓦斯抽采计量设备技术要求和验收标准；</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">协助山阳煤矿开展</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采掘区瓦斯含量测定与瓦斯地质图绘制；协助</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">山阳煤矿</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开展地面瓦斯抽采系统调试、制度建设及培训。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人负责协助甲方建立覆盖矿井掘进、全风压形成至回采全过程的瓦斯治理技术模式，明确各阶段治理工艺与参数，形成适用于山阳煤矿的自有瓦斯抽采治理体系，实现从标准化向精细化转变；协助甲方开展专项技术研究，提出包括巷道布置优化、瓦斯抽采工艺等在内的综合治理建议，开展松软煤层瓦斯抽采新工艺与定向钻孔技术研究应用，并指导现场实施；协助甲方开展瓦斯与火灾协同治理技术研究，提出综合防控建议，指导现场落实；协助甲方规范瓦斯治理各阶段工艺标准；协助甲方开展地面瓦斯抽采系统调试、制度建设及培训，并对矿井技术、管理及实验室人员进行瓦斯防治理论、技能、装备、法规培训；根据需求联系对外交流，提升自主治理能力。具体内容详见招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目地点：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西澄合山阳煤矿有限公司。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务期限：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同生效后</span>8<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月内完成项目技术服务内容。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.6<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质量要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">符合《煤矿安全规程》（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）及《陕西省煤矿瓦斯防治规定（试行）》等相关规定相关标准、规范及甲方技术管理要求，满足矿井安全生产需求。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求（以下两个条件二选一）：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年经审计的财务审计报告（须包括审计报告正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表，并附审计机构营业执照、会计师事务所执业证书、注册会计师执业证书）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人提供基本账户银行出具的资信证明（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">自</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">05</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">01</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后出具</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供近年（</span>2023<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日期）至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项矿井瓦斯治理技术服务相关业绩。业绩证明材料以合同协议书为准，有效时间以签订时间为准。合同协议书应至少包含合同首页、关键信息页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人员要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目负责人须具有采矿工程（矿业工程）或通风安全（安全工程、安全科学与工程）或地质测量任意一种专业</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&zwnj;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">中级及以上职称</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，并提供</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以后由社保部门出具的连续</span>5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月及以上的社保缴费证明。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.6<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">其他要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目不接受联合体投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目资格审查方式为资格后审。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.1</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\">2026<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span>2</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span>8<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分至</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">03</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span>18<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.2</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下载招标文件，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标文件每套</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">500</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">元</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">售后不退</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标后仅提供电子普票。具体操作步骤如下：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）登录</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，点击【资料审核】，进入资料审核页面，上传授权委托书、法定代表人及委托代理人身份证等资料，点击【提交】后按系统提示下载招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书才能完成投标工作，数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书办理及咨询电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4008206660</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">转</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。咨询日期：工作日及周末：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8:00-20:00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">客服，客服电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">400-685-1179</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">qyebidding@163.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08:30-12:00 13:30-17:30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下载网址：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人操作手册及开标注意事项</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.1</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：</span>2026<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">19</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">上午</span>9<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spa