\" style=\"margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0gd; text-align: center; tab-stops: 394.9pt;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">厂区光伏建设项目招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0gd; text-align: center; tab-stops: 394.9pt;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（招标编号：</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: windowtext; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">0866-26C1SXQY0492</span></strong></a></span><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">）</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">项目所在地区：湖南省益阳市</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"41\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 155%; font-family: 宋体;\">1</span><span style=\"line-height: 155%; font-family: 宋体;\">、招标条件</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">本招标项目&ldquo;厂区光伏建设项目&rdquo;已获批准采购，招标人为长安益阳发电有限公司，资金来源为企业自筹。项目已具备招标条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受长安益阳发电有限公司的委托，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"41\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 155%; font-family: 宋体;\">2</span><span style=\"line-height: 155%; font-family: 宋体;\">、项目概况和招标范围</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">项目名称：长安益阳发电有限公司厂区光伏建设项目</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">项目概况：本项目位于湖南省益阳市赫山区长安益阳发电有限公司厂区（会龙山办事处仑塘村二组），场址区中心坐标为经度</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">E112.275004</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&deg;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">纬度</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">N28.594105</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&deg;，场址区长安益阳发电有限公司厂区内，场址整体相对平整，局部地形有一定起伏，属于有利于建设光伏电站的地址。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">建设规模：<a name=\"OLE_LINK3\"></a>本工程分为光伏发电工程及充电桩工程。光伏发电工程部分：本项目直流侧总装机容量</span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">6725.46kWp</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">，交流侧</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">5860kW</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">，共使用</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">10038</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">块组件，全部选用</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">670Wp</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">单晶硅</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">N</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">型电池组件。利用现状变压器</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">台，共</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">L01-L10</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">发电单元，采用</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">60</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">台组串式逆变器</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(58</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">台</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">100KW ,2</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">台</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">30KW)</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">，共新建低压并网柜</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">15</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">个，预计</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">15</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">个低压</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">380V</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">接入点；接入电压等级为</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">380V</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">，采用&ldquo;全部自发自用&rdquo;模式。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">充电桩工程部分：本项目在西侧停车场，安装</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">16</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">个</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">21KW</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">（单桩）慢充车位，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">个</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">60KW</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">快充车位（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">个</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">120KW</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">直流单桩双枪），充电桩安装总功率</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">576KW</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK3;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">招标范围：本项目的勘察、设计（含加固设计）、设备及材料供货（光伏组件除外）、建筑工程（含加固工程）、车棚及安装工程、调试并网送电等交钥匙总承包建设，具体工作范围包括（但不仅限于）：光伏场本体、厂区集电线路、支架及电气设备基础，光伏电站站内围栏施工、配电房中开关柜及设备、高低压配电开关设备、电气二次（综自系统、远程监控系统含环境监测站）、在线智慧平台，在线视频监控，场站数据接入长江智慧本部数据中心设备、钢格栅检修通道，清洗管道（带保温），红外抄表系统，安全工器具、专用工具及备品备件（不具备存放条件的扣款后续自主采购），气象站等及并网线路的工程勘测、设计（含初设及详勘）、并网接入手续办理及批复、设备及材料采购、建筑工程、安装工程、已有建筑物加固、换瓦、屋面修缮、屋面落水管道修缮、屋面水沟清淤、地面场平、厂区内引水取电计量系统、现场配置数据采集柜和所需要的光纤、屋面检修步道、设备安装调试工程（含调试、培训、试运、性能试验行等）、消缺、性能保证、验收考核、技术和售后服务、人员培训、招标人企业宣传标识标牌及安全标识标牌、电网提出的整改意见措施费等一揽子工作，以及试运行验收通过后的质保责任和缺陷修补、本工程相关的各专项并网前电力验收、并网及相关手续办理、电网公司对接、业主单位相关协调等全部工作的&ldquo;交钥匙工程&rdquo;，达到招标人达标投产要求并通过招标人验收，最终实施方案需经长安益阳发电有限公司厂区光伏建设项目产权方认可，具体招标范围详见发包人要求。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">计划工期：本项目总工期为</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">90</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">个日历日，自招标人发出的书面开工通知中载明的开工日期起计算。中标人应于合同签订后</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">个日历日内完成施工准备工作（包括但不限于设计、场地清理、平整及土建施工前置工作），具体进场施工时间以招标人书面通知为准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">项目建设地点：湖南省益阳市赫山区会龙山街道仑塘村长安益阳发电有限公司。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">质量标准：<a name=\"OLE_LINK6\"></a>设计质量符合国家相关技术标准、规范的要求和招标文件要求；施工质量达到《光伏发电工程验收规范》（</span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">GB/T50796-2012</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">）、电力行业工程质量标准和本项目建设验收要求。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"41\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 155%; font-family: 宋体;\">3</span><span style=\"line-height: 155%; font-family: 宋体;\">、投标人资格要求</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK28\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK8\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 3.1</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">资质要求：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; （</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">）投标人须具有中华人民共和国境内注册的独立企业法人资格，具备有效的营业执照。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; （</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">）投标人须具有建设行政主管部门颁发的工程设计综合甲级资质或工程设计电力行业（新能源）乙级及以上资质，同时具有电力工程施工总承包二级及以上资质。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; （</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">）投标人须具有有效的安全生产许可证。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">3.2</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">财务要求：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><a name=\"_Hlk205915856\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">投标人须提供</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk205915856;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">年至</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk205915856;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">年连续三年的财务审计报告，投标人成立不足三年的，提供自成立以来的财务审计报告（至少包含：审计报告正文及正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表、审计机构营业执照、会计师事务所执业证书、注册会计师执业证书）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">，</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">投标人成立不足一年的提供自成立以来的财务报表。联合体投标，联合体各方均需提供。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">3.3</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">业绩要求：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; 投标人须提供自</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">日至投标截止时间内（以合同签订时间为准）至少</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">份</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">5MW</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">及以上光伏发电工程承包业绩，若投标人为联合体，需提供联合体各方相对应专业至少</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">份</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">5MW</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">及以上光伏发电工程业绩（有效业绩以合同文件为准，至少包含：合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页）。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 3.4</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">人员要求：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK9\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; （</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">）项目经理：具有机电工程专业二级及以上注册建造师资格及有效的《安全生产考核合格证书》（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">B</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">类）</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-fam