）至少具有</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">个光伏发电工程</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">EPC</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">总承包项目的管理经历并提供业绩证明材料（担任项目经理或技术负责人，业绩中需体现</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">EPC</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">项目负责人姓名）。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; （</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">）设计负责人：具备注册电气工程师（供配电）专业执业证书或高级工程类相关专业技术职称，<a name=\"OLE_LINK2\"></a>提供在本单位</span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK2;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK2;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK2;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">日至投标截止日连续</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK2;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">个月由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料，</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">且</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">月至投标截止时间内（以合同签订时间为准）至少具有</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">个光伏发电工程</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">EPC</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">总承包项目设计管理经验并提供关业绩证明材料（业绩中需体现负责人姓名）。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; （</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">）施工负责人：具备建筑工程或机电工程专业二级及以上注册建造师资格及有效的《安全生产考核合格证书》（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">B</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">类），提供在本单位</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">日至投标截止日连续</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">个月由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料，且</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">月至投标截止时间内（以合同签订时间为准）至少具有</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">个光伏发电工程</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">EPC</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">总承包项目管理经验并提供关业绩证明材料（业绩中需体现负责人姓名）。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; （</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">）其他主要人员：拟派安全生产管理人员必须是投标人在册职工，须具有有效的安全生产考核合格证书（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">C</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">类），提供在本单位</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">日至投标截止日连续</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK9;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">个月由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">3.5</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">信誉要求：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; （</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">）投标人未列入信用中国</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/)</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">严重失信主体名单（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书或网站截图为准为准）。联合体投标，联合体各方均需提供。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; （</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/)</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">严重违法失信名单</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">黑名单</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">信息（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书或网站截图为准）。联合体投标，联合体各方均需提供。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">3.6</span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">其他要求：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">（1）投标人负责人为同一人或存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得参加同一项目投标，否则相关投标均无效。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">（2）本项目接受联合体投标，联合体投标的，应满足下列要求：</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">①联合体牵头人需为施工单位，联合体成员数量不超过2个（含牵头人），联合体各方须签订联合体协议书，明确联合体牵头人和各方的权利义务；</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">②联合体各方均具备在中国境内注册法人或其他组织，并依法取得企业营业执照；</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">③联合体各方不得再以自己名义单独或参加其他联合体在同一项目中投标；</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK8;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK28;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">④联合体成员应当具备承担招标项目所需相应资质条件和能力。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"41\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 155%; font-family: 宋体;\">4</span><span style=\"line-height: 155%; font-family: 宋体;\">、招标文件的获取</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.1获取时间：</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">2026年</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">7</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">月</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">23</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">日上午8时00分至2026年</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">7</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">月3</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">0</span></span><span class=\"NormalCharacter\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">日下午18时00分。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2pt; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">4.2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">）&rdquo;上免费注册。注册完成后，投标人登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;将授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及第</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">条&ldquo;投标人资格要求&rdquo;的所有资料的扫描件，所有资料汇总成一个加盖单位公章的</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">PDF</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">文件上传。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2pt; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">4.3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">投标人办理购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件每套售价：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">800</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">元，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2pt; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">4.4</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">潜在投标人支付招标文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">(</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">招标文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">)</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">。若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2pt; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">4.5</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">已注册的潜在投标人若注册信息发生变更</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">(</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">如与初始注册信息不一致</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">)</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2pt; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">4.6</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">此次采购招标项目为全流程网上操作，需要登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">）&rdquo;主页&ldquo;常用文件&rdquo;下载投标人操作手册及</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">CA</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">驱动及</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">CA</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">办理指南完成投标工作。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">4.7</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">有关注册、购买招标文件等交易平台的操作问题请咨询（注册审批：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">029-81613218</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">；技术支持：客服电话：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">400-685-1179</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">，邮箱：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">qyebidding@163.com</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">；数字</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">CA</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">证书办理及咨询电话：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">4008206660</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">转</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">6</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">，咨询时间：工作日及周末：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">8:30-12:00<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>13:30-17:30</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"41\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 155%; font-family: 宋体;\">5</span><span style=\"line-height: 155%; font-family: 宋体;\">、投标文件的递交</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">5.1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">2026</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">8</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">13</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">9</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">00</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">5.2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：本次招标采取网上电子版提交的投标方式，以网上电子版为准。不接受纸质版和</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">U</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">盘投标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">5.3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">为避免受网速影响，以及网站技术支持的时间，建议于投标截止时间前</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">24</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">小时完成网上电子版的提交。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"41\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 155%; font-family: 宋体;\">6</span><span style=\"line-height: 155%; font-family: 宋体;\">、开标时间及地点</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">6.1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">2026</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">8</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">13</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">9</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">00</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">6.2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">开标地点：开标通过&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人应提前</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">20</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">分钟登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，按时完成解密和确认步骤。投标人须用</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">CA</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"41\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 155%; font-family: 宋体;\">7</span><span style=\"line-height: 155%; font-family: 宋体;\">、发布公告的媒介</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标公告同时在&ldquo;</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK13\"></a><a href=\"http://www.cebpubservice.com/\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: windowtext; text-decoration: none;\">中国招标投标公共服务平台</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; color: windowtext; text-decoration: none;\"> (http://www.cebpubservice.com/)</span></span></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">、陕西采购与招标网（</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">http://www.sntba.com/announcement?id=35&amp;page=1&amp;tab=40</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">）和秦源招标电子招标平台（</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK13;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">&rdquo;发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"41\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 155%; font-family: 宋体;\">8</span><span style=\"line-height: 155%; font-family: 宋体;\">、监督部门及异议渠道</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">8.1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目的监督部门为：长安益阳发电有限公司计划经营部，联系人：谭密，监督电话：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">&nbsp;0737-6802371</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">，监督邮箱：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">yydczbjd@cadlhz.com</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">8.2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">异议渠道及方式：投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">10</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">日内以书面形式（邮件发送）向招标人提出，邮箱：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">yydczbjd@cadlhz.com</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">）异议人的名称、地址、联系人及有效联系方式。</span> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">）提出异议项目的名称、编号、所涉及的具体事项及被异议人的有效联系方式。</span> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">）提出异议事项的基本事实、具体理由及明确诉求。</span> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">4</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">）有效线索和相关证明材料。</span> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">5</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">）异议人为其他利害关系人的，应提交利害关系证明。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"41\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 155%; font-family: 宋体;\">9</span><span style=\"line-height: 155%; font-family: 宋体;\">、联系方式</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">招标人：长安益阳发电有限公司</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">地</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">址：湖南省益阳市赫山区会龙山街道仑塘村</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">联系人：杨仕朝</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">电</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">话：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">13875370923</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">邮</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">箱：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">ysc@cadlhz.com</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">招标机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">地</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">址：<a name=\"_Hlk166019591\"></a>陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路</span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk166019591;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">38</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk166019591;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">号东院办公楼</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk166019591;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">102</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk166019591;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">室</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">联系人：<a name=\"_Hlk166019598\"></a>招标三部</span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk166019598;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk166019598;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">景小羿</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">联系电话：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">19911311939</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.13;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">邮</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">箱：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">358698756@qq.com</span></span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26C1SXQY0492',NULL,NULL,'长安益阳发电有限公司厂区光伏建设项目','长安益阳发','2026-07-23 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097377841882730498,'','2026-09-10 09:35:02','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕西龙门钢铁有限责任公司炼钢6#转炉炉体装配【第2次招标】招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260723/1264873691443888128.html','01d2e8395fcc64432ed45af3a3961d9200fee15837ce548cbd4d946f98fe838a',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">陕西龙门钢铁有限责任公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.6000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">炼钢</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6#转炉炉体装配</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.6000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">二次</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.6000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0866-26B2SXQY0313</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目所在地区：陕西省，韩城市</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">一、招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本招标项目陕西龙门钢铁有限责任公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">炼钢</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6#转炉炉体装配</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已批准，项目资金来源为企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%，招标人为陕西龙门钢铁有限责任公司。本项目已具备招标条件，招标方式为公开招标。诚邀符合条件的潜在投标人前来参加。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">二、项目概况和招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1、项目概况：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕西龙门钢铁有限责任公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">炼钢厂</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6#转炉炉壳及下悬挂装置已连续投用十余年，历经长期高温工况、周期性倾动载荷及热应力交变作用，设备整体老化、疲劳损伤较为突出，对转炉安全稳定运行、倾动机构可靠性及生产连续性构成隐患。为彻底消除设备缺陷，保障安全生产、满足工艺运行要求，现计划对6#转炉炉壳及下悬挂装置进行整体更换。炼钢6#转炉炉体装配</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">主要包括：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">炉壳</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1套，炉壳挡座1套，炉壳吊挂座4套，挡渣裙板及支撑架1套、</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">炉口法兰、上锥段（炉帽</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">炉帽冷却水</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">管）、炉身圆柱段、下锥段及炉底等部分组成。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2、招标范围：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">炼钢</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6#转炉炉体装配主要包括：炉壳1套，炉壳挡座1套，炉壳吊挂座4套，挡渣裙板及支撑架1套、炉口法兰、上锥段（炉帽、炉帽冷却水管）、炉身圆柱段、下锥段及炉底等部分组成；投标人负责拟投标设备的设计、制造、检验、试验、包装、运输、必要的附件、备品备件及专用工位器具、技术资料（包括出厂检验合格证、制造总图、部件图/易损件图纸、设备装配图及装配检验记录、材质报告、</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">设备操作规程、日常维护保养手册等；图纸资料须配备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CAD版本和蓝图</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">），负责现场焊接拼装所涉及的焊接材料、设备、工位器具并提供相应的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">焊缝探伤检测报告（委托符合国家资</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">质要求的第三方检测机构出具</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）及退火报告，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">指导安装、调试、人员培训与服务并配合完成整套设备性能考核验收、售后服务及质保期内的维修和保养等为实施本项目所需的全部工作内容，详见本项目发包人要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">交货期</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">120日历天</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4、质保期：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">整套设备安装调试验收合格后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">12个月或货到现场后18个月，以先到时间为准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5、质量：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">所供货物符合国家及行业现行质量验收标准合格等级</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.6、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">交货</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">地点：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕西</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">省韩城市龙门镇龙钢公司。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-autospace: none; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.1、资质要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.2、人员要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">焊工</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2名：须提供有效的特种作业安全管理和作业人员证（熔化焊接与热切割作业），以上人员须为本单位在册职工，须提供社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料（2025年6月1日起连续5个月)。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.3、财务要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&mdash;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年连续三年）经</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">会计师事务所</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">至少</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">包含审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表），若投标人成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">、业绩要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">须</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提供近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日至投标截止日期）不少于</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2份转炉炉体</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">含</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">炉壳）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">供货</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">业绩</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（转炉公称容量</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ge;100吨）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">有效业绩以合同复印件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同对应增值税发票（至少提供合同总金额</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">30%以上发票，合同金额及发票均不得涂抹、遮挡）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">为准，业绩的有效时间以合同签订时间为准，合同文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">须</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">包含</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">：合同首页、供货范围、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">公称容量、合同金额、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">签订时间、双方盖章签字页（可提供技术协议作为</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">合同</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">补充材料）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">、信誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入信用中国</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/)严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/)严重违法失信名单(黑名单)</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">、其他要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标，本项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">不接受非制造商投标</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，项目审核方式为资格后审。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">获取时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">23</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">11</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">00分至20</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">26</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">30</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">18</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">00分</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -13.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -1.2400gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">获取方式：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&rdquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">下载招</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">标文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">-【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书的扫描件，点击【提交】</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字CA证书才能完成投标工作，数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">客服</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，客服电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00 13:30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（1）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/投标人操作手册及开标注意事项</span></span><a href=\"../cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html%E3%80%82\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">12</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：电子文件上传递交到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">接收</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">六、开标时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">开标时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">12</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">开标方式：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招投标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）。投标人代表须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目招标公告在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;中国招标投标公共服务平台&rdquo;、&ldquo;陕西采购与招标网&rdquo;和&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;上发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">八、</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">监督部门：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕西龙门钢铁有限责任</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">公司招标办，监督电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0913-5182358，监督邮箱：lggszbb@163.com</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">九、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">异议渠道及方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">10日内以书面形式(邮件发送)向招标人提出。提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（1）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">异议提出人名称、地址、电话等；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（2）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（3）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">提出异议的日期。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">十</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">招</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">标</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">人：陕西龙门钢铁有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">地</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">址：陕西省韩城市龙门镇</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" styl