n></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: -.05pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">．项目概况与招标范围</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc144974396\"></a><a name=\"_Toc152047193\"></a><a name=\"_Toc179715685\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.1 </span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">工程规模：陕煤金融中心（二期）<span lang=\"EN-US\">DK57</span>位于西安市浐灞国际港香湖湾五路（规划路）以东，世博东路（规划路）以南，香湖湾四路（规划路）以西，规划净用地面积<span lang=\"EN-US\">46744</span>㎡，规划建设面积约<span lang=\"EN-US\">143263.87</span>㎡，包含住宅楼、配套服务、地下车库及相关配套。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.2 </span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">项目地点：西安市浐灞生态区东三环辅路以东，世博东路以南，香湖湾四路（规划路）以西，中固加油站东北。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.3 </span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">项目投资总额：<span lang=\"EN-US\">1085390000</span>元。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.4 </span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">标段划分：标段<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>：标段名称：陕煤金融中心（二期）<span lang=\"EN-US\">DK57</span>消防工程；标段编号：<span lang=\"EN-US\"> E6101003506FYH53cqsN001</span>；标段类型：施工；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.5</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：标段<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>：包括陕煤金融中心（二期）<span lang=\"EN-US\">DK57</span>消防工程全部内容，具体包括但不限于：消火栓系统、自喷系统、室外消防系统、火灾报警系统、消防应急广播系统的施工、防火门监控系统的施工、电气火灾监控系统的施工、消防电源监控系统的施工、<span lang=\"EN-US\">CO</span>系统的施工等。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.6 </span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">其他：（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）本次施工招标预算约<span lang=\"EN-US\">1159.89</span>万元；（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）计划工期：<span lang=\"EN-US\">180</span>天；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: -.05pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">．申请人资格要求</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3.1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">本次资格预审要求申请人具备消防设施工程专业承包一级及以上资质，并在人员、设备、资金等方面具备相应的能力。其中，申请人拟派项目经理具备注册建造师一级及以上执业资格（机电工程专业），具有有效的安全生产考核合格证书（安<span lang=\"EN-US\">B</span>证），在本单位注册，且未担任其他在建工程的项目负责人（项目经理）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3.2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">本次资格预审不接受联合体资格预审申请；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3.3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">各投标人均可就本招标项目上述标段中的<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>个标段投标；但最多允许中标<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>个标段 （适用于分标段的招标项目）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3.4 </span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">其他要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3.4.1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">营业执照：具备合法有效的营业执照；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3.4.2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">申请人须具有有效的安全生产许可证；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3.4.3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">申请人信誉要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）申请人不得在&ldquo;信用中国<span lang=\"EN-US\">-</span>中国执行信息公开网&rdquo;网站被列为失信被执行人；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）申请人不得在项目所在地各级建设诚信平台被列为投标受限制的行为人；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）申请人不得在全国企业信用信息公示系统被列入严重违法失信企业名单；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>）申请人及拟派项目负责人（项目经理）相关信息在&ldquo;西安市公共资源交易中心工程建设交易平台&rdquo;可查询。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">5</span>）自<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">01</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">01</span>日至资格预审申请文件递交截止时间（若为<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">01</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">01</span>日之后注册登记的企业则为注册登记之日起至今），无因申请人违反国家相关法律法规或不履行与发包人签订的建设工程合同造成的诉讼或仲裁。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: -.05pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">．资格预审文件获取</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">4.1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">请申请人于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">07</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">23</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>秒起至<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">07</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">29</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>秒从西安市公共资源交易中心工程建设交易平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://new.xacin.com.cn:8887</span>）下载资审文件。<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; </span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">4.2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">资审文件不收费，资格预审文件每套售价<span lang=\"EN-US\">0.00</span>元。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: -.05pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">5.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">资格预审文件递交</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">5.1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">资格预审申请文件截止时间为<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">04</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>分 ，地点为西安市公共资源交易中心工程建设交易平台&ldquo;不见面开标大厅&rdquo;。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">5.2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">逾期送达的或者未送达指定地点及未按要求递交的资格申请文件，招标人不予受理。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">5.2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">资格预审申请文件递交方式：网上递交。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: -.05pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">6.</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">资格预审开始时间及地点</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">6.1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">资格预审开始时间为<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">04</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>分，地点为西安市公共资源交易中心工程建设交易平台&ldquo;不见面开标大厅&rdquo;。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">6.2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">本次资格预审采用有限数量制，<span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span>家。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">6.3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">资格审查会议形式：远程会议。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">7</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">、其他公告内容</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">7.1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">本次资格审查公告同时在《西安市公共资源交易平台》、《陕西采购与招标网》 发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">7.2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">资格审查申请人须在西安市公共资源交易中心工程建设交易平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://new.xacin.com.cn:8887</span>）中登记企业信息，然后使用数字认证<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>锁获取资格审查文件及其他文件。资格审查申请人应使用电子投标书制作工具制作、加密资格审查申请文件，并在规定时间上传经过数字证书加密的电子资格审查申请文件（资格审查申请文件为<span lang=\"EN-US\">.xazst</span>格式）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">7.3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采用不见面开标模式。资格审查申请人应在资格预审申请文件截止时间前登录西安市公共资源交易中心工程建设交易平台&ldquo;不见面开标大厅&rdquo;，按系统提示完成开标流程。因资格审查申请人自身设施故障或自身原因导致无法完成资格预审的，由资格审查申请人自行承担后果。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .05pt; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">7.4</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">请中标人在领取中标通知书前将纸质版投标文件正本<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>册、副本<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>册打印盖章后提交至招标代理机构处，以便招标人进行留存备案等工作，中标人应保持投标文件纸质版内容与电