ine; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_bookmark18\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc21048\"></a><a name=\"_Toc21070\"></a><a name=\"_Toc491883077\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目所在地区：陕西省、榆林市</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-right: 2.8500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Toc15651\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc25956\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">袁大滩煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">11216综采工作面增补液压支架采购项目招标项目，招标人为榆林市榆阳中能袁大滩矿业有限公司，招标项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为100%。该项目已具备招标条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受榆林市榆阳中能袁大滩矿业有限公司的委托，现对袁大滩煤矿11216综采工作面增补液压支架采购项目进行（国内）公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Toc491883078\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc13452\"></a><a name=\"_Toc27372\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况、包次划分与招标范围</span></span></strong></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">:</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">袁大滩煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">11216综采工作面增补液压支架采购项目（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">招标编号：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0866-26A2SXQY0734），本项目划分为1个包次。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况：陕西中能煤田有限公司袁大滩井田位于陕北侏罗纪煤田榆横矿区东北部，榆溪河以西，无定河以北，古长城西北处。井田东距榆林市约</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">20km，行政区划隶属榆林市榆阳区小纪汗乡及芹河乡。本项目针对袁大滩煤矿112盘区南翼11216综采工作面及112盘区、122盘区北翼开采区域，工作面设计生产能力5Mt。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2号煤赋存于延安组第四段顶部，为井田内最厚的主采煤层，埋深179.71～388.72m，煤层底板标高+810～+1020m。煤层埋藏深度由东南部向西北逐渐变深。煤层在井田东部不可采，其余地段均可采，厚度变化趋势为东、南部薄，向西、北逐渐增厚，最厚处位于井田的西北角，可采面积105.60km2。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2号煤为大部可采煤层，最厚处为南翼采区西北端停采线处。11216工作面为此次招标设备的采面，根据两巷掘进揭露煤层情况，最薄处1.6米，最厚处2.0米，1.8米占多数，确定此次支架的使用范围1.6-2.0米。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">煤层顶板岩性主要为细粒砂岩、粉砂岩，次为泥岩或中粒砂岩；底板岩性主要为粉砂岩，次为细粒砂岩、中粒砂岩、炭质泥岩、砂质泥岩。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面倾斜长度（实体煤）：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">346.88米，运输巷（矩形）：6&times;2.6m，回风巷（矩形）：6&times;2.5m。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">此次招标增补</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">27架液压支架，配套袁大滩煤矿11212综采工作面设备，用于11216综采工作面。11212综采工作面液压支架生产厂家为郑州煤矿机械集团股份有限公司、西安重装铜川煤矿机械有限公司，电液控生产厂家为北京天玛智控科技股份有限公司。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">招标范围：</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">货物需求一览表</span></strong></p>\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 97.3600%; margin-left: 6.7500pt; border: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3000pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 11.8800%; padd