"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3)异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人（单位负责人）或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4)提出异议的日期。 </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -33.1500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26A2SXQY0734',NULL,NULL,'项目名称: 袁大滩煤矿11216综采工作面增补液压支架采购项目','榆林市榆阳中能袁大滩矿业有限公司','2026-07-22 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097377905980084226,'','2026-09-10 09:35:02','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕西韩城矿业王峰煤矿有限责任公司王峰煤矿水害超前探查招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260722/1264517226145251328.html','33b3688846beea16346ff45b464c7802472fc2f440e77272ed0a1e6f0254c364',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">陕西韩城矿业王峰煤矿有限责任公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">王峰煤矿水害超前探查</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; text-align: center; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">标段编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">E6100013501260286001001</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; text-align: center; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目所在地区：陕西省韩城市</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一、招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本招标项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">王峰煤矿水害超前探查</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已由陕西省发展和改革委员会以陕发改能煤炭〔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2021</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">〕</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">950</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">号文件核准批复，</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标人为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西韩城矿业王峰煤矿有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标代理机构</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。建设资金来自企业自筹，出资</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，资金已落实。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">及标段编号</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">王峰煤矿水害超前探查</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">标段编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">E6100013501260286001001</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">王峰煤矿位于陕西渭北煤田韩城矿区东北部，行政区划隶属陕西省韩城市桑树坪镇管辖。井田走向南北长约</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">18km</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，东西宽约</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8km</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，面积</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">81.92km2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，主采</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">号煤层，平均厚度</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5.06m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，设计可采储量</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">293.05Mt</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，设计生产能力为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.00Mt/a</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，服务年限</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">69.8a</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。矿井目前处于建设阶段，属煤与瓦斯突出矿井，水文地质类型为&ldquo;中等&rdquo;，主要水害为顶板砂岩水、底板岩溶水。矿井主要以岩巷掘进为主，掘进方式为盾构机和综掘机掘进。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次探查主要对</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">S1303</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面底抽巷</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">DF14</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">断层采用定向长钻孔结合孔中雷达及伽马测井技术进行探查，该断层贯穿</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">S1303</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面，最大落差</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">32m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，倾角</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">65</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&deg;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-70</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&deg;，属正断层切割含煤地层并延伸至基底，该断层可能成为导水通道，对巷道布置及安全生产构成威胁。为查明断层产状及确保安全安全生产，拟采用定向长钻孔结合孔中物探的方式进行超前探查。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人需依据矿井地质、水文地质资料及掘进工作计划，负责以下工作：（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）编审文件：包括地质异常体探查设计、配套安全技术措施及成果报告。（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）探查技术实施：①采用随钻测量定向钻进技术，依托实时轨迹控制和侧钻分支技术探测断层；②结合岩屑分析、出水量监测、物探数据，综合判定断层产状；③运用孔中雷达（探测钻孔径向</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">～</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">10m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">范围地质构造）和伽马测井（分析钻孔径向</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0.1m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">内岩性、轨迹监测及测斜），解析钻孔周边岩性与地质构造，为导水通道判定提供技术支撑。（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）探查工作调整：可根据井巷工程掘进计划灵活优化实施。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具体内容详见招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目地点：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西省渭南市韩城市王峰煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">服务期限</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">质量要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">符合《煤矿安全规程》及《煤矿防治水细则》要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（1）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（2）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具有地质灾害评估和治理工程勘查设计甲级资质</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人提供近三年（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年至</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年其中任意连续三年）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人须提供基本账户银行出具的资信证明（在投标截止日期前</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月内出具）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供近年（自</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日起至投标截止日期）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项煤矿水害探查项目业绩</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。业绩证明材料以</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合同协议书</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">为准，有效时间以签订时间为准。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合同协议书</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">应至少包含合同首页、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">主要服务范围、合同期限、合同签订时间及双方盖章签字页。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.4</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">人员要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目负责人须具有物探专业或地质专业中级及以上职称，并提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后由社保部门出具的连续</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月有效社保证明材料。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">其他要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）单位负</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目不接受联合体投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：</span></span></strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">07</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">22</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">0<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分至</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">07</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">29</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span>00<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）凡有意参加投标者，登录陕西省公共资源交易平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）下载电子招标文件及附件，投标人必须在上述时间内下载招标文件，逾期无法下载。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）招标文件下载流程：投标人应登录陕西省公共资源交易平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">），选择&ldquo;电子交易平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西省工程建设交易系统</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">新点软件工程建设交易系统企业端&rdquo;进行登录，登录后选择&ldquo;交易乙方&rdquo;身份进入，进入后在左上角&ldquo;建设工程&rdquo;类别中找到并选择本项目点击文件下载，免费下载电子招标文件（后缀为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">.SXSZF</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的文件）及有关附件。投标人须在招标文件获取时限内，下载获取电子招标文件及有关附件，逾期下载通道将关闭，未及时下载获取电子招标文件及有关招标文件附件将会导致后期无法上传电子投标文件，无法参与本项目投标，投标人后果自负。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人初次使用交易平台需按陕西省公共资源交易平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）的要求办理</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">锁。办理须知详见：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/fwzn/004002/004002007/20250108/efdc53a2-c250-44b1-876c-c44ab6c5e66d.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5.1</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">13</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目采用</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;不见面开标&rdquo;方式，无须投标人现场递交纸质投标文件。投标人在投标截止时间前，在陕西省公共资源交易平台（陕西省）（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）在线递交上传电子投标文件并完成在线签到。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5.2</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在全国公共资源交易平台（陕西省）（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）网上递交，未上传电子投标文件或未上传指定平台的电子投标文件，招标人不予受理。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent2\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent2\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5pt;\">六、</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.1</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">13</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.2</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">地点</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西省公共资源交易平台《陕西省不见面开标大厅》在线开标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">七、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标采用资格后审的方法对投标人资格进行审查，资格评审的条件、标准、方法详见招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标公告同时在陕西采购与招标网（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sntba.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）和全国公共资源交易平台（陕西省）（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）、中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.cebpubservice.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">上发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须在陕西省公共资源交易中心网站企业诚信管理系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）中登记企业信息，然后登录全国公共资源交易平台（陕西省）</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(http://www.sxggzyjy.cn/)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下载、查看电子招标文件及有关附件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">关于平台操作及常见问题，请查看陕西省公共资源交易中心&ldquo;服务指南&rdquo;，具体详见&ldquo;办事指南&rdquo;和&ldquo;常见问题解答&rdquo;。如有疑问请联系平台，相关技术问题，请提前咨询软件开发商：技术支持热线：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">029-88661287</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">029-88661298</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0512-58188039</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标的时候必须携带加密锁（公司</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">锁）。该项目将采取&ldquo;不见面&rdquo;开标方式，投标人无须到达开标现场，即可在网上直接参与开标活动。具体方法详见招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">八、监督部门</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目的监督部门为陕西省能源局，联系电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">029-63913307</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 21.3000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">九、异议渠道及方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日内以书面形式</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">邮件发送</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">向招标人提出。提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）异议提出人名称、地址、电话等；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）提出异议的日期。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">十</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标人：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西韩城矿业王峰煤矿有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">地址：陕西省韩城市桑树坪镇卓立村</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">联系人：企管部魏工</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0913-5261381</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标代理机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">38</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">号东院南一楼</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">118</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">室</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">联系人：李工（招标二部）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">029-89578069/18192595269</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子邮箱：</span>173461141@qq.com</span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'陕西韩城矿业王峰煤矿有限责任公司王峰煤矿水害超前探查','陕西韩城矿业王峰煤矿有限责任公司','2026-07-22 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097377913064263682,'','2026-09-10 09:35:02','','2026-09-10 09:37:22',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目全厂门卫室及外操室工程招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260722/1264495650330902528.html','ae5c8aaeb0dc09ca97adeab0788c5dfc993f2aab8dd313a5d6f04a8817addf9c',NULL,'HTML','<p>陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司 1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目全厂门卫室及外操室工程 招标公告 招标编号：0866-26B1SXQY0369 项目所在地区：陕西省，榆林市 一、招标条件 本招标项目陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目全厂门卫室及外操室工程，招标人为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司，招标项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为100%，资金已落实。招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目进行国内公开招标，诚邀符合条件的潜在投标人前来参加。 二、项目概况与招标范围 2.1、项目名称：1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目全厂门卫室及外操室工程（招标编号：0866-26B1SXQY0369） 2.2、项目概况：本次招标为1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段全厂门卫室及外操室工程。本施工工程包含2#门卫室、5#门卫室、6#门卫室、9#门卫室、煤储运装置门卫室及2#外操室、3#外操室、4#外操室、5#外操室、6#外操室、7#外操室，其中： 2#门卫室地上一层，建筑高度4.30米（室外地坪至屋面面层的高度），占地面积64㎡，建筑面积64㎡，结构形式为钢筋混凝土框架结构，耐火等级为二级，主体结构设计工作年限50年，抗震设防烈度为6度，外墙、屋面防水等级为一级。 5#门卫室地上一层，建筑高度4.30米（室外地坪至屋面面层的高度），占地面积94.5㎡，建筑面积94.5㎡，结构形式为钢筋混凝土框架结构，耐火等级为二级，主体结构设计工作年限50年，抗震设防烈度为6度，外墙、屋面防水等级为一级。 6#门卫室地上一层，建筑高度3.70米（室外地坪至屋面面层的高度），占地面积64㎡，建筑面积64㎡，结构形式为钢筋混凝土框架结构，耐火等级为二级，主体结构设计工作年限50年，抗震设防烈度为6度，外墙、屋面防水等级为一级。 9#门卫室地上一层，建筑高度4.30米（室外地坪至屋面面层的高度），占地面积64㎡，建筑面积64㎡，结构形式为钢筋混凝土框架结构，耐火等级为二级，主体结构设计工作年限50年，抗震设防烈度为6度，外墙、屋面防水等级为一级。 煤储运装置门卫室地上一层，建筑规划高度5.10米，占地面积57.2㎡，建筑面积57.2㎡，结构形式为钢筋混凝土框架结构，耐火等级为二级，主体结构设计工作年限50年。 2#外操室地上一层，建筑规划高度6.55米，占地面积673.92㎡，建筑面积673.92㎡，结构形式为钢筋混凝土框架+钢筋混凝土抗爆墙结构，耐火等级为二级，主体结构设计工作年限50年，抗震设防烈度为6度，建筑防水等级为一级。 3#外操室地上二层，建筑规划高度11.55米，占地面积726.16㎡，建筑面积1452.32㎡，结构形式为钢筋混凝土框架+钢筋混凝土抗爆墙结构，耐火等级为二级，主体结构设计工作年限50年，抗震设防烈度为6度，建筑防水等级为一级。 4#外操室地上一层，建筑规划高度6.40米，占地面积808.02㎡，建筑面积808.02㎡，结构形式为钢筋混凝土框架+钢筋混凝土抗爆墙结构，耐火等级为二级，主体结构设计工作年限50年，抗震设防烈度为6度，建筑防水等级为一级。 5#外操室地上一层，建筑规划高度6.40米，占地面积717.57㎡，建筑面积717.57㎡，结构形式为钢筋混凝土框架+钢筋混凝土抗爆墙结构，耐火等级为二级，主体结构设计工作年限50年，抗震设防烈度为6度，建筑防水等级为一级。 6#外操室地上一层，建筑规划高度6.55米，占地面积974.61㎡，建筑面积974.61㎡，结构形式为钢筋混凝土框架+钢筋混凝土抗爆墙结构，耐火等级为二级，主体结构设计工作年限50年，抗震设防烈度为6度，建筑防水等级为一级。 7#外操室地上一层，建筑规划高度6.40米，占地面积717.57㎡，建筑面积717.57㎡，结构形式为钢筋混凝土框架+钢筋混凝土抗爆墙结构，耐火等级为二级，主体结构设计工作年限50年，抗震设防烈度为6度，建筑防水等级为一级。 2.3、招标范围：投标人需按设计图纸文件、施工及验收规范等要求完成二期一阶段全厂门卫室及外操室工程施工，工作内容包括但不限于：建筑工程（含精装修）、结构工程、室外工程（含电瓶车停车场及自行车棚、道路、标识标线等）、电气工程、电信工程、给排水工程、消防工程、暖通工程等所有专业工程施工，同时，负责门卫室同全厂围墙的衔接工作，负责甲供设备/材料的卸车、二次搬运、保管等工作。向发包人提交完整的工程文件和资料等工作内容，并配合发包人开展各专项验收、中间交接，负责保修责任期间的保修等工作。 2.4、项目地点：陕西省榆林市神木市大保当镇榆神工业区清水工业园。 2.5、工期：150日历天（具体开工时间以甲方书面通知为准）。 2.6、质量：符合现行国家有关工程施工质量验收规范、标准要求和设计要求，达到合格等级标准。 三、投标人资格要求 3.1、资质要求：投标人必须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人，具有有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书或其他组织；提供行政主管部门颁发的建筑工程施工总承包三级及以上资质；并提供有效的安全生产许可证。 3.2、财务要求： 投标人财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一： （1）有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（投标截止前三个月内）； （2）任意连续三年（2022年—2025年）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件。 3.3、业绩要求： 投标人须提供2023年1月1日至投标截止日期至少3份单合同建筑总面积不少于3000㎡的建筑施工业绩。有效业绩以合同文件为准，合同内容需体现：合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页、证明业绩有效的其他关键信息等（可提供相关技术协议、图纸作为补充材料）。 3.4、人员要求： （1）项目经理：具有建筑工程专业二级及以上建造师注册证书及安全生产考核合格证书（B类）；且未担任其他在建项目的项目负责人或技术负责人（提供承诺书）； （2）技术负责人：具有工程类相关专业中级工程师及以上技术职称； （3）安全负责人：具有安全生产考核合格证书（C类）； 以上人员均须为本单位在册职工，提供由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料（2026年1月1日起以后连续3个月）。 3.5、信誉要求（提供承诺书）： （1）投标人未被列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单； （2）投标人未被列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。 3.6、其他要求： （1）投标人需保证投标文件资料的真实性、准确性，如发现故意虚构、隐瞒重要信息等，一经发现，将取消其投标资格； （2）中标单位不得进行转包、非法分包，一经发现，立即终止合同，且需赔偿由此给招标人造成的损失； （3）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得参加同一标段投标； （4）本项目不接受联合体投标，本项目资格审查方式为资格后审； （5）投标人基本信息应在“陕西省建筑市场监管与诚信一体化管理系统”可查询。 四、招标文件的获取 4.1、获取时间：2026年7月22日8时00分至2026年7月27日18时00分； 4.2、获取方式：凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录“秦源招标电子招标平台（https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html）”下载招标文件，具体操作步骤如下： （1）登录“秦源招标电子招标平台”，按照提示信息进行投标人注册； （2）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书、法定代表人及委托代理人身份证等资料，点击【提交】后按系统提示下载招标文件。招标文件售价：500元/套，售后不退。 （3）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字CA证书才能完成投标工作，数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6。 （4）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询“秦源招标电子招标平台”客服，客服电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00，13:30-17:30。 下载网址： 1）秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的供应商/投标人操作手册及开标注意事项：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html 2）秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html 五、投标文件的递交 5.1、递交截止时间：2026年8月12日上午9时整。 5.2、递交方式：投标人应在投标截止时间前，登录“秦源招标电子招标平台”，将加密的投标文件上传，上传成功后，系统自动反馈上传结果和时间，递交时间即为系统反馈结果时间。未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接收。 六、开标时间及地点 6.1、开标时间：2026年8月12日上午9时整。 6.2、开标方式：通过“秦源招标电子招标平台”线上开标系统开标。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤，系统默认解密时间为30分钟。 七、其他 本次招标公告在中国招标投标公共服务平台（http://www.cebpubservice.com/）、陕西招标投标协会网（http://www.sntba.com/announcement?id=35&page=1&tab=40）、秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）同时发布。 八、监督部门 监督部门：陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司商务部 监督电话：0912-3732054 监督邮箱：swb@shccig.com 九、异议渠道及方式 投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前10日内以书面形式（邮件发送）向招标人提出。提出的异议书应包含的内容： 1）异议提出人名称、地址、电话等； 2）具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料； 3）异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章； 4）提出异议的日期。 十、联系方式 招标人：陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司 地址：陕西省榆林市榆神工业区清水工业园汇源大道1号 联系人：商务部宋工 联系电话：0912-3732053 电子邮箱：// 招标机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司 地址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路38号东院办公楼1楼118室 联系人：招标二部杨工 联系电话：029-86452114 电子邮箱：928544011@qq.com</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26B1SXQY0369',NULL,NULL,'2.1、项目名称：1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目全厂门卫室及外操室工程','陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司','2026-07-22 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097377919842258946,'','2026-09-10 09:35:02','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','柠条塔煤矿地质保障系统优化提升项目招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260721/1264281629564600320.html','3d97bb3062ff496c24497a60c7fd18557056dd829c70fbbc2e3f69f6ff5efeb0',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; line-height: 150%; text-align: center;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; text-align: justify; text-indent: 28px;\">陕煤集团神木柠条塔矿业有限公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; line-height: 150%; text-align: center;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0666667px; text-indent: 28.2667px;\">柠条塔煤矿地质保障系统优化提升项目</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; line-height: 150%; text-align: center;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0666667px; text-indent: 28.2667px;\">招标编号：0866-26E2SXQY0669</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; line-height: 150%; text-align: center;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0666667px; text-indent: 28.2667px;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 119.4000pt left blank 141.6000pt left blank 173.6000pt left blank 333.3500pt left blank 363.5000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">本招标项目</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">&ldquo;柠条塔煤矿地质保障系统优化提升项目&rdquo;招标人为陕煤集团神木柠条塔矿业有限公司，招标项目资金来自企业自筹</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">。该项目已具备招标条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕煤集团神木柠条塔矿业有限公司的委托，现对柠条塔煤矿地质保障系统优化提升项目进行（国内）公开招标</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1项目名称：柠条塔煤矿地质保障系统优化提升项目（招标编号：0866-26E2SXQY0669）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目概况</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">柠条塔煤矿通过国家首批智能化示范矿井验收，达到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">I类中级智能化示范矿井，建成了智能化综合管控平台、智能灾害防治系统、安全管理系统、智能化采煤工作面、智能化掘进工作面等智能化系统。2023年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">升级</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">建设了中级地质保障系统。柠条塔</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">矿业公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">计划在利用矿井现有的地质保障系统建设基础上，通过对系统中不完善的功能进行全面提升和优化，进一步增强系统在矿井安全保障和提高开采效率方面的支撑作用</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标范围</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）融合采掘工作面前方地质异常体的各种探测信息、多属性隐蔽致灾地质因素融合分析，提升采掘工作面隐蔽致灾因素超前探测与监测准确性。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）升级建设地质数据库。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）三维地质几何建模及属性建模。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）搭建矿井透明地质保障系统。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本次建设须达到《陕西省透明地质保障建设技术规范》高级透明地质保障建设要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.3000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具体要求详见招标文件第五章发包人要求。</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">交货地点：陕煤集团神木柠条塔矿业有限公司。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">交货及安装期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">90个日历日内完成地质保障系统安装调试</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">质量要求：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合格。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.2000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.7质保期：自项目验收合格之日起3年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 219.7000pt left blank 299.5000pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.1</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资质要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 219.7000pt left blank 299.5000pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人必须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 219.7000pt left blank 299.5000pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人须提供煤矿手机</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">防爆终端</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">的煤安证及</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">防爆合格证</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 8pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 219.7000pt left blank 299.5000pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2人员要求：拟派项目负责人须具有计算机技术与软件相关专业高级或以上职称</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，不得在其他在建项目中担任项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">负责人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（须提供无在建承诺书），</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">并提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">月以后本单位为其缴纳不少于</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">个月的社保证明</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 219.7000pt left blank 299.5000pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：投标人必须具有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日至投标截止之日地质保障系统或</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">矿山信息化类似项目的建设或优化业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">不少</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\">于</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">项，证</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\">明文件以合同为准，合同有效日期以签订时间为准，合同至少包含合同首页、签订时间、合同内容明细及双方盖章页。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 219.7000pt left blank 299.5000pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">信誉要求</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">以加盖公章的承诺书为准</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未列入信用中国(https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt. gov. cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 219.7000pt left blank 299.5000pt; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4.1</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">获取方式：凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">）&rdquo;下载招标文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">）登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书及&ldquo;三、投标人资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件，点击【提交】。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">证书才能完成投标工作，数字</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">证书办理及咨询电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4008206660</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">转</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">400-685-1179</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">，邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">qyebidding@163.com</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">08:30-12:00</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">13</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">30-17:30</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">）秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">投标人操作手册及开标注意事项：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">）投标客户端下载网址：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4.2</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">招标文件费用：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">500</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">元</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">套，通过秦源招标电子招标平台支付，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4.3</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">购买招标文件的发票，投标人可在平台自行下载并打印（招标文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4.4</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">招标文件购买时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">7</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">22</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">日至</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">7</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">27</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">日（法定节假日期间接受文件购买），每日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">时至</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">时，下午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">14</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">时至</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">时（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">五．投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5.1</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">13</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">09</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">分（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5.2</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">递交方式：电子招标平台文件递交：电子招标平台下载《投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">供应商操作手册》，按说明操作。电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">）&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">六．开标时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 4.9500pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.4500gd; text-indent: 15.7500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.1开标时间</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年8月13日09时00分（北京时间）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.2开标地点：开标通过&ldquo;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;网上进行。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须用</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\" align=\"justify\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">七．</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\">发布公告的媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">本次招标公告在</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">&ldquo;中国招标投标公共服务平台&rdquo;、&ldquo;陕西采购与招标网&rdquo;和&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">八．</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">监督部门及异议渠道和方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8.1本项目监督部门：陕煤集团神木柠条塔矿业有限公司企业管理部</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系人：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">17791205679</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1603840453@qq.com</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8.2 异议渠道及方式:投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前10日内以书面形式(邮件发送)向招标人提出，邮箱:1603840453@qq.com。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提出的异议书应包含的内容</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">:</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1)异议提出人名称、地址、电话等;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2)具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3)异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字;异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">代表人或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">;</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 15.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4) </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">提出异议的日期</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">九、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">招标人：陕煤集团神木柠条塔矿业有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">址：陕西省神木市孙家岔镇柠条塔村</span> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系人：</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">李先生</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">15353860555</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: n