0%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">话：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">18592032598</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&nbsp; 邮</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">箱：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">678012</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">@qq.com</span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'彬长各矿井下用编织袋招商项目',NULL,'2026-07-21 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097377934438436866,'','2026-09-10 09:35:02','','2026-09-10 09:37:22',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目倒班宿舍楼壁布框架采购及安装二次招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260718/1263066557706141696.html','bd7943a637507427be960a1884838cfb907e2b45666b15f314b2befae6c0f58a',NULL,'HTML','<p>陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司 1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目倒班宿舍楼壁布框架采购及安装 二次招标公告 招标编号：0866-26B2SXQY0312 项目所在地区：陕西省，榆林市 一、招标条件 本招标项目为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目倒班宿舍楼壁布框架采购及安装，招标人为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司，招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。招标项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为100%。该项目已具备招标条件，现进行国内二次公开招标。诚邀符合条件的潜在投标人前来参加。 二、项目概况和招标范围 1.项目名称：1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目倒班宿舍楼壁布框架采购及安装（招标编号：0866-26B2SXQY0312） 2.项目概况：本次采购供货范围二期一阶段项目倒班宿舍楼壁布框架采购及安装，暂估数量为57158.67㎡，厂家须根据要求提供产品选样，待甲方签字确认后进行生产加工，壁布的执行标准及技术参数要求详见清单，由于需求可能存在变化，故以框架采购形式进行招标，具体详见第五章供货要求。 3.招标范围： 投标人负责拟投标货物的深化设计和制造、包装、供货、运输交付、装卸车、安装验收、检验和试验、现场技术服务、培训、售后服务、质保期服务及技术文件资料等所有为实施本项目所需的全部工作内容。详见本招标文件第五章“供货要求”。 4.交货地点：榆林市神木市大保当镇榆神工业区清水工业园项目现场。 5.交货期：框架协议及采购订单签订生效后25个自然天到货，到货后30个自然天内完成施工；采购订单另有约定的，从约定。 6.质保期：货到安装验收合格后12个月。 7.有效期： 框架采购模式有效期：自本框架协议生效之日起，2年后或已生效标准采购订单累计价款超过本框架协议暂估总价后（以先到者为准），双方不再订立新的采购订单，但已生效且尚未履行完毕的采购订单应予继续履行。 框架采购协议有效期：自双方法定代表人或委托代理人签字并加盖公章或合同专用章之日起生效，至双方在本框架协议中的义务均已履行完毕之日终止。 三、投标人资格要求 3.1资质要求： （1）投标人须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件； （2）若投标人为代理商，应提供本次拟代理品牌制造商针对本项目的唯一有效授权书。 3.2财务要求： 投标人财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一： （1）有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（投标截止前三个月内）； （2）（2022年—2025年其中任意连续三年）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件。 3.3业绩要求： （1）当投标人为制造商时，须提供近年（2021年1月1日至投标截止日期）至少3份单项合同壁布面积不低于10000㎡的供货业绩，有效业绩以签署完毕的合同文件为准，合同文件须至少包含合同首页、供货范围、供货数量、技术指标、合同签订时间、双方盖章签字页、证明业绩有效的其他关键信息等（可提供相关技术协议作为补充材料）； （2）若投标人为代理商时，须提供近年（2021年1月1日至投标截止日期）至少3份单项合同壁布面积不低于10000㎡的供货业绩，该业绩可以是代理商自身作为卖方签订的合同，也可以是本次投标拟代理品牌的制造商作为卖方签订的合同。有效业绩以签署完毕的合同文件为准，合同文件须至少包含合同首页、供货范围、供货数量、技术指标、合同签订时间、双方盖章签字页、证明业绩有效的其他关键信息等（可提供相关技术协议作为补充材料）。 3.4信誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）： （1）投标人未被列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单； （2）投标人未被列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。 3.5其他要求： （1）本项目不接受联合体投标； （2）本项目资格审查方式为资格后审。 四、招标文件的获取 4.1、获取时间：2026年7月18日8时00分至2026年7月24日18时00分； 4.2、获取方式：凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录“秦源招标电子招标平台（https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html）”下载招标文件，具体操作步骤如下： （1）登录“秦源招标电子招标平台”，按照提示信息进行投标人注册； （2）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书、法定代表人及委托代理人身份证等资料，提交后按系统提示下载招标文件。招标文件售价：500元/套，售后不退。 （3）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字CA证书才能完成投标工作，数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6。 （4）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询“秦源招标电子招标平台”客服，客服电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00，14:00-17:30。 下载网址： 1）秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的供应商/投标人操作手册及开标注意事项：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html 2）秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html 五、投标文件的递交 5.1、递交截止时间：2026年8月12日9时整（北京时间）。 5.2、递交方式：投标人应在投标截止时间前，登录“秦源招标电子招标平台”，将加密的投标文件上传，上传成功后，系统自动反馈上传结果和时间，递交时间即为系统反馈结果时间。未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。 六、开标时间及方式 6.1、开标时间：2026年8月12日9时整（北京时间）。 6.2、开标方式：通过“秦源招标电子招标平台”线上开标系统开标。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤，系统默认解密时间为30分钟。 七、发布公告媒介 本次招标公告在中国招标投标公共服务平台（http://www.cebpubservice.com/）、陕西招标投标协会网（http://www.sntba.com/）、秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）同时发布。 八、监督部门 本招标项目的监督部门：陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司商务部 监督电话：0912-3732054 监督邮箱：swb@shccig.com 九、异议渠道及方式 投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前10日内以书面形式（邮件发送）向招标人提出。提出的异议书应包含的内容： 1）异议提出人名称、地址、电话等； 2）具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料； 3）异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章； 4）提出异议的日期。 十、联系方式 招标人：陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司 地址：陕西省榆林市榆神工业区清水工业园汇源大道1号 联系人：商务部曹工 联系电话：0912-3734228 电子邮箱：// 招标机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司 地址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路38号东院办公楼1楼118室 联系人：招标二部杨工 联系电话：029-86452114 电子邮箱：928544011@qq.com</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26B2SXQY0312',NULL,NULL,'1.项目名称：1500万吨/年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程一阶段项目倒班宿舍楼壁布框架采购及安装','陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司','2026-07-18 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097377941384204290,'','2026-09-10 09:35:02','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕西陕煤澄合矿业有限公司董家河煤矿分公司2026年度矿山土地复垦与生态修复监测评价招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260717/1262921517398753280.html','a837f698fa5a4397ff6a6a25b81f3bf910d49182db6ca084f1f76475feaef2fa',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">陕西陕煤澄合矿业有限公司董家河煤矿分公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年度矿山土地复垦与生态修复监测评价</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: center; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（招标编号：</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26B3SXQY0246</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: center; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目所在地区：陕西省渭南市</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一、招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本招标项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年度矿山土地复垦与生态修复监测评价</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，招标人为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西陕煤澄合矿业有限公司董家河煤矿分公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。建设资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，资金已落实。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年度矿山土地复垦与生态修复监测评价</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（招标编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26B3SXQY0246</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">董家河煤矿已建成较为完善的矿山地质环境动态监测网络和监测评价体系，形成了涵盖北斗形变位移监测、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">InSAR</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">遥感监测、无人机监测、实地调查、地下水与土壤环境检测、植被遥感监测等多手段协同的综合监测基础。</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年计划在原有监测体系、监测系统及既有成果基础上，持续开展矿山生态修复与土地复垦动态监测及综合评价，逐步形成连续多年的监测评价成果。同时，新增部署的监测设备统一接入矿山企业矿山地质环境动态监测预警系统。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人负责</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">实施内容包括：年度监测评价方案编制、新增部署北斗形变位移测量系统</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">套、迁移</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">套北斗形变位移监测系统、采空区塌陷</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">InSAR</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">遥感监测</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项、开采工作面无人机监测</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项、重点区域实地调查及人工巡查</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项，地下水环境质量检测分析</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">组、地形地貌景观高分感监测</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项、地表水环境质量检测分析</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">组、土壤环境质量检测分析</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">组、土地损毁与复垦高分遥感监测</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项、植被多光谱遥感监测</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项、复垦土壤质量检测分析</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">组及年度监测评价成果报告编制。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具体内容详见招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目地点：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西陕煤澄合矿业有限公司董家河煤矿分公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">服务期限</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同生效后至</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年底完成成果报告并通过专家评审。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">质量要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">所有监测工作及成果质量符合国家、行业现行规范标准，确保成果合格，顺利通过主管部门验收。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求（以下两个条件二选一）：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年经审计的财务审计报告（须包括审计报告正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表，并附审计机构营业执照、会计师事务所执业证书、注册会计师执业证书）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人提供基本账户银行出具的资信证明（自</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">05</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">01</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后出具）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日期）至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项矿山地质环境治理恢复与土地复垦监测评价业绩。业绩证明材料以</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合同协议书</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">为准，有效时间以签订时间为准。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">合同协议书</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">应至少包含合同首页、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">关键信息页</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.4</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">人员要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目负责人须具有高级工程师及以上专业技术职称，职称专业类别应为地质类相关专业或者测绘类相关专业。项目负责人须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后由社保部门出具的连续</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月有效社保证明。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">其他要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）单位负</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目不接受联合体投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目资格审查方式为资格后审。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.1</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">18</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">0<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分至</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span>18<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.2</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）&rdquo;下载招标文件</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，招标文件每套</span>500<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">元，售后不退，开标后仅提供电子普票。具体操作步骤如下：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）登录&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，点击【资料审核】，进入资料审核页面，上传授权委托书、法定代表人及委托代理人身份证等资料，点击【提交】后按系统提示下载招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书才能完成投标</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作，数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书办理及咨询电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4008206660</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">转</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。咨询日期：工作日及周末</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8:00-20:00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">400-685-1179</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">qyebidding@163.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08:30-12:00 13:30-17:30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人操作手册及开标注意事项</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5.1</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">上午</span>9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">00<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时整。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5.2</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子文件上传递交到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接收。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent2\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent2\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5pt;\">六、</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.1</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">上午</span>9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spa