 align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">陕西澄合山阳煤矿有限公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 14.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">山阳煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年度矿山地质环境治理恢复与土地复垦监测</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（招标编号：</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26B3SXQY0248</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">项目所在地区：陕西省渭南市</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一、招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目山阳煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年度矿山地质环境治理恢复与土地复垦监测，招标人为陕西澄合山阳煤矿有限公司，招标机构为陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。建设资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，资金已落实。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、项目概况与招标范围</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">山阳煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年度矿山地质环境治理恢复与土地复垦监测（招标编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26B3SXQY0248</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">山阳煤矿已建成较为完善的矿山地质环境动态监测网络和监测评价体系，形成了涵盖北斗形变位移监测、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">InSAR</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">遥感监测、无人机监测、实地调查、地下水与土壤环境检测、植被遥感监测等多手段协同的综合监测基础。</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年，在原有监测体系、监测系统及既有成果基础上，持续开展矿山生态修复与土地复垦动态监测及综合评价，逐步形成连续多年的监测评价成果。同时，新增部署的监测设备统一接入矿山企业矿山地质环境动态监测预警系统。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标范围：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人负责实施内容包括：年度监测评价方案编制、新增部署北斗形变位移测量系统</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">套、迁移部署北斗形变位移测量系统</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">套、采空区塌陷</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">InSAR</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">遥感监测</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项、开采工作面无人机监测</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项、重点区域实地调查及人工巡查</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项，地下水环境质量检测分析</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">组、浅层水环境质量检测分析</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">组、地形地貌景观高分遥感监测</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项、地表水环境质量检测分析</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">16</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">组、土壤环境质量检测分析</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">组、土地损毁与复垦高分遥感监测</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项、植被多光谱遥感监测</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项、复垦区土壤质量检测分析</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">组及年度监测评价成果报告编制。具体内容详见招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目地点：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕西澄合山阳煤矿有限公司。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">服务期限</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同生效后至</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年底完成成果报告并通过专家评审。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质量要求</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">所有监测工作及成果质量符合国家、行业现行规范标准，确保成果合格，顺利通过主管部门验收。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求（以下两个条件二选一）：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年经审计的财务审计报告（须包括审计报告正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表，并附审计机构营业执照、会计师事务所执业证书、注册会计师执业证书）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人提供基本账户银行出具的资信证明（自</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">05</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">01</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后出具）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至投标截止日期）至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项矿山地质环境治理恢复与土地复垦监测评价业绩。业绩证明材料以合同协议书为准，有效时间以签订时间为准。合同协议书应至少包含合同首页、关键信息页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.4</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">人员要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">项目负责人须具有高级工程师及以上专业技术职称，职称专业类别应为地质类相关专业或者测绘类相关专业。项目负责人须提供</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以后由社保部门出具的连续</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月有效社保证明。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">其他要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）单位负责人为同一人</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目不接受联合体投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目资格审查方式为资格后审。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.1</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">18</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">0<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分至</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span>18<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.2</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）&rdquo;下载招标文件</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标文件每套</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">500</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">元</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">售后不退</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标后仅提供电子普票。具体操作步骤如下：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行投标人注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">【确定】，获取投标资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，点击【资料审核】，进入资料审核页面，上传授权委托书、法定代表人及委托代理人身份证等资料，点击【提交】后按系统提示下载招标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）本项目采用全流程电子招标方式，潜在投标人须使用数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书才能完成投标工作，数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书办理及咨询电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4008206660</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">转</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。咨询日期：工作日及周末：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8:00-20:00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）有关注册、下载招标文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">400-685-1179</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">qyebidding@163.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08:30-12:00 13:30-17:30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人操作手册及开标注意事项</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cm</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">s/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.1</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; text-underline: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; 