标平台','长安石门发电有限公司#3汽轮机组提效改造项目招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260717/1262796750381383680.html','cc9288754388065868cce079f03c4225a4e177225a1905c15350cc1dcfd60ce7',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: -1.75pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.02gd; text-align: center; text-indent: -.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: -.02; margin: 0cm -1.75pt .0001pt .1pt;\" align=\"center\"><a name=\"_Hlk55910695\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">长安石门发电有限公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: -1.75pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.02gd; text-align: center; text-indent: -.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: -.02; margin: 0cm -1.75pt .0001pt .1pt;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">#3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">汽轮机组提效改造项目招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: -1.75pt; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.02gd; text-align: center; text-indent: -.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: -.02; margin: 0cm -1.75pt .0001pt .1pt;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（招标编号：</span></strong><a><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">0866-26C1SXQY0491</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 7.7pt; text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 宋体;\">项目所在地区：湖南省<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>常德市，石门县</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; break-after: avoid;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;\">1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%;\">、招标条件</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; margin: 7.5pt 10.5pt 6.0pt 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目<span lang=\"EN-US\">#3</span>汽轮机组提效改造项目已获批准，项目资金来源为企业自筹，招标人为长安石门发电有限公司。本项目已具备招标条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受长安石门发电有限公司的委托，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; break-after: avoid;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;\">2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%;\">、项目概况和招标范围</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><a name=\"_Toc234572448\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572389\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">2.1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">项目名称：</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">长安石门发电有限公司</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">#3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">汽轮机组提效改造项目</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><a name=\"_Toc234572449\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572390\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">2.2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">项目概况：</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">长安石门发电有限公司</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">#3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">机组为</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">300MW</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">燃煤发电机组，于</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">2005</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">8</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">月投产发电，其汽轮机系哈尔滨汽轮机厂有限责任公司引进西屋技术优化设计的</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">N300-16.7/537/537-2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">型汽轮机组，单轴、高中压合缸、低压缸双分流、亚临界、一次中间再热、双缸双排汽、凝汽式汽轮机，额定功率</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">300MW</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">。循环水采用直流供水方式，水源为澧水。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><a name=\"_Toc234572391\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572450\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">2.3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">招标范围：长安石门发电有限公司</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">#3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">汽轮机提效改造，包括汽轮机高、中、低压通流部分全面改造的设计、设备制造、供货、运输和检查、原有通流部件及辅机部件的拆改、金属监督、安装、部分设备的检修、试验、服务、培训、启动调试配合、</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">168h</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">试运行技术指导以及第三方性能考核试验配合等全部工作；同时也包括所有必要的材料、备品备件、专用工具、消耗品以及相关技术资料的提供等。</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">具体内容详见招标文件技术要求。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><a name=\"_Toc234572392\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572451\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">2.4</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">计划工期：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><a name=\"_Toc234572452\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572393\"></a><span style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">总工期：合同签订生效后<span lang=\"EN-US\">500</span>天。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><a name=\"_Toc234572394\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572453\"></a><span style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">制造工期：<span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span>个月内，<span lang=\"EN-US\">2027</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日前完成所有设备供货到现场；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><a name=\"_Toc234572454\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572395\"></a><span style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">施工工期：<span lang=\"EN-US\">60</span>天。<span lang=\"EN-US\">#3</span>汽轮机组<span lang=\"EN-US\">A</span>级检修计划于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2027</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>日开工，具体开工日期以招标人通知为准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><a name=\"_Toc234572396\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572455\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">2.5</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">建设地点：湖南省常德市石门县宝峰街道长安石门发电有限公司厂区。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><a name=\"_Toc234572397\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572456\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">2.6</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">质量标准：<a name=\"OLE_LINK15\"></a>符合现行国家有关质量验收规范和标准的要求，达到合格标准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; break-after: avoid;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%;\">、投标人资格要求</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><a name=\"_Toc169080534\"></a><a name=\"_Toc180148156\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572398\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572457\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">3.1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">资质要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）投标人须是中华人民共和国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织，具有有效的营业执照；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">）投标人须具有电力工程施工总承包一级及以上资质；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">）投标人</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">须具有</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">有效的安全生产许可证。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.8pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><a name=\"_Toc169080538\"></a><a name=\"_Toc180148160\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572399\"></a><a name=\"_Toc234572458\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">3.</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK6\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">业绩要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">投标人需提供</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2021</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">日起至投标截止时间内（以合同签订时间为准）</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK1\"></a><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">台及以上</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">300MW</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">容量及以上机组汽轮机通流部分改造</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">的成功业绩，需提供：合同封面、合同买卖双方盖章页、合同签订时间和业绩要求中的关键信息页</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">（包括组容量、改造范围、热耗指标、供货范围、用户完工（投运）证明，），并附改造后性能考核试验报告封面及能反映热耗试验值的内容等</span> <span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">。若投标人为联合体，需提供联合体各方相对应专业至少</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">台及以上</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">300MW</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">容量及以上机组汽轮机通流部分改造业绩。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><a name=\"_Hlk226544837\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">3.3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">财务要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">投标人须提供</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2023</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">年至</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2025</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">年连续三年的财务审计报告，投标人成立不足三年的，提供自成立以来的财务审计报告，（至少包含：审计报告正文及正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表），<a name=\"OLE_LINK2\"></a>投标人成立不足一年的提供自成立以来的财务报表。</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">联合体投标，联合体各方均需提供。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">3.4</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">项目经理要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><a name=\"_Hlk226544546\"></a><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">投标人项目经理需具有机电工程专业一级注册建造师证书及有效的《安全生产考核合格证书》（</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">B</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">类），且未担任其他在建项目的项目经理（提供承诺书），至少从事过</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">次及以上</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">300MW</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">容量及以上汽轮机通流改造项目的项目经理从业经历（提供证明材料）。须提供在本单位</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2025</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">6</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">日至投标截止日连续</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">6</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">个月由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">若项目经理注册证书出现以下情况，提供的项目经理一级注册建造师证书无效：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">）未在注册证书手写签名；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">）手写签名与电子签名图像笔迹不一致；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">）项目经理注册证书右上角无有效时限的水印。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><a name=\"_Hlk226544863\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">3.5</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">信誉要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">）投标人未列入信用中国</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">(https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/)</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">严重失信主体名单（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书或网站截图为准为准）。联合体投标，联合体各方均需提供。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">(https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/)</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">严重违法失信名单</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">(</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">黑名单</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">)</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">信息（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书或网站截图为准）。联合体投标，联合体各方均需提供。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">3.6</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">其他要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">）投标人负责人为同一人或存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得参加同一项目投标，否则相关投标均无效。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">）本项目接受联合体投标，联合体投标的，应满足下列要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">①联合体成员数量不超过</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">个（含牵头人），联合体各方须签订联合体协议书，明确联合体牵头人和各方的权利义务；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">②联合体各方均具备在中国境内注册法人或其他组织，并依法取得企业营业执照；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">③联合体各方不得再以自己名义单独或参加其他联合体在同一项目中投标；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">④联合体成员应当具备承担招标项目所需相应资质条件和能力。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; break-after: avoid;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%;\">、招标文件的获取</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><a name=\"_Toc428196413\"></a><a name=\"_Toc399427367\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk226544953\"></a><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4.1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">获取时间：</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2026</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">7</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">17</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">08</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">时</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">00</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">分至</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2026</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">7</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">24</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">18</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">时</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">00</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4.2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">获取方式：在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">）&rdquo;上免费注册。注册完成后，投标人登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;将授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及第</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">条&ldquo;投标人资格要求&rdquo;的所有资料的扫描件，所有资料汇总成一个加盖单位公章的</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">PDF</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">文件上传。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4.3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">投标人办理购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件每套售价：</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">800</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">元，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4.4</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">潜在投标人支付招标文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">(</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">招标文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">)</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">。若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4.5</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">已注册的潜在投标人若注册信息发生变更</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">(</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">如与初始注册信息不一致</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">)</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4.6</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">此次采购招标项目为全流程网上操作，需要登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">）&rdquo;主页&ldquo;常用文件&rdquo;下载投标人操作手册及</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">CA</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">驱动及</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">CA</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">办理指南完成投标工作。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4.7</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">有关注册、购买招标文件等交易平台的操作问题请咨询（注册审批：</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">029-81613218</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">；技术支持：客服电话：</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">400-685-1179</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">，邮箱：</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">qyebidding@163.com</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">；数字</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">CA</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">证书办理及咨询电话：</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">4008206660</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">转</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">6</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">，咨询时间：工作日及周末：</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">8:30-12:00&nbsp;&nbsp; 13:30-17:30</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; break-after: avoid;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;\">5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%;\">、投标文件的递交</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><a name=\"_Hlk226544983\"></a><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">5.1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2026</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">8</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">7</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">9</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">时</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">00</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">分；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">5.2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">递交方式：本次招标采取网上电子版提交的投标方式，以网上电子版为准。不接受纸质版和</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">U</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">盘投标文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">5.3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">为避免受网速影响，以及网站技术支持的时间，建议于投标截止时间前</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\"> 24 </span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">小时完成网上电子版的提交。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; break-after: avoid;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;\">6</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%;\">、开标时间及地点</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><a name=\"_Hlk226545045\"></a><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">6.1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">开标时间：</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">2026</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">8</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">7</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">09</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">时</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">00</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">分；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">6.2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">开标地点：电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">）&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; break-after: avoid;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;\">7</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 150%;\">、发布公告的媒介</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">本次招标公告同时在&ldquo;</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK13\"></a><a href=\"http://www.cebpubservice.com/\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; color: windowtext; text-decoration: none;\">中国招标投标公共服务平台</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; color: windowtext; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\"> (http://www.cebpubservice.com/)</span></a><span style=\"line-height: 150%;\">、陕西采购与招标网（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%;\">http://www.sntba.com/announcement?id=35&amp;page=1&amp;tab=40</span><span style=\"lin