ily: 宋体;\">中厚煤层上覆采空区回采巷道围岩应力规律研究及支护优化方案应用</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">进行（国内）公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 3.2500pt; margin-left: 5.0000pt; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_bookmark3\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称：中厚煤层上覆采空区回采巷道围岩应力规律研究及支护优化方案应用</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标编号：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26A3SXQY0693</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标内容：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">133101<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面为小保当二号煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><sup><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; vertical-align: super;\">-1</span></sup><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">煤层首采工作面，针对工作面</span>133101<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">回采巷道在重复采掘扰动影响下巷道围岩应力叠加变形破坏机制不清、非对称变形破坏严重现象，系统分析</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">133101</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面回采巷道围岩叠加应力演化过程，揭示巷道非对称变形破坏机制，设计分级分区巷道支护优化方案，构建巷道围岩精准控制体系，最终形成以</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">主动支护</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">差异化设计</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为核心的围岩控制方法，为实现此类复杂条件下巷道围岩的安全与稳定控制提供理论基础和工程实践依据</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">研究内容包括：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1.<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">近距离上覆采空区底板应力传递规律及破坏特征研究</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">复杂应力环境下高强度开采巷道围岩变形破坏机制研究</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">近距离煤层回采巷道全生命周期围岩控制技术研究</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">详见第五章发包人要求。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务期：</span>2027<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月前完成所有研究内容并提交项目最终报告和验收报告。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 3.2500pt; margin-left: 5.0000pt; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_bookmark4\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">必须为中华人民共和国境内合法注册的独立法人企业或其他组织机构，企业法人提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">须提供</span>2020<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日起</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">至投标截止之日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">至少</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项相关项目业绩（业绩以合同文件为准</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，时间以合同签订时间为准</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，合同内容要体现：合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页及双方盖章签字页）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span></strong> <strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">人员</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">拟派项目负责人需具有采矿工程专业高级</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">或</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以上职称，且具</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">有至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">同类项目</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">业绩</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，投标时提供相关证明材料。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">须提供项目负责人由</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">社保经办机构出具（或政务平台下载带电子签章）投标截止日前</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">一</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年内任意连续</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月养老保险缴纳凭证；缴费单位名称须与投标人全称完全一致；至少包含养老保险险种</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">退休</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">返聘</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人员无需提供社保证明，提供退休证</span>+<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人正式聘用协议，职称、业绩满足招标文件要求方可认定为本单位人员</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人成立不足</span> 3 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月：提供自企业成立当月起全部月份社保记录，同时出具加盖公章情况说明</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(1)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（投标截止日前三个月内）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">(2)<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年）其中连续三年经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告复印件（至少包括</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">审计报告正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表，并附审计机构营业执照、会计师事务所执业证书、注册会计师执业证书</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告复印件</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入信用中国</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(</span></span><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">https://www.creditchina.go</span></a><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">v.cn/</span></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">)<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">严重失信主体名单；（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(</span></span><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">https://ww</span></a><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">w.gsxt.gov.cn/</span></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">) <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">严重违法失信名单</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">黑名单</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信息。（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span></strong> <span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 5.1000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Toc19738\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_bookmark5\"></a><a name=\"_bookmark6\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK4\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须在</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（ </span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）上免费注册；注册时预留联系人手机号应为常用手机，购买文件后及时申请办理</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">锁。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注册完成后，投标人登录</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（ </span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人资格要求</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">所有资料的扫描件（加盖单位公章）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标文件费用：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">500</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">元，通过秦源招标电子招标平台支付，售后不退。（支付时请按平台要求提供企业信息及购买招标文件的项目信息，注明项目名称和招标编号）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">购买招标文件的发票，投标人可在平台自行申请并打印（招标文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标文件购买时间</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span>2026<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">17</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span>8<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分（北京时间）至</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span>18<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.6<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">其他</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）秦源招标电子招标平台使用方法、业务咨询及技术支持电话</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">400-685-1179</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">qyebidding@163.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08:30~11:30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">13:30~17:30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）秦源招标电子招标平台投标人（供应商）操作手册下载网址：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/40.htm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人须办理数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书并下载投标客户端。数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书办理及客服咨询电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4008206660</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">转</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。咨询时间：工作日及周末：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8:00-20:00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">驱动及办理指南下载网址：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/43.htm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。投标客户端下载网址：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/45.htm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc25561\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">五</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5.1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标文件递交的截止时间为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">9<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分（北京时间）；地点为电子文件上传递交到</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5.2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">逾期送达的或者未送达指定地点的投标文件，招标人不予受理。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_bookmark7\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">六</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间及地点</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 10.5000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 1.0000gd; text-indent: 10.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间：</span>2026<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">9<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分（北京时间）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标地点：开标通过</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">网上进行。投标人须用</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">七</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">发布公告的媒介</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标公告同时在陕西采购与招标网（</span>http://www.sntba.com/<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）、中国招标投标公共服务平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(http://www.cebpubservice.com))</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justi