"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: center; line-height: 200%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标编号：</span></strong><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 200%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;\">0866-26A3SXQY0694</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 200%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">项目所在地区：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西省,榆林市</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Toc21570_WPSOffice_Level2\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK9\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.招标条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 10.5500pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 67.1500pt left blank 134.8500pt left blank 163.2000pt left blank 244.8000pt left blank 300.2500pt left blank 354.2500pt left blank 374.9000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;浅埋深大采高孤岛工作面开采强矿压机理及控制技术研究服务项目&rdquo;，招标人为陕西小保当矿业有限公司，招标项目资金来自企业自筹。该项目已具备招标条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕西小保当矿业有限公司的委托，现对&ldquo;浅埋深大采高孤岛工作面开采强矿压机理及控制技术研究服务项目&rdquo;进行（国内）公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 3.2500pt; margin-left: 5.0000pt; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_bookmark3\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.1项目名称：浅埋深大采高孤岛工作面开采强矿压机理及控制技术研究服务项目</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.2招标编号：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0866-26A3SXQY0694</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.3招标内容：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">小保当一号煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">112202区块工作面受两侧及前方采空影响，形成了浅埋深、大采高、三面采空的孤岛工作面，本研究目的是系统揭示浅埋大采高孤岛工作面覆岩关键层的破断模式与应力场响应特征，通过建立动静载作用下的煤柱失稳判据，确立合理的煤柱宽度优化范围。基于&ldquo;围岩-支护&rdquo;体系，项目力求优化锚杆（索）协同支护参数，并研发全方位的钻-压一体卸压及分级治理技术，形成完善的强矿压防治系统</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。详见第五章发包人要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 178.3000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务期：合同签订后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2个月内完成实施方案编制;合同签订后12个月内布设井下微震、支架阻力及地表InSAR监测系统，完成初始数据采集。合同签订后15个月内开展数值模拟与相似模拟实验，初步揭示覆岩结构与应力场演化规律；完成第一阶段监测数据分析。合同签订后18个月内深入研究煤柱失稳机制，建立临界应力-能量判据；完成巷道煤柱宽度与锚杆（索）协同支护参数的多方案模拟与优化。合同签订后24个月内，集成前期研究成果，形成强矿压控制技术体系初步方案；在112202工作面选定区段进行工业性试验，并完成试验数据的采集与评估。完成项目研究报告的编制；准备项目结题验收。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 3.2500pt; margin-left: 5.0000pt; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_bookmark4\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">三</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1 资质要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">必须为中华人民共和国境内合法注册的独立法人企业或其他组织机构，企业法人提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2 业绩要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">应具有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年1月1日至投标截止之日至少3项矿压监测与治理技术研究相关项目业绩(</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">业绩以合同文件为准，时间以合同签订时间为准，合同内容要体现：合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页及双方盖章签字页</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">)；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3</span></strong><ins cite=\"mailto:Huawei\" datetime=\"2026-07-06T11:46\"> </ins><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目负责人</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">项目负责人具有采矿</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">工程专业</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">高级或以上职称证书</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">须提供证明材料</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">须提供项目负责人由</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">社保经办机构出具（或政务平台下载带电子签章）投标截止日前</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">一</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年内任意连续</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">个月养老保险缴纳凭证；缴费单位名称须与投标人全称完全一致；至少包含养老保险险种。退休</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">返聘</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人员无需提供社保证明，提供退休证</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">+投标人正式聘用协议，职称、业绩满足招标文件要求方可认定为本单位人员。投标人成立不足 3 个月：提供自企业成立当月起全部月份社保记录，同时出具加盖公章情况说明）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span class=\"msoIns\"><ins cite=\"mailto:%E8%A7%82%E9%9F%AC%E8%A5%BF%E5%AE%89-%E8%A3%B4%E9%9B%AA%E9%98%B3\" datetime=\"2026-07-03T21:10\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4</span></ins></span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">(1)有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（投标截止日前三个月内）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">(2)投标人须提供（2022年-2025年）其中连续三年经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告复印件（至少包括审计报告正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表，并附审计机构营业执照、会计师事务所执业证书、注册会计师执业证书）。投标人若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告复印件</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span class=\"msoIns\"><ins cite=\"mailto:%E8%A7%82%E9%9F%AC%E8%A5%BF%E5%AE%89-%E8%A3%B4%E9%9B%AA%E9%98%B3\" datetime=\"2026-07-03T21:10\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5</span></ins></span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未列入信用中国(</span></span><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">https://www.creditchina.go</span></a><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">v.cn/</span></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">)严重失信主体名单；（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统(</span></span><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">https://ww</span></a><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">w.gsxt.gov.cn/</span></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">) 严重违法失信名单(黑名单)信息。（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -0.3000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -0.0300gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 203.2000pt center blank 253.6000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span class=\"msoIns\"><ins cite=\"mailto:%E8%A7%82%E9%9F%AC%E8%A5%BF%E5%AE%89-%E8%A3%B4%E9%9B%AA%E9%98%B3\" datetime=\"2026-07-03T21:10\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6</span></ins></span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 5.1000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_bookmark5\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_bookmark6\"></a><a name=\"_Toc19738\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.招标文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK4\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.1投标人须在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（ http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上免费注册；注册时预留联系人手机号应为常用手机，购买文件后及时申请办理CA锁。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.2注册完成后，投标人登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（ http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及&ldquo;3.投标人资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件（加盖单位公章）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.3招标文件费用：500元，通过秦源招标电子招标平台支付，售后不退。（支付时请按平台要求提供企业信息及购买招标文件的项目信息，注明项目名称和招标编号）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.4购买招标文件的发票，投标人可在平台自行申请并打印（招标文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.5招标文件购买时间：2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">17</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时00分（北京时间）至2026年7月</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">24</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.6其他</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）秦源招标电子招标平台使用方法、业务咨询及技术支持电话400-685-1179，邮箱： &nbsp;qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间： &nbsp;08:30~11:30，13:30~17:30；（2）秦源招标电子招标平台投标人（供应商）操作手册下载网址：http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/40.htm。（3）投标人须办理数字CA证书并下载投标客户端。数字CA证书办理及客服咨询电话：4008206660转6。咨询时间：工作日及周末：8:00-20:00。数字CA驱动及办理指南下载网址：http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/43.htm。投标客户端下载网址：http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/45.htm。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc25561\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">五</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.投标文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5.1投标文件递交的截止时间为2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">8月10日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">9时00分（北京时间）；地点为电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5.2逾期送达的或者未送达指定地点的投标文件，招标人不予受理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_bookmark7\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">六</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.开标时间及地点</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 10.5000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 1.0000gd; text-indent: 10.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">8月10日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">9时00分（北京时间）</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-left: 10.5000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 1.0000gd; text-indent: 10.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标地点：开标通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">七</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.发布公告的媒介</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标公告同时在陕西采购与招标网（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.sntba.com/）、中国招标投标公共服务平台(http://www.cebpubservice.com))及秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">八</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.监督部门及异议渠道</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000p