ent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26A3SXQY0678',NULL,NULL,'地表水体下采煤可行性与防治水技术研究服务项目',NULL,'2026-07-17 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097378048947130370,'','2026-09-10 09:35:02','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','黄陵矿业集团有限责任公司双龙煤业综采设备中转库项目招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260717/1262704076911542272.html','fd845f496f46ea1bc8f28962f1f5d08ada22a6aa92d332acde741ba67fa12125',NULL,'HTML','<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en-US\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Aspose.Words for Java 20.6\" /><title></title><style type=\"text/css\">div.Section1 { margin:72pt 54.15pt }</style></head><body><div class=\"Section1\"><p style=\"margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:4pt; text-align:center; page-break-inside:avoid; page-break-after:avoid; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:16pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">第一章 招标公告</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:15pt\"><br style=\"page-break-before:always; clear:both\" /></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-right:5.55pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'TENDEREE_NAME\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'TENDEREE_NAME\'\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-weight:bold\">黄陵矿业集团有限责任公司</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-right:5.55pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'MAIN_NAME\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'MAIN_NAME\'\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-weight:bold\">黄陵矿业集团有限责任公司双龙煤业综采设备中转库项目</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-right:5.55pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-weight:bold\">招标公告</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-right:5.55pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:center; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-weight:bold\">（招标编号：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'MAIN_CODE\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'MAIN_CODE\'\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-weight:bold\">0866-26D1SXQY0270</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-weight:bold\">）</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">项目所在地区：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'PROJECTAREA_ADDR\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'PROJECTAREA_ADDR\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">陕西省</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">/</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">延安市</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">/</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-weight:bold\">一、招标条件</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'MAIN_NAME\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'MAIN_NAME\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">黄陵矿业集团有限责任公司双龙煤业综采设备中转库项目</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">已由项目审批/核准/备案机关批准，项目资金来源为</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'FUND_SOURCE\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'FUND_SOURCE\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">企业自筹</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">，出资比例</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'INVESTMENT_PROPORTION\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'INVESTMENT_PROPORTION\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">100</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">，招标人为</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'TENDEREE_NAME\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'TENDEREE_NAME\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">黄陵矿业集团有限责任公司</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">。该项目已具备招标条件，现招标方式为公开招标。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-weight:bold\">二、项目概况和招标范围</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">1、项目概况：</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">项目位于双龙煤业厂区内，建筑面积2695m2，长×宽×高：110m×24.5m×11.8m，单层钢结构厂房，门式刚架结构，耐磨钢筋混凝土重载地面，安装航吊1个，最大起重量30吨。室外场坪硬化面积约1800m2，其他配套工程包括综合沟、电缆沟、污水管网、箱变等。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">2、招标范围：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'BIDDING_SCOPE\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'BIDDING_SCOPE\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">本工程为单层钢结构厂房，门式刚架结构，耐磨钢筋混凝土重载地面，建筑面积</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2695m2</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">，建筑高度</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">11.80m</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">。主要内容包括：建筑、结构、电气、给排水、采暖通风及室外照明工程；路面拆除与恢复、构筑物拆除及垃圾外运等。其他配套工程包括室外场坪硬化、围墙、综合沟、电缆沟、污水管网、箱变等，具体详见设计施工图及工程量清单。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">3、</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">计划</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">工期</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'DURATION\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'DURATION\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">自合同签订生效之日起</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">10</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">个月。具体开工日期以甲方对乙方开工报告批准之日为准。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">4、</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">建设</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">地点：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'CONSTRUCTION_SITE\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'CONSTRUCTION_SITE\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">陕西省延安市黄陵县双龙镇。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">5、</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">质量要求</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">：</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">合格。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-weight:bold\">三、投标人资格要求</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">1、资质要求：</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">（1）投标人须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">（2）投标人须具备建设行政主管部门颁发的有效的建筑工程施工总承包三级及以上资质，并具有建设行政主管部门颁发的有效的安全生产许可证；</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">（3）投标人基本信息在“陕西省住房和城乡建设厅（http://js.shaanxi.gov.cn/）-陕西省建筑市场监管与诚信信息发布平台”可查询（以投标人提供的查询截图为准）。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">2、业绩要求：</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; -aw-import:spaces\">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">投标人近年（合同签订时间为</span><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">2021</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">月</span><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">日起至投标截止日）具有1份房屋建筑工程新建或改建或扩建工程施工业绩（以合同为准，包含合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页）。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">3、信誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）：</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">（1）投标人未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单；</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">（2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">4、</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">其他</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">要求</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial; -aw-import:spaces\">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">拟派驻本项目的项目负责人须具有建筑工程专业二级及以上注册建造师资格且在本单位注册，具备有效的安全生产考核合格证书（B类），并未担任其它在建工程项目负责人（提供相关证明材料或承诺书）。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial; -aw-import:spaces\">&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; </span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'UNION_SEND_INFO\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'UNION_SEND_INFO\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-weight:bold\">四、招标文件的获取</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">获取时间：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'SIGN_BEGIN_TIME\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'SIGN_BEGIN_TIME\'\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">2026-07-17 08:30</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">到</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'SIGN_END_TIME\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'SIGN_END_TIME\'\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">2026-07-24 18:00</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">获取方式：</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">1、投标人须在“秦源招标电子招标平台”（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）上免费注册。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">2、注册完成后，投标人登录“秦源招标电子招标平台”（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及“三、投标人资格要求”所有资料的扫描件。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">3</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">、</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">经招标机构确认后，通知投标人办理购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件费用</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'PRICE_MODEL\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'PRICE_MODEL\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">500</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">元，售后不退</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">、</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">购买招标文件的发票，待招标机构开出后投标人可在平台下载（购买招标文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-weight:bold\">五、投标文件的递交</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'BID_OPEN_TIME\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'BID_OPEN_TIME\'\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">2026-08-07 09:00</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">递交方式：</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">电子文件上传递交到“秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）”，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-weight:bold\">六、开标时间及地点</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">开标时间：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'BID_OPEN_TIME\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'BID_OPEN_TIME\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2026-08-07 09:00</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">开标地点：开标通过“秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）”网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-weight:bold\">七、其他</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">1、本项目招标公告仅在陕西采购与招标网（http://www.sntba.com）、秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）、中国招标投标公共服务平台（http://www.cebpubservice.com/）发布。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">2、秦源招标电子招标平台使用方法及技术支持咨询电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：</span><a href=\"mailto:qyebidding@163.com\" title=\"mailto:qyebidding@163.com\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; text-decoration:underline\">qyebidding@163.com</span></a><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">，咨询时间：法定工作日08:30~12:00，13:30~17:30。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">3、秦源招标二期电子招投标系统操作手册（供应商）下载网址：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">4、投标人须办理数字CA证书并下载投标客户端。数字CA证书办理及咨询电话：4008206660转6。数字CA驱动及办理指南下载网址：</span><a href=\"http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/43.htm%E3%80%82\" title=\"http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/43.htm%E3%80%82\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; text-decoration:underline\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/43.htm。</span></a><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">秦源招标二期投标客户端下载网址： </span><a href=\"https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html%E3%80%82\" title=\"https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html%E3%80%82\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; text-decoration:underline\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></a></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; line-height:150%; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">5、提出异议的渠道和方式:联系人:</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'7ae69989-5775-48a0-92fd-1902229ce61a\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'7ae69989-5775-48a0-92fd-1902229ce61a\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">黄陵矿业集团有限责任公司法律事务办公室</span></span></span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'ab64d722-8e3e-4931-a5a3-1ff69f154df0\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'ab64d722-8e3e-4931-a5a3-1ff69f154df0\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">蔡华</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">，联系电话：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'51bd8043-336e-4b36-9487-3049bbcb1a32\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'51bd8043-336e-4b36-9487-3049bbcb1a32\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">15091256531</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">；联系邮箱：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'2aa9ff0e-6b7b-48d5-aa14-1a8967975b39\'\"><span style=\"-a