MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.2</span>招标范围：包含住宅<span lang=\"EN-US\">1#</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">5#~8#</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">11#</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">12#</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">16#</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">17#</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">21#</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">25#</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">26#</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">32#</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">49</span>栋多层（含<span lang=\"EN-US\">24#</span>楼）、地下车库、幼儿园、社区中心等楼宇消防设施维修，墙体、墙面、地面、门窗等的拆除、更换、维修与恢复并按要求完成项目验收。具体内容详见工程量清单。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.3</span>计划工期：自合同签订生效之日起<span lang=\"EN-US\">180</span>日历天，具体开工日期以开工报告为准。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.4</span>建设地点：陕西省渭南市白水县仓颉路东<span lang=\"EN-US\">50</span>米白水工人新村小区。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2.5</span>质量要求：合格。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong>三、投标人资格要求</strong></span></p>\n<p st