目负责人基本信息在&ldquo;陕西省住房和城乡建设厅（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://js.shaanxi.gov.cn/</span>）<span lang=\"EN-US\">-</span>陕西省建筑市场监管与诚信信息发布平台&rdquo;可查询（以投标人提供的加盖公章的网页查询截图为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目不允许联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><a name=\"_Toc117253880\"></a><a name=\"_Toc67468317\"></a><strong>四、招标文件的获取</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：从<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">07</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">17</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>分到<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">07</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">24</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">4.1 </span>投标人须在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）上免费注册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">4.2 </span>注册完成后，投标人登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及&ldquo;三、投标人资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">4.3 </span>经招标机构确认后，通知投标人办理购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件费用：<span lang=\"EN-US\">500</span>元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">4.4 </span>购买招标文件的发票，待招标机构开出后投标人可在平台下载（购买招标文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong>五、投标文件的递交</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">07</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong>六、开标时间及地点</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">07</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标地点：开标通过&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong>七、其他</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">7.1 </span>本项目招标公告仅在中国招标投标公共服务平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.cebpubservice.com</span>）、陕西采购与招标网（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://www.sntba.com</span>）和秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">7.2 </span>秦源招标电子招标平台使用方法及技术支持咨询电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">400-685-1179</span>，邮箱：<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyebidding@163.com</span>。咨询时间：法定工作日<span lang=\"EN-US\">08:30~12:00</span>，<span lang=\"EN-US\">13:30~17:30</span>。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">7.3 </span>秦源招标二期电子招投标系统操作手册（投标人<span lang=\"EN-US\">&amp;</span>供应商）下载网址：<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html</span>。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">7.4 </span>投标人须办理数字<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>证书并下载投标客户端。数字<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>证书办理及咨询电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">4008206660</span>转<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>。数字<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>驱动及办理指南见秦源招标二期电子招投标系统操作手册（投标人<span lang=\"EN-US\">&amp;</span>供应商）。投标客户端下载网址：<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html</span>。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 0cm; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all