 vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本招标项目陕西陕煤铜川矿业有限公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下石节煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">231、228工作面定向高位长钻孔工程</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，招标人为陕西陕煤铜川矿业有限公司，项目资金来自企业自筹，项目出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%。项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目进行公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2、项目概况及招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.1项目概况：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（一）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">231回顺定向高位长钻孔</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">231回顺巷道煤墙侧钻场【钻场规格：10m（长）&times;5m（宽）&times;3.9m（高）】内施工。钻场内设计施工10个钻孔，共两排，每排5个孔，终孔高度分别为煤层顶板以上5m、10m，倾向控制范围为回顺煤墙帮向运顺方向8～44m区域，终孔孔间距（平距）8m。钻孔孔径&Phi;153mm，采用囊袋两堵一注封孔方式，孔内全程下&Phi;90mmPVC护孔筛管。共施工10个钻孔，单孔设计深度280m，孔径153mm，设计施工钻孔工程量2800m。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（二）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">228回顺定向高位长钻孔</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">228回顺巷道煤墙侧开口施工，钻场间距300m，钻场规格：10m（长）&times;5m（宽）&times;3.9m（高）。每个钻场内设计施工12个钻孔，共两排，每排6个孔，终孔高度分别为煤层顶板以上10m、14m，倾向控制范围为回顺煤墙帮向运顺方向8～52m区域，终孔孔间距（平距）8m。钻孔孔径&Phi;153mm，采用囊袋两堵一注封孔方式，孔内全程下&Phi;90mmPVC护孔筛管。共施工24个钻孔，单孔设计深度300m，孔径153mm，设计施工钻孔工程量7200m。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.2招标范围：全部钻孔施工</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">及封孔作业</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">包含钻孔分析报告等必要服务成果，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">一个标段。（详见招标文件第五章招标人要求）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.3项目地点：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">陕西省铜川市耀州区瑶曲镇下石节煤矿</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.4工期：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">150</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">日历天。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.5招标编号：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">0866-26C1SXQY0487</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人资格要求</span><a name=\"_Toc179632531\"></a></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc152042291\"></a><a name=\"_Toc144974483\"></a><a name=\"_Toc152045515\"></a></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1资质要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人必须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">企业</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">须</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具有矿山工程施工总承包一级</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">及以上</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资质</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">并具备有效的安全生产许可证。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; page-break-after: avoid; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2人员要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; page-break-after: avoid; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">拟派项目经理</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">须具有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">矿业工程专业</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">级</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">及以上</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">注册建造师资格</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具有有效的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">安全生产考核合格证书（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">B类），且未担任其他在建项目的</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目经理</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（提供相关证明材料或承诺书）。投标人需提供拟派驻的项目经理近</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6个月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">的纳税证明或社保证明。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; page-break-after: avoid; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）安全生产管理人员须持有主管监管部门颁发、在有效期内的矿山类安全生产知识和管理能力考核合格证。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3业绩要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供自</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日（以合同签订时间为准）至投标截止日期，至少</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项煤矿井下瓦斯抽采（或防突）钻孔施工业绩。业绩证明材料以合同文件为准（合同内容须清晰体现：合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页及双方盖章签字页）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.4财务要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">至</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">年连续三年，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表及财务报表附注）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">，投标人新成立</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">满一年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">不足三年的企业需提供自成立以来的财务审计报告</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">投标人新成立不满一年的须提供</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">自成立以来</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">的财务报表</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.5信誉要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人不得在信用中国（http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）中被列入失信企业目录（提供网页截图或承诺书）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人不得列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span></span><a href=\"https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">www.gsxt.gov.cn</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）严重违法失信名单