000pt;\">资料上传。投标人即可办理缴费下载招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.3</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">常用文件</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&mdash;</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">手册及开标注意事项</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-b