0000pt;\">资料上传。投标人即可办理缴费下载招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.3</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">常用文件</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&mdash;</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">手册及开标注意事项</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人在秦源招标电子招标平台购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件每套售价：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">800元，招标文件售后不退。购买招标文件发票可在平台开具后自行打印（仅提供电子增值税普通发票）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.5潜在投标人支付招标文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.6已注册的潜在投标人若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: lines-together; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_bookmark6\"></a><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_bookmark7\"></a><a name=\"_Toc2663\"></a><a name=\"_Toc25862\"></a><a