ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2、项目概况及招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.1项目概况：为落实&ldquo;重大灾害超前治理&rdquo;的规定要求，确保409工作面生产期间风排瓦斯涌出量符合要求，设计在409运顺施工360个采前预抽钻孔，钻孔垂直巷帮平行布置，开孔高度1.5m，孔间距6m，孔径113mm，孔深150m，钻孔终孔点位于煤层中下部，钻孔工程量54000m。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.2招标范围：全部钻孔施工</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">及封孔作业</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">包含钻孔分析报告等必要服务成果，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">一个标段。（详见招标文件第五章招标人要求）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagina