 font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人资格要求</span><a name=\"_Toc144974483\"></a></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc179632531\"></a><a name=\"_Toc152045515\"></a><a name=\"_Toc152042291\"></a></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1资质要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人必须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">企业</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">须</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具有矿山工程施工总承包一级</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">及以上</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资质</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">并具备有效的安全生产许可证。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; page-break-after: avoid; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2人员要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; page-break-after: avoid; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">拟派项目经理</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">须具有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">矿业工程专业</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">级</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">及以上</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">注册建造师资格</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具有有效的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">安全生产考核合格证书（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">B类），且未担任其他在建项目的</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目经理</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（提供相关证明材料或承诺书）。投标人需提供拟派驻的项目经理近</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6个月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">的纳税证明或社保证明。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; page-break-after: avoid; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）安全生产管理人员须持有主管监管部门颁发、在有效期内的矿山类安全生产知识和管理能力考核合格证。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">业绩要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供自</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日（以合同签订时间为准）至投标截止日期，至少</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项煤矿井下瓦斯抽采（或防突）钻孔施工业绩。业绩证明材料以合同文件为准（合同内容须清晰体现：合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页及双方盖章签字页）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.4财务要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">至</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">年连续三年，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表及财务报表附注）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">，投标人新成立</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">满一年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">不足三年的企业需提供自成立以来的财务审计报告</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">投标人新成立不满一年的须提供</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">自成立以来</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">的财务报表。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.5信誉要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人不得在信用中国（http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）中被列入失信企业目录（提供网页截图或承诺书）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人不得列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span></span><a href=\"https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">www.gsxt.gov.cn</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息（提供网页截图或承诺书）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.6其他要求：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本项目不接受联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_bookmark23\"></a><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc27394\"></a><a name=\"_Toc7902\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.1 获取时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">15</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0分至202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">21</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日下午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">时</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0分。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.2 获取办法：凡有意参加投标者，登录秦源招标电子招标平台（qyzb.shccmg.com），点击&ldquo;投标人登录&rdquo;请将法人授权委托书（附法定代表人、委托代理人身份证复印件）及上述&ldquo;3.投标人资格要求&rdquo;的</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">相关</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">资料上传。投标人即可办理缴费下载招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.3</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">常用文件</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&mdash;</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">手册及开标注意事项</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人在秦源招标电子招标平台购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件每套售价：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">800元，招标文件售后不退。购买招标文件发票可在平台开具后自行打印（仅提供电子增值税普通发票）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4.5潜在投标人支付招标文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layou