text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 24px;\"><a name=\"_Toc428196409\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 12pt;\">1.招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本招标项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">小庄矿40208备采面采前瓦斯治理及40207工作面高位定向钻孔项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，资金为企业自筹，项目已具备招标条件，招标人为陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司。陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司的委托，现对该项目进行国内公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 24px;\"><a name=\"_Toc399427364\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 12pt;\">2.项目概况及招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1项目名称：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">小庄矿40208备采面采前瓦斯治理及40207工作面高位定向钻孔项目</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">概况</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">40208工作面面宽280m，普通钻孔施工存在抽采盲区，需配套施工煤层定向钻孔实现抽采全覆盖，采前预抽钻孔（含定向钻孔）工程需集中力量年底前完成施工；同时针对40207、40208工作面规划的高位定向钻孔施工也需同步开展。</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-top: 0.2pt; margin-left: 0.55pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标范围：现有施工力量难以完成计划任务，为彻底扭转矿井瓦斯治理被动局面，严格落实瓦斯超前精准治理要求，消除抽采盲区、提升抽采效果，保障抽采系统稳定运行及治灾环节良性接续，需外委10.4万采前预抽钻孔进尺（常规采前预抽钻孔进尺10万m，煤层定向钻孔进尺0.4万m）、1.14万m高位定向钻孔进尺。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">详</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">见</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 20px; font-size: 10pt;\">第五章发包要求</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 20px; font-size: 10pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">服务期</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7个月</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">服务地点</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西省咸阳市彬州市义门镇街道17号陕西彬长矿业集团小庄矿指定地点。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 24px;\"><a name=\"_Toc399427365\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 12pt;\">3.投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 24px;\"><a name=\"_Toc39