 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4034上04工作面为403采区南翼第2个综采工作面，采用走向长臂后退式综合机械化采煤法采煤，全部垮落法处理顶板。工作面设计走向长度1596m，留设大巷保护煤柱150m，可采长度为1446m，倾向长度350m。煤层底板标高+520～+590m，煤层埋藏深度495～670m。4034上04工作面东侧为4034上02采空区，西侧及南侧为实煤体，北侧为4煤西翼开拓大巷</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; margin-top: 0.2pt; margin-left: 0.55pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标范围：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">根据陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司《关于大佛寺矿外委施工瓦斯抽采钻孔工程相关事宜的批复》(陕彬矿司发(2026)177号)精神，计划外委施工</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">该工作面5个高位定向瓦斯抽采钻场中的50个钻孔，进尺2.1万</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">详</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">见</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 20px; font-size: 10pt;\">第五章发包要求</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 20px; font-size: 10pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">服务期</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">540日历天</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.</span><span 