class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人操作手册下载网址：http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/40.htm 。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 12pt;\">8</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 12pt;\">．</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 12pt;\">其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目的监督部门：陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司规划部</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 42pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">联系人：郑先生&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">监督电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">029-33191601</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">监督邮箱：</span><a href=\"mailto:tousujiandu@sxxaqyzb.com%E3%80%82\"><span class=\"10\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2236744@qq.com</span><span class=\"10\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px;\">。</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.2异议渠道及方式：投标人或其他利害关系人对本招标公告及招标文件内容有异议的，应在投标文件递交截止前10日内以书面形式（邮件发送）向招标人提出，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">邮箱</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">:</span><span class=\"10\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2236744@qq.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">异议书应包含的内容：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1）异议人的名称、地址、联系人及有效联系方式。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2）提出异议项目的名称、编号、所涉及的具体事项及被异议人的有效联系方式。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3）提出异议事项的基本事实、具体理由及明确诉求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4）有效线索和相关证明材料。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5）异议人为其他利害关系人的，应提交利害关系证明。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 24.1pt; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 12pt;\">9</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; font-size: 12pt;\">．联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标人：陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">地址：咸阳世纪大道中段58号彬长大厦14层</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">联系人：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">郑</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">先生</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">联系</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">029-33191601</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormalIndent\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\';\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">地址：陕西省西安市自强西路38号东院办公楼103室</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">联系人：李女士</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">电话：18192595116</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: \'Noto Sans SC\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">邮箱：</span><a href=\"mailto:1611673531@qq.com\"><u><span class=\"16\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px; color: #0000ff;\">1611673531@qq.com</span></u></a></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26C3SXQY0478',NULL,NULL,'大佛寺矿4034上04工作面高位定向瓦斯抽采钻孔项目','陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司','2026-07-13 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097378391026176001,'','2026-09-10 09:35:03','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','建庄矿业工业场地6号楼区域综合治理工程招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260713/1261264594576343040.html','8c9e42bf7c627378da8b2c5e3b4d0812e9d4098f071fba439a51bf760b62ea68',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16pt;\">陕西陕煤蒲白矿业有限公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">建庄矿业工业场地</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6号楼区域综合治理工程</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16pt;\">（招标编号：</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16pt;\">0866-26D1SXQY0231</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16pt;\">）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目所在地区：陕西省</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">延安市</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">黄陵县</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">一、招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">建庄矿业工业场地</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6号楼区域综合治理工程</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已由项目审批</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/核准/备案机关批准，项目资金来源为其他资金（企业自筹，比例100%），招标人为</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西陕煤蒲白矿业有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。本项目已具备招标条件，现招标方式为公开招标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二、项目概况和招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1项目概况：本项目建设地点位于延安市黄陵县陕西煤业集团黄陵建庄矿业有限公司矿区内东北部。本次治理的6号员工宿舍楼在矿区东北部，经调查，其东、西、北侧有长225m、最大高度10m的不稳定边坡，受降水等影响易失稳，威胁下方设施、道路及人员安全。此外，6号宿舍楼修建时在周边堆放设备、材料和垃圾，造成临时占地损毁，严重破坏周边绿化，使工业场地地形地貌不协调。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标范围</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">边坡整体较低处采用</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;重力式挡墙&rdquo;的形式；6号楼周边距离临空面较近一侧，采用&ldquo;悬臂式钢筋混凝土挡墙&rdquo;；剩余段边坡凌空高度较高，顶部为污水处理建筑，采用&ldquo;柱板墙+锚索&rdquo;的支护形式，</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具体详见设计施工图纸及工程量清单。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3计划</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">工期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3个月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，具体开工日期以开工报告为准。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4建设地点：陕西省延安市黄陵县店头镇新村</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">质量</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">要求</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：合格，符合</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">国家、陕西省、延安市对相关工程的质量标准、施工图纸、技术规范、施工图技术要求</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资质条件：</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人须具备有效的地质灾害治理工程施工甲级资质，并具有建设行政主管部门颁发的有效的安全生产许可证。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">业绩要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人近年（合同签订时间为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">202</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">起至投标截止日）具有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1份地质灾害治理工程施工或边坡治理工程施工业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（以合同为准，包含合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">信誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书为准）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.4 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">其他要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">拟派驻本项目的项目负责人须具有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资源与环境类（包括水文地质或工程地质或环境地质或地质工程）高级及以上职称或土木水利类（包括岩土工程或结构工程或防灾减灾工程及防护工程）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">高级及以上职称，且未担任其它在建工程项目负责人（提供相关证明材料或承诺书）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本项目不允许联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">获取时间：从</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年07月13日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">0分到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年07月20日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">获取方式：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.1 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">上免费注册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.2 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注册完成后，投标人登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;三、投标人资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.3 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">经招标机构确认后，通知投标人办理购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件费用：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">500元，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.4 购买</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标文件的发票，待</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">招标机构</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">开出后投标人可在平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">下载</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（购买招标文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年08月05日09时00分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：电子文件上传递交到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接受。投标人应登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">六、开标时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">开标时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年08月05日09时00分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标地点：开标通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7.1 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目招标公告仅在中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">www.cebpubservice.com）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</s