炉维修项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">已具备采购条件。现公开邀请供应商参加谈判采购活动，相关事项告知如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1、采购项目简介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.1 采购项目名称：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">建庄矿业公司锅炉维修项目</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.2 采购人：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西陕煤蒲白矿业有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.3 采购代理机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.4 采购项目资金落实情况：已落实</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.5 采购项目概况：建庄矿3台燃气锅炉，自2018年安装运行以来，由于矿井水质差，腐蚀性大，锅炉内部结垢较大、部分配套设施老化、节能效果差等，影响锅炉安全运行。根据2025年采暖期内锅炉运行情况，经对锅炉设备现场检查，需对锅炉进行整体年度检修维护。包含锅炉介质化验、2号公寓楼地下室供暖设施维修。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.6 成交供应商数量：一家</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2、采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1 采购范围：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">WNS10-1.25Y.Q型燃气锅炉修理，数量：3台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">具体内容如下：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.三台锅炉省煤器检修及节能器更换。2.三台锅炉给水管，阀门更换，除氧器到给水泵管道更换。3.三台锅炉内部酸洗、烟道清理、防爆门检修，水位计、连桶、阀门更换。4.三台锅炉燃烧机检修。5.树脂过滤器检修，更换管道、隔膜阀阀门、泵及管路更换。6.两台水暖换热器检修、清洗。7.除氧器检修、阀门更换、下水母管更换（除氧箱至每台锅炉给水泵走专管）。8.三台锅炉差压变送器调校，水位计调校，电气控制设备检修。9.2号公寓楼供暖设施维修改造，消除管道内流水声。10.4号公寓楼热交换器检修清洗。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2 维修</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">周期</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">自合同签订生效之日起</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">30天</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">内。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">质保期</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">设备维修验收合格并投入使用之日起</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">12个月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3、供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3.1 供应商应依法设立且满足如下要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）资质要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">①</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">②</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具有有效的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">《中华人民共和国特种设备生产许可证》</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">【许可内容包含：锅炉安装（含修理、改造）】</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">B级或以上资质</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\" align=\"justify\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">（2）</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">业绩要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">供应商具有近年（合同签订时间为</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">01月01日起至响应文件递交截止之日）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">至少</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1份</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">燃气锅炉维修</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">服务</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">业绩</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">业绩</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">以合同为准，包含合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">）信誉要求</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">（下列要求均由供应商提供加盖公章的承诺书）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">①供应商未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">cn/）严重失信主体名单；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">②供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2 供应商不得存在下列情形之一：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）其他：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">法律法规规定的及谈判采购文件约定的其他情形。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3 本次采购不接受联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4、采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.1 如贵单位有意参加谈判采购活动，请在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上免费注册，注册成功后申请成为供应商。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.2 注册完成后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，供应商于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年9月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">08时30分到2026年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及&ldquo;3、供应商资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.3 经采购代理机构确认后，供应商可在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;选择&ldquo;网上支付&rdquo;扫码办理谈判采购文件缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载谈判采购文件。谈判采购文件费用：500元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.4 购买谈判采购文件的发票，待采购代理机构开出后供应商可在平台打印（购买谈判采购文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5、响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5.1 响应文件递交的截止时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年9月15日09时00分</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5.2 递交方式：电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;，未在响应文件递交的截止时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接受。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6、谈判时间</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">递交响应文件的供应商应委派代表准时参加谈判活动。谈判开始时间为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年9月15日09时00分</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，与供应商进行谈判的具体时间在谈判开始后另行通知。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7.1 本项目谈判采购公告仅在中国招标投标公共服务平台（http://www.cebpubservice.com/）、陕西采购与招标网（http://www.sntba.com/）和秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）发出；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台使用方法及技术支持咨询电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com（咨询时间：法定工作日08:30~12:00 13:30~17:30）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-