fy\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目简介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 18.5500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.1 项目名称：文家坡供应站露天货场新建材料棚项目（采购编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">0866-26C1SXQY0609</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 18.5500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.2 采购人：陕西煤业物资有限责任公司彬长分公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 18.5500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.3 采购组织机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 18.5500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.4 项目资金落实情况：企业自筹，出资率100%</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 18.5500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt