 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.3 采购代理机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1.4 采购项目资金落实情况：已落实。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1.5 采购项目概况：本项目为建新煤化地面一、二号瓦斯抽放泵站减速机冷却循环水系统采购及相关配套服务，需为泵站瓦斯抽放泵共8台（四用四备）减速机配置闭式循环冷却水系统两套，实现减速机冷却水的闭式循环冷却与循环利用，每套系统总冷却水量</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">至少</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">需达到</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">21.6m&sup3;/h。系统需具备智能自动化控制能力，可根据减速机运行数量、水量及水温需求自动调整供水循环参数，减速机在各类工况下的冷却效果，提升设备运行可靠性。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1.6 成交供应商数量：一家。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2、采购范围及相关要求</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-par