 style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.6 成交供应商数量：一家。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2、采购范围及相关要求</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1 采购范围：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">汽车装车、火车装车服务：产品采用</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">25kg/袋的包装方式，经由叉车转运，并依靠人工实施卸车与装车作业。铁路空车余煤清扫服务内容包括：在铁路专用线完成卸煤翻车机作业后，对空车线内残留余煤（含冻煤、泥煤）进行人工清理；作业过程中开启的车门须在清扫完毕后关闭并加固；清扫范围不包含未装载煤的空车。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">服务</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">期限</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：自合同签订生效之日起</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1年。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoToaHeading\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">服务地点</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：陕西省渭南市蒲城县蒲城清洁能源化工有限责任公司厂区</span><span style=\"font-famil