; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">榆林化学二期一阶段</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CIF</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">进口设备材料采购合同国内清关运输框架协议</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已具备采购条件，现公开邀请潜在供应商参加</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">公开询比</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购活动。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">一</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、采购项目简介</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.1 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目名称：</span></span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">榆林化学二期一阶段</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CIF</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">进口设备材料采购合同国内清关运输框架协议</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购编号</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26B3SXQY0521</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.2 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购人：</span></span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司榆林分公司</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.3</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购代理机构：</span></span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目资金落实情况：</span></span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已落实。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目概况：</span></span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1500</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万吨</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年煤炭分质清洁高效转化示范项目烯烃、芳烃及深加工工程（以下简称&ldquo;一阶段项目&rdquo;）是在一期项目基础上，通过煤热解、煤</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">半焦气化及下游深加工技术系统集成，进一步拓展和延伸产业链，探索煤基烯烃和煤基芳烃耦合发展的新路径，生产高性能材料、电池电解液溶剂、可降解材料及特种油品等</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">大类高附加值产品，实现煤化工产业高端化、多元化、低碳化发展。按照&ldquo;总体规划、分步实施&rdquo;原则，一阶段项目分为一阶段项目和后续项目。一阶段项目主要建设</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">560</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万吨</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年煤制甲醇、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">148</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万吨</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年甲醇制烯烃及下游深加工装置，生产聚乙烯、聚丙烯、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">EVA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">SAP</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">等</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">类产品合计</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">277</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">万吨</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">成交供应商数量及成交份额：</span></span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">家，</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">成交份额：第一名：</span><u><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">60%</span></span></u><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；第二名：</span><u><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">40%</span></span></u><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、采购范围及相关要求</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购范围：</span></span></strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次采购标的物为陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司二期一阶段项目中所有</span>CIF<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">进口设备材料采购合同国内清关运输服务，包括但不限于进口设备材料的港口清关提货及国内段运输至项目现场指定交货地点的全过程服务，报价包括码头清关理货服务费、港区至掏箱地及集装箱归还装卸运费、港区 </span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">/ </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">掏箱地至榆林化学项目现场内陆运费、运输过程不可预见费，该费用包含服务商的利润。供应商须确保货物安全、准时交付，并协助采购人完成相关单证审核与费用结算工作，以满足项目建设进度要求。具体服务范围、技术标准及商务条款详见</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购文件</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">第五章</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">发包人要求</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及相关附件规定。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目拟选择综合排序前两名的入围供应商与项目业主、采购人签订进口设备国内运输框架协议，第一名获进口设备材料</span>CIF<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购合同总金额的</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">60%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">清关运输额度；第二名获进口设备材料</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CIF</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购合同总金额的</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">40%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">清关运输额度。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务期限：</span></span></strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">自框架协议签订后生效，框架协议执行有效期为合同签订之日起两年</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质量标准：</span></span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次国内清关运输服务需符合国家及行业现行相关标准和规范，且须满足项目建设对货物运输的安全性、时效性要求，保证进口设备、材料运输全程无损坏、无遗失，清关流程合规顺畅，按时交付至项目现场指定地点，若出现运输损坏、延误等问题，中标人需按照合同约定承担相应责任。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三、供应商资格要求</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商依法设立并满足如下要求：</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）供应商须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）供应商必须具有《道路运输经营许可证（含大型物件运输）》、《国际货运代理企业备案表》。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商需提供近年（</span>2021<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至响应截止日）至少</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">份进口设备材料采购合同国内清关运输业绩。有效业绩以合同为准，日期以合同签订时间为准。合同文件需体现：合同首页、服务范围、合同签订时间、双方盖章签字页（可提供技术协议补充合同内容）。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）财务要求：</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商财务资质审查须提供的财务信息由以下两项任选其一：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）有效的基本账户银行出具的资信证明（响应截止前三个月内）；</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年&mdash;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表）。供应商若成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 24.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）信誉要求：</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）供应商未被列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）供应商未被列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商不得存在下列情形之一：</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）法律法规规定的</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">以</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及采购文件约定的其他情形。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3 </span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次采购</span></span><u><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">不接受</span></span></u><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联合体。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">四、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购文件</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的获取</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：</span></span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">从</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">0<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分至</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span>18<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取办法：</span></span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">如贵单位有意参加采购活动，请在</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）上免费注册，注册成功后申请成为供应商。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注册完成后，供应商</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">在上述获取时间内</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">登录</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）上传授权委托书</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">法定代表人及委托代理人身份证。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">经采购代理机构确认后，供应商可在</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">选择</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">网上支付</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">扫码办理采购文件缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载采购文件。采购文件费用：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">300</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">元，售后不退。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">购买采购文件的发票，待采购代理机构开出后供应商可在平台打印（购买采购文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">五、响应文件的递交</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5.1</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：</span></span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">22</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">日</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">09<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分（北京时间）。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5.2</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：</span></span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子文件上传递交到</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，未在</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">响应文件递交截止</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接收。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">六、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">响应文件开启时间和地点</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6.1</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">响应文件开启时间：</span></span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">22</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">日</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">09<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分（北京时间）</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6.2</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">响应文件开启</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">地点</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">通过</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">进行。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">七、发布公告的媒介</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购公告</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中国招标投标公共服务平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西采购与招标公共服务平台</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">上</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">发布。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">八、监督部门：</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">监督部门：陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司榆林分公司物资管理部</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">监督电话：</span>0912-8302862</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">监督邮箱：</span>wgb@smwzyt.com</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">九、异议渠道及方式</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">或其他利害关系人对本</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购公告</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购文件</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">内容有异议的，应在响应文件递交截止时间前</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日内以书面形式</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">邮件发送</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">向</span></span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购人</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提出。提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）异议提出人名称、地址、电话等；</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料；</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章；</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）提出异议的日期。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-alig