00pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">选煤楼栈桥及转运站加固工程</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已具备采购条件，现公开邀请供应商参加谈判采购活动。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">简介</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.1 </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">名称：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">选煤楼栈桥及转运站加固工程</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.2 </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购人：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西陕煤澄合矿业有限公司董家河煤矿分公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.3</span> <span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购代理机构：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西秦源招标有限责公司</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.4</span> <span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资金落实情况：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已落实</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.5 </span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">概况：因</span> 2#<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5# </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">栈桥底板钢筋锈胀外露、混凝土开裂、钢结构锈蚀，通廊顶板、屋面梁钢筋锈蚀；转运站部分梁底、板底钢筋锈胀外露，局部板底开洞，结构可靠性不满足国家标准，严重威胁安全生产，难以正常使用。现需实施整治：拆除混凝土构件</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">64.85m&sup3;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、浇筑混凝土构件</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">175.93m&sup3;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，金属面除锈刷漆</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">385.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">㎡，抹灰面翻新</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">294.58</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">㎡，更换栏杆</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">36.64m</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、门窗</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">80</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">樘</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.6</span> <span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">成交供应商数量及成交份额：一家</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span> <span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购范围及相关要求</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购范围：包括拆除混凝土构件、浇筑混凝土构件、金属面除锈刷油、抹灰面翻新、栏杆更换、门窗更换等工程</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">详见第五章</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购需求</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">计划工期：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">90</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日历天</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">建设地点：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西省渭南市澄城县</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">董家河煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质量要求：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">达到现行国家及行业质量验收合格标准，并满足谈判采购文件中规定的各项技术要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商资格要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商应依法设立且满足如下要求：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">(1)</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商必须是</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">建筑</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">工程施工总承包</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">级及以上资质，具有有效的安全生产许可证。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">(2)</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务要求</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（以下两个条件二选一）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提供经审计的</span>2025<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年度财务审计报告</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">须包括审计报告正文签字盖章页、资产负债、利润表、现金流量表、并附审计机构营业执照、会计师事务所执业证书、注册会计师执业证书</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提供基本账户银行出具的资信证明</span>(<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">自</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后出具</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及银行开户许可证</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">或银行基本账户证明资料</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">(3)<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">须提供近年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">自</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日起至</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">响应文件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">递交截止日期</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">加固修缮整治工程业绩</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">份</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">有效业绩以合同为准，有效时间以合同签订日期为准。合同文件需体现</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同期限、合同签订时间及双方盖章签字页。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">(</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">)<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">由</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提供加盖公章的承诺书</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及项目负责人基本信息应在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;陕西省（或全国）建筑市场监管公共服务平台&rdquo;可查询。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">(</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">)</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人员</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">要求：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目负责人（项目经理）须具有</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">建筑</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工程专业二级及以上注册建造师资格，具有有效的《安全生产考核合格证书》（</span>B<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">类），并提供由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后连续</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商不得存在下列情形之一：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位同时参加本采购项目的谈判。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）电子响应文件检测后</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">MAC</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地址或加密信息两家及以上单位相同的情形。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>5<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）供应商响应保证金从同一账户汇出或显示汇入同一子账号。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>6<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）法律法规规定的其他情形。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次采购不接受联合体。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购文件的获取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.1 </span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">有意参加谈判采购活动的单位，</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">请于</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2026年0</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">01</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日至</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年0</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">04</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">日（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8:30至17:30）,购买采购文件。采购文件每套售价500元，售后不退</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.2</span> <span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目通过</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">(https://qyzb.shccmg.coml)<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提供供应商注册、获取采购文件、递交响应文件、澄清说明和补正等功能。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台使用方法及技术支持咨询电话：</span>400-685-1179<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">qyebidding@163.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；咨询日期：法定工作日；咨询时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08:30~12:00 13:30~17:30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">响应文件的递交</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5.1 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">响应文件递交的截止时</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">间为</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2026年09月11日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; mso-font-width: 100%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">09时00分（北京时间</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-wrap: simple; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5.2 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交地址</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商请于响应文件递交截止时间前登录</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">(https://qyzb.shccmg.com</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">进入响应文件递交页面。供应商的电脑和网络环境应按照平台要求。电子响应文件逾期上传或上传未成功</span>,<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购人拒收响应文件（平台自动关闭上传端口</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。采购人温馨提醒，为避免近响应截止时间网络拥堵，建议供应商适当提前上传时间。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">谈判时间和地点</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">谈判时间与</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交响</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">应文件的截止时间为同一时间，</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开启会议</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">通过</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>http://qyzb.shccmg.com/<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">网上进行</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商须用加密方式对上传的响应文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面谈判，供应商无需到场，允许供应商通过远程方式进行开启解密。开启会议期间供应商须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由供应商自行承担</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">发布公告的媒介</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目采购公告同时在</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span>http://www.cebpubservice.com/<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）、陕西采购与招标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://www.sntba.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）及秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">上发布（注：如不同平台公告发布截止时间不一致，以陕西采购与招标网发布的截止时间为准）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: 