 style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">1</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">、 采购项目简介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">1.1 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">采购项目名称：</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">长安益阳发电有限公司专家进班组和班组安健环标准化建设咨询服务。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 24.0pt; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0gd; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">1.2 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">采购人：</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">长安益阳发电有限公司 </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 24.0pt; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0gd; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">1.3 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">采购编号<span lang=\"EN-US\">:</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"> <a><span style=\"color: windowtext; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">0866-26C3SXQY0605</span></a></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 24.0pt; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0gd; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">1.4 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">采购组织机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 24.0pt; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0gd; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">1.5 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">采购项目资金落实情况：企业自筹，出资率<span lang=\"EN-US\">100%</span>。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">1.6 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">采购项目概况：为落实上级安全生产治本攻坚部署，全面提升基层班组安全风险防控能力，夯实安全生产基层基础，长安益阳发电有限公司拟开展班组安健环标准化建设暨<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>专家进班组<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>专项工作，通过第三方专业机构提供全流程技术服务，实现班组安全能力与标准化水平双提升，坚决杜绝安全生产事故，保障公司安全生产形势持续稳定。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">1.7 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">成交供应商数量及成交份额：一家</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">，成交份额<span lang=\"EN-US\">100%</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 150%; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">2</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">、采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">2.1 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">采购范围：覆盖长安益阳发电有限公司<span lang=\"EN-US\">25</span>个基层班组，包含检修班组、生产运行班组、长协外委班组，实现班组安全提升全覆盖、无死角。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">2.2 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">服务期限：</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">合同签订生效后<span lang=\"EN-US\">15</span>个月。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">2.3 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">项目地点：湖南省益阳市黄泥湖区仑塘村长安益阳发电有限公司。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 150%; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">、供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 24.0pt; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0gd; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">3.1 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">供应商须依法设立且满足如下要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 24.0pt; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0gd; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">3.1.1</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">资质要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">供应商</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人单位。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.1.2</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">业绩要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">供应商需提供自<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日至谈判截止时间内（以合同签订时间为准）一份及以上发电或电网企业安全管理体系咨询服务的合同业绩（需提供合同首页、主要内容页、双方盖章签字页）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.1.3</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">人员要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">项目负责人要求：须具备注册安全工程师执业资格证书或高级工程师技术职称，在班组安全建设领域具有丰富工作经验。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.1.4</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">信誉要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK5\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商未列入信用中国<span lang=\"EN-US\">(https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/)</span>严重失信主体名单（以供应商加盖公章的承诺书或网站截图为准为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统<span lang=\"EN-US\">(https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/)</span>严重违法失信名单<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>黑名单<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>信息（以供应商加盖公章的承诺书或网站截图为准）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.1.5</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">其他要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本项目谈判，</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">否则相关谈判均无效</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.2 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">供应商不得存在下列情形之一：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.2.1</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.2.2</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.3 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">本次采购不接受联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 150%; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">4</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">、采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 24.0pt; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0gd; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.1</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">获取时间：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">年<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">31</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分至<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">4.2</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">请供应商登录秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">）购买电子文件。未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;供应商注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;常用文件&mdash;供应商操作手册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">4.3</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">已注册的供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;供应商登录&rdquo;请将加盖单位公章的法人授权委托书（附法定代表人、委托代理人身份证复印件）上传。潜在供应商应及时关注、查阅秦源招标电子招标平台。因未及时查看导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">4.4</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">潜在供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台购买采购文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载采购文件。采购文件每套售价：<span lang=\"EN-US\">500</span>元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">4.5</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">潜在供应商支付采购文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票（采购文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">4.6</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">已注册的潜在供应商若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">4.7</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">有关注册、下载采购文件、上传电子响应文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">400-685-1179</span>，邮箱：<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyebidding@163.com</span>。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">08:30-12:00 13</span>：<span lang=\"EN-US\">30-17:30</span>。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 150%; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">5</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">、响应文件的递交：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">5.1</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">响应文件递交的截止时</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>日上午<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分（北京时间）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">5.2</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">响应文件递交方式：电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，未在谈判开始时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接受。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 150%; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">6</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">、谈判时间和地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">6.1</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">谈判开始时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>日上午<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分（北京时间）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">6.2</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">谈判地点及方式：湖南省长沙市天心区新姚南路<span lang=\"EN-US\">222</span>号立达人酒店八楼会议室，本<span style=\"color: black;\">次谈判通过<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>秦源招标电子招标平台<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>网上进行，供应商需携带笔记本电脑到达谈判现场。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 150%; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">7</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">、发布公告的媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">本次谈判采购公告</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">仅在</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">&ldquo;<span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"http://www.cebpubservice.com/\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: windowtext; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">中国招标投标公共服务平台 (http://www.cebpubservice.com/)</span></span></a></span>、陕西采购与招标网（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://www.sntba.com/announcement?id=35&amp;page=1&amp;tab=40</span>）和秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span>）&rdquo;发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 150%; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">8</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10