: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #221e1f; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0866-26B2SXQY0514</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #221e1f; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西陕煤协创达新材料有限公司聚烯烃弹性体（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">POR）工业化示范项目低压开关柜（含低压母线槽）采购已具备采购条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕西陕煤协创达新材料有限公司委托，现</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">公开邀请供应商参加询比采购活动</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">一</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、采购项目简介</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.1 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目名称：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">聚烯烃弹性体（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">POR</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）工业化示范项目低压开关柜（含低压母线槽）采购</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购编号</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0866-26B2SXQY0514</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.2 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购人：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西陕煤协创达新材料有限公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购代理机构：</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资金落实情况：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">已落实。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1.5</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目概况：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">根据聚烯烃弹性体（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">POR）工业化示范项目装置厂前区变配电需求，结合低压开关柜（含低压母线槽）的技术规格书等相关内容，现对21台低压开关柜(含低压母线槽)进行采购</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1.6 </span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">成交供应商数量及成交份额：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">一家。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">二、采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.1 </span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购范围：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商负责低压开关柜</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(含低压母线槽)的制造、供货、检验和试验、包装和运输装卸、现场指导安装、现场指导调试和测试、配合系统开车、技术培训、质保期服务、售后服务及提供与其配套的安装操作及维修所需的备品备件、专用工具和技术资料等为完成本项目的全部工作内容。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.2</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">交货期</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">自合同签订生效之日起</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3个月内。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.3 </span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">质保期：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本设备的质量保证期为待设备调试完毕性能验收合格后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">12个月或到货验收完毕18个月，以先到时间为准（由于供应商原因未通过性能验收除外）。在质保期间，如需更换某一零部件，此零部件的质保期从更换之日起重新计算。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.4</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">交货</span></strong><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">地点：</span></strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕西省渭南市蒲城县渭北煤化工业园区。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.2500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.5 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">货</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">物质量标准或主要技术性能指标：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">符合国家及行业相关规范要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">三、供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1 供应商依法设立并满足如下要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资质要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商必须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件，投标人拟投标产品须出具型式试验报告及国家强制性产品认证证书；非制造商投标须提供制造商针对本项目的唯一有效授权书</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">财务要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">以下方式二选一</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1）供应商提供经审计的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2025年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">度</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">财务审计报告</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(须包括审计报告正文签字盖章页、资产负债、利润表、现金流量表、并附审计机构营业执照、会计师事务所执业证书、注册会计师执业证书)。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2）供应商提供基本账户银行出具的资信证明(自2026年5月1日以后出具)及银行开户许可证(或银行基本账户证明资料)</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">业绩要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1）当供应商为制造商时，须提供近年（2023年1月1日至投标截止日期）至少2份拟投标产品的供货业绩，有效业绩以合同为准。其中合同文件需体现：合同首页、主要工作范围页、技术参数、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页，可提供技术协议补充合同内容。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2）当供应商为代理商时，则须提供近年（2023年1月1日至投标截止日期）至少2份拟投标产品的供货业绩。该业绩可以是代理商自身作为卖方签订的合同，也可以是所代理品牌的制造商作为卖方签订的合同。有效业绩以签署完毕的合同文件为准，合同文件须至少包含合同首页、供货范围、供货数量、技术指标、合同签订时间、双方盖章签字页、证明业绩有效的其他关键信息等（可提供相关技术协议作为补充材料）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）信誉要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1）供应商未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2）供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3）供应商未列入陕煤集团建设项目失信供应商名单；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5）承担本项目的主要人员要求：无</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6）其他要求：无</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商不得存在下列情形之一：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>2<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>3<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位同时参加本采购项目的</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">询比</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>4<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）电子响应文件检测后</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">MAC</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地址或加密信息两家及以上单位相同的情形。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span>5<span s