o-bookmark: _Hlk79872225;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk109421235;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">业绩要求：供应商须提供自<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日至响应文件递交的截止时间内至少具有<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>份火电机组安全阀校验的业绩，并附合同扫描件（扫描件必须提供合同正文首页、签字盖章页及能证明工作范围等信息的页面）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk79872225;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><a name=\"_Hlk148452022\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">3.1.3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk79872225;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk148452022;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">信誉要求<a name=\"_Hlk92456497\"></a>：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Courier New\'; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商未列入&ldquo;信用中国（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https:</span>／<span lang=\"EN-US\">/www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span>）&rdquo;严重失信主体名单（以供应商加盖单位公章的承诺书为准）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Courier New\'; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）供应商未列入&ldquo;国家企业信用信息公示系统（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span>）&rdquo;严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息（以供应商加盖单位公章的承诺书为准）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">3.2</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">供应商不得存在下列情形之一：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）其他：被列入陕煤集团&ldquo;建设项目失信供应商名单&rdquo;且在公布期内。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">3.3</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">本次采购不接受联合体</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk53649150\"></a><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">4</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Hlk53649298\"></a><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">4.1</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">有意参加询比采购活动的供应商，请于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">31</span>日至<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>日，每日上午<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>时至<span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span>时，下午<span lang=\"EN-US\">14</span>时至<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>时（北京时间，下同），登录<a name=\"_Hlk204008035\"></a>秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）购买采购文件。未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;常用文件&mdash;投标人操作手册。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">4.2</span></strong></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">已注册的潜在供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;投标人登录&rdquo;请将法人授权委托书、法人身份证、委托人身份证正反面复印件、委托代理人姓名、手机号码所有资料扫描以<span lang=\"EN-US\">PDF</span>文件形式上传。潜在供应商应及时关注、查阅秦源招标电子招标平台。因未及时查看导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">4.3</span></strong></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">经采购组织机构确认后，供应商通过秦源招标电子招标平台缴纳采购文件费，缴费完毕即可在平台下载采购文件。采购文件每套售价<span lang=\"EN-US\">500</span>元，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">4.4</span></strong></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">潜在供应商支付采购文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票（文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">4.5</span></strong></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">已注册的潜在供应商若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">5</span></strong></span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk53649359\"></a><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">5.1</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649359;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">响应文件递交的截止时间为<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">11</span>日上午<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分，地点为秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）。供应商应于响应截止时间前通过秦源招标电子招标平台递交所有响应文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649359;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">5.2 </span></strong></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649359;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">逾期送达的、未送达指定地点的响应文件，采购人将拒绝接收</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649359;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">6</span></strong></span><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">响应文件开启时间和地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk82017544\"></a><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">响应文件开启在响应文件递交截止时间的同一时间进行，地点为秦源招标电子招标平台上进行，供应商应提前<span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>分钟登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与会议。供应商未参加在线开启会议的，视为默认开启结果。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk82017544;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">7</span></strong></span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">发布公告的媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk82017622\"></a><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">本询比采购公告同时在中国招标投标公共服务平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.cebpubservice.com</span>）、陕西采购与招标网（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.sntba.com</span>）、秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）上发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk82017622;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">8</span></strong></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk82017622;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">其他</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk82017622;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">本项目的监督部门为陕煤电力信阳有限公司经营管理部</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk82017622;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体