t-size: 10.5000pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 10.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）凡有意参加</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">谈判</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">者，登录秦源招标电子招标平台（</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">qyzb.shccmg.com）购买</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">采购</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">文件。未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注册</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;常用文件&mdash;供应商操作手册。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 10.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）已注册的供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;供应商登录&rdquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">请将加盖单位公章的授权委托书、法定代表人及委托代理人身份证的</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">所有资料合成一个</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">PDF上传</span></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。潜在</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">应及时关注、查阅秦源招标电子招标平台。因未及时查看导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 10.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">经采购机构确认后，潜在供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台购买采购文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载采购文件。采购文件每套售价：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">00元，售后不退。购买采购文件的发</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">票，供应商可在平台自行申请并打印（采购文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票，开具时间：本项目结束之后）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: