font-family: 宋体;\">sxqygjb@126.com</span></span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26D3SXQY0341',NULL,NULL,'陕煤物资商城平台设计与搭建项目','陕西煤业物资有限责任公司','2026-08-27 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097378863652933634,'','2026-09-10 09:35:04','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕西龙门钢铁有限责任公司炼钢6#转炉炉体装配邀请公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/2ywgg/20260826/1277300970073620480.html','2ebf3979e9053f7b792c139f92596da99e48cc210a1e01743c34a56de44cd322',NULL,'HTML','<h1 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">第一章</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">谈判采购邀请书</span></span></strong></h1>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></u><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西龙门钢铁有限责任公司炼钢</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6#转炉炉体装配已具备采购条件，现邀请贵公司参加谈判采购活动。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">一、采购项目简介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1.1 采购项目名称：炼钢6#转炉炉体装配（谈判采购编号：0866-26B2SXQY0313）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1.2 采购人：陕西龙门钢铁有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1.3 采购项目资金落实情况：已落实。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1.4 采购项目概况：陕西龙门钢铁有限责任公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">炼钢厂</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6#转炉炉壳及下悬挂装置已连续投用十余年，历经长期高温工况、周期性倾动载荷及热应力交变作用，设备整体老化、疲劳损伤较为突出，对转炉安全稳定运行、倾动机构可靠性及生产连续性构成隐患。为彻底消除设备缺陷，保障安全生产、满足工艺运行要求，现计划对6#转炉炉壳及下悬挂装置进行整体更换。炼钢6#转炉炉体装配</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">主要包括：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">炉壳</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1套，炉壳挡座1套，炉壳吊挂座4套，挡渣裙板及支撑架1套、</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">炉口法兰、上锥段（炉帽</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">炉帽冷却水</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">管）、炉身圆柱段、下锥段及炉底等部分组成。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1.5 成交供应商数量及成交份额：1家，比例100%。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">二、采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.1 采购范围：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">炼钢</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6#转炉炉体装配主要包括：炉壳1套，炉壳挡座1套，炉壳吊挂座4套，挡渣裙板及支撑架1套、炉口法兰、上锥段（炉帽、炉帽冷却水管）、炉身圆柱段、下锥段及炉底等部分组成；投标人负责拟投标设备的设计、制造、检验、试验、包装、运输、必要的附件、备品备件及专用工位器具、技术资料（包括出厂检验合格证、制造总图、部件图/易损件图纸、设备装配图及装配检验记录、材质报告、</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">设备操作规程、日常维护保养手册等；图纸资料须配备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CAD版本和蓝图</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">），负责现场焊接拼装所涉及的焊接材料、设备、工位器具并提供相应的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">焊缝探伤检测报告（委托符合国家资</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">质要求的第三方检测机构出具</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）及退火报告，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">指导安装、调试、人员培训与服务并配合完成整套设备性能考核验收、售后服务及质保期内的维修和保养等为实施本项目所需的全部工作内容，详见本项目发包人要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.2 </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">交货期：合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">120日历天。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.3质保期：整套设备安装调试验收合格后12个月或货到现场后18个月，以先到时间为准。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.4 质量：所供货</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">物符合国家及行业现行质量验收标准合格等级</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.5 项目地点：陕西省韩城市龙门镇龙钢公司。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">三、资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.1资质要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">须是中华人民共和国境内依法注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.2人员要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">焊工</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2名：须提供有效的特种作业安全管理和作业人员证（熔化焊接与热切割作业），以上人员须为本单位在册职工，须提供社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料（2025年6月1日起连续5个月)。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3.3财务要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">须提供（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&mdash;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年连续三年）经</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">会计师事务所</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">至少</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">包含审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表），若投标人成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">业绩要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">须</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提供近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">0</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日至投标截止日期）不少于</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2份转炉炉体</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">含</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">炉壳）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">供货</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">业绩</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（转炉公称容量</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ge;100吨）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">有效业绩以合同复印件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同对应增值税发票（至少提供合同总金额</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">30%以上发票，合同金额及发票均不得涂抹、遮挡）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">为准，业绩的有效时间以合同签订时间为准，合同文件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">须</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">包含</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">：合同首页、供货范围、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">公称容量、合同金额、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">签订时间、双方盖章签字页（可提供技术协议作为</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">合同</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">补充材料）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.5、信誉要求（下列要求均由</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">供应商</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">提供加盖公章的承诺书）：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未列入信用中国</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/)严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/)严重违法失信名单(黑名单)</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.6、其他要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本招标项目的投标，本项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">不接受非制造商投标</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">，项目审核方式为资格后审。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">四、谈判文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：从</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年8月26日下午16时00分至2026年8月31日18时00分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取办法：凡有意参加者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html）&rdquo;下载采购文件，采购文件每套500元，售后不退，谈判结束后仅提供电子普票。具体操作步骤如下：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行供应商（供应商）注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取参与资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，点击【资料审核】，进入资料审核页面，上传授权委托书、法定代表人及委托代理人身份证等资料，点击【提交】后按系统提示下载采购文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）有关注册、下载采购文件、上传电子响应文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00 13:30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下载网址：秦源招标一期、二期电子招投标系统的供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/供应商操作手册及开标注意事项https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">五、响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.1递交截止时间：2026年9月4日9时00分（北京时间）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.2递交方式：电子文件上传递交至&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，未在谈判开始时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接收。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">六、谈判开始时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.1谈判开始时间：2026年9月4日9时00分（北京时间）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.2谈判地点及方式：本次谈判通过&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;网上进行。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目谈判采购公告在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;中国招标投标公共服务平台&rdquo;&ldquo;陕西采购与招标网&rdquo;和&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">八、监督部门</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\"margin-right: 2.4000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 2.1500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.2000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.1800gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西龙门钢铁有限责任公司招标办，监督电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0913-5182358，监督邮箱：lggszbb666@163.com。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextFirstIndent\" style=\