pan style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">用煤仓直径：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&Phi;4700mm</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">清仓作业行程：</span>600mm</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电机功率</span> 7.5kW</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作半径：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">7.5m，安装后清仓机尺寸：长宽高8000&times;800&times;3300mm，尺寸误差不得大于3%</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">因井下空间有限，钻机尺寸不得超过：长</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1105mm宽800mm高2242mm</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">钻与清仓机共用一套动力单元</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">其他技术参数</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">具体详见第五章</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">需求</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.2 交货期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">15天。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.3 质保期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">12个月。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.4 交货地点：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">陕西省咸阳市长武县亭口镇</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司生产服务中心。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.5 货物质量标准或主要技术性能指标：详见采购需求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">3、供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 18.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">应是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立的企业法人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">须具有有效的营业执照；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 18.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Hlk92988356\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">供应商须提供相应产品的矿用产品安全标志证书、气体防爆一级证；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 18.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">须提供</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">近三年（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">02</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日至递交</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">谈判响应</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">文件截止日期</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">以来（以合同签订时间为准）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">类似项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3份及以上</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">（如为刚</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">承接</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">的项目，应提供中标通知书</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">（或成交通知书）；如为正在实施或已完</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">成的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">项目，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">提供显示以上业绩项目名称、合同服务范围、合同签订时间页及双方盖章签字页）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">未被</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">列入</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">&ldquo;信用中国&rdquo;（www.creditchina.gov.cn）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">严重失信主体名单</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">5供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单信息</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">法定代表人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">本次谈判采购</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">本项目不接受</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">代理商、不接受</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4、采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.1获取时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">25</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">0分至2026年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">31</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日下午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">0分。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">请有意参与本项目谈判的供应商</span><a name=\"_Hlk117178301\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在规定时间通过秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">qyzb.shccmg.com）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">购买采购文件。未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;供应商/投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;常用文件&mdash;供应商操作手册。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已注册的供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;供应商登录&rdquo;请将加盖单位公章的法人授权委托书（附法定代表人、委托代理人身份证复印件）及上述&ldquo;3、供应商资格要求&rdquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">的</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">所有</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">资料合成一个</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">PDF</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">上传。潜在</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">应及时关注、查阅秦源招标电子招标平台。因未及时查看导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">经采购组织机构确认后，潜在供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台购买采购文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载采购文件。采购文件每套售价：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">800元，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">潜在供应商支付采购文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票（采购文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票，下载时间：本项目结束之后）。若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">已注册的潜在供应商若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注：本项目所有程序均在秦源采购电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">qyzb.shccmg.com）进行操作执行，如有疑问请致电平台客服电话：400-685-1179</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left