-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西煤业物资榆通有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%。项目</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">已具备采购条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西煤业物资榆通有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">委托，现公开邀请供应商参加谈判采购活动，相关事项告知如下：</span></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc21704\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购项目简介</span></strong></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK14\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.1采购项目名称：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">红柳林矿矿用胶带机声纹检测系统采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（采购编号</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">0866-26E2SXQY0801</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">），本项</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">目共划分</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">个包次。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000