so-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">公开邀请供应商参加询比采购活动</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，相关事项告知如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">一、采购项目简介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1、采购项目名称：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">井下探放水工程</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（采购编号：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0866-26E3SXQY0822</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2、采购人：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">采购机构</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4、采购项目资金落实情况：企业自筹，比例100%。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5、采购项目概况：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">详见第五章采购需求</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6、成交供应商数量以及成交份额：一家，100%</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二、采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">采购范围：根据</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">红柳林</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2026年井下采掘安排部署，计划实施采掘工作面探放水工作，主要内容如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）可能存在的积水井巷、老空或相邻煤矿；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）接近含水层、导水断层等；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）接近河流、水库、蓄水池、水井等相通的导水通道；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）接近可能有出水的钻孔；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5）水文地质条件不清的区域；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6）其他可能存在水害隐患的区域。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">注：工程量根据地质情况结合实际需要而确定，以最终验收为准</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，具体内容以第五章采购需求为准。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务期：服务期</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1年，自2026年9月26日开始，2027年9月25日结束</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">三、供应商资格要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.1 供应商应满足如下要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）依法设立：供应商须为中华人民共和国境内合法注册的独立法人企业或其他组织机构，企业法人提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）资质要求：具有有效的地质灾害治理工程施工甲级资质证书及安全生产许可证</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）业绩要求：供应商须提供2023年1月1日至询比截止</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">时间</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">类似业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">不少于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">份</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">，</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">证明材料以合同及合同对应的任意一张增值税发票为准，合同至少包含合同首页、签订日期、合同内容及双方盖章页，有效业绩时间以合同签订日期为准。</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）信誉要求：具有良好的社会信誉，未被国家企业信用信息公示系统（http://www.gsxt.gov.cn/index.html）列入严重违法失信名单（黑名单）；未被列入&ldquo;信用中国&rdquo;（http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单（以上条款提供承诺书或相关证明材料）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5）人员要求：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">拟派项目负责人须具备地质或水文地质或物探专业高级（含）以上技术职称，且为本单位职工（提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2025年10月后不少于6个月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本单位</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">为其缴纳的社保</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">或医保</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">证明）</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.2 供应商不得存在下列情形之一（提供承诺书或相关证明材料）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形。</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.3 本次采购不接受联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">四、采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.1如贵单位有意参加参加询比采购活动</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">请</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">于</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">25</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">上</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">午</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时至</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">28</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日下午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时内登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;网址为：（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）下载</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">询比</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">采购文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行供应商注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取参与资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书及&ldquo;三、供应商资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件，点击【提交】。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）有关注册、下载</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">询比</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购文件、上传电子文件等有关问题可咨询</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00，13：30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标二期电子招标系统的供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/供应商操作手册及开标注意事项：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">询比</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购文件费用：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">500元，通过秦源招标电子招标平台支付，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.3购买</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">询比</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">采购文件的发票，待采购机构开出后</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">供应商可在平台打印（购买</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">询比</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">采购文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4询比</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">采购文件获取不足三家时，本次采购活动终止，重新发布</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">询比</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">采购公告。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">五、响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5.1递交截止时间：2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5.2递交方式：将电子文件上传递交至&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，未在</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">询比</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">开始时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接收。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">六、询比时间和地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6.1询比开始时间：2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6.2询比地点：秦源招标电子招标平台。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">七、发布公告的媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本询比采购公告在</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">中国招标投标公共服务平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.cebpubservice.com/）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西采购与招标网（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.sntba.com）及秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）上同时发布</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000