"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为确保塌陷区群众能够正常开展生产活动，本年度计划对部分塌陷区损毁土地进行裂缝充填</span>+<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">表土剥离、</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">回覆</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">应急治理工程。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">成交供应商数量及成交份额：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">家，比例</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt 