0%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">系</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">人：招标一部</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">常女士</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 12.0000pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0912-8302848 18</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">192595105</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 10.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">邮</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">570966851@qq.com</span></span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26A2SXQY0850',NULL,NULL,'1.1采购项目名称：储运工厂翻车机专用备件框架协议采购','陕煤集团榆林化学有限责任公司','2026-08-20 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097379107048394754,'','2026-09-10 09:35:04','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司榆林分公司曹家滩矿井下排水管网优化项目采购询比采购公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/2ywgg/20260820/1275115283329056768.html','2b918e88c4ba6601e2a62bdfcfc9fda4427d75b68b6bd74825cfd48ea339ca1f',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; break-after: avoid; line-height: 150%; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 18pt;\">询比采购公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">曹家滩矿井下排水管网优化项目采购，采购人为陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司榆林分公司，项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%。项目</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">已</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具备采购条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司榆林分公司委托，现公开邀请供应商参加询比采购活动，相关事项告知如下：</span><u></u></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购项目简介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1.1采购项目名称：曹家滩矿井下排水管网优化项目采购（采购编号：0866-26E2SXQY0799）</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.2釆购人：陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司榆林分公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.3釆</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">购机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">釆购项目资金落实情况：企业自筹，比例</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%</span></span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购项目概况：本项目为曹家滩矿业智能化改造</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，针对矿井多条顺槽、回撤通道、切眼等区域离散排水点、壁墙放水点、自吸泵及配采水仓，开展集中监测控制系统升级改造，包含</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">06排水点优化改造及顺槽综合保护器</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">指导</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">安装。项目配套部署矿用</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">PLC控制箱、各类传感器、AI摄像仪、气动阀门及全套线缆辅材，搭建地面智能监控平台，具备远程启停控制、AI视频智能分析、故障预警、数据统计分析、多系统信息融合功能，可实现与矿井综合管控平台、钉钉平台无缝对接及泵房联动报警。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6成交供应商数量及成交份额：一家，100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1采购范围：供应商负责所供设备的设计、制造、检验、试验、包装、运输（装卸）、随机标准附件、备品备件及专用工具、技术资料、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">指导</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">安装、调试、试运转、人员培训与服务并配合完成整套设备性能考核验收、售后服务及质保期内的维修和保养等为实施本项目所需的全部工作内容，具体内容及要求详见询比采购文件第五章采购需求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">交货期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供方在签订合同后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">90个日历日到货</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">交货地点：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">曹家滩煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4质保期：设备安装运行验收合格后1年，或设备到矿后18个月，先到为准。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; break-after: avoid; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc219\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商应满足如下要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\" align=\"justify\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（1）</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">依法设立</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">必须具有独立法人资格的生产厂家或集成商，提供加载统一社会信用代码的营业执照或事业单位法人证书，提供开户许可证或基本存款账户信息证明材料。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\" align=\"justify\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（2）</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资质要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购主要</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">产品（矿用本安型信号转换器、矿用隔爆兼本安型</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">PLC控制箱、矿用本安型液位传感器、矿用本安型振动温度传感器、矿用本安型图像处理摄像仪、矿用</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">浇封兼本安型直流稳压电源）需具有相应产品的煤矿安全标志证书</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）财务要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">必须提供（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年-2025年）连续三年经第三方审计的财务报告，若公司成立时间不足三年，可提供成立之后年份经第三方审计的财务报告。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）业绩要</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">应具有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">近年（</span>2023年1月1日至询比采购截止日期，有效时间以合同签订日期为准）至少3份类似项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（智能化）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">业绩，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">生产厂家或集成商参加时均需提供自身销售业绩，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">业绩以合同文件为准，合同文件需体现：合同首页、金额、供货范围、签订时间、双方签字盖章页等（可提供技术协议补充）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5）</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">信誉要求</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">未被国家企业信用信息公示系统</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.gsxt.gov.cn/index.html）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">列入严重违法失信名单</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">黑名单</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">未被列入</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">信用中国</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo;（http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">严重失信主体名单。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）其他要求：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">法定代表人为同一个人的两个及两个以上法人，母公司、全资子公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 0.0000pt; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">及其控股公司，都不得同时参与询比采购。</span><s></s></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-left: 24.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商不得存在下列情形之一：（提供承诺书或相关证明材料）</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本次采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">不</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">接受联合体</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">参与</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; break-after: avoid; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc25004\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.1获取时间</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">从</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">21</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时00分至2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">26</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">00分。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.2获取方式</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">凡有意参加</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台(https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html)&rdquo;下载</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">文件，具体操作步骤如下</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">(1)登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">注册</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">(2)注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书及</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;三、供应商资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件，点击【提交】按系统提示下载</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">文件，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">文件售价</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">500元/套，售后不退，项目结束后在秦源招标电子平台下载增值税电子普通发票</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">(3)本项目采用全流程电子</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">化采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">方式，潜在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商不需要使用及购买</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CA锁</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">(4)有关注册、下载</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">文件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">400-685-1179，邮箱</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">法定工作日，咨询时间</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">08</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">30-12</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">00，13</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">30-17</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">30。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">下载网址</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1)秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的供应商/供应商操作手册及开标注意事</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt