; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购项目名称：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">柠条塔矿零散点排水自动化控制设备项目采购（采购编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0866-26E2SXQY0800）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">釆购人：陕西煤业物资榆通有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">釆</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">机构：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">釆购项目资金落实情况：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">企业自筹，比例</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购项目概况：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本项目为陕煤集团神木柠条塔矿井下零散排水系统自动化改造</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，适用于煤矿井下爆炸危险环境。项目针对矿井多条巷道共计</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">64处零散积水点及多处中转水仓排水设备开展智能化升级，配套布设各类矿用防爆控制设备、传感监测装置、摄像设备及线缆设施。项目无需新建软件系统，所有设备数据需接入矿井现有零散排水智能控制系统，实现水泵多模式控制、智能联动、数据监测、视频监控及设备健康管理等功能。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6成交供应商数量及成交份额：一家，100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1采</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">购范围：对井下</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">N1213辅运顺槽至N1223排水措施巷（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">000米）52处零散积水点、南翼2-2煤西区排水措施巷至南翼2-2煤西区辅运巷12处零散积水的点（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">000米）进行自动控制升级，实现对零散排水设备状态远程监测、水泵控制、运行分析功能，直观</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">反映</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">井下零散排水状态，辅助管理决策。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">对</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">S1231中转污水仓（3台离心泵）、S1229中转清水仓（2台离心泵）、西区</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">43</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">00米排水巷（2台离心泵）、北翼西大巷中转清水仓（2台离心泵）、北翼西大巷污水仓（2台离心泵）、北翼污水处理站（2台供水离心泵）、东区回撤通道清水仓（4台离心泵）、进行智能化改造。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">包括设计、采购、运输、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">指导</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">安装调试、技术服务、人员培训、整套系统的性能保证、售后服务、竣工验收等为实施本项目所需的全部工作内容，具体内容及要求详见</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购文件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">第五章</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购需求</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">交货期</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">40个工作日内供货到矿</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">交货地点：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">柠条塔煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4质保期：安装调试合格后12个月。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; break-after: avoid; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc219\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商应满足如下要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\" align=\"justify\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（1）</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">依法设立</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">必须具有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">独立法人资格的生产厂家，并提供加载统一社会信用代码的营业执照或事业单位法人证书、提供开户许可证或基本存款账户信息证明材料。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（2）</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资质要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">必须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">矿用隔爆兼本安型可编程控制箱、矿用隔爆型电源箱、矿用本质安全型摄像仪</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">煤矿安全标志证书。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">业绩要求：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">应具有近年（自</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年1月1日至</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">询比采购</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">截止日期）至少</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">一</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">项</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">类似项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">业绩（业绩以合同为准，合同必须有双方盖章页、首页、供货清单，合同内容清晰，甲乙双方盖章完整，有效业绩时间以合同签订时间为准）。</span><s></s></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">信誉要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未被国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.gsxt.gov.cn/index.html）列入严重违法失信名单（黑名单）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；未被列入</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;信用中国&rdquo;（http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">其他要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">法定代表人为同一个人的两个及两个以上法人，母公司、全资子公司及其控股公司，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">都不得同时参与询比采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商不得存在下列情形之一：（提供承诺书或相关证明材料）</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本次采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">不接受</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; break-after: avoid; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc25004\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.1获取时间：从2026年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">21</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时00分至2026年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">26</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.2获取方式：凡有意参加询比采购者请在上述时间内登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台(https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html)&rdquo;下载询比采购文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">(1)登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行供应商注册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">(2)注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取询比采购资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书及&ldquo;三、供应商资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件，点击【提交】按系统提示下载询比采购文件，询比采购文件售价：500元/套，售后不退，项目结束后在秦源招标电子平台下载增值税电子普通发票；</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">(3)本项目采用全流程电子化采购方式，潜在供应商不需要使用及购买CA锁；</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">(4)有关注册、下载询比采购文件；加密、上传电子申请文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08：30-12：00，13：30-17：30。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1)秦源招标二期电子招投标系统的供应商/供应商操作手册及开标注意事项：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2)秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888594722560.html。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.4获取</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购文件的潜在供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">不足三家时，本次采购活动终止，采购人重新组织采购。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; break-after: avoid; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc16929\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5.1递交截止</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; fo