6192.html','1f392a1633c877ba2a95dc5c2d3dbc49a1598c08f98dd9f2c26b39d6964c2c6f',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"16\" style=\"text-indent: 0.0000pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; page-break-after: avoid; mso-pagination: lines-together; text-align: center; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\">二次</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\">询比采购公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕煤集团神木张家峁矿业有限公司地面变电站备用电源购置采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，采购人为陕西煤业物资榆通有限责任公司，项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%。项目已具备采购条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕西煤业物资榆通有限责任公司委托，现公开邀请供应商参加</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二次</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购活动，相关事项告知如下：</span><u></u></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购项目简介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购项目名称：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕煤集团神木张家峁矿业有限公司地面变电站备用电源购置采购（采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0866-26E2SXQY0720）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">釆购人：陕西煤业物资榆通有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">釆</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">机构：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">釆购项目资金落实情况：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">企业自筹，比例</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购项目概况：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目为地面变电站备用电源购置，采用</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">10.5kV高压集装箱式柴油发电成套设备，配套10.5kV高压发电机，根据安装场地定制静音集装箱、2000L独立储油柜体、柴发进线柜、</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">双电源切换柜及集装箱内部的保温加热装置</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，整套设备为一体化预制集成设计，具备自动启停、双电源切换、稳压稳频、持续应急供电功能，适用于工矿、数据中心、大型公用工程等重要负荷备用及应急供电场景。</span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6成交供应商数量及成交份额：一家，100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1采</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">购范围：柴油发动机、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">10.5kV高压发电机、智能控制系统、一体静音集装箱、独立油箱柜体、10.5kV柴发进线柜、</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">双电源切换柜及集装箱内部的保温加热装置</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">集装箱内部连接线缆</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、减震系统、排烟系统、通风降噪系统、照明系统。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">涵盖设计、制造、试验、包装、运输、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">指导</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">安装、调试、验收及售后服务等为实施本项目所需的全部工作内容，具体内容及要求详见</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购文件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">第五章</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购需求</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">交货期：合同签订</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">生效</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">40个日历日内到货</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">交货地点：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">张家峁</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4质保期：主机保修期为到货起两年或实际使用2000个小时，以先到为准，易损件、损耗件除外。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; break-after: avoid; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc219\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商应满足如下要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\" align=\"justify\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（1）</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">依法设立</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">必须具有独立的法人资格，并提供加载统一社会信用代码的营业执照或事业单位法人证书、提供开户许可证或基本存款账户信息证明材料，如为授权代理商必须提供柴油发动机制造商针对本项目唯一的授权委托书</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">业绩要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">应具有近年（自</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日至</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">截止日期）至少</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">三</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">项</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">同类项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">销</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">售业绩（业绩以合同及合同对应的任意一张增值税发票为准，对应的增值税发票在国家税务总局全国增值税发票查验平台核验必须真实、有效，合同必须有双方盖章页、首页、供货清单，合同内容清晰，甲乙双方盖章完整，有效业绩时间以合同签订时间为准</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">授权代理商或制造商均需提供自身销售业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">信誉要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未被国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.gsxt.gov.cn/index.html）列入严重违法失信名单（黑名单）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；未被列入</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;信用中国&rdquo;（http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">其他要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">法定代表人为同一个人的两个及两个以上法人，母公司、全资子公司及其控股公司，都不得同时参加询比采购。</span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商不得存在下列情形之一：（提供承诺书或相关证明材料）</span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本次采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">不接受</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; break-after: avoid; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc25004\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.1如贵单位有意参加参加询比采购活</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">动，请于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">20</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时至2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">25</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;网址为：（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）下载询比采购文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行供应商注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"22\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"f