ark: _Hlk109421235;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">供应商须具有有效期内的《特种设备生产许可证》（许可项目：压力管道安装、修理、改造，<a name=\"OLE_LINK85\"></a>工业管道<span lang=\"EN-US\">GC2</span>级及以上，含<span lang=\"EN-US\">GC1</span>级）；或有效期内的旧版《特种设备安装改造维修许可证》（压力管道），许可范围含工业管道<span lang=\"EN-US\">GC2</span>级及以上（含<span lang=\"EN-US\">GC1</span>级）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk79872225;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk109421235;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）财务要求：<span lang=\"EN-US\">/</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk79872225;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk109421235;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">（<a name=\"OLE_LINK46\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）业绩要求：<a name=\"OLE_LINK23\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK46;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2021</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日至响应文件递交的截止时间前（以合同签订时间为准），供应商具有<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>项管道维修更换或改造项目业绩。须附合同复印件（至少包含：合同双方盖章页、合同签订时间页、工作内容或技术协议等关键内容页面）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk79872225;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk109421235;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>）</span></span></span><a name=\"_Hlk148452022\"></a></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc14497448