ht: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">供应商不得存在下列情形之一：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）其他：被列入陕煤集团&ldquo;建设项目失信供应商名单&rdquo;且在公布期内。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">3.3</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">本次采购不接受联合体</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><a name=\"_Hlk53649150\"></a><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">4</span></strong></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">采购文件的获取</span></strong></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><a name=\"_Hlk53649298\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK77\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">4.1</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK77;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">有意参加询比采购活动的供应商，请于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">15</span>日至<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">21</span>日，每日上午<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>时至下午<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>时（北京时间，下同），登录<a name=\"_Hlk204008035\"></a>秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）购买采购文件。未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;常用文件&mdash;投标人操作手册。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK77;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">4.2</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK77;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">已注册的潜在供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;投标人登录&rdquo;请将法人授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码及上述&ldquo;<span lang=\"EN-US\">3.</span>供应商资格要求&rdquo;的所有资料扫描以<span lang=\"EN-US\">PDF</span>文件形式上传。潜在供应商应及时关注、查阅秦源招标电子招标平台。因未及时查看导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK77;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">4.3</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK77;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">供应商通过秦源招标电子招标平台缴纳采购文件费，缴费完毕即可在平台下载采购文件。采购文件每套售价<span lang=\"EN-US\">800</span>元，售后不退。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK77;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">4.4</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK77;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">潜在供应商支付采购文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票（文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK77;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">4.5</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK77;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">已注册的潜在供应商若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK10;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK6;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK20;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK51;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">5</span></strong></span></span></s