pt; border-left: 1.0000pt solid #000000; mso-border-left-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000; border-right: 1.0000pt solid #000000; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000; border-bottom: 1.0000pt solid #000000; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000;\" valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"63\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 98.4000pt; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: none; border-right: 1.0000pt solid #000000; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000; border-bottom: 1.0000pt solid #000000; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"164\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">涌鑫矿业安山煤矿防爆混凝土搅拌运输车</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 154.6500pt; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: none; border-right: 1.0000pt solid #000000; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000; border-bottom: 1.0000pt solid #000000; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000;\" valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"257\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">整备质量（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">t）&ge;10t,罐体有效容积(m&sup3;)&ge;4m&sup3;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具体内容详见谈判采购文件第五章采购需求</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 46.7000pt; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: none; border-right: 1.0000pt solid #000000; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000; border-bottom: 1.0000pt solid #000000; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"77\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1种</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4辆</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 61.7500pt; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: none; border-right: 1.0000pt solid #000000; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000; border-bottom: 1.0000pt solid #000000; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000;\" valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"102\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">安山煤矿</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.1000pt; padding: 0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: none; border-right: 1.0000pt solid #000000; mso-border-right-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000; border-bottom: 1.0000pt solid #000000; mso-border-bottom-alt: 0.5000pt solid #000000;\" valign=\"center\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"55\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2、 </span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1采购范围：本次购置</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4辆</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">防爆混凝土搅拌运输车，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">整备质量（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">t）&ge;10t,罐体有效容积(m&sup3;)&ge;4m&sup3;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具体内容详见谈判采购文件第五章采购需求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2交货期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">30天内到货</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3交货地点：货物运至</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">小保当矿</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">甲方指定地点。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4质保期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">车辆办理验收单正常使用之日起整车质保</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18个月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 24.1000pt; text-indent: -21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3、供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1供应商应依法设立且满足如下要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK30\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK31\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）依法设立：必须为具有独立的法人资格的生产厂家，并提供加载统一社会信用代码的营业执照或事业单位法人证书，有效的开户许可证或有效的银行开户证明材料</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">资质要求</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">必须提供本次采购产品的煤矿安全标志证书及配套电气产品的防爆合格证</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）财务要求：必须提供（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">-202</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">年）连续三年经第三方审计的财务报告，若公司成立时间不足三年，可提供成立之后年份经第三方审计的财务报告。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoToc2\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）业绩要求：应具有近年（自2022年1月1日至谈判截止日期）至少3项同类业绩（以合同及发票为准，发票需清晰明了完整，不得遮挡，每份合同对应的增值税发票不少于1张，对应的增值税发票在国家税务总局全国增值税发票查验平台核验必须真实、有效，合同必须有签订时间页及双方盖章页，合同复印件应清晰明了，可以看清合同内容，甲乙双方盖章完整，有效业绩时间以合同签订时间为准）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）信誉要求（以供应商加盖公章的承诺书或相关证明材料为准）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未被国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.gsxt.gov.cn/index.html）列入严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">未被列入</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;信用中国&rdquo;（http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2供应商不得存在下列情形之一（提供承诺书或相关证明材料）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形。</span><u></u></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.3本次采购不接受联合体。</span><a name=\"_Toc10688\"></a></span></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc10856\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4、采购文件的获取</span></strong></h3>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc11513\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4.1凡有意参加谈判者请在上述时间内登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;网址为：（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）下载谈判采购文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行供应商注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取参与资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书及&ldquo;三、供应商资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件，点击【提交】。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"19\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）有关注册、下载谈判采购文件、上传电子文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00，13：30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"19\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso