ze: 10.5000pt;\">日</span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26E2SXQY0755',NULL,NULL,'1.1采购项目名称：涌鑫矿业沙梁煤矿防爆混凝土搅拌运输车采购','陕西煤业化工物资集团有限公司榆林分公司','2026-08-13 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097379239861030913,'','2026-09-10 09:35:04','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕煤电力信阳有限公司东、西煤场煤棚屋面及排气楼屋面加固治理询比采购公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/2ywgg/20260812/1272252342686711808.html','26c07129dbe4a833b9592bfb20aee2c4c5cdbc4dcacc696d3a0a5b1673e5d991',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">陕煤电力信阳有限公司东、西煤场煤棚屋面及排气楼屋面加固治理询比采购公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（采购编号：<span lang=\"EN-US\">0866-26C1SXQY0563</span>）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">项目所在地区：河南省、信阳市、平桥区</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">陕煤电力信阳有限公司东、西煤场煤棚屋面及排气楼屋面加固治理已具备采购条件，现公开邀请供应商参加询比采购活动。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">1</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">采购项目简介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">1.1</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">采购项目名称：东、西煤场煤棚屋面及排气楼屋面加固治理 </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">1.2</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">采购人：陕煤电力信阳有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">1.3</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">采购组织机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">1.4</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">采购项目资金落实情况：资金已到位</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">1.5</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">采购概况：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">陕煤电力信阳有限公司位于河南省南部，一期工程装机容量<span lang=\"EN-US\">2&times;320MW</span>，二期工程装机容量<span lang=\"EN-US\">2&times;660MW</span>，日均消耗原煤<span lang=\"EN-US\">17000</span>吨左右。一、二期机组分别于<span lang=\"EN-US\">1999</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">2009</span>年投产。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">原输煤系统一期<span lang=\"EN-US\">2&times;320MW</span>、二期<span lang=\"EN-US\">2&times;660MW</span>机组共有三处煤场，按照在总平面中的地理位置，分别为西煤场、中煤场及东煤场。本次维修部位主要为：东煤场西延段新旧煤棚接缝、西煤场西延段新旧煤棚接缝、西煤场东延段排气楼、东煤场西延段新旧煤棚接缝和西延段排气楼以及西煤煤棚透亮处。西煤场西延段跨度<span lang=\"EN-US\">75</span>米，煤棚屋面高度约<span lang=\"EN-US\">32</span>米，东煤场西延段屋面高度约<span lang=\"EN-US\">39.4</span>米、煤棚跨度<span lang=\"EN-US\">101.6</span>米，西煤场东延段跨度<span lang=\"EN-US\">119</span>米，煤棚屋面高度约<span lang=\"EN-US\">40</span>米。煤棚均安装有从地面直达气楼马道和爬梯，煤棚屋面至排气楼屋面未安装爬梯。修复面积以实际缺陷情况为准。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">1.6</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">成交供应商数量及成交份额：一家，成交份额：<span lang=\"EN-US\">100%</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">2</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">2.1</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">采购范围：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">采购范围：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">1.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">对西煤场西延段和东煤场西延段新旧煤棚接缝进行整改，重新对整段伸缩缝两侧煤棚屋面端面及檩条进行处理，重新设置新旧煤棚伸缩峰延展板，对伸缩缝两端变形、锈蚀或脱落檩条和固定延展板的檩条进行更换和修复整改。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1.2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">对通向气楼和屋面的马道及爬梯进行清理、除锈和防腐刷漆工作。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">1.3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">对西煤场东延段排气楼脱落、松动檩条及檩托、彩瓦进行拆除、重新安装檩托、主次檩条和安装彩瓦，并对排气楼四周峰板进行固定和加固处理，更换弯曲杆件。对排气楼爬梯和马道、杆件和紧固件进行清理、除锈、防腐刷漆工作业。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">1.4.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">供应商负责本项目整改的所有工具、材料和相关用品等。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">1.5.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">供应商负责本项目四措两案和超高高处作业专项施工方案的编制、审核和专项方案评审，安全施工的技术方案、各项专项施工方案措施的制定与实施。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">1.6.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">供应商中选后，在做好安全措施的前提下，对上述各部位进行测绘、对损坏部件进行测绘，为后续修复提供屋面修复材料的各项技术参数。制定修复技术、安全方案后，经过具有设计资质人员审核后，编制修复方案和安全专项措施，经审核后方可施工。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">1.7</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">网架该处作业需要具有高处作业资质专业人员实施。按照高处作业各环节及区域安全风险及隐患、制定作业方案、安全防护措施和管控方案。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">1.8.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">对屋面伸缩缝两侧檩条及过渡段进行彻底整改、防腐和找正，修正过渡段檩条安装曲线及弧度，保证泛水板安装与屋面保持一致性。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">1.9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">对东煤场西延段和西煤场东延段排气楼受损杆件、檩条、檩座和彩瓦进行拆除，重新设计和安装新的杆件、檩条、檩座和重新恢复屋面彩瓦，并做好防止再次被大风刮开的措施；同时对受损区域杆件进行除锈和防腐作业，对排气楼进行整体加固、对原有檩条、彩瓦和围护封孔彩瓦进行加固处理。防止再次被风刮开。彻底消除存在隐患。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">1.10</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">对西煤场旧煤棚屋面透亮接缝进行修复，对西煤场屋面</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">处锈蚀严重部位进行防腐处理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">1.11</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">本项目实施各阶段的各作业点超危专项安全防护措施、安全工具、施工工具、起重及牵引设备、设施均在本项目中。专项安全施工方案实施前必须进行专家评审。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1.12</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">对通向排气楼爬梯、马道进行检查、发现异常应立即禁止通行。对通向排气楼马道积粉进行清理、对锈蚀部位进行防腐刷漆工作。对排气楼部位受损杆件进行更换。对锈蚀杆件、马道和爬梯进行修复，修复后进行防腐、刷漆处理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1.13</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">下面本项目受损后的图片，仅供参考，因视觉所限，上述新旧棚交接两侧部位未提及受损部位，在施工解决发现后，一并处理和实施，且不引起商务价格的变化，请供应商对修复工作进行审慎评估。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">1.14</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">项目实施中设备及材料转运、各项安全措施搭建与拆除等相关施工均包含此项目中。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">本次采购内容包含以上内容及&ldquo;第五章采购需求&rdquo;。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">2.2</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">工期：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 175%; margin: 3.3pt 5.25pt .0001pt 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">本项目工期</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">55</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">日历天。具体开工时间根据施工现场是否具备开工条件安排，由采购人提前通知应答方。供应商接到通知后必须在开工日的前三天到达采购方施工现场。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">2.3</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">项目实施地点：河南省信阳市平桥区平桥镇陕煤电力信阳有限公司。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">2.4</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">质量要求：符合国家及行业验收相关标准，并达到合格要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 175%; margin: 3.3pt 5.25pt .0001pt 0cm;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">2.5</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">付</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 175%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">款方式：</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 175%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .3pt;\">本项目不预付款，工作完工并通过验收后，办理完业务结算单并通过甲方内部审计后，乙方提供全额增值税专用发票，甲方付至合同总价款的<span lang=\"EN-US\">97%</span>，剩余<span lang=\"EN-US\">3%</span>为质保金，待<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>年质保期满，且无因乙方责任出现质量问题后，付清全部费用。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">3</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">3.1</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">供应商应依法设立且满足如下要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">3.1.1.</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">资质要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商须为在中华人民共和国境内依法注册设立的独立法人企业或其他组织，若为企业法人，须提供有效的营业执照；若为事业法人，须提供有效的事业单位法人证书；若为其他组织，须提供合法有效的登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">供应商应具备由建设行政主管部门核发的</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">有效安全生产许可证，供应商应具有电力工程施工总承包一级及以上资质或钢结构工程专业承包三级及以上资质</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">3.1.2</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">业绩要求：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">供应商须提供自</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2021</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">日至响应文件递交的截止时间内至少具有</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">份及以上钢结构或干煤棚安装业绩，提供业绩证明材料（</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">提供的业绩须以合同签订时间为准，并附合同扫描件（扫描件必须提供合同正文首页、签字盖章页及能证明工作范围等信息的页面）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">3.1.3</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">项目经理要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><a name=\"OLE_LINK5\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">本项目为超高高处作业项目，本工程实行&ldquo;项目经理负总责、安全员专岗监督&rdquo;的双轨安全责任制。本项目项目经理必须具有二级及以上注册机电工程专业建造师证及安全生产考核合格证</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">B</span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">证，须提供</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2021</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">日至递交响应文截止时间以来类似项目业绩证明材料（提供的项目经理业绩证明材料是以合同签订时间为准，</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK5;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">供应商须提供能证明项目经理业绩的证明文件，可以是合同或验收证明或用户盖章的证明材料，合同或证明材料中须体现项目经理的姓名。未担任其他在建工程项目经理职务（须提供承诺书），在担任项目经理期间未发生重大安全事故（须提供承诺书），并提供本单位近半年以来的社保缴纳证明材料。项目经理须为本单位在职人员，项目经理不能兼任其他职务；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">若项目经理提供一级注册证书出现以下情况，提供的项目经理一级注册建造师证书无效：</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">（1）未在注册证书手写签名；</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">（2）手写签名与电子签名图像笔迹不一致；</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">（3）项目经理注册证书本人签署日期不是公告至投标的截止日期内的日期；</span></p>\n<p class=\"11\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN;\">（4）项目经理注册证书右上角无有效时限的水印。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk148452022\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">3.1.4</span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk148452022;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">信誉要求<a name=\"_Hlk92456497\"></a>：<a name=\"_Hlk220578760\"></a></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk148452022;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk220578760;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Courier New\'; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商未列入&ldquo;信用中国（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https:</span>／<span lang=\"EN-US\">/www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span>）&rdquo;严重失信主体名单（以供应商加盖单位公章的承诺书为准）；</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk148452022;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk220578760;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Courier New\'; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）供应商未列入&ldquo;国家企业信用信息公示系统（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span>）&rdquo;严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息（以供应商加盖单位公章的承诺书为准）。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">3.2</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">供应商不得存在下列情形之一：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）其他：被列入陕煤集团&ldquo;建设项目失信供应商名单&rdquo;且在公布期内。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">3.3</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">本次采购不接受联合体</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">4</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">4.1</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">有意参加询比采购活动的供应商，请于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span>日至<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>日，每日上午<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>时至<span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span>时，下午<span lang=\"EN-US\">14</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>分至<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>时（北京时间，下同），登录秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）购买采购文件。未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;供应商注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;常用文件&mdash;供应商操作手册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">4.2</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">已注册的潜在供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;供应商登录&rdquo;请将法人授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码及上述&ldquo;<span lang=\"EN-US\">3.</span>供应商资格要求&rdquo;的所有资料扫描以<span lang=\"EN-US\">PDF</span>文件形式上传。潜在供应商应及时关注、查阅秦源招标电子招标平台。因未及时查看导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">4.3</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">经采购组织机构确认后，供应商通过秦源招标电子招标平台缴纳采购文件费，缴费完毕即可在平台下载采购文件。采购文件每套售价<span lang=\"EN-US\">800</span>元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">4.4</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">潜在供应商支付采购文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票（文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">4.5</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">已注册的潜在供应商若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">5</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">5.1</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">响应文件递交的截止时间为<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">25</span>日上午<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分，地点为秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）。供应商应于响应截止时间前通过秦源招标电子招标平台递交所有响应文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">5.2 </span></strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">逾期送达的、未送达指定地点的响应文件，采购人将拒绝接收</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; background: white;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">6</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;\">响应文件开启时间和地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">响应文件开启在响应文件递交截止时间的同一时间进行，地点为秦源招标电子招标平台上进行，供应商应提前<span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>分钟登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与会议。供应商未参加在线开启会议的，视为默认开启结果。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">7</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">发布公告的媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">本次询比采购公告同时在中国招标投标公共服务平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.cebpubservice.com</span>）、陕西采购与招标网（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.sntba.com</span>）、秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）上发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">8</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">本项目的监督部门为陕煤电力信阳有限公司经营管理部</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">联系人：黄先生<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>监督电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">0376-6522449<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>监督邮箱：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"mailto:614000762@qq.com\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">614000762@qq.com</span></a></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">本项目的评审办法为最低价法。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">9</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; letter-spacing: -.25pt;\">采购人：陕煤电力信阳有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; letter-spacing: -.25pt;\">地址：河南省信阳市平桥区平桥镇</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; letter-spacing: -.25pt;\">联系人：王女士</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; letter-spacing: -.25pt;\">电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">0376-6522248</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; letter-spacing: -.25pt;\">电子邮件：<span lang=\"EN-US\">jingyingbu0376@163.com</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">采购组织机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">地址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路<span lang=\"EN-US\">38</span>号东院办公楼<span lang=\"EN-US\">105</span>室</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">联系人：凌洋（秦源招标三部）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">029-81615928</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">电子邮箱：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\"><a href=\"mailto:lingyang@sxxaqyzb.com\"><span style=\"color: black; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">lingyang@sxxaqyzb.com</span></a></span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26C1SXQY0563',NULL,NULL,'东、西煤场煤棚屋面及排气楼屋面加固治理','陕煤','2026-08-12 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097379246731300866,'','2026-09-10 09:35:04','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕煤电力信阳有限公司炉后设备荷载强度安全检测鉴定评估询比采购公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/2ywgg/20260812/1272251737515753472.html','dfa58d24ad0fe457a6e8ba432b4f0364d0c91188e425f57cdcbebc8227a06c6d',NULL,'HTML','<div class=\"WordSection1\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK10\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK20\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK6\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk161263070\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk218680825\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤电力信阳有限公司</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">炉后设备荷载强度安全检测鉴定评估询比采购公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（采购编号：<span lang=\"EN-US\">0866-26C3SXQY0564</span>）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk53648321\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">项目所在地区：河南省、信阳市、平桥区</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤电力信阳有限公司炉后设备荷载强度安全检测鉴定评估已具备采购条件，现公开邀请供应商参加询比采购活动。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目简介<a name=\"_Hlk53648584\"></a></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">1.1</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目名称：炉后设备荷载强度安全检测鉴定评估 </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">1.2</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购人：<a name=\"_Hlk203668422\"></a>陕煤电力信阳有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">1.3</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">1.4</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目资金落实情况：资金已到位</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">1.5</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目概况：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">为防止出现电力生产重特大安全事故，降低坍塌类事故带来的人员伤亡及经济损失，依据《电力重大事故隐患判定标准及治理监督管理规定》（国家发改委第</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">41</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">号令）第六条（五）相关条款要求，对陕煤电力信阳有限公司生产现场服役环境恶劣、坍塌风险突出的燃煤锅炉后烟风道、电除尘器、脱硫吸收塔、脱硫区域烟道、脱硝催化剂装置、输煤栈桥、粉仓、高效浓缩机、渣仓、脱水仓等设备设施开展专项结构检测鉴定工作。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤电力信阳有限公司配置</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">台国产</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">320MW</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">上海锅炉厂生产的</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">1025t/h</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">亚临界机组，于</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">2001</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">年建成投产，锅炉制造厂：上海锅炉</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">集团</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">股份有限公司。型号：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">SG</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">－</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">1025/17.4</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">&mdash;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">M847</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">台</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">东方锅炉厂生产的<span lang=\"EN-US\">DG2000/26.15-</span>Ⅱ<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>型国产<span lang=\"EN-US\">660MW</span>超超临界参数变压本生直流锅炉，一次再热、单炉膛、尾部双烟道结构、采用烟气挡板调节再热汽温<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>固态排渣，全钢构架、全悬吊结构<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>平衡通风、露天布置<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>前后墙对冲燃烧，于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2001</span>年建成投产，总装机容量<span lang=\"EN-US\">1960MW</span>。</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">厂内锅炉后烟风道、电除尘器、脱硫吸收塔、脱硫区域烟道、脱硝催化剂装置、输煤栈桥、粉仓、高效浓缩机、渣仓、脱水仓等建构筑物至今已近二十年服役年限，长期受高温、粉尘、腐蚀等恶劣工况侵蚀。为全面掌握上述建构筑物主体结构实际安全性能，保障机组长期稳定安全运行，同时为后续检修维护、加固改造工作提供技术依据，计划对该批建构筑物主体结构开展可靠性检测鉴定</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">1.6</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">成交供应商数量及成交份额：一家，成交份额：<span lang=\"EN-US\">100%</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购范围：<a name=\"_Hlk137766975\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK14\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK7\"></a></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.1.1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">炉后设备包含：除尘器<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>台，渣仓<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>台，粉仓<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>台，脱水仓<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>台，浓缩机<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>台，脱硝<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>台，炉后烟道<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>台，脱硫吸收塔<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>台，脱硫吸收塔烟道<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>台，输煤栈桥<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>台。共计<span lang=\"EN-US\">32</span>台。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.1.2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">现场检测检查内容：对结构布置、连接核查与构件截面尺寸检测、结构材料性能检测；混凝土构件钢筋配置、混凝土碳化深度、混凝土构件钢筋保护层厚度；钢构件涂层厚度检测、结构构件损伤缺陷检查、结构变形检测<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.1.3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">根据检测检查结果进行结构强度计算校核与分析、可靠性鉴定评级及结构抗震鉴定。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.1.4</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">现场检测所需的脚手架搭设及打磨工作由供应商负责。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.1.5</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">并出具有明确的检测鉴定结论及处理建议的检测鉴定报告。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">具体内容详见采购文件&ldquo;第五章采购需求&rdquo;</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 5.25pt; mso-para-margin-right: .5gd; line-height: 150%; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.2</span></strong><a name=\"_Hlk175651893\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk146752279\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk140139122\"></a><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">服务期限：</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">供应商自开工之日<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>天内完成现场检测，<span lang=\"EN-US\">40</span>天内出具检测鉴定报告。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.<a name=\"_Hlk53648978\"></a>3</span></strong><a name=\"_Hlk93178661\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk93179697\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk86228230\"></a><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">项目实施地点</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">：<a name=\"OLE_LINK16\"></a>河南省信阳市平桥区平桥镇陕煤电力信阳有限公司厂区内。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">4</span><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">质保期</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">：本项目全部检测、鉴定、评估工作成果质保有效期<span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span>个月，自项目最终竣工之日起计算。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">付款方式</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">：本项目不预付款，全部工作完成并出具相应的检测鉴定报告，经甲方确认无误后，办理业务结算，如有未检测设备，则从合同价款中扣除相应金额。乙方提供全额增值税专用发票，甲方付至合同结算价款的<span lang=\"EN-US\">97%</span>，剩余款项待质保期结束并办理质保金结算审批单后支付。质保期为项目竣工之日起一年。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc179632531\"></a><a name=\"_Toc152042291\"></a><a name=\"_Toc144974483\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk77338991\"></a><a name=\"_Toc152045515\"></a><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3.1</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">供应商应依法设立且满足如下要求：<a name=\"_Hlk79872225\"></a></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk109421235\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk84679065\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk86224955\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3.1.1</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">资质要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk109402969\"></a><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商须为在中华人民共和国境内依法注册设立的独立法人企业或其他组织，若为企业法人，须提供有效的营业执照；若为事业法人，须提供有效的事业单位法人证书；若为其他组织，须提供合法有效的登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）供应商须有建设工程质量检测机构资质证书，以下满足其一即可： </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">1.</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">专项资质：同时具有主体结构及装饰装修、钢结构、地基基础检测机构专项资质；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">综合资质。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3.1.2</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">业绩要求：供应商须提供<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>月至今至少两份电力行业建筑物或构筑物检测鉴定业绩（提供的合同须以合同签订时间为准），并附合同扫描件（扫描件必须提供合同正文首页、签字盖章页及能证明工作范围等信息的页面）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk148452022\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3.1.3</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求<a name=\"_Hlk92456497\"></a>：<a name=\"_Hlk220578760\"></a></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商未列入&ldquo;信用中国（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https:</span>／<span lang=\"EN-US\">/www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span>）&rdquo;严重失信主体名单（以供应商加盖单位公章的承诺书为准）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）供应商未列入&ldquo;国家企业信用信息公示系统（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span>）&rdquo;严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息（以供应商加盖单位公章的承诺书为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3.2</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">供应商不得存在下列情形之一：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）其他：被列入陕煤集团&ldquo;建设项目失信供应商名单&rdquo;且在公布期内。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3.3</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">本次采购不接受联合体</span><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk53649150\"></a><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"left\"><a name=\"_Hlk53649298\"></a><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">4.1</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">有意参加询比采购活动的供应商，请于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span>日至<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>日，每日上午<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>时至<span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span>时，下午<span lang=\"EN-US\">14</span>时至<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>时（北京时间，下同），登录<a name=\"_Hlk204008035\"></a>秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）购买采购文件。未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;常用文件&mdash;投标人操作手册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">4.2</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">已注册的潜在供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;投标人登录&rdquo;请将法人授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码及上述&ldquo;<span lang=\"EN-US\">3.</span>供应商资格要求&rdquo;的所有资料扫描以<span lang=\"EN-US\">PDF</span>文件形式上传。潜在供应商应及时关注、查阅秦源招标电子招标平台。因未及时查看导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">4.3</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">经采购机构确认后，供应商通过秦源招标电子招标平台缴纳采购文件费，缴费完毕即可在平台下载采购文件。采购文件每套售价<span lang=\"EN-US\">800</span>元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">4.4</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">潜在供应商支付采购文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票（文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">4.5</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">已注册的潜在供应商若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk53649359\"></a><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">5.1</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">响应文件递交的截止时间为<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">25</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分，地点为秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）。供应商应于响应截止时间前通过秦源招标电子招标平台递交所有响应文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">5.2 </span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">逾期送达的、未送达指定地点的响应文件，采购人将拒绝接收</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">6</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">响应文件开启时间和地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk82017544\"></a><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">响应文件开启在响应文件递交截止时间的同一时间进行，地点为秦源招标电子招标平台上进行，供应商应提前<span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>分钟登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与会议。供应商未参加在线开启会议的，视为默认开启结果。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">7</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">发布公告的媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk82017622\"></a><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">本询比采购公告同时在中国招标投标公共服务平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.cebpubservice.com</span>）、陕西采购与招标网（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.sntba.com</span>）、秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）上发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">8</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">本项目的监督部门为陕煤电力信阳有限公司经营管理部</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">联系人：黄先生<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>监督电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">0376-6522449&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>监督邮箱：</span><a href=\"mailto:614000762@qq.com\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">614000762@qq.com</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">本项目的评审办法为最低价法。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">9</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购人：陕煤电力信阳有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">地址：河南省信阳市平桥区平桥镇</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">联系人：彭女士</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">0376-6522248</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">电子邮箱：<span lang=\"EN-US\">/</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">地址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路<span lang=\"EN-US\">38</span>号东院办公楼<span lang=\"EN-US\">105</span>室</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">联系人：凌洋（秦源招标三部）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">029-81615928</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">电子邮箱：</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK150\"></a><a href=\"mailto:lingyang@sxxaqyzb.com\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">lingyang@sxxaqyzb.com</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: right; text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"right\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n</div>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 15pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26C3SXQY0564',NULL,NULL,'炉后设备荷载强度安全检测鉴定评估','陕煤','2026-08-12 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'