le=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53648584;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">陕煤电力信阳有限公司<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>号、<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>号机组锅炉采用上海锅炉厂生产的<span lang=\"EN-US\">SG-1025/17.4-M847</span>型亚临界、中间再热、自然循环汽包炉，单炉膛&prod;型布置，切向燃烧，宽调节比摆动式煤粉燃烧器，煤粉喷嘴四层布置，平衡通风，固态机械除渣。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 15.8pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53648584;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3</span></strong></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53648584;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">号、<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>号机组简介</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53648584;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">陕煤电力信阳有限公司<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>号、<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>号机组锅炉采用东方锅炉厂生产的<span lang=\"EN-US\">DG2000/26.15-</span>Ⅱ<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>型国产<span lang=\"EN-US\">660MW</span>超超临界参数变压本生直流锅炉，一次再热、单炉膛、尾部双烟道结构、采用烟气挡板调节再热汽温<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>固态排渣，全钢构架、全悬吊结构<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>平衡通风、露天布置<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>前后墙对冲燃烧。 </span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53648584;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">1.6</span></strong></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53648584;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;\">成交供应商数量及成交份额：一家，成交份额：<span lang=\"EN-US\">100%</span></sp