an; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子邮箱：</span>1062485299@qq.com</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购代理机构</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地址：陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路</span>38<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">号秦源招标公司一楼</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">118</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">室</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">联系人：吴工（招标二部）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">029-89578069</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2670569660@qq.com</span></span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26B3SXQY0437',NULL,NULL,'1.1 采购项目名称：2026年西安分公司第一批次汽运承运服务项目韩城区域至湖北省十堰市运输08包','陕西钢铁集团有限公司西安分公司','2026-08-07 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097379397197762561,'','2026-09-10 09:35:05','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','彬长孟村煤矿生产地质报告编制项目谈判采购公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/2ywgg/20260807/1270410115551330304.html','a2bf336ecc26a427dde8d5f05101b819f545741448d6c9092dcecb96b71cec5d',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">彬长孟村煤矿生产地质报告编制项目</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（采购编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0866-26C3SXQY0559）</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">谈判</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\">采购公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">项目所在地区：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">陕西省</span> <span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">咸阳市</span><u></u></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司彬长孟村煤矿生产地质报告编制项目已具备采购条件，现公开邀请供应商参加谈判采购活动。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 7.8000pt; margin-bottom: 7.8000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">1、</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">项目简介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">1.1 采购项目名称：彬长孟村煤矿生产地质报告编制项目</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">1.2 采购编号：0866-26C3SXQY0559</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">1.3 采购人：陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">1.4 采购组织机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">1.5 项目资金落实情况：企业自筹，出资率100%。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1.6 项目概况：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">依据《煤矿地质工作细则》（矿安﹝</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023﹞192号）第十三条、第十五条法定要求：基建煤矿移交生产后应在3年内完成煤矿地质类型划分，报告可与煤矿生产地质报告合并编写；煤矿地质类型每3年需重新评定。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">孟村煤矿上一轮生产地质报告修编完成于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年10月，按照规范强制要求，需在2026年10月前完成本轮修编工作。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">通过系统编制报告，全面夯实矿井地质基础数据，精准研判矿井地质条件变化，为采掘规划、灾害防治提供地质技术支撑，强化矿井地质工作管理，保障安全生产。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">1.7 成交供应商数量及成交份</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">额：一家，成交份额</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">2、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">采购</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">2.1 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">范围：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">本次采购覆盖报告编制全流程工作，从前期资料收集、地质条件分析，到报告图件编制、最终成果交付，再到配合评审验收全部包含在内，具体内容如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">（一）核心工作任务</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">全面收集孟村煤矿建井以来的地质勘探、生产揭露、补充勘探等各类地质资料，系统梳理矿井整体地质条件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">严格对照《煤矿地质工作细则》及配套行业标准，逐项完成地质构造复杂程度、煤层稳定程度、瓦斯类型、水文地质类型、冲击地压危险等级划分，同时分析顶底板条件、煤层倾角、油层气等其他特殊开采地质因素。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">汇总所有分项划分结果，评定矿井整体地质类型（简单</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/ 中等 / 复杂 / 极复杂），最终编制完成《孟村煤矿生产地质报告》，报告中同步包含地质类型划分的全部内容。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">结合最新生产进度和补充勘探成果，修编更新矿井全套核心地质图件，满足生产管理和合规检查要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">（二）具体技术工作内容</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">基础资料归集：整理矿井历次地质勘探报告、补充勘探报告、采掘工程平面图、钻孔柱状图、煤层等厚线图、构造纲要图，以及瓦斯参数、水文地质、顶底板岩性、地温、冲击地压等所有实测资料。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">专项地质分析：</span> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">梳理矿井断层、褶皱的发育规模与分布规律，按标准评定地质构造复杂程度；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">根据煤层厚度变化、结构特征、可采范围，评定煤层稳定程度；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">结合矿井瓦斯等级、瓦斯含量、压力等实测数据，划分瓦斯类型；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">依据充水水源、涌水量特征、防治水难度划分水文地质类型，并分盘区预测未来三年矿井涌水量；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">分析冲击地压倾向性、地温梯度、煤层自燃倾向性、煤尘爆炸性、油型气等因素对开采的影响。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">报告编制：报告正文须涵盖绪论、地层、地质构造、煤层煤质与资源储量、瓦斯地质、水文地质、冲击地压、其他开采地质条件、矿井地质类型划分结果、地质工作建议等完整章节，数据准确、结论可靠。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">（三）成果交付要求</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">最终交付成果包含纸质版</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">7 套、电子版 1 套，由报告正文、配套附图、配套附表三部分组成：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">附图共</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">13 类，包括 1:10000 地质地形图、1:200 地层综合柱状图、15 条主勘探线 + 5 条走向地质剖面图、1:10000 地质构造纲要图、1:10000 煤层底板等高线及资源储量估算图、1:10000 瓦斯地质图、1:10000 综合水文地质图、1:5000 水文地质剖面图、1:10000 充水性图、1:10000 煤层顶板坚硬岩层分布及厚度等值线图，以及 1:5000、1:10000 两种比例的采掘工程平面图、井上下对照图和主要巷道预想地质剖面图。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">附表共</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9 类，分别为勘探钻孔综合成果表、钻孔揭露煤层情况一览表、资源储量计算基础表及汇总表、瓦斯基础参数表、岩石煤样采集及化验成果汇总表、水质分析成果表、冲击地压危险性评价表、煤尘与自燃鉴定表、煤岩物理力学试验成果表。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 19.45pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">具体内容详见第五章采购需求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6 服务期限：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目整体服务周期为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">45日历天，自合同生效之日起计算，</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">成交供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">须在工期内完成全部资料梳理、报告编制、图件修编及成果提交工作。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">2.7 服务地点：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">陕西彬长孟村矿业有限公司孟村煤矿矿区。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.4500pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7700; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">8 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">质量要求或服</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">务标准：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">本项目须严格遵循国家及行业现行煤矿地质相关规范、陕西省地方管理规定，贴合孟村煤矿生产实际，确保报告内容完整、数据准确、论证严谨，配套图件附表规范齐全，满足地质类型重新评定的合规备案与矿井安全生产指导需求，最终通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">采购人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">及上级单位组织的评审验收，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">并</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">符合采购文件要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 7.8000pt; margin-bottom: 7.8000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">3、供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 24.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0000gd; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">3.1资质要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">3.1.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">供应</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人单位</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">或其它组织。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">3.2人员要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">.2.1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">项</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">目负责人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; color: #222222; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">须</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">具备</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">地质相关专业高级</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">及以上</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">职称</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">提供职称证书复印件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">业绩要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">3.3.1供应商须提供202</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">3年1月1日至响应文</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">件递交截止日，至少</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">1项生产地质报告编制业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">（业绩以合同文件为准，合同内容主要体现：合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页及双方盖章签字页）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">信誉要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">.4.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商未列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https:</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">//</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单（以供应商加盖单位公章的承诺书为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">.4.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息（以供应商加盖单位公章的承诺书为准）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 36.0000pt left blank 48.0000pt left blank 60.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">其他要求：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">.5.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">本次谈判采购不接受联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">.5.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">法定</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">代表人为同一人的两个及两个以上法人、母子公司、全资子公司及其控股公司不得同时参与本项目谈判采购。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 7.8000pt; margin-bottom: 7.8000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">4、采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 36.0000pt left blank 48.0000pt left blank 60.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">4.1获取时间</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">08</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">08</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">8时至2026年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">08</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">14</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日下午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">（北京时间，节假日除外，下同）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 36.0000pt left blank 48.0000pt left blank 60.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">4.2请供应商登录秦源招标电子招标平台（qyzb.shccmg.com）购买电子文件。未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;供应商注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;常用文件&mdash;供应商操作手册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 36.0000pt left blank 48.0000pt left blank 60.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">4.3已注册的供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;供应商登录&rdquo;请将加盖单位公章的法人授权委托书（附法定代表人、委托代理人身份证复印件）及上述&ldquo;3、供应商资格要求&rdquo;的3.1-3.5条资料上传。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 36.0000pt left blank 48.0000pt left blank 60.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">4.4潜在供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台购买采购文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载采购文件。采购文件每套售价：800元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 36.0000pt left blank 48.0000pt left blank 60.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">4.5潜在供应商支付采购文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票（采购文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 36.0000pt left blank 48.0000pt left blank 60.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">4.6已注册的潜在供应商若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 7.8000pt; margin-bottom: 7.8000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">5、响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">5.1 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">响应文件递交的截</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">止时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">08</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">19</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">日上午</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">0</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">9时00分（北京时间）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">5.2响应文件递交方式：电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，未在谈判开始时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接受。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 7.8000pt; margin-bottom: 7.8000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">6、谈判时间和地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">6.1 谈判开始时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">08</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">19</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">日上午</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">0</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">9时00分（北京时间）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">6.2 谈判地点及方式：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">38号梅苑温泉小区东院数智交易中心二楼开标室20</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次谈判通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;实施，供应商须委派授权代表携带笔记本电脑，按规定时间抵达谈判现场参与谈判。已提交响应文件的供应商因故无法到场或缺席单轮谈判的，视为放弃该轮次现场商谈权利，但仍具备最终报价资格；通过谈判并进入最终报价环节的供应商，必须按谈判小组通知的时间登录系统在线填报并提交最终报价。逾期未上传或上传不成功的，该供应商被视为退出本次竞争性谈判；供应商应自行查阅谈判全过程发布的通知、澄清及文件调整内容，缺席对应轮次视同知悉并认可全部谈判内容。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 7.8000pt; margin-bottom: 7.8000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">7、发布公告的媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.7500pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本谈判采购公告在陕西采购与招标网（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">www.sntba.com）、秦源招标电子招标平台（qyzb.shccmg.com）和中国招标投标公共服务平台（www.cebpubservice.com）上发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 7.8000pt; margin-bottom: 7.8000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">8、监督部门</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">本项目的监督部门为：陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司规划部。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目监督电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">029-33191601。监督邮箱：2236744@qq.com。联系人：郑先生。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 7.8000pt; margin-bottom: 7.8000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">9、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">采购人：陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">址：陕西省咸阳市秦都区西咸大道</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">58号14层</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 11pt;\">联系人：郑先生</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0000pt; mso-char-indent-c