 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">降低能耗。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">拟在冷冻水回水管（回水箱处）增设旁通管路</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">并新增一台配套冷冻水泵</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，使冷冻水系统形成完整的闭式循环，降低水泵能耗。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">具</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">体要求以谈判采购文件采购需求为准。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -33.1500pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.2、工期</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年10月底前完成。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 21.0000pt; text-indent: -21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.3、质保期：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">一年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 21.0000pt; text-indent: -21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-sp