明、使用证明、回访记录、业主出具的书面证明等），须体现项目名称及设备投运时间。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk176732756;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk79872225;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk148452022;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk92456497;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.3</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk176732756;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk79872225;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk148452022;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk92456497;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">信誉要求：</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk79872225;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.3.1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk79872225;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">供应商未列入信用中国（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span>）严重失信主体名单（以供应商加盖单位公章的承诺书为准）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk79872225;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.3.2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk79872225;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span>）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息（以供应商加盖单位公章的承诺书为准）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk53649150\"></a><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.4</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649150;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">其他要求：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649150;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.4.1</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649150;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">本次谈判采购不接受联合体。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk53649298\"></a><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">4.</span></strong><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">采购文件的获取</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">4.1</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">获取时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">06</span>日上午<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>时至<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>时。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">4.2</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">获取办法：贵方如有参加，请在上述时间内登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span>）&rdquo;确认并下载采购文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">（1）</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，点击【邀请回执】－进入邀请回执确认页面，上传附件，点击【发送】即可。随后按平台系统提示下载采购文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">（2）</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">采购文件每套售价：<span lang=\"EN-US\">800</span>元，售后不退。购买采购文件的发票，供应商可在平台自行申请并打印（采购文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票，开具时间：本项目结束之后）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）有关注册、下载采购文件、上传电子响应文件等问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">400-685-1179</span>，邮箱：<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyebidding@163.com</span>。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">08:30-12:00</span>，<span lang=\"EN-US\">13:30-17:30</span>。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">5.</span></strong></span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk53649359\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">5.1</span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649359;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">响应文件递交的截止时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">19</span>日上午<span lang=\"EN-US\">09</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649359;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">5.2</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649359;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">响应文件</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649359;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">递交方式：</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649359;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，未在谈判开始时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接收。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649359;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">6.</span></strong></span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">谈判时间和地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk82017544\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font