 style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">1.2 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">采购人：西安尚和置业有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">1.4 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">采购代理机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">1.5 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">采购项目资金落实情况：已落实</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">1.6 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">采购项目概况：项目位于西安市浐灞生态区东三环辅路以东，世博东路以南，香湖湾五路（规划路）以西，中固加油站东北。陕煤金融中心（二期）<span lang=\"EN-US\">DK56</span>规划净用地面积约<span lang=\"EN-US\">43259</span>平方米，规划建设面积约<span lang=\"EN-US\">140006.32</span>㎡，陕煤金融中心（二期）<span lang=\"EN-US\">DK57</span>规划净用地面积约<span lang=\"EN-US\">46744</span>平方米，规划建设面积约<span lang=\"EN-US\">147814.48</span>㎡，陕煤金融中心（二期）<span lang=\"EN-US\">DK58</span>规划净用地面积约<span lang=\"EN-US\">47621</span>平方米，规划建设面积约<span lang=\"EN-US\">150029.89</span>㎡包含住宅楼及配套服务、地下车库及相关配套。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">1.7 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">成交供应商数量：一家</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-outline-level: 2; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">、采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">2.1 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">采购范围：（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）基于<span lang=\"EN-US\">UE5</span>系统制作陕煤德璟项目<span lang=\"EN-US\">VR</span>电子沙盘服务（包括：项目营销展示数字化落地支持、定制化营销交互适配）；（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）一次性开发服务内容（包含：需求调研对接、<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM/CAD</span>图纸还原、<span lang=\"EN-US\">UE5</span>场景开发、设备适配调试、操作培训交付、售后对接运维。具体涵盖：项目周边区域规划配套<span lang=\"EN-US\">1:1</span>高精度还原、项目整体规划可视化呈现、建筑外立面与细节质感渲染、全维度园林景观场景制作、多户型精细模型搭建与漫游动线设计，最终实现满足案场营销展示需求的可交付<span lang=\"EN-US\">UE5 -VR</span>电子沙盘产品等内容）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">2.2 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">服务期：收到采购人资料后<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>天内完成。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">2.3 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">服务地点：陕煤金融中心（二期）项目<span lang=\"EN-US\">DK56</span>位于西安市浐灞生态区东三环辅路以东，世博东路以南，香湖湾五路（规划路）以西。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">2.4 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">质保期：软件部分<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>年，硬件部分<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>年。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-outline-level: 2; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">、供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">3.1 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">供应商应依法设立（供应商应提供市场监管部门或其他行政机关颁发的可以合法开展业务的执照或证书复印件）且满足如下要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）资质要求：无。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）财务要求：无。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）业绩要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK3\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK2\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">供应商近年（合同签订时间为<span lang=\"EN-US\">2021</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">01</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">01</span>日起至响应文件递交截止之日）具有至少<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>份数字（电子）沙盘服务业绩（以合同为准，包含合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>）信誉要求（下列要求均由供应商提供加盖公章的承诺书）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">①供应商未列入信用中国（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span>）严重失信主体名单；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">②供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span>）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">3.2 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">供应商不得存在下列情形之一：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）其他：法律法规规定的及谈判采购文件约定的其他情形。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">3.3 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">本次采购不接受联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-outline-level: 2; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">、采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">4.1 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">如贵单位有意参加谈判采购活动，请在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span>）上免费注册，注册成功后申请成为供应商。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">4.2 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">注册完成后，供应商于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">06</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>分到<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">11</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span>）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及&ldquo;<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>、供应商资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">4.3 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">经采购代理机构确认后，供应商可在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;选择&ldquo;网上支付&rdquo;扫码办理谈判采购文件缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载谈判采购文件。谈判采购文件费用：<span lang=\"EN-US\">500</span>元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">4.4 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">购买谈判采购文件的发票，待采购代理机构开出后供应商可在平台打印（购买谈判采购文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-outline-level: 2; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">、响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">5.1 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">响应文件递交的截止时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">17</span>日上午<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">5.2 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">响应文件递交的地点为：电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span>）&rdquo;，逾期送达的、未送到指定地点的响应文件，将拒绝接收。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-outline-level: 2; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">6</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">、谈判时间和地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">递交响应文件的供应商应委派代表准时参加谈判活动。谈判开始时间为<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">17</span>日上午<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分，与供应商进行谈判的具体时间在谈判开始后另行通知。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-outline-level: 2; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">7</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">7.1</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">本项目谈判采购公告仅在陕西采购与招标网（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://www.sntba.com/</span>）、秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span>）、中国招标投标公共服务平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://www.cebpubservice.com/</span>）发出；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">7.2</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">监督部门：陕西煤业化工实业集团有限公司规划工程管理部；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">7.3</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">秦源招标电子招标平台使用方法及技术支持咨询电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">400-685-1179</span>，邮箱：<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyebidding@163.com</span>（咨询日期：法定工作日；咨询时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">08:30~12:00 13:30~17:30</span>）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">7.4</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">秦源招标二期电子招投标系统操作手册（投标人<span lang=\"EN-US\">&amp;</span>供应商）操作手册下载网址：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"../cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html</a></span>。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">7.5</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">提出异议的渠道和方式：联系人：陕西煤业化工实业集团有限公司规划工程管理部；联系电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">029-8795600</span>，联系邮箱<span lang=\"EN-US\">: 328019537@qq.com</span>。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-outline-level: 2; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">8</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; tab-stops: 0cm 90.0pt 126.0pt 162.0pt 198.0pt 234.0pt 270.0pt 306.0pt 342.0pt 378.0pt 414.0pt 450.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; punctuation-trim: leading; word-break: break-all;\"><span 