ne; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目资金落实情况：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">已落实。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目概况：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">对西卓煤矿工业场地东北约</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4.0km处的煤矸石综合利用小流域治理示范工程进行现场调查测绘、完成相关技术咨询报告编制、监测及监控及效果评估。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">6</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">成交供应商数量及成交份额：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1家，比例100%。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">二</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">、采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2.1 采购范围：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">对西卓煤矿煤矸石综合利用小流域治理示范工程项目进行现场调查等工作，编制项目建议书、可行性研究报告、初步设计（含地形测绘、工程勘察报告、施工图）、环境影响评价、水土保持方案、水土保持初步设计、地质灾害危险性评估、稳定评价报告、防渗专项研究、环境背景监测、煤矸石成分检测分析、治理示范工程</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年度（治理第一年）环境影响监测、治理示范工程2027年度（治理第二年）环境影响监测、智能信息化、2026年度（治理第一年）治理效果评估、2027年度（治理第二年）治理效果评估等报告的编制，通过技术评审并获得主管部门或业主批复（或备案或评审意见）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2.2 服务期限：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1.项目建议书、可行性研究报告、初步设计（含地形测绘、工程勘察报告、施工图）、环境影响评价、水土保持方案、水土保持初步设计、地质灾害危险性评估、稳定评价报告：合同签订之日起30天内完成。2.防渗专项研究、环境背景监测、煤矸石成分检测分析、治理示范工程2026年度（治理第一年）环境影响监测、治理示范工程2027年度（治理第二年）环境影响监测、智能信息化、2026年度（治理第一年）治理效果评估、2027年度（治理第二年）治理效果评估：自开工建设起2年内完成。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2.3 </span></strong><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">服务地点：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">陕西省渭南市合阳县</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">城关西卓煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2.4 质量：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">编制的专题报告应符合国家和行业技术标准、规程和规范，通过技术评审并获得主管部门或业主批复（或备案或评审意见），其中：治理效果评估应通过生态环境部环境工程评估中心组织的技术验收会。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">三、供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">3.1 供应商依法设立并满足如下要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">资质要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">供应商须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；供应商须具有地质灾害防治单位地质灾害评估和治理工程勘查设计甲级</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">资质。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Hlk15585266\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">人员要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">项目负责人须具有高级工程师及以上职称，专业为（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">环境工程、环境科学、环境科学与工程、环境监测</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）任意一种即可，并提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年1月1日以后由社保部门出具的连续3个月有效社保证明。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2.技术人员须配备环境影响评价工程师2名、注册岩土工程师2名；并提供2026年1月1日以后由社保部门出具的连续3个月有效社保证明；</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">3）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">业绩要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">须提供近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年1月1日至谈判截止日期）至少1份</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">煤矿类</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">相关</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">可行性研究报告</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">或初步设计业绩，煤矿类环境影响评价或水土保持方案业绩至少</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1份，矿山地质环境保护与土地复垦方案（矿区生态修复方案）业绩至少1份。业绩均以</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">合同为准</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">，合同应至少包含合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页，有效时间以签订时间为准。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）财务要求：（以下两个条件二选一）</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1）供应商提供2025年经审计的财务审计报告（须包括审计报告正文签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表、并附审计机构营业执照、会计师事务所执业证书、注册会计师执业证书）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2）供应商提供企业账户银行出具的资信证明（自2026年5月1日以后出具）及银行开户许可证（或银行账户证明资料）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5）信誉要求：（下列要求均由供应商提供加盖公章的承诺书）：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1）供应商未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn）严重失信主体名单；</span></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2）供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">3.2 供应商不得存在下列情形之一：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位同时参加本采购项目的谈判。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）电子响应文件检测后MAC地址或加密信息两家及以上单位相同的情形。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5）供应商响应保证金从同一账户汇出或显示汇入同一子账号。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6）法律法规规定的其他情形。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">7）供应商被列入陕煤集团&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">建设项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">失信</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商名单</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&rdquo;且在公布期内（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">提供承诺</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">3 </span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">本次采购</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">不接受</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">四、采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">获取时间：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">从</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">02</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">6年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">日上午</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">时</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">0</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">0分至2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">8</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">分</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">获取办法：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-fami