ily: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;，未在投</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">接收</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。投标人应登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">五、开标时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5.1 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">25</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">09</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分（北京时间）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-