ass=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、其中&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">219</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">主供水管每隔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">500</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米安装一个</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">DN200</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">闸阀</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">每隔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">50</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米设置一个三通</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">每个三通上设置</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">KJ25</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">截止阀一个</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">并使用&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">25</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">高压架管沿巷道帮部固定敷设</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">距地</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">325</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">主压风管每隔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">500</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米安装一个</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">DN300</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">闸阀</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">每隔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米设置一个三通</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">每个三通上设置</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">KJ25</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">截止阀一个</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">并使用&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">25</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">高压架管沿巷道帮部固定敷设</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">距地</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、巷道内每隔</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">200</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米加装压风、供水分支胶管管理牌板。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、在各联巷及用风地点</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">219</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">主供水管和&Phi;</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">325</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">主压风管上加装</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">DN150</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">三通并加装阀门</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">用于各采掘工作面供风</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">共计加装三通</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">20</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、所有钢构件均做防腐处理。防腐涂层采用重防腐涂层</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">即采用富锌底漆做底层</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">环氧云铁做中间层</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">环氧沥青作面层</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">漆膜厚度不小于</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">200um</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、巷道内的原管路钢梁进行除锈刷漆</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,22#</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工字钢</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">长度</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米共计</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">980</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">组</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">防腐涂层采用重防腐涂层</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">即采用富锌底漆做底层</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">环氧云铁做中间层</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">环氧沥青作面层</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">漆膜厚度不小于</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">200um</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、所有安装材料地面装车</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地面运距</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">200</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">然后使用矿方车辆运输至井下联巷口</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">经人工运输至安装位置</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">平均运距</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1000</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、所有拆除工作量</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">由施工单位人工运输至中央胶带大巷各联巷并装车</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">平均运距</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1000</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">),</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">然后由矿方车辆运输升井</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">由施工单位卸车至指定地面存放地点</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地面运距</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">200</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、本工程施工在中央胶带大巷</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">皮带机正常生产</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">安装与生产同时进行，具体施工范围及工程量以招标清单为准。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">计划工期：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">180</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">天。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工程地</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">点：陕西省咸阳市彬州市彬长小庄矿。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">质量目标：符合现行国家有关工程施工质量验收规范和标准的要求，达到建设工程质量验收统一标准合格等级。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc24090\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText3\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc5196\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc27882\"></a><a name=\"_Toc89974230\"></a><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.1</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资质要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.1.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须为在中华人民共和国境内注册的企业法人或其他组织，具备有效的营业执照。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.1.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须具备矿山工程施工总承包壹级及以上资质，且具备有效的安全生产许可证，所有证书均应在有效期内。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText3\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.2</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">人员要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.2.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目负责人：拟派项目负责人应具备矿业工程或机电工程专业贰级及以上注册建造师注册证书，并持有有效的安全生产考核合格证书（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">B</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证），且未担任其他在建建设工程项目的项目负责人（须提供无在建项目承诺书）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.2.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">技术负责人：须具有机电工程专业中级及以上工程师职称，或持有机电工程专业贰级及以上注册建造师执业资格。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.2.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">安全负责人须持有有效的安全生产考核合格证书（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">C</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">类）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以上人员均须为申请人本单位在册职工，申请人须提供社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明，社保证明须覆盖</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后任意连续</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以上人员须为本单位在册职工，提供由社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日以后任意连续</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个月）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">绩要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">202</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日起至本</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">项目资格预审申请文件递交截止之日止（以合同签订时间为准）至少</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">项类似项目施工业绩，并提供相关合同扫描件，合同扫描件须至少包含合同双方盖章页、合同签订日期等信息</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText3\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.4</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">财务要求</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2024年度或2025年度经审计的财务报告，内容应包括审计报告正文（含签字盖章页）、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表；自成立之日起至投标截止日不足一年的投标人可仅提供财务报表，无需审计。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText3\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.5</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">信誉要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.5.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人未列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重失信主体名单（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.5.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）（以投标人加盖公章的承诺书为准）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText3\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; punctuation-trim: leading; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.6</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">其他要求：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本次</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">招标</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">不接受联合体</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 19.9000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc24749\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">三、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc363568583\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc356895431\"></a><a name=\"_Toc89974231\"></a><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.1 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">时</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">从</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">07</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">31</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">至</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">07</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">18</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">时（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">北京时间，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">节假日除外，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">下同）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.2 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1.</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须在</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）上免费注册，注册审批联系方式：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">029-81613218</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，平台客服电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">400-685-1179</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。邮 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">qyebidding@163.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。咨询日期：法定工作日。咨询时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08:30~12:00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">13:30~17:30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。投标人操作手册下载链接：</span></span><a href=\"http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/40.htm\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; color: #000000; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/40.htm</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注册完成后，投标人登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">上传</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;二、投标人资格要求&rdquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">所需上传</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资料的扫描件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人办理购买招标文件缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台自行下载招标文件。招标文件费用：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">800</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">元，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc89974233\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">四、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4.1 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交截止时间：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">26</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">09</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4.2 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;，未在投</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">接收</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。投标人应登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">五、开标时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5.1 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标时间：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">8</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">26</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">09</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分（北京时间）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5.2 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标地点：开标通过&ldquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。本项目采用不见面开标，投标人无需到场，允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">六、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1.</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本项目投标邀请书仅</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">秦源招标电子招标平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">发出</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须办理数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书并下载投标客户端。数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">证书办理及咨询电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4008206660</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">转</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。数字</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CA</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">驱动及办理指南下载网址：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/43.htm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。投标客户端下载网址：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">http://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/channel/help4/45.htm</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。 &nbsp;投标客户端客服电话： </span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">400-685-1179</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。邮 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">qyebidding@163.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。咨询日期：法定工作日。咨询时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">08:30</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&mdash;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">12:00</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">13:30</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&mdash;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">17:30</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">七、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">监督部门及异议渠道和方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1.</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本项目的监督部门为：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司规划部。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目监督电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">029-33191601</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。监督邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2236744@qq.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。联系人：郑先生。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3.</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">异议渠道及方式：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">或其他利害关系人对本</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">招标</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">公告及</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">招标</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">文件内容有异议的，应在</span><span class=\"16\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">招标</span><span class=\"16\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">文件递交截止</span><span class=\"16\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">时间</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">10日前</span><span class=\"16\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">以书面形式（邮件发送）向招标人提出，提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"16\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">1)异议人的名称、地址、联系人及有效联系方式。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"16\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2)提出异议项目的名称、编号、所涉及的具体事项及被异议人的有效联系方式。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"16\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3)提出异议事项的基本事实、具体理由及明确诉求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"16\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">4)有效线索和相关证明材料。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"16\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5)异议人为其他利害关</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">系人的，应提交利害关系证明。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc8858\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">八、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc152045525\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc35