煤业物资榆通有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">委托，现公开邀请供应商参加谈判采购活动，相关事项告知如下，相关事项告知如下：</span></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1、&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购项目简介</span></strong></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.1采购项目名称：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">小保当公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">110kV变电站故障录波装置、小电流接地选线装置及GIS综合在线监测系统升级改造项目</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（采购编号</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">0866-26E2SXQY0635</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">），本项</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">目共划分</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1个包次。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.2采购人：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西煤业物资榆通有限责任公司</span><u></u></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.3采购机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-inde