family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>谈判采购公告</strong></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目所在地区：陕西省</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">咸阳市</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司生产服务中心套管加工专用数控车床购置项目已具备采购条件，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">现公开邀请供应商参加谈判采购活动。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1、</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">采购项目简介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1.1 采购项目名称：生产服务中心套管加工专用数控车床购置项目</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1.2 采购人：陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司 </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1.3 采购编号</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">: 0866-26C2SXQY0506 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1.4 采购组织机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1.5 采购项目资金落实情况：企业自筹，出资率100%。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1.6 成交供应商数量及成交份额：一家</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，成交份额</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2、采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.1 采购范围：双头数控车床2台，数控车床应采用十字滑台移动结构。床身铸件应为整体式床身，材质不低于HT260-300，符合GB9439-88标准。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">导轨应采用硬轨，并进行高频淬火，淬火深度应达到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.5mm～3mm，硬度应达到HRC45～52，以提高耐磨性能。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">其他技术参数具体详见第五章采购需求</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.2 交货期</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：合同签订后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">60天。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.3 质保期</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">：一年。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.4 交货地点：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">陕西省咸阳市长武县亭口镇</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司生产服务中心。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.5 货物质量标准或主要技术性能指标：详见采购需求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">3、供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 18.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.1供应商应是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立的企业法人，须具有有效的营业执照；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 18.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.2供应商须提供近三年（2023年1月1日至递交谈判响应文件截止日期）以来（以合同签订时间为准）同类项目业绩3份及以上（如为刚承接的项目，应提供中标通知书（或成交通知书）；如为正在实施或已完成的项目，提供显示以上业绩项目名称、合同服务范围、合同签订时间页及双方盖章签字页）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.3供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">未被</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">列入</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&ldquo;信用中国&rdquo;（www.creditchina.gov.cn）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">严重失信主体名单</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.4供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单信息；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.5法定代表人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本次谈判采购；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.6本项目不接受联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4、采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.1获取时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时00分至2026年8月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">日下午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">18时00分。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4.2请有意参与本项目谈判的供应商</span><a name=\"_Hlk117178301\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在规定时间通过秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">qyzb.shccmg.com）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">购买采购文件。未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;供应商/投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;常用文件&mdash;供应商操作手册。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.3已注册的供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;供应商登录&rdquo;请将加盖单位公章的法人授权委托书（附法定代表人、委托代理人身份证复印件）及上述&ldquo;3、供应商资格要求&rdquo;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">的</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">所有</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">资料合成一个</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">PDF</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">上传。潜在</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">应及时关注、查阅秦源招标电子招标平台。因未及时查看导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.4经采购组织机构确认后，潜在供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台购买采购文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载采购文件。采购文件每套售价：800元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.5潜在供应商支付采购文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票（采购文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票，下载时间：本项目结束之后）。若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.6已注册的潜在供应商若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注：本项目所有程序均在秦源采购电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">qyzb.shccmg.com）进行操作执行，如有疑问请致电平台客服电话：400-685-1179</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（咨询日期：法定工作日</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">咨询时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">08:30-12:00 &nbsp;14:00-17:30）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">5、响应文件的递交：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">5.1 响应文件递交的截止时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2026年8月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00时整</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">（北京时间），</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">5.2响应文件递交方式：电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，未在谈判开始时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接受。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">6、谈判时间和地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">6.1 </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">谈判时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2026年8月1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00时整</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">（北京时间）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">6.2谈判方式：本次谈判通过&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;网上进行。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">6.3谈判地点为：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">38号陕西秦源招标有限责任公</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">司开标室</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">五</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">20</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">注：供应商需到达现场并携带笔记本电脑。</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">7、其他</span></s