acing: -0.6000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">采购</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.6000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">编号：</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.6000pt; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">0866-26C2SXQY0507）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">谈判采购公告</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目所在地区：陕西省</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">咸阳市</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">生产服务中心供配电系统改造箱式变电站购置项目已具备采购条件，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">现公开邀请供应商参加谈判采购活动。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1、</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">采购项目简介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1.1 采购项目名称：生产服务中心供配电系统改造箱式变电站购置项目</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1.2 采购人：陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司 </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1.3 采购编</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">号</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">: 0866-26C2SXQY0507 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1.4 采购组织机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1.5 采购项目资金落实情况：企业自筹，出资率100%。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1.6 成交供应商数量及成交份额：一家</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，成交份额</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2、采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; layout-grid-mode: char; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.1 采购范围：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">箱式变电站，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2套。单套明细：箱式变电站外壳，1台，箱顶盖应有5%坡度并装设防雨檐，顶盖不积水，防护等级不低于IP33D；</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中置式高压柜，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1台，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">额定电压：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">12kV，额定频率：50Hz，额定电流：630A，柜体尺寸：800&times;1660&times;2300mm，颜色为RAL7035；</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">干式电力变压器，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1台，额定容量3150KVA,额定频率50hz,相数三相；低压配电柜，5台，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">柜体颜色</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">RAL7035，外形尺寸：800（1200,1000）（宽）&times;800（1000）（深）&times;2200（高），按实际订货尺寸为准；防护等级IP30，系统额定电压：380V；</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">高压转运小车，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1台。其他参数详见第五章采购需求。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.2 交货期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">70天内。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.3 质保期：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">设备安装调试合格之日起</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">12个月或设备到货之日算起18个月，以时间先到者为先。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.4 交货地点</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">陕西省咸阳市长武县亭口镇</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司生产服务中心。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.5 货物质量标准或主要技术性能指标：详见采购需求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">3、供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.1供应商应是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立的企业法人，须具有有效的营业执照；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Hlk92988356\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2供应商须提供近三年（2023年1月1日至递交谈判响应文件截止日期）以来（以合同签订时间为准）类似项目业绩3份及以上（如为刚承接的项目，应提供中标通知书（或成交通知书）；如为正在实施或已完成的项目，提供显示以上业绩项目名称、合同服务范围、合同签订时间页及双方盖章签字页）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.4供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">未被</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">列入</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&ldquo;信用中国&rdquo;（www.creditchina.gov.cn）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">严重失信主体名单</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.5供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单信息；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.6法定代表人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本次谈判采购；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.7本项目不接受联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4、采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.1获取时间：2026年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时00分至2026年8月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日下午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4.2请有意参与本项目谈判的供应商</span><a name=\"_Hlk117178301\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在规定时间通过秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">qyzb.shccmg.com）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">购买采购文件。未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;供应商/投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;常用文件&mdash;供应商操作手册。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.3已注册的供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;供应商登录&rdquo;请将加盖单位公章的法人授权委托书（附法定代表人、委托代理人身份证复印件）及上述&ldquo;3、供应商资格要求&rdquo;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">的</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">所有</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">资料合成一个</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">PDF</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">上传。潜在</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">应及时关注、查阅秦源招标电子招标平台。因未及时查看导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.4经采购组织机构确认后，潜在供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台购买采购文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载采购文件。采购文件每套售价：800元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.5潜在供应商支付采购文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票（采购文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票，下载时间：本项目结束之后）。若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.6已注册的潜在供应商若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注：本项目所有程序均在秦源采购电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">qyzb.shccmg.com）进行操作执行，如有疑问请致电平台客服电话：400-685-1179</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（咨询日期：法定工作日</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">咨询时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">08:30-12:00 &nbsp;14:00-17:30）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">5、响应文件的递交：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">5.1响应文件递交的截止时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2026年8月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00时整</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">（北京时间），</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">5.2响应文件递交方式：电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，未在谈判开始时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接受。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">6、谈判时间和地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">6.1 </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">谈判时间</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2026年8月1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00时整</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">（北京时间）</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">6.2谈判方式：本次谈判通过&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;网上进行。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">6.3谈判地点为：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西省西安市莲湖区自强西路</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">38号陕西秦源招标有限责任公</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">司开标室</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">五</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">20</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">注：供应商需到达现场并携带笔记本电脑。</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">7、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">本项目的监督部门为：陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司规划部。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目监督电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">029-33191601。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">监督邮箱</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">：</span><a href=\"mailto:2236744@qq.com%E3%80%82\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; color: #000000; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2236744@qq.com。</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">联系人：王先生。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">8、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">采购人：陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family