t; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目简介<a name=\"_Hlk53648584\"></a></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">1.1</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目名称：安全生产标准化及应急能力建设评估咨询服务</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">1.2</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购人：陕煤电力汨罗有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">1.3</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购组织机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">1.4</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目资金落实情况：资金已到位</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">1.5</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK2\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK45\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目概况</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤汨罗<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>&times;<span lang=\"EN-US\">100</span>万千瓦燃煤发电工程项目厂址位于湖南省汨罗市白水镇，距离市区约<span lang=\"EN-US\">11.0km</span>。拟扩建<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>&times;<span lang=\"EN-US\">1000MW</span>超超临界二次再热燃煤发电机组，同步建设烟</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">气脱硫、脱硝设施。工程于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>月开工建设，<span lang=\"EN-US\">2027</span>年两台机组投产。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">1.6</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">成交供应商数量及成交份额：一家，成交份额：<span lang=\"EN-US\">100%</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><a name=\"_Hlk225177982\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.1</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">采购范围：<a name=\"_Hlk137766975\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK14\"></a></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.1.1 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">安全生产标准化达标咨询。严格按照能源局《电力建设工程安全生产标准化实施规范》《陕煤电力华中发电有限公司电力建设工程安全生产标准化达标评价细则》及相关要求提供技术咨询服务；组织国家能源局或电力行业方面专家进行安全生产标准化一级动态达标验收，并编制安全生产标准化建设评审报告，授予安全生产标准化达标一级牌匾。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.1.2 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">安全管理制度检查、修编。根据陕煤电力汨罗有限公司<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>&times;<span lang=\"EN-US\">100</span>万千瓦燃煤发电工程目前的类型及特点，于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>日前完成项目安健环管理制度审查及修编，并完成对其他各参建单位的安健环制度体系进行检查，并协助指导其修编完善。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.1.3 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">安全生产标准化管控支持体系建设。调研《企业安全生产标准化基本规范》相关的安全生产管理需求，分析安全生产标准化管控支持体系需求，设计功能架构（包括前后端结构、数据库设计等），制定用户角色和权限管理方案，提出修改完善安全信息化平台的建议，并指导完成，确保流程合理，要素齐全，满足项目安全生产标准化需求，并贯彻执行。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">&nbsp;2.1.4 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">日常安全管理服务。派驻<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>名火电建设经验丰富的安全生产标准化专家，自<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>日至<span lang=\"EN-US\">2027</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>日进行现场安全管理服务，协助建设单位开展日常安全管理工作。包括但不限于：参与建设单位组织的安全会议，提出专业建议；指导危险性较大分部分项工程的专项方案编制、专家论证及现场实施监督；对施工现场进行常态化巡查，及时发现并反馈安全隐患，跟踪整改闭环；协助开展安全教育培训，提升作业人员安全意识；配合建设单位进行应急演练策划与评估；定期向建设单位提交安全管理工作报告，为管理决策提供数据支撑。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">&nbsp;2.1.5 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">安全检查及培训服务。组织安全管理专家依据《电力建设工程安全生产标准化实施规范》（<span lang=\"EN-US\">DL/T 2679-2023</span>）分别于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>月、<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">11</span>月、<span lang=\"EN-US\">2027</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>月、<span lang=\"EN-US\">2027</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>月对本项目进行安全检查，并开展不少于两次安全生产标准化专项讲座（培训时长不少于<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>课时），检查出的问题由驻厂专家指导整改并持续督导检查整改效果。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">&nbsp;2.1.6&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">应急能力评估。依据《电力企业应急能力建设评估管理办法》（国能发安全〔<span lang=\"EN-US\">2020</span>〕<span lang=\"EN-US\">66</span>号）及《电力建设企业应急能力建设评估规范》等相关规定，对项目应急管理体系进行全面评估。于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">31</span>日前完成首次全面评估，形成《应急能力评估报告》，明确存在的薄弱环节并提出系统性改进建议；并于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">31</span>日前开展复评，验证整改成效，确保项目应急能力达到行业先进水平，满足安全生产标准化一级达标对应急管理要素的要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.2</span><a name=\"_Hlk175651893\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk146752279\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk140139122\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK5\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK8\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">服务期限：</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">自合同签订之日起至项目通过安全生产标准化一级评审，且不早于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2027</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>日。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.<a name=\"_Hlk53648978\"></a>3</span><a name=\"_Hlk86228230\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk93178661\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK38\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk93179697\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk226127915\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">服务地点：</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK16\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">湖南省岳阳市汨罗市白水镇双桥村毛栗塝上。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK46\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">2.4</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">工作总目标：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2027</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span>月前通过安全生产标准化一级动态达标及应急能力建设评估&ldquo;合格&rdquo;，授予安全生产标准化一级达标牌匾，并出具报告。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">．供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><a name=\"_Toc152042291\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk77338991\"></a><a name=\"_Toc144974483\"></a><a name=\"_Toc152045515\"></a><a name=\"_Toc179632531\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3.1</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">供应商应依<a name=\"OLE_LINK4\"></a>法设立且满足如下要求：<a name=\"_Hlk79872225\"></a></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><a name=\"_Hlk84679065\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk109421235\"></a><a name=\"_Hlk86224955\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）资质要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">供应商须为在中华人民共和国境内依法注册设立的独立法人企业或其他组织，若为企业法人，须提供有效的营业执照；若为事业法人，须提供有效的事业单位法人证书；若为其他组织，须提供合法有效的登记证明文件</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">； </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）财务要求：<span lang=\"EN-US\">/</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK26\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）业绩要求：</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK23\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK7\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK22\"></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 36.75pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><a name=\"OLE_LINK6\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">供应商须提供<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 2021</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日至递交响应文件截止时间内至少完成的<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>份类似项目业绩，业绩时间认定以合同完成时间为准；类似项目指为电力建设工程项目提供安全生产标准化建设咨询、评审辅导服务，协助委托方完成安全生产标准化达标考评的服务项目；业绩须提供对应证明材料，包括清晰体现合同双方主体、项目名称、服务内容、签订时间、双方签字盖章等核心信息的合同关键页复印件，以及加盖业主单位公章的项目完工证明材料（包括但不限于业主出具的验收确认书、达标考评通过证明、服务完工回执等），所有证明材料复印件须加盖供应商公章；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>）</span><a name=\"_Hlk148452022\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">信誉要求<a name=\"_Hlk92456497\"></a>：<a name=\"_Hlk220578760\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\">1.</span>供应商未列入&ldquo;信用中国（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https:</span>／<span lang=\"EN-US\">/www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span>）&rdquo;严重失信主体名单（以供应商加盖单位公章的承诺书为准）；<span lang=\"EN-US\">2.</span>供应商未列入&ldquo;国家企业信用信息公示系统（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span>）&rdquo;严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息（以供应商加盖单位公章的承诺书为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 26.25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">5</span>）其他要求：<span lang=\"EN-US\">/</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3.2</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">供应商不得存在下列情形之一：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）其他：被列入陕煤集团&ldquo;建设项目失信供应商名单&rdquo;且在公布期内。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 15.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">3.3</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">本次采购不接受联合体</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">．采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><a name=\"_Hlk53649298\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">4.1</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">有意参加谈判采购活动的供应商，请于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">07</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">23</span>日至<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">07</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>日，每日上午<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>时至下午<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>时（北京时间，下同），登录<a name=\"_Hlk204008035\"></a>秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyzb.shccmg.com</span>）购买采购文件。未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;常用文件&mdash;投标人操作手册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">4.2</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">已注册的潜在供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;投标人登录&rdquo;请将法人授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码及上述&ldquo;<span lang=\"EN-US\">3.</span>供应商资格要求&rdquo;的所有资料扫描以<span lang=\"EN-US\">PDF</span>文件形式上传。潜在供应商应及时关注、查阅秦源招标电子招标平台。因未及时查看导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">4.3</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">供应商通过秦源招标电子招标平台缴纳采购文件费，缴费完毕即可在平台下载采购文件。采购文件每套售价<span lang=\"EN-US\">800</span>元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">4.4</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">潜在供应商支付采购文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票（文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 26.25pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">4.5</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">已注册的潜在供应商若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">．响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none;\"><a name=\"_Hlk82017544\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">5.1 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">响应文件递交的截止时间为<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">03</span>日下午<span lang=\"EN-US\">14</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分（北京时间）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">5.2 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">响应文件递交方式：电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，未在谈判开始时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接收。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">6</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">．谈判时间和地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">6.1 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">谈判开始时间为<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">03</span>日下午<span lang=\"EN-US\">14</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分（北京时间）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">6.2 </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">谈判地点及方式：湖南省长沙市天心区新姚南路<span lang=\"EN-US\">222</span>号立达人酒店八楼会议室，本次谈判通过&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;实施，供应商须委派授权代表携带笔记本电脑，按规定时间抵达谈判现场参与谈判。已提交响应文件的供应商因故无法到场或缺席单轮谈判的，视为放弃该轮次现场商谈权利，但仍具备最终报价资格；供应商应自行查阅谈判全过程发布的通知、澄清及文件调整内容，缺席对应轮次视同知悉并认可全部谈判内容。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">6.3</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">通过谈判并进入最终报价环节的供应商，必须按谈判小组通知的时间登录系统在线填报并提交最终报价。逾期未上传或上传不成功的，该供应商被视为退出本次竞争性谈判</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">7</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">．发布公告的媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%; mso-pagination: none;\"><a name=\"_Hlk82017622\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体;\">本次谈判采购公告同时在中国招标投标公共服务平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.cebpubservice.com</span>）、陕西采购与招标网（<span lang=\"EN-US\">www.sntba.com</span