宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.1询比开始时间：2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">31</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.2询比地点：秦源招标电子招标平台。</span></p>\n<p class=\"23\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; break-after: avoid; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc14598\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">发布公告的媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"24\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本询比采购公告在中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.cebpubservice.com/）、陕西采购与招标网（http://www.sntba.com）及秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）上同时发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"24\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">监督部门及异议渠道和方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"25\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.1本项目监督部门:陕西煤业物资榆通有限责任公司物资管理部。</span></p>\n<p class=\"25\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系人：杨先生；监督电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">13891246218；监督邮箱：wgb@smwzyt.com。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"25\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.2 异议渠道及方式:供应商或其他利害关系人对本询比采购公告及询比采购文件内容有异议的，应在询比采购文件递交截止前5日内以书面形式(邮件发送)向采购人提出，邮箱：wgb@smwzyt.com。</span></p>\n<p class=\"25\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></p>\n<p class=\"25\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1)异议提出人名称、地址、电话等；</span></p>\n<p class=\"25\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2)具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料；</span></p>\n<p class=\"25\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3)异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章；</span></p>\n<p class=\"24\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4)提出异议的日期。</span></p>\n<p class=\"25\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc30614\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9.联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购人：陕西煤业物资榆通有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">详细地址：陕西省榆林市神木市杏花滩公园南侧陕煤集团</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1号楼12层</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">联系人：杨先生</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">15332628919</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2732057523@qq.com</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购机构名称：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">详细地址：陕西省榆林市神木市杏花滩公园南侧陕煤集团</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1号楼11层1-1110室</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系人：招标五部葛工</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18192595130</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"24\" style=\"text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">邮箱：</span><a href=\"mailto:360283738@qq.com\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">360283738@qq.com</span></a></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26E2SXQY0665',NULL,NULL,'1.1采购项目名称：陕煤集团神木柠条塔矿业有限公司井下主运输系统集控PLC控制箱更新采购','陕西煤业物资榆通有限责任公司','2026-07-21 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097379944235667457,'','2026-09-10 09:35:06','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕西神渭煤炭管道运输有限责任公司神渭管道输煤项目富余煤浆应用配套工程（渭化提浓供浆项目）搅拌器设备采购二次谈判采购公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/2ywgg/20260721/1264282326989275136.html','616dda452335cc6663aba58e823d1c46fececa02e5dc3b33e5bbc3b028e29595',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16pt;\">陕西神渭煤炭管道运输有限责任公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16pt;\">神渭管道输煤项目富余煤浆应用配套工程（渭化提浓供浆项目）搅拌器设备采购</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-line-break-override: restrictions; text-autospace: none; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（采购编号：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0866-26C2SXQY0471）</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 20.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16pt;\">二次</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16pt;\">谈判采购公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西神渭煤炭管道运输有限责任公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;神渭管道输煤项目富余煤浆应用配套工程（渭化提浓供浆项目）搅拌器设备采购&rdquo;已具备采购条件，现公开邀请符合资格条件的供应商参加该项目的谈判采购活动，相关事项告知如下：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">1、 采购项目简介</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">1.1 采购项目名称：神渭管道输煤项目富余煤浆应用配套工程（渭化提浓供浆项目）搅拌器设备采购</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">1.2 采购人：陕西神渭煤炭管道运输有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">1.3 采购编号：0866-26C2SXQY0471</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">1.4 采购组织机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">1.5 采购项目资金落实情况：企业自筹，出资率100%。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">1.6 采购项目概况：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目是陕西神渭煤炭管道运输有限责任公司为解决神渭输煤管道富余煤浆处置、盘活闲置资产而建设的配套工程，选址于神渭管运公司渭南站（陕西省渭南市高新区内），核心服务于陕西渭河煤化工集团有限责任公司（渭化）的生产需求。项目主要建设煤浆提浓装置，新增提浓车间、浓缩车间及供浆泵房等，装置设计生产能力为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">130万t/a。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">1.7成交供应商数量及成交份额：一家，成交份额100%。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">2、采购范围及相关要求</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">2.1 采购范围：神渭管道输煤项目富余煤浆应用配套工程（渭化提浓供浆项目）搅拌器15台等，包含货物运输、装卸、搬运、仓储、指导安装、调试、保险等。详见采购文件相应的技术规范书。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">2.2 交货期：合同签订生效后60日历天内将货物送达甲方交货地点（如有变化，具体以甲方通知为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">2.3 质保期：设备到货验收合格之日起18个月或设备安装调试投入运行后12个月（以先到为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">2.4 交货地点：陕西省渭南市临渭区东风大街西段38号陕西神渭管运公司渭南站。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">3、供应商资格要求</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">供应商应依法设立且满足如下要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">3.1 资质要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">供应商应是中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">3.2 财务要求：</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">无</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">3.3 业绩要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">须提供自</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年1月1日至响应文件的递交截止日至少具有2份</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">1000m&sup3;以上</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">搅拌器设备供货合同业绩（业绩时间以合同签订时间为准），需提供合同复印件首页、供货设备清单页、双方盖章签字页。代理商参加的，可提供授权制造商的业绩。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">3.4 信誉要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">3.4.1供应商未列入信用中国(</span><a href=\"https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span></a><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">)严重失信主体名单；（以响应人加盖公章的承诺书或网站截图为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">3.4.2供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统(</span><a href=\"https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span></a><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">)严重违法失信名单(黑名单)信息。（以响应人加盖公章的承诺书或网站截图为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">3.5 供应商不得存在下列情形之一：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">3.5.1 处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">3.5.2 进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">3.6 本次采购不接受联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4、采购文件的获取</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.1 获取时间：2026年0</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">7</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">月</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">2</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">1</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">日</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">下</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">午</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">15</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">00分至2026年0</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">7</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">月</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">2</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日下午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">4.2 获取办法：贵方如有参加，请在上述时间内登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><a href=\"../cms/default/webfile/index.html\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span></a><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&rdquo;购买并下载采购文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，点击&ldquo;供应商登录&rdquo;请将加盖单位公章的法人授权委托书（附法定代表人、委托代理人身份证复印件）及上述&ldquo;3、供应商资格要求&rdquo;上传附件，点击【发送】即可。随后按平台系统提示下载采购文件。采购文件每套售价：800元，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）有关注册、下载采购文件、上传电子响应文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：</span></span><a href=\"file:///C:/Users/Huawei/Desktop/7.29/qyebidding@163.com\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">qyebidding@163.com</span></a><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">08:30-12:00 13:30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">5、响应文件的递交：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">5.1 响应文件递交的截止时间为2026年07月30日</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">上</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">午</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">09</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">00分（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">5.2 响应文件递交方式：电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，未在谈判开始时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接收。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">6、谈判时间和地点</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">6.1 谈判开始时间为2026年07月30日</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">上</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">午</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">09</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">00分（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">6.2 谈判地点及方式：陕西省西安市自强西路38号秦源招标办公楼二楼开标室三(209) ，本次谈判通过&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;实施，供应商须委派授权代表携带笔记本电脑，按规定时间抵达谈判现场参与谈判。已提交响应文件的供应商因故无法到场或缺席单轮谈判的，视为放弃该轮次现场商谈权利，但仍具备最终报价资格；供应商应自行查阅谈判全过程发布的通知、澄清及文件调整内容，缺席对应轮次视同知悉并认可全部谈判内容。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">7、发布公告的媒介</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本采购公告在中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.cebpubservice.com/）、陕西采购与招标网（http://www.sntba.com/）和秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc22552\"></a><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><a name=\"_Toc25165\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">监督部门：陕西神渭煤炭管道运输有限责任公司招标办。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系人：曹经理，监督电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0913-2069676，监督邮箱：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:swgyzzb@qq.com%E3%80%82\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">swgyzbb@qq.com。</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">9</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">、联系方式</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">采购人：陕西神渭煤炭管道运输有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">地址：陕西省渭南市临渭区东风大街西段</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">38号</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">联系人：朱先生</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: 