9-10 09:35:06','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司43106、44210、44212工作面采煤沉陷区裂缝治理与植被恢复工程招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/2ywgg/20260721/1264181275577548800.html','4df11fbf75861de8a4af07b51145adc9d79ecb6e8ffc8b17ff771fbd4a1ad26d',NULL,'HTML','<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><a name=\"_Toc172105814\"></a><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; text-indent: 28px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">43106、44210、44212工作面采煤沉陷区裂缝治理与植被恢复工程</span></span></strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px;\">采购编号：</span><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px;\">0866-26E1SXQY0651</span></span></strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #221e1f;\">询比采购公告</span></span></h1>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&nbsp; 陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">43106、44210、44212工作面采煤沉陷区裂缝治理与植被恢复工程，采购人为陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司，项目资金来自企业自筹，出资比例为100%。项目已具备采购条件，陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司委托，现</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">公开邀请供应商参加询比采购活动</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，相关事项告知如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">一、采购项目简介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1、采购项目名称：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">43106、44210、44212工作面采煤沉陷区裂缝治理与植被恢复工程</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（采购编号：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">0866-26E1SXQY0651</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2、采购人：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">采购机构</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4、采购项目资金落实情况：企业自筹，比例100%。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5、采购项目概况：为全面贯彻落实《陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司红柳林煤矿矿山地质环境治理恢复与土地复垦年度工程治理计划（2026年度）》，有效解决矿产开发过程中引发的地质环境问题及土地损毁，现需对公司43106、44210、44212工作面采煤沉陷区进行治理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6、成交供应商数量以及成交份额：一家，100%</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二、采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购范围：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">43106工作面面积为73.4683hm2，治理面积为86.9610hm2；44210工作面面积为65.9928hm2，治理面积为65.9928hm2。44212工作面面积为36.2915hm2，治理面积为45.3169hm2。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面地类为旱地、乔木林地、灌木林地、其他林地、天然牧草地、其他草地、农村道路、设施农用地、沙地，工程主要实施内容为裂缝填充、警示牌、植被恢复。为避免造成生态环境破坏，将采空区治理分为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2个治理分区：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）治理分区Ⅰ：主要布置在地势平缓的梁峁与沟谷的耕地等；按照土质裂缝的不同宽度，为避免机械施工造成更大生态破坏，2~30cm以人工治理为主，＞30cm以机械治理为主、人工为辅的措施进行治理。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）治理分区Ⅱ：主要布置在地势平缓的梁峁与沟谷的草地等，为避免机械施工导致植被损毁，主要采取人工治理。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）在人类活动相对密集的区域设置警示牌</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，具体内容以工程量清单为准。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">工期：自合同签订</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">生效</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">之日起至工作面回采结束</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">质保期：</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">竣工验收合格之日起</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1年</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">质量要求：</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">合格。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2.5建设地点：陕煤集团神木红柳林煤矿。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">三、供应商资格要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.1供应商应满足如下要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）依法设立：供应商须为中华人民共和国境内合法注册的独立法人企业或其他组织机构，企业法人提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">资质要求：</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">具有地质灾害防治单位资质证书（地质灾害治理工程施工甲级资质），并具备有效的安全生产许可证。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目负责人要求：拟派项目负责人具有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">地质相关专业中级（含）以上职称</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，且不得在其他在建工程项目担任项目负责人（提供无在建项目承诺），项目负责人须为本单位在册职工，须提供社会保障管理部门出具的有效社保证明材料（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2025年10月1日起连续6个月)。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4）业绩要求：供应商须提供2023年1月1日至询比截止时间类似业绩至少1项（证明材料以合同为准，至少包含合同首页、签订日期、合同内容及双方盖章页，有效业绩时间以合同签订日期为准）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5）信誉要求：具有良好的社会信誉，未被国家企业信用信息公示系统（http://www.gsxt.gov.cn/index.html）列入严重违法失信名单（黑名单）；未被列入&ldquo;信用中国&rdquo;（http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单（以上条款提供承诺书或相关证明材料）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6）其他要求：供应商基本信息在&ldquo;陕西省建筑市场监管与诚信一体化管理系统&rdquo;可查询（提供查询截图）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.2供应商不得存在下列情形之一（提供承诺书或相关证明材料）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3.3本次采购不接受联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">四、采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">如贵单位</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">有意参加参加询比采购活动</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">请</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">于</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">21</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">下</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">午</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">17</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时至</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">24</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日下午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;网址为：（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）下载</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">询比</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">采购文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，按照提示信息进行供应商注册；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）注册成功后，登录系统，在【我要参与】列表中找到所要参加的项目，点击【立即参与】-【确定】，获取参与资格。完成后在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，上传授权委托书及&ldquo;三、供应商资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件，点击【提交】。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）有关注册、下载</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">询比</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购文件、上传电子文件等有关问题可咨询</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00，13：30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标二期电子招标系统的供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/供应商操作手册及开标注意事项：https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">询比</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购文件费用：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">500元，通过秦源招标电子招标平台支付，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.3购买</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">询比</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">采购文件的发票，待采购机构开出后</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">供应商可在平台打印（购买</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">询比</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">采购文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">询比</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">采购文件获取不足三家时，本次采购活动终止，重新发布</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">询比</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">采购公告。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">五、响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5.1递交截止时间：2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">29</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">5.2递交方式：将电子文件上传递交至&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，未在</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">询比</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">开始时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接收。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">六、询比时间和地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6.1询比开始时间：2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">29</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6.2询比地点：秦源招标电子招标平台。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">七、发布公告的媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本询比采购公告在</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">中国招标投标公共服务平台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋