12:00，13：30-17:30。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秦源招标二期电子招标系统的供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/供应商操作手册及</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注意事项：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241202/1048174459543879680.html。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.2询比采购文件费用：500元，通过秦源招标电子招标平台支付，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.3购买询比采购文件的发票，待采购机构开出后，供应商可在平台打印（购买询比采购文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.4获取</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购文件的潜在供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">不足三家时，本次采购活动终止，采购人重新组织采购。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; break-after: avoid; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc16929\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">响应文件的</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.1递交截止</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">27</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:00（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5.2递交方式：将电子文件上传递交至&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，未在询比开始时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接收。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; break-after: avoid; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc28407\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比时间和地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">6.1询比开始时间：2026年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">7</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">27</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9:0</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">0（北京时间）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.2询比地点：秦源招标电子招标平台。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; break-after: avoid; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc14598\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">发布公告的媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本询比采购公告在中国招标投标公共服务平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://www.cebpubservice.com/）、陕西采购与招标网（http://www.sntba.com）及秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com）上同时发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">监督部门及异议渠道和方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"21\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.1本项目监督部门:陕西煤业物资榆通有限责任公司物资管理部。</span></p>\n<p class=\"21\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系人：杨先生；监督电话：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">13891246218；监督邮箱：wgb@smwzyt.com。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"21\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.2 异议渠道及方式:供应商或其他利害关系人对本询比采购公告及询比采购文件内容有异议的，应在询比采购文件递交截</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">止前</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5日</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">内以书面形式</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(邮件发送)向采购人提出，邮箱：wgb@smwzyt.com。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"21\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">提出的异议书应包含的内容：</span></p>\n<p class=\"21\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1)异议提出人名称、地址、电话等；</span></p>\n<p class=\"21\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2)具体的异议事项、事实依据及相关证明材料；</span></p>\n<p class=\"21\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3)异议人署名。异议人为自然人的，由本人签字；异议人为法人或者其他组织的，由法定代表人或者主要负责人签字并加盖公章；</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4)提出异议的日期。</span></p>\n<p class=\"21\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.5000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; mso-outline-level: 2; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc30614\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9.联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购人：陕西煤业物资榆通有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">详细地址：陕西省榆林市神木市杏花滩公园南侧陕煤集团</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1号楼12层</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">联系人：李先生</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 20.8000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: -0.05pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">联系电话：</span><span style=\"font-fa