\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'PROJECTAREA_ADDR\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">陕西省</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">/</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">榆林市</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">/</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">陕西秦源招标有限责任公司受</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'TENDEREE_NAME\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'TENDEREE_NAME\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">陕煤集团神木柠条塔矿业有限公司</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">委托，就</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'MAIN_NAME\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'MAIN_NAME\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">柠条塔矿业有限公司锅炉房区域增设围墙大门等工程</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">组织本次谈判。该项目已具备采购条件，现邀请贵公司参加该项目的谈判采购活动，相关事项告知如下：</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:8pt; margin-bottom:4pt; text-align:justify; page-break-inside:avoid; page-break-after:avoid; line-height:15.75pt; widows:0; orphans:0\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-size:10.5pt; font-weight:bold\">1、采购项目简介</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">1.1采购项目名称：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'MAIN_NAME\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'MAIN_NAME\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">柠条塔矿业有限公司锅炉房区域增设围墙大门等工程</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">（采购编号：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'MAIN_CODE\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'MAIN_CODE\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">0866-26E1SXQY0654</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">）。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">1.2 采购人：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'TENDEREE_NAME\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'TENDEREE_NAME\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">陕煤集团神木柠条塔矿业有限公司</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">1.3 采购机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">1.4 采购项目资金落实情况：企业自筹，出资率100%</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">1.5 采购项目概况：详见第五章采购需求 </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">1.6 成交供应商数量及成交份额：一家，成交份额100%</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:8pt; margin-bottom:4pt; text-align:justify; page-break-inside:avoid; page-break-after:avoid; line-height:15.75pt; widows:0; orphans:0\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-size:10.5pt; font-weight:bold\">2、采购范围及相关要求</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">2.1</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">项目概况：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'BIDDING_CONTENT\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'BIDDING_CONTENT\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">采购人拟对锅炉房区域增设围墙大门工程进行谈判采购</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">2.2采购范围：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'BIDDING_SCOPE\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'BIDDING_SCOPE\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">包含布袋除尘间、鼓风机房等升级改造，锅炉房内部升级改造，二层锅炉房卫生间升级改造，锅炉房外区域升级改造，锅炉房栈桥及廊道，办公楼屋面防水改造，煤质科展览走廊、档案室改造，落煤塔东侧围墙大门，南门道闸门电路改造等。</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">2.3</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">工</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">期：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'DURATION\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'DURATION\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">90</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">天</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">2.4</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">质量要求：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'SERVICE_QUALITY\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'SERVICE_QUALITY\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">合格</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">2.5</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">建设</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">地点：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'CONSTRUCTION_SITE\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'CONSTRUCTION_SITE\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">柠条塔矿业有限公司厂区</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:8pt; margin-bottom:4pt; text-align:justify; page-break-inside:avoid; page-break-after:avoid; line-height:15.75pt; widows:0; orphans:0\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-size:10.5pt; font-weight:bold\">3、供应商资格要求</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">3.1 供应商应满足如下要求：</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">（1）依法设立：供应商须为中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人企业或事业单位，能够提供有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">（2）</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">资质</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">要求</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'TENDER_QUALI_CLAIM\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'TENDER_QUALI_CLAIM\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">供应商须具备房屋建筑工程施工总承包三级及以上资质</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">（3）</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">业绩</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">要求</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">：</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">/</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">（4）</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">信誉要</span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">求：具有良好的社会信誉，未被国家企业信用信息公示系统</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">（http://www.gsxt.gov.cn/index.html）列入严重违法失信名单（黑名单）；未被列入“信用中国”（http://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单（以上条款提供承诺书或相关证明材料）。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">（5）人员要求：拟派项目负责人须具备房屋建筑工程专业二级（含）以上注册建造师执业资格证书，并具有有效的B类《安全生产考核合格证书》。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">（6）其他要求：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'OTHER_REQUIREMENTS\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">/</span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">3.2 供应商不得存在下列情形之一（提供承诺书或相关证明材料）：</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">3.3 </span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'UNION_SEND_INFO\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'UNION_SEND_INFO\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">本次招标不接受联合体投标。</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:8pt; margin-bottom:4pt; text-align:justify; page-break-inside:avoid; page-break-after:avoid; line-height:15.75pt; widows:0; orphans:0\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-size:10.5pt; font-weight:bold\">4、采购文件的获取</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">4.1 获取时间：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'SALE_BEGIN_TIME\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'SALE_BEGIN_TIME\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2026-07-17 17:00</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:underline\">至</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'SALE_END_TIME\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'SALE_END_TIME\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2026-07-21 23:59</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:underline\">（北京时间）。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">4.2获取方式：有意参与项目者，请在上述时间内登录“秦源招标电子招标平台</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">（https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html）”确认并下载谈判采购文件，具体操作步骤如下：</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">（1）登录“秦源招标电子招标平台”，在【我的项目】列表中找到已参与的项目，点击【邀请回执】进入邀请回执确认页面，上传电子文件，点击【发送】即可。随后按平台系统提示下载采购文件；谈判采购文件费用：</span><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'PRICE_MODEL\'\"><span style=\"-aw-sdt-tag:\'PRICE_MODEL\'\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">500</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">元，售后不退。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">（2）有关注册、下载采购文件、上传电子响应文件等有关问题可咨询“秦源招标电子招标平台”客服，客服电话：400-685-1179，邮箱：qyebidding@163.com。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：08:30-12:00、13：30-17:30。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">下载网址：</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">（1）秦源招标二期电子招标系统的供应商/供应商操作手册及开标注意事项</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/cywj/20241126/1046075888694722560.html。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:21pt; text-align:justify; widows:0; orphans:0; font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:SimSun\">（2）秦源招标二期投标客户端及驱动下载网址：</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bott