ong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购项目简介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购项目名称：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">柠条塔矿矿井主要排水泵房运行状态安全监测系统项目采购（采购编</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">号：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0866-26E2SXQY0579）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">釆购人：陕西煤业物资榆通有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">釆</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">机构：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">釆购项目资金落实情况：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">企业自筹，比例</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购项目概况：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目针对陕煤集团神木柠条塔矿业有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">13个泵房、57台水泵，通过在排水泵安装传感器和监测主机，搭建物联网，实现水泵运行中的振动、温度等信号的采集，并将数据上传至现场服务器，通过专业系统软件进行处理和分析，实现故障预警及精确诊断，提供1年远程诊断服务，搭建水泵在线监测及故障诊断系统。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 3; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6成交供应商数量及成交份额：一家，100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1采</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">购范围：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目采购范围覆盖现场</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">13个泵房、57台水泵的在线监测及故障诊断系统相关设备、辅材及服务。具体包括：320个矿用本安型无线振动温度传感器（含22个备品）、13台矿用振动温度监测装置主机、13台矿用隔爆兼本安型直流稳压电源、1套安装及辅材，以及1年远程诊断看护服务，涵盖设计、制造、试验、包装、运输、</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">指导</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">安装、调试、验收及售后服务等为实施本项目所需的全部工作内容，具体内容及要求详见</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购文件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">第五章</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">采购需求</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">交货期：合同签订生效后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">40个工作日内到矿</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">交货地点：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">柠条塔</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">煤矿</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4质保期：验收通过后12个月，供货方必须对所供产品质量实行三包。</span></p>\n<p class=\"21\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21.1pt; break-after: avoid; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc219\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">供应商应满足如下要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\" align=\"justify\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（1）</span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">依法设立</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\" align=\"justify\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">a.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">必</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">须具有独立法人资格，并提供加载统一社会信用代码的营业执照或事业单位法人证书、提供开户许可证或基本存款账户信息证明材料。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\" align=\"justify\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">b.</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本项目接受制造商或授权代理商参与，如为授权代理商参与，必须提供制造商针对本项目唯一的授权委托书。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）资质要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">必须提供矿用本安型无线振动温度传感器、矿用振动温度监测装置主机、矿用隔爆兼本安型直流稳压电源煤矿安全标志证书及防爆合格证</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">财务要求：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">必须提供（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">-202</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年）连续三年经第三方审计的财务报告，若公司成立时间不足三年，可提供成立之后年份经第三方审计的财务报告。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">业绩要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">a.如为制造商参与，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">应具有近年（自</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年1月1日至</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">截止日期）至少三项</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">煤矿设备状态</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">安全监测系统或故障诊断系统</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">销售业绩（业绩以合同及合同对应的任意一张增值税发票为准，对应的增值税发票在国家税务总局全国增值税发票查验平台核验必须真实、有效，合同必须有双方盖章页、首页、供货清单，合同内容清晰，甲乙双方盖章完整，有效业绩时间以合同签订时间为准</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"20\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">b.如为授权代理商参与，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">应具有近年（自</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年1月1日至</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">询比采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">截止日期）至少三项</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">煤矿设备状态</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 10.5pt;\">安全监测系统或故障诊断系统</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">销售业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">授权代理商可提供自身销售业绩或所代理制造商的销售业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-