t-family: 宋体;\">邮</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;箱：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:121454895@qq.com\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">121454895@qq.com</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; color: #ff0000; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26B2SXQY0372',NULL,NULL,'聚烯烃弹性体（POR）工业化示范项目精馏系统真空泵（干式）','陕西陕煤协创达新材料有限公司','2026-07-15 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097380117846298625,'','2026-09-10 09:35:06','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','陕西某单位改扩建项目-训练场馆改造消防检测二次询价公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/2ywgg/20260715/1261958669914865664.html','d5b42e48cf044d00fc54798ed7c62a6ca6f0bbcc648b379f10072bdae64b2eb5',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%; mso-outline-level: 1;\" align=\"center\"><a name=\"_Toc234915135\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体;\">陕西某单位改扩建项目<span lang=\"EN-US\">-</span>训练场馆改造消防检测二次询价公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%; mso-outline-level: 1;\" align=\"center\"><a name=\"_Toc234915136\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体;\">（采购项目编号：<span lang=\"EN-US\">0866-26D3SXQY0220</span>）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">陕西某单位改扩建项目<span lang=\"EN-US\">-</span>训练场馆改造消防检测，经相关部门批准，对本项目组织询价，欢迎符合资格条件的、有能力提供本项目所需服务的供应商响应。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体;\">一、项目基本情况：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目编号：<span lang=\"EN-US\">0866-26D3SXQY0220</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">项目名称：陕西某单位改扩建项目<span lang=\"EN-US\">-</span>训练场馆改造消防检测</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">最高限价：<span lang=\"EN-US\">10000</span>元</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">项目概况：本项目为现有靶场地上<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>层的综合性改造工程，改造建筑面积约<span lang=\"EN-US\">1036.59</span>平方米。改造内容主要包括建筑室内装饰装修、给排水、电气、暖通空调、消防系统等专业的全面升级改造，以满足现代化训练场馆的功能需求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">5.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">采购范围及内容：①按照相关标准规范要求，对项目开展的消防查验工作进行服务指导；②开展消防设施检测工作，出具消防设施检测报告，对报告结果负责，并承担相应法律责任。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">6.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">服务期限：供应商在接收采购人委托单之日起<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>个日历天内完成检测，并在检测完成之日起<span lang=\"EN-US\">15</span>个日历天内将全套正式纸质版检测报告移交采购人。 </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体;\">二、供应商的资格要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">、资质要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoCommentTextCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织。企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoCommentTextCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）供应商信息在社会消防技术服务信息系统（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://shhxf.119.gov.cn/</span>）中可查询，且服务内容需包含&ldquo;消防设施维护保养检测&rdquo;（以网页截图为准）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoCommentTextCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）拟派项目负责人须具有一级注册消防工程师资格<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>在本单位注册且在社会消防技术服务信息系统<span lang=\"EN-US\">(https://shhxf.119.gov.cn/)</span>中可查询（以网页截图为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoCommentTextCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">、近三年（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2023</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">01</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">01</span>日至报价响应文件递交截止之日）具有消防检测业绩（时间以合同签订时间为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoCommentTextCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">、信誉要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoCommentTextCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商不得在&ldquo;信用中国<span lang=\"EN-US\">-</span>中国执行信息公开网&rdquo;网站被列为失信被执行人（以供应商加盖公章的承诺书为准）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoCommentTextCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）供应商不得在项目所在地各级建设诚信平台被列为投标受限制的行为人（以供应商加盖公章的承诺书为准）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoCommentTextCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）供应商不得在全国企业信用信息公示系统被列入严重违法失信企业名单（以供应商加盖公章的承诺书为准）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoCommentTextCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">、单位负责人为同一人或者存在直接控股、管理关系的不同供应商，不得同时参加本采购项目。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoCommentTextCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; 