span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53648584;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">1.3</span></strong></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53648584;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">采购人：陕煤电力石门有限公司</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53648584;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">1.4</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53648584;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">采购组织机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53648584;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">1.5</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53648584;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">采购项目资金落实情况：企业自筹，出资率<span lang=\"EN-US\">100%</span>。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53648584;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">1.6</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53648584;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">采购项目概况：陕煤石门<span lang=\"EN-US\">2&times;66</span>万千瓦扩能升级改造项目位于湖南省石门县，是陕煤集团为提升发电效率、推动绿色转型而实施的重点项目。项目积极响应国家<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>双碳<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>战略，致力于打造花园式、生态型、景观化的现代绿色电厂。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53648584;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">1.7</span></strong></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53648584;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">成交供应商数量及成交份额：一家，成交份额：<span lang=\"EN-US\">100%</span>。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53648584;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">2</span></strong></span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">、采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">2.1</span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk176732101;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">采购范围：<span style=\"letter-spacing: .2pt; layout-grid-mode: line;\">陕煤石门<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>&times;<span lang=\"EN-US\