er-spacing: .05pt; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.1.4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk180141275;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk109421235;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk176732756;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk79872225;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">信誉要求：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk180141275;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk109421235;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk176732756;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk79872225;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）供应商未列入信用中国<span lang=\"EN-US\">(https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/)</span>严重失信主体名单（以供应商加盖公章的承诺书或网站截图为准为准）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk180141275;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk109421235;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk176732756;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk79872225;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统<span lang=\"EN-US\">(https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/)</span>严重违法失信名单<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>黑名单<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>信息（以供应商加盖公章的承诺书或网站截图为准）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk180141275;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk109421235;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk176732756;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk79872225;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.1.5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk180141275;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk109421235;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk176732756;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk79872225;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">其他要求：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.2pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk180141275;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk109421235;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk176732756;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk79872225;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk84679065;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc179632531;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152045515;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc144974483;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc152042291;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk77338991;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: .05pt; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加本项目谈判，否则相关谈判均无效；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.2 </span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649150;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">供应商不得存在下列情形之一：</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649150;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.2.1</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649150;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649150;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.2.2</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649150;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649150;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.2.3</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649150;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">在最近三年内发生重大产品质量问题。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649150;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">3.3 </span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649150;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">本次采购不接受联合体。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649150;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">4</span></strong></span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">、采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">4.1</span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">获取时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">14</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">08</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分至<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">18</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">4.2</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">请供应商登录秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span>）购买电子文件。未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;供应商注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;常用文件&mdash;供应商操作手册。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">4.3</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">已注册的供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击&ldquo;供应商登录&rdquo;请将加盖单位公章的法人授权委托书（附法定代表人、委托代理人身份证复印件）及上述&ldquo;<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>、供应商资格要求&rdquo;的<span lang=\"EN-US\">3.1</span>条资料上传。潜在供应商应及时关注、查阅秦源招标电子招标平台。因未及时查看导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">4.4</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">潜在供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台购买采购文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载采购文件。采购文件每套售价：<span lang=\"EN-US\">800</span>元，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">4.5</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">潜在供应商支付采购文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票（采购文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">4.6</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">已注册的潜在供应商若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 21.3pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">4.7</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">有关注册、下载采购文件、上传电子响应文件等有关问题可咨询&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;客服，客服电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">400-685-1179</span>，邮箱：<span lang=\"EN-US\">qyebidding@163.com</span>。咨询日期：法定工作日，咨询时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">08:30-12:00 13</span>：<span lang=\"EN-US\">30-17:30</span>。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649298;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">5</span></strong></span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">、响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">5.1</span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649359;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">响应文件递交的截止时间</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649359;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">28</span>日上午<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649359;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">5.2</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649359;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">响应文件递交方式：电子文件上传递交到&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，未在谈判开始时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接受。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk53649359;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">6</span></strong></span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">、谈判时间和地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">6.1</span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk82017544;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">谈判开始时间：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2026</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">28</span>日上午<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>时<span lang=\"EN-US\">00</span>分（北京时间）。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk82017544;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">6.2</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk82017544;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">谈判地点及方式：湖南省长沙市天心区新姚南路<span lang=\"EN-US\">222</span>号立达人酒店八楼会议室，本次谈判通过<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>秦源招标电子招标平台<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>网上进行，供应商需携带笔记本电脑到达谈判现场。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk82017544;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">7</span></strong></span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">、发布公告的媒介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">本次谈判采购公告</span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk82017622;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">仅在</span></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk82017622;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">&ldquo;</span></span><a href=\"http://www.cebpubservice.com/\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk82017622;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; color: windowtext; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">中国招标投标公共服务平台<span lang=\"EN-US\"> (http://www.cebpubservice.com/)</span></span></span></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk82017622;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">、陕西采购与招标网（<span lang=\"EN-US\">http://www.sntba.com/announcement?id=35&amp;page=1&amp;tab=40</span>）和秦源招标电子招标平台（<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span>）&rdquo;发布。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk82017622;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">8</span></strong></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk82017622;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">、其他</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">本谈判项目的监督部门为陕煤电力石门有限公司部，联系人<span lang=\"EN-US\">: </span>王紫薇，监督电话：<span lang=\"EN-US\">0736-5162285 </span>，监督邮箱：<span lang=\"EN-US\">2020956159@qq.com </span>。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">9</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">采购人：陕煤电力石门有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN;\">地<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span>址：湖南省石门县宝峰街道宝塔社区</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.75pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-s