qygjb@126.com</span></p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0866-26D3SXQY0544',NULL,NULL,'建庄矿业五盘区东部、四盘区南部、四盘区东部地表瞬变电磁物探','陕西陕煤蒲白矿业有限公司','2026-09-09 00:00:00',NULL,NULL,'ACTIVE','APPROVED',NULL,'SOCIAL',0,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,NULL,'NONE',NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL),(2097475618386141185,'','2026-09-10 09:35:06','','2026-09-10 09:36:13',_binary '\0','QYZB','秦源电子招标平台','建庄矿业五盘区东部高密度三维地震勘探招标公告','https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/1ywgg/20260909/1282244435584745472.html','9938970ab7666617bd7b4bc602684de5ca479901bd360fe0c14744573c1e3830',NULL,'HTML','<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">陕西陕煤蒲白矿业有限公司</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">建庄矿业五盘区东部高密度三维地震勘探</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; word-break: break-all; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">招标公告</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: center; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">（招标编号：</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">0866-26D3SXQY0545</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">）</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">项目所在地：陕西省，延安市，黄陵县</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">一、招标条件</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">建庄矿业五盘区东部高密度三维地震勘探</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已由项目审批</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">/核准/备案机关批准，项目资金来源为其他资金（企业自筹，比例100%），招标人为陕西陕煤蒲白矿业有限公司。本项目已具备招标条件，现招标方式为公开招标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">二、项目概况和招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1、项目概</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">况：五盘区东部地表对应区域实施面积为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.6Km&sup2;的高密度三维地震勘探，为五盘区东部安全采掘作业提供地质支撑。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2、招标范围：查明区域内落差&ge;5m的断层；控制可采煤层的埋藏深度及起伏形态；预测主采煤层的厚度变化趋势；预测并解释勘探区内的地质异常体；查明主要可采煤层受古河床、古隆起影响的范围。通过以上工作，查明采掘范围内的地质隐蔽致灾因素，保障矿井安全生产。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3、服务期限：自合同签订之日起，总工期180个日历天。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4、服务地点：陕西省延安市陕西煤业集团黄陵建庄矿业有限公司。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">5、质量标准：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">勘探设计、方法、成果满足相关规范、标准要求，通过专家的评审</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1、资格条件：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人须是中国境内合法注册的独立法人或其他组织，企业法人应提供有效的营业执照，事业法人应提供事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">业绩要求：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人近年（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同签订时间为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2020年01月01日至投标截止日</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">）具有至少一份</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">高密度三维地震勘探相关</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">服务业绩（以合同为准，至少包含合同首页、工作范围页、合同签订时间页及双方盖章页）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3、信誉要求（下列要求均</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">以</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书为准）：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）投标人未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/）严重失信主体名单；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">本项目不允许联合体投标。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年0</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">09</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">08时30分到2026年0</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">16</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时00分</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">获取方式：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">1、投标人须在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上免费注册。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2、注册完成后，投标人登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及&ldquo;三、投标人资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">3、经招标机构确认后，通知投标人办理购买招标文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载招标文件。招标文件费用：500元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">4、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">购买招标文件的发票，待招标机构开出后投标人可在平台下载（购买招标文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">五、投标文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">递交截止时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">2026年9月30日09时00分</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-break: break-all; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交方式：电子文件上传递交到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;，未在投标截止时间前成功递交的投标文件将被拒绝接收。投标人应登录秦源招标电子招标平台在线参与开标会议，完成解密和确认步骤。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt;\">六、开标时间及地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.5500pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; word-