>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目资金落实情况：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已落实。企业自筹，出资率</span>100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">5</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购项目概况：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">陕西澄合山阳煤矿有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">CT502<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面近南北向展布，南北长约</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1100</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米，东西宽约</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">200</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米。采深</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">435</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米，采高</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3~3.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米。采用条带式开采，日推进速度约</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米，上部黄土覆盖层</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">130~170</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米。根据前期监测记录，影响半径一般</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">180</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米，最大</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">250</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米。</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">CT502</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作面西侧煤壁边界与运庄村东侧十户居民房屋的最近水平距离约为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">88</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">米。由于该工作面正由北向南方向推进，即将从十户房屋旁侧穿过。鉴于搬迁协调存在实际困难，为最大程度降低采动活动对地表房屋的损害风险，保障居民生命财产安全，我公司决定采取预先主动加固措施。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">6</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">成交供应商数量及成交份额：</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1<span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">家，比例</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">100%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-left: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">二</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、采购范围及相关要求</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"16\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1 <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购范围：</span></span></strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 