织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">）业绩要求：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">供应商具有近年（合同签订时间为</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">202</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">01月01日起至响应文件递交截止之日）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">至少</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3份</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">综掘机</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">维修业绩</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">业绩</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">以合同为准，包含合同首页、主要工作范围页、合同签订时间页、双方盖章签字页）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">）信誉要求（下列要求均由供应商提供加盖公章的承诺书）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: normal; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">①供应商未列入信用中国（https://www.creditchina.gov.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">cn/）严重失信主体名单；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">②供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单（黑名单）信息。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2 供应商不得存在下列情形之一：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1）处于被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销执照、暂扣或者吊销许可证、吊销资质证书状态；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2）进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3）其他：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">法律法规规定的及谈判采购文件约定的其他情形。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3 本次采购不接受联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4、采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.1 如贵单位有意参加谈判采购活动，请在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上免费注册，注册成功后申请成为供应商。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.2 注册完成后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，供应商于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年9月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">08时30分到2026年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">14</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18时</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">00分登录&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）上传授权委托书、委托代理人姓名、手机号码以及&ldquo;3、供应商资格要求&rdquo;所有资料的扫描件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.3 经采购代理机构确认后，供应商可在&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;选择&ldquo;网上支付&rdquo;扫码办理谈判采购文件缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载谈判采购文件。谈判采购文件费用：500元，售后不退。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.4 购买谈判采购文件的发票，待采购代理机构开出后供应商可在平台打印（购买谈判采购文件发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level: 2;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5、响应文件的递交</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; word-break: break-all; punctuation-trim: leading; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5.1 响应文件递交的截止时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2026年9月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">17</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">09时00分</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-para-margin-top: 0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt left blank 90.0000pt left blank 126.0000pt left blank 162.0000pt left blank 198.0000pt left blank 234.0000pt left blank 270.0000pt left blank 306.0000pt left blank 342.0000pt left blank 378.0000pt left blank 414.0000pt left blank 450.0000pt; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mo