s=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本招标项目陕西龙门钢铁有限责任公司高压变频器采购已批准，项目资金来源为企业自筹，出资比例为</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%，招标人为陕西龙门钢铁有限责任公司。本项目已具备招标条件，招标方式为公开招标。诚邀符合条件的潜在投标人前来参加。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc67468311\"></a><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">二、项目概况和招标范围</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><a name=\"_Toc67468312\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1、项目概况：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕西龙门钢铁有限责任公司</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">能源管控中心</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">现有</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">400㎡烧结主抽风机配套高压变频器目前已连续运行12年，远超电子设备常规使用寿命，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">整体设备及</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">电子元件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">老化</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，故障频发。为彻底消除设备</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">隐患</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，保障烧结产</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">线长期安全、稳定、经济运行，现计划对四台主抽高压变频器实施整体升级改造，更换为两台大功率高压变频器（高压电源</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">10kV AC&plusmn;10%，容量&ge;11000kVA，输出电流&ge;6</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">00A</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">），采用</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;一拖一&rdquo;控制模式。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">400㎡烧结主抽风机配套</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">高压</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">变频器</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">主要包括：高压变频器本体</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2台</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（高压电源</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">10KV AC&plusmn;10%，容量&ge;11000KVA，输出电流&ge;6</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">00A</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，一次预充柜</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2台，变频进线柜2台，变频出线柜2台。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">变频控制系统的程序编写与调试，新控制系统上位机的控制系统画面编程；系统功能、路线布置、后台监控等技术服务；提供变频器到电机、开关柜到变频器的控制电缆、低压动力电缆、通讯电缆、光纤、网关、孔洞封堵、防火材料等辅</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">材；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">所有软件（包括但不限于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">PLC程序、HMI画面）的完整、未加密的源代码及目标代码、变量表均需交付</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">招标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，并授予</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">招标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">及其指定第三方永久、不可撤销、免费的修改、复制、安装、备份的权利，所有软件不得包含任何形式的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;逻辑炸弹&rdquo;、时间锁或授权限制，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">其他内容</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">详见本项目技术规格书。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.2、招标范围：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人负责拟投标设备</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">系统</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">的设计、制造（含设备系统所需的软件）、检验、试验、包装、运输、必要的附件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">提供变频器到电机、开关柜到变频器的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">线缆及其他</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">辅</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">材</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">、备品备件及专用工位器具、技术资料（包括出厂检验合格证</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">、检测报告、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">软件程序备份</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">设备清单、设备操作手册</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">电气原理图、日常维护保养手册等）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">指导</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">安装、调试、人员培训与服务</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，并</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">配合完成整套设备性能考</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">核验收、售后服务及质保期内的维修和保养等为实施本项目所需的全部工作内容，详见本项目发包人要求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3、交货期：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">合同签订生效</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">之日起</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">100</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日历天</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4、质保期：</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">整套设备安装调试验收合格后</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5、质量：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">所供货物符合国家及行业现行质量验收标准合格等级。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.6、交货地点：</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">陕西省韩城市龙门镇龙钢公司。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-autospace: none; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">三、投标人资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.1、资质要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -5.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人必须是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立法人、事业单位或其他组织，具备有效的企业法人营业执照或事业单位法人证书，其他组织应提供合法登记证明文件；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -5.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本项目接受代理商投标，投标人为代理商时，需提供拟投标设备制造商出具针对本项目的唯一授权委托书（同一品牌同一型号仅接受一家授权），</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\">同一品牌同一型号的设备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">只接受</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">家投标人投标；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）投标人须提供由具备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CMA或CNAS资质的第三方检测机构出具、对应拟投标产品型号的完整型式试验报告（额定电压等级&ge;10kV，容量&ge;10000kVA）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">财务</span></strong><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">投标人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">须</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提供基本账户银行出具的资信证明（自</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日以后出具）及银行开户许可证（或银行基本账户证明资料）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年&mdash;2025年连续三年）经会计师事务所或审计机构出具的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件（至少包括审计报告签字盖章页、资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表）</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">若投标人成立不足三年，则提供自成立年份以来的财务审计报告、财务报表复印件</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">若投标人成立不足</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">一</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">须</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">提供</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">自成立以来的财务报表，财务报表至少包含：资产负债表、利润表、现金流量表。</span></p>\n<p class=\"17\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 21.1000pt; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.3、业绩要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）当投标人为制造商时，</span><a name=\"OLE_LINK18\"></a></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">需提供近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2021年1月1日至投标截止日期</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）至少</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3份</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">高压变频器</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（额定电压</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">等级</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&ge;10KV，容量</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&ge;10000KVA</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的制造供货业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）当投标人为代理商时，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">需提供近年（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2021年1月1日至投标截止日期</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）至少</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3份</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">本次投标拟代理品牌的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">高压变频器</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（额定电压</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">等级</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&ge;10KV，容量</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">&ge;10000KVA</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">的供货</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">销售</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">业绩（该业绩可以是代理商自身作为卖方签订的合同，也可以是所代理品牌的制造商作为卖方签订的合同，也可以是所代理品牌的其他代理商（销售商）作为卖方签订的合同）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">有效业绩以合同复印件及对应</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">至少</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1张</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">增值税专用发票</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（加盖税务局印章的原始票据扫描件，发票</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">及合同内容</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">不得遮挡、涂抹）为准，业绩的有效时间以合同签订时间为准，合同文件须包含：合同首页、供货范围</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">、</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">技术参数（电压等级、容量）、合同金额、合同签订时间、双方盖章签字页等</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">证明业绩有效的其他关键信息</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（可提供技术协议补充合同内容）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.4、信誉要求（下列要求均由投标人提供加盖公章的承诺书）：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人未列入信用中国</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">严重失信主体名单；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">严重违法失信名单</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(黑名单</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.1000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">3.5、其他要求：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">参加本次招标</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">项目的投标，本项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">接受非制造商投标，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">不接受联合体投标，项目审核方式为资格后审。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">四、招标文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21.0000pt; tab-stops: left blank 0.0000pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">获取时间：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">10</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">00分</span></span>至20</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">26</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">年</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">9</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">月</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">17</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">日</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">18</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">00分</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -13.0000pt; mso-para-margin-right: -1.2400gd; text-indent: 21.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; tab-stops: left blank 49.6500pt left blank 56.7000pt; text-autospace: none; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">获取方式：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">凡有意参加投标者请在上述时间内登录</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">https://qyzb.shccmg.com/cms/default/webfile/index.html</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: