lor Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本招标项目</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">红柳林矿井三号风井及附属工程项目厂区综合管网及护坡水沟工程由神木市发展改革和科技局批准建设</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">，招标人（项目业主）为陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司，建设资金来自自筹，项目出资比例为自筹资金</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">100.00%。 项目已具备招标条件，现对该项目进行公开招标，特邀有意愿的投标人参加投标。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder; max-width: 100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.项目概况与招标范围</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.1 建设地点：陕西省榆林市神木市西沙街道办事处芦草沟村</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.2 工程规模：本工程包括三号风井场地三网工程（给排水管网、热力管网、电力管网）；雨水收集池；日用消防水池及泵房；护坡水沟工程；生活污水处理站土建及配套安装工程</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.3 项目投资总额：1352250900元（其中本次招标工程估算75333027.24元）</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.4 计划工期：</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">205日历天。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.5 标段划分：标段1: 标段名称</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：红柳林矿井三号风井及附属工程项目厂区综合管网及护坡水沟工程；</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">标段编号</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">E6108003536d04550001001</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">标段类型</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">施工</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.6 招标范围：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.三号风井场地生产区及生活区管网工程：含管网土建、电气、给排水、工业管道、消防水、热力管网工程。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.雨水收集池：含土建、电气、给排水工程。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.日用消防水池及泵房：日用消防水池地上一层、地下一层，防火高度4.9m，规划高度5.3m</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">；</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">泵房建筑面积</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">209m&sup2;，水池容积1600</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">m&sup3;</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，包含土建、电气、给排水、采暖、通风工程。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.护坡水沟工程：含浆砌片石护坡、泄水孔、排水沟、绿化场地整理、草籽播种等。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5.生活污水处理站：地上采用钢筋混凝土框排架结构，地下泵房及水池为钢筋混凝土结构；处理车间建筑高度9.05m，其余部位5.4m，地上建筑面积1075.20m&sup2;；包含土建、电气、给排水、采暖、通风、消防工程。项目总投资7533.302724万元，共划分一个标段</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">其他</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">/</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder; max-width: 100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder; max-width: 100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">投标人资格要求</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.1</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资格要求：</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">须具有独立法人资格并提供加载统一社会信用代码的营业执照或事业单位法人证书。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.2</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资质要求：具备市政公用工程施工总承包一级（含）以上资质，</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">并在人员、设备、资金等方面具备相应的施工能力</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.3</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">资质要求：</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">须具有有效的安全生产许可证。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">项目负责人</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">要求：</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">须具有</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">市政公用工程专业一级注册建造师</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">执业</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">资格及有效的《安全生产考核合格证书》（</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">B类</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">且未担任其他在建工程项目</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">负责人（提供无在建项目承诺）</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">财务要求：提供企业赋码后的</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">202</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">年度财务审计报告。</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">202</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年至今新成立的公司须提供基本户银行资信证明。</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">在注册会计师行业统一监管平台（</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">http://acc.mof.gov.cn/）报备的财务审计报告须可查询，并提供网页查询截图。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">3.</span><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); max-width: 100%;\" name=\"_Hlk155797988\"></a></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">信誉要求：</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">投标申请人及拟派项目负责人信息应在</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">&ldquo;陕西省住房和城乡建设厅&rdquo;网站录入并可查询</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">提供查询截图</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">。投标人存在下列情形之一者不具备投标资格（</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">1-4项提供承诺书，5-6项提供网查截图）</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">①被依法暂停或者取消投标资格；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">②被责令停产停业、暂扣或者吊销许可证、暂扣或者吊销执照；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">③进入清算程序，或被宣告破产，或其他丧失履约能力的情形；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">④在最近三年内发生重大施工质量问题（以相关行业主管部门的行政处罚决定或司法机关出具的有关法律文书为准）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">⑤被列入信用中国（https：//www.creditchina.gov.cn/xinyongfuwu/shixinheimingdan/）严重失信主体名单；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">⑥在近三年内投标人和其法定代表人、拟派项目负责人在中国裁判文书网有行贿犯罪记录的（http：//wenshu.court.gov.cn/）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7本次招标接受联合体投标；联合体投标的，应满足下列要求：①组成联合体成员数量不超过2家；②联合体各方具有独立法人资格，且必须满足本次招标资格要求条件，并签订联合体协议书，明确联合体牵头人和各方的权利义务；③联合体各方不得再单独参加或者与其他投标人另外组成联合体参加本项目投标，投标时必须出具《联合体协议书》</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder; max-width: 100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">4.资格审查方法</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">本次招标采用资格后审的方法对投标人资格进行审查，资格评审的条件、标准、方法详见招标文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder; max-width: 100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">5.招标文件的获取</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 19.4pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">请于</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">202</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">日</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">1</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">时</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">00分起至202</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">14</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">日</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">1</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">时</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">00分从</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">《榆林市公共资源智慧交易平台》（</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">http://111.20.184.141:8888/ylggzy/gdebs-login-web/login_index）下载招标文件</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder; max-width: 100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.投标文件的递交</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 19.4pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.1 投标文件递交的截止时间(投标截止时间，下同</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">为</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">202</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">年</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">10</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">月</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">9</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">日</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">09时30分，</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">地点为</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">通过</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">《榆林市公共资源智慧交易平台》系统上传递交投标文件，并在不见面开标大厅完成签到。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 19.4pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">6.2 逾期送达的或者未送达指定地点的投标文件，招标人不予受理。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder; max-width: 100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7.发布公告的媒介</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 19.4pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">本次招标公告在《全国公共资源交易平台</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">（</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">陕西省</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">&middot;榆林市</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">）</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">榆林市公共资源交易中心》、</span> <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">《陕西采购与招标网</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">》《</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%;\">中国招投标公共服务平台》</span> </span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">、《秦源招标电子招标平台》</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">等媒介上发布。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder; max-width: 100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.其他</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 19.4pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.1招投标人须在榆林市公共资源智慧交易平台（http://111.20.184.141:8888/ylggzy/gdebs-login-web/login_index）登记企业信息，然后登陆榆林市公共资源智慧交易平台（http://111.20.184.141:8888/ylggzy/gdebs-login-web/login_index）下载、查看电子版的招标文件及其他文件。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 19.4pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.2 电子标（招标文件后缀名.YLZ）：必须使用最新版本的电子投标工具制作电子版的投标文件；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 19.4pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.3 投标截止时间前，必须在网上上传电子投标书&mdash;&mdash;（电子标：投标书为YLT格式）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px 21pt; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.4 该项目采取&ldquo;不见面 &rdquo;开标方式， 投标单位无须到达开标现场，具体要求详见招标文件规定。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px 21pt; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.5接收异议联系人和联系方式：陕煤集团神木红柳林矿业有限公司审计部，电话：0912-8519850，邮箱：</span><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #0051c1; text-decoration: none; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); max-width: 100%;\" href=\"mailto:416540547@qq.com%E3%80%82\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; color: #428bca; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">416540547@qq.com。</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px 21pt; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder; max-width: 100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">8.6 </span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder; max-width: 100%;\"><span class=\"16\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">本项目施工组织设计评审方式：暗标评审</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder; max-width: 100%;\"><span class=\"16\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 5px; max-width: 100%; color: #333333; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', \'Liberation Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'No