gn: baseline;\"><a name=\"_Toc18577\"></a><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\">6</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\">.</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\">1</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\">开标时间：</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\">2026年10月15日</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\">上午</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\">9</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">00分</span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; line-height: 21px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 21pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\">6</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\">.</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\">2</span><span class=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">开标地点：开标通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台（http://qyzb.shccmg.com/）&rdquo;网上进行。投标人须用CA数字认证证书对上传的投标文件进行解密。允许投标人通过远程方式进行开标解密。开标期间投标人须保持随时在线状态，否则引起的不利后果由投标人自行承担。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"18\" style=\"margin-top: 0.65pt; line-height: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">七、</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">发布公告的媒介</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; line-height: 21px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt; text-indent: 21pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7</span><span style=\"line-height: 21px; font-size: 10.5pt;\">.1</span><span style=\"line-height: 21px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10.5pt;\">7.1本项目招标公告在中国招标投标公共服务平台（http://www.cebpubservice.com/）、陕西