%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.1项目名称：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤电力上高有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2&times;1000MW清洁煤电扩建项目五辅设备采购-包2：消声型电动防雨百叶窗</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 20.6pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.2招标编号：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">0866-26C2SXQY0630</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0500pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">2.3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">项目概况：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕煤电力上高有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2&times;1000MW清洁煤电扩建项目位于江西省宜春市上高县芦洲乡。本期项目拟建设2&times;1000MW超超临界二次再热燃煤发电机组，同步建设烟气脱硫、脱硝、除尘设施，全厂实现废水零排放。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">2.4招标范围</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.0000pt; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">本项目包括消声型电动防雨百叶窗及其附属设备的设