sp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">二次谈判采购公告</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">项目所在地区：陕西省</span> </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">咸阳</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">市</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司生产服务中心防爆发动机试验台采购项目已具备采购条件，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">现公开邀请供应商参加谈判采购活动。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1、</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">采购项目简介</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1.1 采购项目名称：生产服务中心防爆发动机试验台采购项目</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1.2 采购人：陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司 </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1.3 采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">编号</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">: 0866-26C2SXQY0585 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1.4 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">采购组织</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">机构：陕西秦源招标有限责任公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1.5 采购项目资金落实情况：企业自筹，出资率100%。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">成交供应商数量及成交份额：一家</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，成交份额</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">100%</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2、采购范围及相关要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.1 采购范围：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">防爆发动机试验台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">1套，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">用于矿用车辆发动机试验测试</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">其中，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">电涡测功器主机</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">1台，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">额定吸收功率：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">300kw，最高转速：5000r/min，最大制动力：2046N，最大扭矩：1954N.m，主轴转向：双向。测功器底座外形尺寸：1020&times;780&times;300毫米，主轴中心至底座下平面高：600毫米</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">测功器控制柜</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">1台，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">要求卧式操作台、测试控制仪采用计算机数据采集控制测控系统。系统由操作台、上位机、下位机等组成</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">发动机与测功器工作大</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">平板</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">1台，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">外型尺寸：长</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4000m</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">m,</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">宽</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2000mm，厚200mm，根据台架设计结构，安装在水平基础上</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">发动机固定可调支架及发动机与测功器大平</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">板</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1台，发动机固定可调支架，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">上下行程</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0-350mm，横向0-1000mm，纵向0-1000mm。每个可调支架的设计承重重量3000KG</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">台架在水泥基础上，安装大平板，平板上开设数条</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">T型槽</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">用于</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">测功器与发动机等设备安装</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">油门执行器</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">1台，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提供安装支架及油门拉杆一套。（复位）电磁阀采用直流</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">24伏/10A</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">发动机与测功器的联轴器</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">1台，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">许用转速</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9000r.min</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">许外圆波动</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0.11～0.15</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">mm,</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">许外端与水平面垂直</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0.10～0.12</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">mm,</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">发动机与测功器的联接，采用缓冲高弹性的联接</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">油耗仪</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">1台，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">具备定时和定重双重测量功能</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">测功器全密封冷却系统</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">1台，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">进入测功器的前端加过滤器，过滤目数不小于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">50目</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">发动机</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">试验台</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">尾气排放检测设备</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">1台，适用于</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">汽油机、柴油机、天然气发动机台架性能试验、耐久试验、排放标定试验，可实时检测尾气中</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CO、CO₂、HC、NOₓ、O₂、颗粒物、烟度等参数</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">；</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">发动机</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">ECU参数修改设备</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">1台，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">设备可实现</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">ECU数据读取、参数修改、程序刷写、标定调整、故障码清除、备份还原，支持原厂ECU、后处理ECU、动力控制器等</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">其他技术参数</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">具体详见第五章</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">需求</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.2 交货期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">60天。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.3 质保期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">12个月。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.4 交货地点：陕西省咸阳市长武县亭口镇</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">陕西彬长矿业集团有限公司生产服务中心。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2.5 货物质量标准或主要技术性能指标：详见采购需求。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">3、供应商资格要求</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 18.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.1</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">应是在中华人民共和国境内注册的独立的企业法人</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">须具有有效的营业执照；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 18.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><a name=\"_Hlk92988356\"></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">须提供</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">近三年（</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">02</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1月1日至递交</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">谈判响应</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">文件截止日期</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">以来（以合同签订时间为准）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">类似项目</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3份及以上</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">（如为刚</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">承接</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">的项目，应提供中标通知书</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">（或成交通知书）；如为正在实施或已完</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">成的</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">项目，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">提供显示以上业绩项目名称、合同服务范围、合同签订时间页及双方盖章签字页）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">未被</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">列入</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">&ldquo;信用中国&rdquo;（www.creditchina.gov.cn）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">严重失信主体名单</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4供应商未列入国家企业信用信息公示系统（https://www.gsxt.gov.cn/）严重违法失信名单信息</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.5</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">法定代表人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得同时参加</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">本次谈判采购</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">6</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">本项目不接受</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">代理商、不接受</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">联合体。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4、采购文件的获取</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.1获取时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8时</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">0分至2026年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">14</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日下午</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">时</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">0分。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">请有意参与本项目谈判的供应商</span><a name=\"_Hlk117178301\"></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在规定时间通过秦源招标电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">qyzb.shccmg.com）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">购买采购文件。未注册秦源招标电子招标平台的用户，登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;供应商/投标人注册&rdquo;完善注册信息，具体操作参见秦源招标电子招标平台&mdash;客服中心&mdash;常用文件&mdash;供应商操作手册。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已注册的供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台，点击</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;供应商登录&rdquo;请将加盖单位公章的法人授权委托书（附法定代表人、委托代理人身份证复印件）及上述&ldquo;3、供应商资格要求&rdquo;</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">的</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">所有</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">资料合成一个</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">PDF</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">上传。潜在</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">供应商</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">应及时关注、查阅秦源招标电子招标平台。因未及时查看导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">经采购组织机构确认后，潜在供应商可登录秦源招标电子招标平台购买采购文件及缴费事宜。缴费完毕即可在平台下载采购文件。采购文件每套售价：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">800元，售后不退。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">潜在供应商支付采购文件费用前需核对单位名称及开票信息，确认无误后支付费用，并通过秦源招标电子招标平台直接获取电子发票（采购文件购买发票仅提供电子增值税普通发票，下载时间：本项目结束之后）。若单位名称及开票信息发生变化或填写有误，须先进行注册信息修改，修改内容审核通过后，再进行费用支付。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">4.6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">已注册的潜在供应商若注册信息发生变更（如：与初始注册信息不一致），应及时网上提交变更申请。因未及时变更导致不利后果的，责任自负。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注：本项目所有程序均在秦源采购电子招标平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">qyzb.shccmg.com）进行操作执行，如有疑问请致电平台客服电话：400-685-1179</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（咨询日期：法定工作日</span> <span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">咨询时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">08:30-12:00 &nbsp;14:00-17:30）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">5、</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">响应文件的递交：</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">5.1 响应文件递交的截止时间</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">17</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">9:00</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">时整（北京时间），</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">5.2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">响应文件递交方式：电子文件上传递交到</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&ldquo;秦源招标电子招标平台&rdquo;，未在谈判开始时间前成功递交的响应文件将被拒绝接受。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">6、谈判时间和地点</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 24.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 150%;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">6.1 </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">谈判</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">时间：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">2026年</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">17</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\">9</sp