g: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">3、相关请求及主张；</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">4、有效线索和相关证明材料。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">注：书面材料必须由其法定代表人或者授权代表签字并加盖单位公章。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 0.0000pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">三、其他</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-right: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">中标候选人第一名：德道默（四川）阀门有限公司</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">业绩一：合同名称：天津国能盘山发电有限责任公司创新升级及延寿改造项目减温减压器采购合同；甲方名称：天津国能盘山发电有限责任公司；乙方名称：四川道默滨大阀门有限公司；签订日期：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2024年1月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩二：合同名称：广东粤电博贺能源有限公司</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1、2号机组供热改造项目减温减压器设备采购；甲方名称：广东粤电博贺能源有限公司；乙方名称：四川滨大阀门有限责任公司；签订日期：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2022年8月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩三：合同名称：泉惠石化</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2X660MW超超临界热电联产工程第三批辅机(减温减压器)设备采购；甲方名称：福建省东桥热电有限责任公司；乙方名称：四川道默滨大阀门有限公司；签订日期：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2025年9月</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0000pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 150%; margin: 0.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">业绩四：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">合同名称：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">山东华电龙口四期</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2X660MW</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">项目第一台机组</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">减温减压器</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">设备采购；甲方名称：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #172b4d; letter-spac